  FT["MY-H6994"] = {"id":"MY-H6994","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 95/2020&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2020年道路运输（禁止使用道路）（吉隆坡市）（第3号）令","en":"ROADTRANSPORT (PROHIBITION OF USE OF ROAD) (CITY OF KUALA LUMPUR) (NO. 3) ORDER 2020","orig":"ROADTRANSPORT (PROHIBITION OF USE OF ROAD) (CITY OF KUALA LUMPUR) (NO. 3) ORDER 2020","ms":"Perintah Pengangkutan Jalan (Larangan Penggunaan Jalan) (Bandaraya Kuala Lumpur) (Bilangan 3) 2020","vi":"Lệnh về Vận tải đường bộ (Cấm sử dụng đường bộ) (Thành phố Kuala Lumpur) (số 3) năm 2020","th":"คำสั่งการขนส่งทางถนน (การห้ามใช้ถนน) (เมืองกัวลาลัมเปอร์) (ฉบับที่ 3) ค.ศ. 2020","id":"Perintah Angkutan Jalan (Larangan Penggunaan Jalan) (Kota Kuala Lumpur) (Nomor 3) Tahun 2020"},"level":"regulation","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA95","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2020","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\2020_P.U.(A)95-2020_ROADTRANSPORT (PROHIBITION OF USE OF ROAD) (CITY OF KUALA LUMPUR) (NO. 3) ORDER 2020.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H6994-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Pengangkutan Jalan (Larangan\n\nPenggunaan Jalan) (Bandaraya Kuala Lumpur) (No. 3) 2020.\n\nLarangan"}},{"id":"MY-H6994-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Pemanduan kenderaan yang dinyatakan dalam ruang (3) Jadual Pertama\n\ndi atas bahagian jalan yang dinyatakan dalam ruang (1) Jadual Pertama\n\nsebagaimana yang ditunjukkan dalam peta dalam Jadual Kedua, melainkan di\n\natas jalan arah yang dinyatakan dalam ruang (2) Jadual Pertama, bagi tempoh\n\nyang dinyatakan dalam ruang (4) Jadual Pertama, dilarang.\n\nJadual Pertama\n\n(1) (2) (3) (4)\n\nJalan yang baginya\n\nLarangan Terpakai\n\nJalan Arah Kenderaan Tempoh Larangan\n\nJ a l a n R a j a d a r i\n\np e r s i m p a n g a n n y a\n\ndengan Jalan Tun\n\nP e r a k d a n J a l a n\n\nP a r l i m e n h i n g g a\n\np e r s i m p a n g a n n y a\n\ndengan Leboh Pasar\n\nBesar sebagaimana\n\nyang ditunjukkan dalam\n\npeta dalam Jadual\n\nKedua\n\n(i) Kenderaan dari\n\nJ a l a n Tu a n k u\n\nAbdul Rahman\n\ndan Jalan Tun\n\nPerak ke Leboh\n\nPasar Besar dan\n\nJ a l a n S u l t a n\n\nH i s h a m u d i n\n\nh e n d a k l a h\n\nm e n g g u n a k a n\n\njalan alternatif\n\ns e b a g a i m a n a\n\nyang ditunjukkan\n\ndalam peta dalam\n\nJadual Kedua\n\n(ii) Kenderaan dari\n\nLeboh Pasar Besar\n\ndan Jalan Sultan\n\nH i s h a m u d i n\n\nk e J a l a n Tu n\n\nPerak hendaklah\n\nm e n g g u n a k a n\n\njalan alternatif\n\ns e b a g a i m a n a\n\nyang ditunjukkan\n\ndalam peta dalam\n\nJadual Kedua\n\nS e m u a k e n d e r a a n\n\nkecuali—\n\n(a) bas\n\n(b) teksi, termasuk\n\nteksi lapangan\n\nterbang dan teksi\n\nm e w a h t e t a p i\n\ntidak termasuk\n\nk e n d e r a a n\n\ne-hailing\n\n(c) kenderaan Polis\n\nDiraja Malaysia\n\n(d) kenderaan\n\nJabatan Bomba\n\ndan Penyelamat\n\n(e) ambulans\n\n(f) kenderaan\n\npenguatkuasaan\n\nDewan Bandaraya\n\nKuala Lumpur\n\n1 April 2020 hingga\n\n31 Mei 2020\n\nP.U. (A) 95.\n\nJadual Kedua\n\nDibuat 17 Mac 2020\n\n[DBKL/JUP/BPPP/GN/3776(B) JLD. 22; PN(PU2)460/CVI]\n\nDato' Nor Hisham bin A Dahlan\n\nDatuk Bandar Kuala Lumpur\n\nP.U. (A) 95.\n\nROAD TRANSPORT ACT 1987\n\nRoad Transport (Prohibition of Use of Road)\n\n(City of Kuala Lumpur) (No. 3) Order 2020\n\nWhereas by P.U. (B) 154/2020 published on 28 February 2020, notice was\n\ngiven of the intention to make an order under section 70 of the Road Transport\n\nAct 1987 [Act 333]:\n\nAnd Whereas no objection was received by the Commissioner of the City\n\nof Kuala Lumpur against the making of such order:\n\nNow Therefore, in exercise of the powers conferred by section 70 of the\n\nAct, the Commissioner of the City of Kuala Lumpur, after consultation with\n\nthe Director General for Road Transport and after taking into consideration\n\nthe matters referred to in subsection 70(2) of the Act, makes the following\n\norder:\n\nCitation"}}],"pack":"my-16"};
  FT["MY-H6995"] = {"id":"MY-H6995","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 95/2021&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2021年所得税（豁免）（第2号）令","en":"INCOME TAX (EXEMPTION) (NO. 2) ORDER 2021","orig":"INCOME TAX (EXEMPTION) (NO. 2) ORDER 2021","ms":"Perintah Cukai Pendapatan (Pengecualian) (Bilangan 2) 2021","vi":"Lệnh về Thuế thu nhập (Miễn trừ) (số 2) năm 2021","th":"คำสั่งภาษีเงินได้ (การยกเว้น) (ฉบับที่ 2) ค.ศ. 2021","id":"Perintah Pajak Penghasilan (Pembebasan) (Nomor 2) Tahun 2021"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA95","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2021","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2021_P.U.(A)95-2021_INCOME TAX (EXEMPTION) (NO. 2) ORDER 2021.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H6995-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1.  (1)  Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Cukai Pendapatan\n(Pengecualian) (No. 2) 2021.\n\n (2)  Perintah ini disifatkan berkuat kuasa mulai tahun taksiran 2020.\n\nPengecualian"}},{"id":"MY-H6995-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. (1) Menteri mengecualikan orang yang layak yang bermastautin di Malaysia\ndaripada pembayaran cukai pendapatan dalam tempoh asas bagi setiap tahun taksiran\nberhubung dengan laba atau keuntungan yang diperoleh, sebagai ganti faedah,\ndaripada Sukuk Prihatin.\n\n(2) Bagi maksud perenggan ini—\n\n \"orang yang layak\" ertinya—\n\n(a) individu yang merupakan seorang warganegara Malaysia berumur\nlapan belas tahun ke atas;\n\n(b) suatu pertubuhan perbadanan yang diperbadankan di bawah\nundang-undang Malaysia tetapi tidak termasuk suatu institusi\nkewangan dan seorang pemegang lesen Perkhidmatan Pasaran\nModal yang menjalankan urusan pengurusan k umpulan wang\ndi bawah Akta Pasaran Modal dan Perkhidmatan 2007\n[Akta 671]; atau\n\n(c) suatu kumpulan orang, perkongsian atau perkongsian liabiliti\nterhad yang didaftarkan di bawah mana -mana undang -undang\nbertulis di Malaysia dan menjalankan perniagaan nya di Malaysia\ntetapi tidak termasuk pemegang amanah yang berdaftar sebagai\nahli Persa tuan Syarikat Amanah Malaysia yang  bertindak bagi\npihak orang itu;\n\n\"Sukuk Prihatin\" ertinya sekuriti Islam yang mempunyai nilai nominal\nsehingga enam ratus enam puluh enam juta empat ratus tujuh belas ribu\ndan lima r atus ringgit (RM666,417,500.00)  yang diterbitkan mengikut\nprinsip Murabahah pada 22 September 2020 oleh Kerajaan.\n\n(3)  Bagi maksud subperenggan (2), \"institusi kewangan\" ertinya—\n\n(a)  suatu bank, bank pelaburan atau penanggung insurans\nyang dilesenkan atau disifatkan dilesenkan di bawah\nAkta Perkhidmatan Kewangan 2013 [Akta 758];\n\n(b) suatu bank Islam, pengendali takaful atau pengendali takaful\nantarabangsa yang dilesenkan atau disifatkan dilesenkan di bawah\nAkta Perkhidmatan Kewangan Islam 2013 [Akta 759];\n\n(c) suatu institusi kewangan pembangunan yang ditetapkan di bawah\nAkta Institusi Kewangan Pembangunan 2002 [Akta 618]; atau\n\n(d) suatu entiti yang disenaraikan di bawah Bahagian 1, Jadual 4 kepada\nAkta Pasaran Modal dan Perkhidmatan 2007.\n\n(4) Tiada apa -apa jua dalam subperenggan (1) boleh melepaskan atau\ndisifatkan telah melepaskan orang itu daripada mematuhi apa -apa kehendak untuk\nmengemukakan apa -apa penyata atau penyata akaun atau memberikan apa -apa\nmaklumat lain di bawah Akta.\n\nDibuat 1 Mac 2021\n[MOF.TAX(S) 700-2/1/114; LHDN.AY.A 600-12/1/7(29)-77; PN(PU2)80/C]\n\nTENGKU DATUK SERI UTAMA ZAFRUL BIN TENGKU ABDUL AZIZ\nMenteri Kewangan\n\n [Akan dibentangkan di Dewan Rakyat menurut subseksyen 127(4)\nAkta Cukai Pendapatan 1967]\n\nINCOME TAX ACT 1967\n\nINCOME TAX (EXEMPTION) (NO. 2) ORDER 2021\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by paragraph 127(3 )(b) of the\nIncome Tax Act 1967 [Act 53], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-16"};
  FT["MY-H6996"] = {"id":"MY-H6996","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 95/2022&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":6,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2022年商品说明（电子烟装置认证与标记）令","en":"TRADE DESCRIPTIONS (CERTIFICATION AND MARKING OF ELECTRONIC CIGARETTE DEVICE) ORDER 2022","orig":"TRADE DESCRIPTIONS (CERTIFICATION AND MARKING OF ELECTRONIC CIGARETTE DEVICE) ORDER 2022","ms":"Perintah Keterangan Perdagangan (Pensijilan dan Penandaan Peranti Rokok Elektronik) 2022","vi":"Lệnh về Mô tả thương mại (Chứng nhận và ghi nhãn thiết bị thuốc lá điện tử) năm 2022","th":"คำสั่งคำบรรยายสินค้า (การรับรองและการทำเครื่องหมายอุปกรณ์บุหรี่อิเล็กทรอนิกส์) ค.ศ. 2022","id":"Perintah Keterangan Dagang (Sertifikasi dan Penandaan Perangkat Rokok Elektronik) Tahun 2022"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA95","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2022","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 6 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2022_P.U.(A)95-2022_TRADE DESCRIPTIONS (CERTIFICATION AND MARKING OF ELECTRONIC CIGARETTE DEVICE) ORDER 2022.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H6996-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan  Perintah Perihal Dagangan\n(Perakuan dan Penandaan Peranti Rokok Elektronik) 2022.\n\n(2) Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 3 Ogos 2022.\n\nTafsiran"}},{"id":"MY-H6996-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Dalam Perintah ini—\n\n\"alat ganti\" ertinya apa -apa komponen yang boleh ditukar ganti pada  suatu\nperanti rokok elektronik;\n\n\"peranti rokok elektronik\" mempunyai erti yang diberikan kepadanya dalam\nStandard Malaysia MS 2716 – Peranti rokok elektronik – Keperluan k eselamatan dan\nkaedah pengujian.\n\nPihak berkuasa yang berwibawa"}},{"id":"MY-H6996-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Bagi maksud Perintah ini, SIRIM QAS International Sdn. Bhd. hendaklah menjadi\npihak berkuasa yang berwibawa yang diseb ut dalam subseksyen 29(3) Akta untuk\nmemperakukan dan mengeluarkan suatu penandaan bahaw a suatu  peranti\nrokok elektronik atau alat ganti mematuhi Standard Malaysia MS 2716.\n\nPermohonan perakuan"}},{"id":"MY-H6996-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4"},"text":{"ms":"4. (1) Mana-mana orang yang membekalkan atau menawarkan untuk\nmembekalkan apa -apa peranti rokok elektronik atau alat ganti hendaklah memohon\nkepada pihak berkuasa yang berwibawa untuk mendapatkan perakuan bagi peranti\nrokok elektronik atau alat ganti itu.\n\n(2) Peranti rokok elektronik atau alat ganti yang disebut dalam\nsubperenggan (1) hendaklah—\n\n(a) diperakukan sebagai telah mematuhi Standard Malaysia\nMS 2716 oleh pihak berkuasa yang berwibawa; dan\n\n(b) ditandakan dengan tanda sebagaimana yang dinyatakan dalam\nJadual.\n\nPenandaan peranti rokok elektronik atau alat ganti"}},{"id":"MY-H6996-A5","no":5,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 5"},"text":{"ms":"5. Mana-mana peranti rokok elektronik atau alat ganti yang hendak ditandakan\nmengikut subsubperenggan 4(2)(b) hendaklah ditandakan dengan menampalkan tanda\nsebagaimana yang dinyatakan dalam Jadual pada kedudukan yang mudah dilihat pada—\n\n(a) peranti rokok elektronik atau alat ganti itu; atau\n\n(b) apa-apa bekas yang di dalamnya, di atasnya atau dengannya peranti rokok\neletronik atau alat ganti itu dibekalkan.\n\nKesalahan"}},{"id":"MY-H6996-A6","no":6,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 6"},"text":{"ms":"6. Mana-mana orang yang tidak mematuhi mana -mana peruntukan\nPerintah ini, melakukan suatu kesalahan dan boleh, apabila disabitkan—\n\n(a) jika orang itu ialah suatu pertubuhan perbadanan, didenda tidak melebihi\ndua ratus ribu ringgit, dan bagi kesalahan yang kedua atau\nyang berikutnya, didenda tidak melebihi lima ratus ribu ringgit; atau\n\n(b) jika orang itu bukan suatu pertubuhan perbadanan, didenda tidak melebihi\nsatu ratus ribu ringgit atau dipenjarakan selama tempoh tidak melebihi\ntiga tahun atau kedua -duanya, dan bagi kesalahan yang kedua atau yang\nberikutnya, didenda tidak melebihi dua rat us lima puluh ribu ringgit atau\ndipenjarakan selama tempoh tidak melebihi lima tahun atau\nkedua-duanya.\n\nJADUAL\n[Perenggan 4 dan 5]\n\nDibuat 31 Mac 2022\n[KPDN(PUU)(PU2)26/5/5; PN(PU2)120/IX]\n\nDATO SRI ALEXANDER NANTA LINGGI\nMenteri Perdagangan Dalam Negeri dan Hal Ehwal Pengguna\n\nTRADE DESCRIPTIONS ACT 2011\n\nTRADE DESCRIPTIONS\n(CERTIFICATION AND MARKING OF ELECTRONIC CIGARETTE DEVICE) ORDER 2022\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 29 of the Trade Descriptions Act 2011\n[Act 730], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement\n1. (1) This order may be cited as the Trade Descriptions (Certification and\nMarking of Electronic Cigarette Device) Order 2022.\n\n(2) This Order comes into operation on 3 August 2022.\n\nInterpretation\n2. In this Order—\n\n\"spare part\" means any interchangeable component of  an electronic cigarette\ndevice;\n\n\"electronic cigarette device\" has the meaning assigned to it in the Malaysian\nStandard MS 2716 – Electronic cigarette device – Safety requirements and test methods.\n\nCompetent authority\n3. For the purposes of this Order, SIRIM QAS International Sdn. Bhd. shall be the\ncompetent authority referred to in  subsection 29(3) of the Act to certify and issue\na marking that an electronic cigarette device or spare part complies with the\nMalaysian Standard MS 2716.\n\nApplication for certification\n4. (1) Any person who supplies or offers to supply any electronic cigarette device\nor spare part shall apply to the competent authority to obtain the certification for the\nelectronic cigarette device or spare part.\n(2) The electronic cigarette device or spare pa rt referred to in\nsubparagraph (1) shall be—\n\n(a) certifed as having complied with Malaysian Standard MS 2716 by\nthe competent authority; and\n\n(b) marked with the mark as specified in the Schedule.\n\nMarking of electronic cigarette device or spare part\n5. Any electronic cigarette device or spare part which is to be marked in accordance\nwith subsubparagraph 4(2) (b) shall be marked by affixing the mark as specified in the\nSchedule in a conspicuous position at—\n\n(a) the electronic cigarette device or spare part; or\n\n(b) anything in, on or with which the electronic cigarette devi ce or spare part\nis supplied.\n\nOffence\n6. Any person  who fails to comply with any provision of this Order, commits\nan offence and shall, on conviction—\n\n(a) if such person is a body corporate, be liable to a fine not exceeding\ntwo hundred thousand ringgit, and for a second or subsequent offence,\nto a fine not exceeding five hundred thousand ringgit; or\n\n(b) if such person is not a body corporate, be liable  to a fine not exceeding\none hundred thousand ringgit or to imprisonment for a term not exceeding\nthree years or to both, and for a second or subsequent offence, be liable to\na fine not exceeding two hundred and fifty thousand ringgit or to\nimprisonment for a term not exceeding five years or to both.\n\nSCHEDULE\n[Paragraphs 4 and 5]\n\nMade 31 March 2022\n[KPDN(PUU)(PU2)26/5/5; PN(PU2)120/IX]\n\nDATO SRI ALEXANDER NANTA LINGGI\nMinister of Domestic Trade and Consumer Affairs"}}],"pack":"my-16"};
  FT["MY-H6997"] = {"id":"MY-H6997","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 95/2023&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2023年关税税则（豁免）（修正）（第2号）令","en":"CUSTOMS DUTIES (EXEMPTION) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 2) ORDER 2023","orig":"CUSTOMS DUTIES (EXEMPTION) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 2) ORDER 2023","ms":"Perintah Duti Kastam (Pengecualian) (Pindaan) (Bilangan 2) 2023","vi":"Lệnh về Thuế quan (Miễn trừ) (Sửa đổi) (số 2) năm 2023","th":"คำสั่งอากรศุลกากร (การยกเว้น) (การแก้ไข) (ฉบับที่ 2) ค.ศ. 2023","id":"Perintah Bea Masuk (Pembebasan) (Perubahan) (Nomor 2) Tahun 2023"},"level":"regulation","category":"03_涉外投资与贸易","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA95","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2023","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\03_涉外投资与贸易\\2023_P.U.(A)95-2023_CUSTOMS DUTIES (EXEMPTION) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 2) ORDER 2023.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H6997-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Duti Kastam (Pengecualian)\n\n(Pindaan) (No. 2) 2023.\n\n(2) Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 1 April 2023.\n\nPindaan Jadual"}},{"id":"MY-H6997-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Perintah Duti Kastam (Pengecualian) 2017 [P.U. (A) 445/2017] dipinda dalam\n\nJadual, dalam Bahagian I, dalam ruang (3), berhubung dengan—\n\n(a) subsubbutiran 10(vii)(f), dengan menggantikan perkataan \"not containing\n\nnicotine\" dengan perkataan \"whether or not containing nicotine\";\n\n(b) subsubbutiran 10A(vii)(f), dengan menggantikan perkataan\n\n\"not containing nicotine\" dengan perkataan \"whether or not containing\n\nnicotine\";\n\n(c) subsubbutiran 11(vi)(f), dengan menggantikan perkataan \"not containing\n\nnicotine\" dengan perkataan \"whether or not containing nicotine\"; dan\n\n(d) subbutiran 94(vi), dengan menggantikan perkataan \"not containing\n\nnicotine\" dengan perkataan \"whether or not containing nicotine\".\n\nDibuat 29 Mac 2023\n\n[SULITKE.HT(96)669/13-66Klt.11; PN(PU2)338/JLD.69]\n\n ANWAR BIN IBRAHIM\n\n Menteri Kewangan\n\nCUSTOMS ACT 1967\n\nCUSTOMS DUTIES (EXEMPTION) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 2) ORDER 2023\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 14(1) of the Customs Act 1967\n\n[Act 235], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-16"};
  FT["MY-H6998"] = {"id":"MY-H6998","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 95/2024&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":7,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2024年竞争（经海运提供班轮运输服务的船舶共享协议集体豁免）令","en":"COMPETITION (BLOCK EXEMPTION FOR VESSEL SHARING AGREEMENTS IN RESPECT OF LINER SHIPPING SERVICES THROUGH TRANSPORTATION BY SEA) ORDER 2024","orig":"COMPETITION (BLOCK EXEMPTION FOR VESSEL SHARING AGREEMENTS IN RESPECT OF LINER SHIPPING SERVICES THROUGH TRANSPORTATION BY SEA) ORDER 2024","ms":"Perintah Persaingan (Pengecualian Blok bagi Perjanjian Perkongsian Kapal bagi Perkhidmatan Perkapalan Berjadual melalui Pengangkutan Laut) 2024","vi":"Lệnh về Cạnh tranh (Miễn trừ theo nhóm đối với thỏa thuận chia sẻ tàu về dịch vụ vận tải tàu chợ bằng đường biển) năm 2024","th":"คำสั่งการแข่งขัน (การยกเว้นแบบกลุ่มสำหรับข้อตกลงแบ่งปันเรือเกี่ยวกับบริการขนส่งเรือประจำเส้นทางทางทะเล) ค.ศ. 2024","id":"Perintah Persaingan Usaha (Pengecualian Blok bagi Perjanjian Berbagi Kapal atas Jasa Pelayaran Berjadwal melalui Pengangkutan Laut) Tahun 2024"},"level":"regulation","category":"03_涉外投资与贸易","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA95","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2024","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 7 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\03_涉外投资与贸易\\2024_P.U.(A)95-2024_COMPETITION (BLOCK EXEMPTION FOR VESSEL SHARING AGREEMENTS IN RESPECT OF LINER SHIPPING SERVICE.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H6998-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Persaingan (Pengecualian Blok\n\nbagi Perjanjian Perkongsian Vesel berkenaan dengan Perkhidmatan Pelayaran\n\nTetap melalui Pengangkutan Laut) 2024.\n\n(2) Perintah ini hendaklah berkuat kuasa dari 7 Julai 2022 hingga 6 Julai 2025.\n\nTafsiran"}},{"id":"MY-H6998-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Dalam Perintah ini—\n\n\"pengendali pelayaran tetap\" ertinya suatu entiti perusahaan pihak yang—\n\n(a) menyediakan perkhidmatan pelayaran tetap melalui pengangkutan laut; dan\n\n(b) menjadi pihak kepada suatu Perjanjian Perkongsian Vesel;\n\n\"Perjanjian Perkongsian Vesel\" ertinya suatu perjanjian antara\n\npengendali-pengendali pelayaran tetap yang menurut perjanjian itu pihak-pihak kepada\n\nperjanjian itu hanya boleh membincangkan dan bersetuju mengenai perkiraan\n\npengendalian yang berhubungan dengan perkhidmatan pelayaran tetap melalui\n\npengangkutan laut, termasuk penyelarasan atau pengendalian bersama perkhidmatan\n\nvesel, dan pertukaran atau pencarteran ruang vesel;\n\n\"perkhidmatan pelayaran tetap melalui pengangkutan laut\" ertinya apa-apa\n\nperkhidmatan yang diberikan oleh pengendali pelayaran tetap kepada mana-mana\n\npengguna pengangkutan atas bayaran bagi pengkontenaan apa-apa barangan dan\n\nmenggunakan pengangkutan laut pada kebiasaannya—\n\n(a) melalui mana-mana laluan tertentu di antara pelabuhan-pelabuhan; dan\n\n(b) mengikut jadual dan tarikh pelayaran yang dijadikan tersedia dan\n\ndiiklankan terlebih dahulu,\n\ntetapi tidak termasuk perkiraan pencarteran keseluruhan vesel dengan mana-mana\n\npengguna pengangkutan seperti kapal tangki dan perkhidmatan vesel pukal.\n\nPengecualian blok"}},{"id":"MY-H6998-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Perjanjian Perkongsian Vesel diberikan suatu pengecualian blok dan dikecualikan\n\ndaripada larangan di bawah seksyen 4 Akta.\n\nSyarat pengecualian blok"}},{"id":"MY-H6998-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4"},"text":{"ms":"4. Pengecualian blok yang diberikan di bawah perenggan 3 adalah tertakluk kepada\n\nsyarat yang berikut:\n\n(a) Perjanjian Perkongsian Vesel itu hendaklah—\n\n(i) hanya bagi perkongsian vesel, pengendalian bersama bagi\n\nperkhidmatan vesel, atau pertukaran atau pencarteran ruang vesel,\n\nantara pengendali-pengendali pelayaran tetap;\n\n(ii) bagi suatu tempoh yang munasabah;\n\n(iii) membenarkan setiap pengendali pelayaran tetap membuat apa-apa\n\nkontrak sulit dan menawarkan apa-apa perkiraan dan harga bagi\n\nperkhidmatan pelayaran tetapnya melalui pengangkutan laut; dan\n\n(iv) memastikan setiap pengendali pelayaran tetap memperuntukkan\n\nkapasiti ruang vesel yang mencukupi sebagai tindak balas kepada naik\n\nturun dalam penawaran dan permintaan, yang mungkin diperlukan\n\nuntuk operasi perkhidmatan bersama di mana-mana pelabuhan\n\ndi Malaysia; dan\n\n(b) Perjanjian Perkongsian Vesel itu tidak boleh—\n\n(i) termasuk apa-apa pengangkutan darat bagi pembawaan barangan\n\nyang merupakan sebahagian daripada pengangkutan terus\n\nyang disediakan oleh penyedia logistik, penghantar, pengendali depot,\n\npemandu lori, pengendali kereta api, penyedia perkhidmatan penyatuan\n\nkemudahan luar dok, dan penyedia perkhidmatan penyimpanan\n\nluar dok dan pergudangan;\n\n(ii) mengandungi apa-apa unsur penetapan harga, pengesyoran harga atau\n\npengenaan tarif, oleh mana-mana orang ke atas pengguna\n\npengangkutan;\n\n(iii) menghendaki penzahiran apa-apa maklumat sulit berkenaan dengan\n\nperkhidmatan pelayaran tetap melalui pengangkutan laut kepada\n\nmana-mana pengguna perkhidmatan pelayaran tetap; dan\n\n(iv) menghendaki mana-mana pihak kepada perjanjian untuk mematuhi\n\nsecara mandatori apa-apa tarif atau mendedahkan apa-apa maklumat\n\nsulit berkenaan dengan perkhidmatan pelayaran tetap kepada\n\npihak lain.\n\nObligasi di bawah pengecualian blok"}},{"id":"MY-H6998-A5","no":5,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 5"},"text":{"ms":"5. (1) Suatu salinan Perjanjian Perkongsian Vesel hendaklah difailkan oleh\n\nsalah seorang daripada pengendali-pengendali pelayaran tetap yang menjadi pihak\n\nkepada perjanjian itu dengan Suruhanjaya dalam masa dua minggu dari\n\ntarikh perjanjian itu ditandatangani.\n\n(2) Jika apa-apa perubahan atau pindaan dibuat kepada Perjanjian Perkongsian\n\nVesel itu selepas pemfailan perjanjian itu di bawah subperenggan (1), salah seorang\n\ndaripada pengendali-pengendali pelayaran tetap yang menjadi pihak kepada perjanjian\n\nitu hendaklah memfailkan perubahan atau pindaan itu secara bertulis dengan\n\nSuruhanjaya dalam masa dua minggu dari tarikh perubahan atau pindaan itu dibuat.\n\n(3) Jika perubahan atau pindaan yang disebut dalam subperenggan (2) tidak\n\ndibuat secara bertulis, salah seorang daripada pengendali-pengendali pelayaran tetap itu\n\nhendaklah memfailkan dengan Suruhanjaya suatu memorandum yang memberikan\n\nperihalan terperinci mengenai perubahan atau pindaan itu secara bertulis dengan\n\nsecepat yang dapat dilaksanakan.\n\n(4) Jika mana-mana pengendali pelayaran tetap yang menjadi pihak kepada\n\nPerjanjian Perkongsian Vesel ingin memohon suatu pengecualian blok yang baharu\n\nselepas tamat tempoh Perintah Pengecualian Blok bagi Perjanjian Perkongsian Vessel itu,\n\nsalah seorang daripada pengendali pelayaran tetap itu hendaklah membuat permohonan\n\nkepada Suruhanjaya sekurang-kurangnya enam bulan sebelum tamat tempoh\n\nperintah itu.\n\nKewajipan untuk menjadikan tersedia dokumen atau maklumat"}},{"id":"MY-H6998-A6","no":6,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 6"},"text":{"ms":"6. (1) Apabila diminta oleh Suruhanjaya, pengendali-pengendali pelayaran tetap\n\nhendaklah menjadikan tersedia kepada Suruhanjaya apa-apa dokumen atau maklumat\n\nyang berhubungan dengan perkhidmatan pelayaran tetap melalui pengangkutan laut\n\natau perkhidmatan lain yang disediakan oleh pengendali pelayaran tetap itu di bawah\n\nPerjanjian Perkongsian Vesel yang kepadanya pengendali-pengendali pelayaran tetap itu\n\nmenjadi pihak, dalam apa-apa bentuk, mengikut apa-apa cara dan dalam apa-apa tempoh\n\nyang ditentukan oleh Suruhanjaya.\n\n(2) Pengendali-pengendali pelayaran tetap adalah dikehendaki untuk\n\nmengemukakan dokumen atau maklumat secara individu kepada Suruhanjaya,\n\nberhubung dengan caj deposit kontena bagi penilaian oleh Suruhanjaya.\n\n(3) Pengendali-pengendali pelayaran tetap hendaklah menjadikan tersedia\n\napa-apa maklumat berkenaan dengan harga atau tarif bagi perkhidmatan pelayaran tetap\n\nmelalui pengangkutan laut, atau struktur dan tahap perkhidmatan bagi perkhidmatan\n\npelayaran tetap melalui pengangkutan laut ini, di bawah Perjanjian Perkongsian Vesel.\n\n(4) Pengendali pelayaran tetap itu hendaklah menjadikan tersedia maklumat\n\nyang disebut di bawah subseksyen (3)—\n\n(a) di pejabat pengendali pelayaran tetap itu atau ejennya di Malaysia; dan\n\n(b) secara umum dalam laman sesawang internet.\n\nPembatalan pengecualian blok"}},{"id":"MY-H6998-A7","no":7,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 7"},"text":{"ms":"7. (1) Suruhanjaya boleh, dengan notis secara bertulis kepada pengendali pelayaran\n\ntetap, membatalkan pengecualian blok yang diberikan di bawah perenggan 3 jika—\n\n(a) apa-apa pindaan yang dibuat kepada Perjanjian Perkongsian Vesel\n\nyang melanggar apa-apa syarat yang dikenakan di bawah perenggan 4;\n\n(b) terdapat suatu kegagalan untuk mematuhi apa-apa obligasi yang\n\ndikenakan di bawah perenggan 5 dan 6; atau\n\n(c) Suruhanjaya berpendapat bahawa Perjanjian Perkongsian Vesel itu\n\nbukan suatu perjanjian yang baginya seksyen 5 Akta terpakai.\n\n(2) Pembatalan yang dibuat oleh Suruhanjaya di bawah subperenggan (1)\n\nhendaklah berkuat kuasa—\n\n(a) dalam hal subsubperenggan (1)(a) atau (b), dari tarikh pelanggaran\n\nsyarat atau kegagalan mematuhi obligasi yang dikenakan, mengikut\n\nmana-mana yang berkenaan; dan\n\n(b) dalam hal subsubperenggan (1)(c), dari tarikh yang ditentukan oleh\n\nSuruhanjaya dalam notis itu.\n\nDibuat 25 Mac 2024\n\n[KPDNKK.100-1/4/33; MyCC/100-1/1/1; PN(PU2)724/III]\n\nDATO' SERI MOHD HISHAMUDIN MOHD YUNUS\n\nPengerusi\n\nSuruhanjaya Persaingan\n\nCOMPETITION ACT 2010\n\nCOMPETITION (BLOCK EXEMPTION FOR VESSEL SHARING AGREEMENTS IN RESPECT\n\nOF LINER SHIPPING SERVICES THROUGH TRANSPORTATION BY SEA) ORDER 2024\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 8(1) of the Competition Act 2010\n\n[Act 712], the Commission makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-16"};
  FT["MY-H6999"] = {"id":"MY-H6999","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 95/2025&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2025年娱乐税（豁免）（第3号）令","en":"ENTERTAINMENTS DUTY (EXEMPTION) (NO. 3) ORDER 2025","orig":"ENTERTAINMENTS DUTY (EXEMPTION) (NO. 3) ORDER 2025","ms":"Perintah Duti Hiburan (Pengecualian) (Bilangan 3) 2025","vi":"Lệnh về Thuế giải trí (Miễn trừ) (số 3) năm 2025","th":"คำสั่งภาษีบันเทิง (การยกเว้น) (ฉบับที่ 3) ค.ศ. 2025","id":"Perintah Bea Hiburan (Pembebasan) (Nomor 3) Tahun 2025"},"level":"regulation","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA95","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2025","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\2025_P.U.(A)95-2025_ENTERTAINMENTS DUTY (EXEMPTION) (NO. 3) ORDER 2025.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H6999-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Duti Hiburan (Pengecualian)\n\n(No. 3) 2025.\n\nPengecualian"}},{"id":"MY-H6999-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Menteri mengecualikan enam puluh peratus daripada duti hiburan yang\n\nkena dibayar atas tiket masuk bagi persembahan 2025 Jason Zhang FUTURE · LIVE\n\n– [Leave For 1982] World Tour – Kuala Lumpur yang telah diadakan di Stadium Merdeka,\n\nKuala Lumpur pada 11 Januari 2025.\n\nDibuat 17 Mac 2025\n\n[MOF.700-4/6/39; PN(PU2)174/JLD.12]\n\nDATUK SERI AMIR HAMZAH AZIZAN\n\nMenteri Kewangan II\n\nENTERTAINMENTS DUTY ACT 1953\n\nENTERTAINMENTS DUTY (EXEMPTION) (NO. 3) ORDER 2025\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by paragraph 12(1)(b) of the\n\nEntertainments Duty Act 1953 [Act 103], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation"}}],"pack":"my-16"};
  FT["MY-H700"] = {"id":"MY-H700","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 101/2026&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2026年印刷机与出版物（不良出版物管制）（第14号）令","en":"PRINTING PRESSES AND PUBLICATIONS (CONTROL OF UNDESIRABLE PUBLICATIONS) (NO. 14) ORDER 2026","orig":"PRINTING PRESSES AND PUBLICATIONS (CONTROL OF UNDESIRABLE PUBLICATIONS) (NO. 14) ORDER 2026","ms":"Perintah Mesin Cetak dan Penerbitan (Kawalan Penerbitan Tidak Diingini) (Bilangan 14) 2026","vi":"Lệnh về Máy in và ấn phẩm (Kiểm soát ấn phẩm không mong muốn) (số 14) năm 2026","th":"คำสั่งแท่นพิมพ์และสิ่งพิมพ์ (การควบคุมสิ่งพิมพ์ที่ไม่พึงประสงค์) (ฉบับที่ 14) ค.ศ. 2026","id":"Perintah Mesin Cetak dan Penerbitan (Pengendalian Terbitan Tidak Diinginkan) (Nomor 14) Tahun 2026"},"level":"regulation","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA101","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2026","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\2026_P.U.(A)101-2026_PRINTING PRESSES AND PUBLICATIONS (CONTROL OF UNDESIRABLE PUBLICATIONS) (NO. 14) ORDER 2026.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H700-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Mesin Cetak dan Penerbitan\n\n(Kawalan Hasil Penerbitan Tidak Diingini) (No. 14) 2026.\n\nLarangan"}},{"id":"MY-H700-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Pencetakan, pengimportan, penghasilan, penghasilan semula, penerbitan,\n\npenjualan, pengeluaran, pengelilingan, pengedaran atau pemilikan hasil penerbitan\n\nyang diperihalkan dalam Jadual yang mungkin memudaratkan ketenteraman awam\n\ndan yang mungkin memudaratkan keselamatan adalah dilarang secara mutlak\n\ndi seluruh Malaysia.\n\nJADUAL\n\n(1)\n\nTajuk Hasil\n\nPenerbitan\n\n(2)\n\nPenerbit\n\n(3)\n\nBahasa\n\n国 内 革 命 战 争 时 期（四） --\n\n肃 反 与 平 反。 反 党 与 分 裂\n\n21 世 纪 出 版 社\n\nTWENTY FIRST CENTURY\n\nPUBLICATION\n\nCina\n\nDibuat 9 Februari 2026\n\n[KDN.PK.S.600-16/15/158; PN(PU2)417/JLD.28]\n\nDATUK SERI SAIFUDDIN NASUTION BIN ISMAIL\n\nMenteri Dalam Negeri\n\nPRINTING PRESSES AND PUBLICATIONS ACT 1984\n\nPRINTING PRESSES AND PUBLICATIONS\n\n(CONTROL OF UNDESIRABLE PUBLICATIONS) (NO. 14) ORDER 2026\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 7(1) of the Printing Presses\n\nand Publications Act 1984 [Act 301], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation\n\n1. This order may be cited as the Printing Presses and Publications\n\n(Control of Undesirable Publications) (No. 14) Order 2026.\n\nProhibition\n\n2. The printing, importation, production, reproduction, publishing, sale, issue,\n\ncirculation, distribution or possession of the publication described in the Schedule\n\nwhich is likely to be prejudicial to public order and likely to be prejudicial to security\n\nis absolutely prohibited throughout Malaysia.\n\nSCHEDULE\n\n(1)\n\nTitle of\n\nPublication\n\n(2)\n\nPublisher\n\n(3)\n\nLanguage\n\n国 内 革 命 战 争 时 期（四） --\n\n肃 反 与 平 反。 反 党 与 分 裂\n\n21 世 纪 出 版 社\n\nTWENTY FIRST CENTURY\n\nPUBLICATION\n\nChinese\n\nMade 9 February 2026\n\n[KDN.PK.S.600-16/15/158; PN(PU2)417/JLD.28]\n\nDATUK SERI SAIFUDDIN NASUTION BIN ISMAIL\n\nMinister of Home Affairs"}}],"pack":"my-16"};
  FT["MY-H7000"] = {"id":"MY-H7000","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 95/2026&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2026年娱乐税（豁免）（第10号）令","en":"ENTERTAINMENTS DUTY (EXEMPTION) (NO. 10) ORDER 2026","orig":"ENTERTAINMENTS DUTY (EXEMPTION) (NO. 10) ORDER 2026","ms":"Perintah Duti Hiburan (Pengecualian) (Bilangan 10) 2026","vi":"Lệnh về Thuế giải trí (Miễn trừ) (số 10) năm 2026","th":"คำสั่งภาษีบันเทิง (การยกเว้น) (ฉบับที่ 10) ค.ศ. 2026","id":"Perintah Bea Hiburan (Pembebasan) (Nomor 10) Tahun 2026"},"level":"regulation","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA95","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2026","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\2026_P.U.(A)95-2026_ENTERTAINMENTS DUTY (EXEMPTION) (NO. 10) ORDER 2026.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H7000-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Duti Hiburan (Pengecualian)\n\n(No. 10) 2026.\n\nPengecualian"}},{"id":"MY-H7000-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Menteri mengecualikan tiket masuk bagi persembahan Diljit Dosanjh AURA Tour\n\nyang telah diadakan di Axiata Arena Bukit Jalil, Kuala Lumpur pada 24 September 2025\n\ndaripada duti hiburan.\n\nDibuat 19 Disember 2025\n\n[MOF.700-4/6/46; PN(PU2)174/JLD.14]\n\nDATUK SERI AMIR HAMZAH AZIZAN\n\nMenteri Kewangan II\n\nENTERTAINMENTS DUTY ACT 1953\n\nENTERTAINMENTS DUTY (EXEMPTION) (NO. 10) ORDER 2026\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by paragraph 12(1)(b)\n\nof the Entertainments Duty Act 1953 [Act 103], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation"}}],"pack":"my-16"};
  FT["MY-H7001"] = {"id":"MY-H7001","coverage":"full","language":"en","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 96/1967&status=PINDAAN","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":3,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"1967年法律的修改（就业信息）（婆罗洲各州的延伸）令","en":"MODIFICATION OF LAWS (EMPLOYMENT INFORMATION)(EXTENSION BORNEO STATES) ORDER 1967","orig":"MODIFICATION OF LAWS (EMPLOYMENT INFORMATION)(EXTENSION BORNEO STATES) ORDER 1967","vi":"Lệnh về Sửa đổi các luật (Thông tin việc làm) (Mở rộng áp dụng cho các bang Borneo) năm 1967","th":"คำสั่งการปรับปรุงกฎหมาย (ข้อมูลการจ้างงาน) (การขยายใช้กับรัฐบอร์เนียว) ค.ศ. 1967","id":"Perintah Modifikasi Undang-Undang (Informasi Ketenagakerjaan) (Perluasan ke Negara-Negara Bagian Borneo) Tahun 1967","ms":"Perintah Pengubahsuaian Undang-Undang (Maklumat Pekerjaan) (Pelanjutan ke Negeri-Negeri Borneo) 1967"},"level":"regulation","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA96","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"1967","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 3 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\1967_P.U.(A)96-1967_MODIFICATION OF LAWS (EMPLOYMENT INFORMATION)(EXTENSION BORNEO STATES) ORDER 1967.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H7001-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"en":"1. This Order may be cited as the Modification of Laws (Trade citation.\nDisputes) (Extension to Borneo States) Order, 1967."}},{"id":"MY-H7001-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"en":"2. The Trade Disputes Ordinance, 1949 (hereinafter called \"the Modification\nextended Ordinance\") and the Trade Disputes (Notice) Regulations, #2dexeosion\n1951, are extended to Sabah and Sarawak with the modifications set out Ordinance\n\nin the Schedule to this Order.                                        Pe"}},{"id":"MY-H7001-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"en":"3. The Trade Disputes Ordinance of Sabah and any subsidiary legis- Repeal ot\nlation made thereunder and the Trade Disputes Ordinance of Sarawak \"43 ana\n\nand any subsidiary legislation made thereunder are hereby repealed: ee\n\nProvided that all appointments made and all acts done under the\nOrdinances hereby repealed and subsisting at the commencement of\nthis Order shall be deemed to have been made or done under the\nextended Ordinance and shall continue in force until they are revoked\nor suspended or have had their effect.\n\nSCHEDULB\n\nPART I\n\nMODIFICATIONS TO BE MADE TO THE TRADE DISPUTES\nORDINANCE, 1949, IN HB een TO THE BORNEO\nES\n\nSection                       Modification\n2     ...    wa     For the definition of \"Commissioner\" in section 2 substitute\nthe following definition:\n\"\"Commissioner' means the Commissioner for Labour\nand all Deputy Commissioners and Assistant Commis-\n\nSabah         sioners appointed under the Labour Ordinance of Sabah\n\nCap. 67.          or of Sarawak, as the case may be, and includes any other\n\nSarawak        officer appointed under either of the said Labour\n\n_         Ordinances for the purpose of carrying out the provisions\nthereof;\".\n\nP.U. 96-97.                                     132\n\nP.U. 96.\nMALAYSIA ACT\n\nMODIFICATION OF Laws (EMPLOYMENT INFORMATION) (EXTENSION TO\nBorneo STATES) ORDER, 1967\n\n25 of 7903.    In exercise of the powers conferred by section 74 of the Malaysia Act,\nthe Yang di-Perluan Agong hereby makes the following Order:\n\nCitntion.      1. This Order may be cited as the Modification of Laws (Employment\nInformation) (Extension to Borneo States) Order, 1967.\n\nExtension     2. (1) The Employment Information Ordinance, 1953 (hereinafter called\n\n33 of 1953.    \"the extended Ordinance') is extended to the Borneo States.\n\n(2) In the application of the extended Ordinance to the Borneo\nStates—\n\n(a) for the definition of \"Commissioner\" in section 2 there shall be\nsubstituted the following definition:\n\n\"Commissioner\" means the Commissioner for Labour and all\nDeputy Commissioners and Assistant Commissioners appomted\n\nSabah Cap. 67        under the Labour Ordinance of Sabah or of Sarawak, ag the\nCap. 76.             case may be;\n\n(b) there shall be inserted in section 2, after the definition of\n\"Commissioner\", the following definition:\n\n\"Labour Officer' means any officer appointed under the\nLabour Ordinance of Sabah or of Sarawak, as the case may\nbe, for the purpose of carrying out the provisions of that\nOrdinance;\";\n\n(c) references in the extended Ordinance to any written law in force\nin the States of Malaya or any part thereof shall—\n\n(i) if such written law has been extended to apply to Sabah\nor Sarawak, as the case may be, be construed as\nreferences to such written law as so extended; or\n\n(ii) if such written law has not been so extended, be construed\nas references to the corresponding written law, if any, in\nforce in Sabah or Sarawak, as the case may be.\n\nMade this 23rd day of January, 1967.\n(AG. 3375 SF. 143.1\n\nBy Command,\n\nTAN Sri ABDUL JAMIL BIN ABDUL Rals,\nSecretary to the Cabinet\n\n(To be laid before each House of Parliament pursuant to section 74 (9)\nof the Malaysia Act.)\n\nvA   P.U. 97.\nINSURANCE ACT, 1963\n1 of 1963.    IN exercise of the powers conferred by section 45 of the Insurance\nAct, 1963, the Minister of Finance hereby makes the following\nregulations :\nCitation,    1. These regulations may be cited as the Insurance (Amendment)\n\nRegulations, 1967,"}}],"pack":"my-16"};
  FT["MY-H7002"] = {"id":"MY-H7002","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 96/2012&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2012年机动车（人员的授权）（修正）规则","en":"MOTOR VEHICLES (AUTHORISATION OF PERSON) (AMENDMENT) RULES 2012","orig":"MOTOR VEHICLES (AUTHORISATION OF PERSON) (AMENDMENT) RULES 2012","ms":"Kaedah Kenderaan Bermotor (Kebenaran Orang) (Pindaan) 2012","vi":"Quy tắc về Xe cơ giới (Ủy quyền cho người) (Sửa đổi) năm 2012","th":"กฎรถยนต์ (การมอบอำนาจให้บุคคล) (การแก้ไข) ค.ศ. 2012","id":"Tata Tertib Kendaraan Bermotor (Kewenangan Orang) (Perubahan) Tahun 2012"},"level":"regulation","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA96","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2012","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\2012_P.U.(A)96-2012_MOTOR VEHICLES (AUTHORISATION OF PERSON) (AMENDMENT) RULES 2012.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H7002-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Kaedah-kaedah ini bolehlah dinamakan Kaedah-Kaedah Kenderaan\n\nMotor (Pemberikuasaan Orang) (Pindaan) 2012.\n\n(2) Kaedah-Kaedah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 6 April 2012.\n\nPindaan kaedah 3"}},{"id":"MY-H7002-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Kaedah-Kaedah Kenderaan Motor (Pemberikuasaan Orang) 1994\n\n[P.U. (A) 104/1994] dipinda dalam subkaedah 3(1)—\n\n(a) dengan menggantikan perkataan \"seksyen 16 dan 27\" dengan perkataan\n\n\"seksyen 16, 27 dan 120\"; dan\n\n(b) dengan menggantikan perkataan \"dan pelesenan pemandu-pemandu\n\nmotor\" dengan perkataan \", pelesenan pemandu kenderaan motor dan\n\npengutipan bayaran atau caj\".\n\nDibuat 26 Mac 2012\n\n[KP/PUU/0.440/W/BD/9; PN(PU2)460/LXVI]\n\nDATO' SERI KONG CHO HA\n\nMenteri Pengangkutan\n\nROAD TRANSPORT ACT 1987\n\nMOTOR VEHICLES (AUTHORISATION OF PERSON) (AMENDMENT) RULES 2012\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by paragraph 66(1)(qq) and section 125 of the\n\nRoad Transport Act 1987 [Act 333], the Minister makes the following rules:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-16"};
