  FT["MY-H7065"] = {"id":"MY-H7065","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 9/2019&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2019年与勋章有关的罪行（附表二修正）令","en":"OFFENCES RELATING TO AWARDS (AMENDMENT OF SECOND SCHEDULE) ORDER 2019","orig":"OFFENCES RELATING TO AWARDS (AMENDMENT OF SECOND SCHEDULE) ORDER 2019","ms":"Perintah Kesalahan Berhubung dengan Darjah Kebesaran (Pindaan Jadual Kedua) 2019","vi":"Lệnh về Các tội liên quan đến huân chương (Sửa đổi Phụ lục thứ hai) năm 2019","th":"คำสั่งความผิดเกี่ยวกับเครื่องราชอิสริยาภรณ์ (การแก้ไขภาคผนวกที่สอง) ค.ศ. 2019","id":"Perintah Tindak Pidana Terkait Tanda Jasa (Perubahan Lampiran Kedua) Tahun 2019"},"level":"regulation","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA9","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2019","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\2019_P.U.(A)9-2019_OFFENCES RELATING TO AWARDS (AMENDMENT OF SECOND SCHEDULE) ORDER 2019.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H7065-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Kesalahan yang berhubungan dengan\n\nAnugerah (Pindaan Jadual Kedua) 2019.\n\nPindaan Jadual Kedua"}},{"id":"MY-H7065-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Akta Kesalahan yang berhubungan dengan Anugerah 2017 dipinda dengan\n\nmenggantikan Jadual Kedua dengan Jadual yang berikut:\n\n\"JADUAL KEDUA\n\n[Seksyen 17]\n\nUndang-Undang Negeri\n\nNegeri Undang-Undang Negeri Peruntukan yang\n\nberhubungan dengan\n\nkesalahan\n\nPerak Enakmen Lambang, Gelaran dan Anugerah\n\n(Mencegah Penggunaan Tidak Wajar) Perak 2016\n\n[Enakmen 12]\n\nSeksyen 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8, 9, 10,\n\n11 dan 12.\n\nKelantan Enakmen Lambang-lambang dan Nama-nama\n\n(Mencegah daripada Salahguna), 1977\n\n[Enakmen Bil. 8 Tahun 1977]\n\nSeksyen 3, 4, 5A, 5B, 5C, 5D,\n\n5E, 5F, 5G, 5H, 5I, 5J dan 6.\n\nNegeri Undang-Undang Negeri Peruntukan yang\n\nberhubungan dengan\n\nkesalahan\n\nMelaka Enakmen Lambang-lambang dan Nama-nama\n\n(Mencegah Penggunaan Yang Tidak Betul) 1981\n\n[Enakmen No. 2 tahun 1981]\n\nSeksyen 3, 4A, 4B, 4C, 4D, 4E,\n\n4F, 4G, 4H dan 5.\n\nJohor Enakmen Lambang, Gelaran dan Anugerah\n\n(Mencegah Penggunaan Tidak Wajar) Johor 2017\n\n[Enakmen 11]\n\nSeksyen 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8, 9, 10,\n\n11 dan 12.\n\nPahang Enakmen Lambang, Gelaran atau Anugerah\n\n(Mencegah Penggunaan Tidak Wajar) Pahang\n\n2017 [Enakmen 18]\n\nSeksyen 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8, 9, 10,\n\n11 dan 12.\n\nSelangor Emblems, Names, Titles and Honours (Prevention\n\nof Improper Use) 1962 [Enactment 13]\n\nSeksyen 3, 4, 4A, 4B, 4C, 4D,\n\n4E, 4F, 4G, 4H dan 5. \"\n\nDibuat 2 Januari 2019\n\n[JPM.S 100-1/7/3 Jld 2 (7)/; PN(PU2)750]\n\n Dengan Titah Perintah\n\nDR. ISMAIL BIN HJ. BAKAR\n\nSetiausaha Jemaah Menteri\n\nOFFENCES RELATING TO AWARDS ACT 2017\n\nOFFENCES RELATING TO AWARDS\n\n(AMENDMENT OF SECOND SCHEDULE) ORDER 2019\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 19 of the Offences relating to Awards\n\nAct 2017 [Act 787], the Yang di-Pertuan Agong upon request of a Ruler and Yang di-Pertua\n\nNegeri, makes the following order:\n\nCitation"}}],"pack":"my-16"};
  FT["MY-H7066"] = {"id":"MY-H7066","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 9/2020&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":3,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2020年公司（公司审计师与清算人费用）条例","en":"COMPANIES (COMPANY AUDITOR AND LIQUIDATOR FEES) REGULATIONS 2020","orig":"COMPANIES (COMPANY AUDITOR AND LIQUIDATOR FEES) REGULATIONS 2020","ms":"Peraturan Syarikat (Fi Juruaudit dan Pelikuidasi Syarikat) 2020","vi":"Quy định về Công ty (Phí kiểm toán viên và người thanh lý công ty) năm 2020","th":"ข้อบังคับบริษัท (ค่าธรรมเนียมผู้สอบบัญชีและผู้ชำระบัญชีบริษัท) ค.ศ. 2020","id":"Peraturan Perusahaan (Biaya Auditor dan Likuidator Perusahaan) Tahun 2020"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA9","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2020","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 3 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2020_P.U.(A)9-2020_COMPANIES (COMPANY AUDITOR AND LIQUIDATOR FEES) REGULATIONS 2020.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H7066-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Peraturan-peraturan ini bolehlah dinamakan Peraturan-Peraturan\nSyarikat (Fi Juruaudit Syarikat dan Penyelesai) 2020.\n\n(2) Peraturan-Peraturan ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 15 Januari 2020.\n\nFi"}},{"id":"MY-H7066-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Fi yang kena dibayar berkenaan dengan perkara yang dinyatakan dalam ruang (2)\nJadual adalah sebagaimana yang dinyatakan dalam ruang (3).\n\nPembatalan"}},{"id":"MY-H7066-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Peraturan-Peraturan Fee  (Juruaudit Syarikat dan Penyelesai) [ P.U. 371/66]\ndibatalkan.\n\nJADUAL\n\n[Peraturan 2]\n\n(1)\nBil.\n(2)\nPerkara\n(3)\nFi\n(RM)\n1. Kelulusan sebagai juruaudit syarikat\n\n500.00 setiap kelulusan\n2. Pembaharuan kelulusan sebagai  juruaudit\nsyarikat\n500.00 setiap\npembaharuan kelulusan\n\n3. Kelulusan sebagai penyelesai\n\n500.00 setiap kelulusan\n4. Pembaharuan kelulusan sebagai penyelesai 500.00 setiap\npembaharuan kelulusan\n\nDibuat 13 Januari 2020\n[KPDNKK 600-1/2/58; PN(PU2)740/III]\n\nDATUK SERI SAIFUDDIN NASUTION BIN ISMAIL\nMenteri Perdagangan Dalam Negeri\ndan Hal Ehwal Pengguna\n\nCOMPANIES ACT 2016\n\nCOMPANIES (COMPANY AUDITOR AND LIQUIDATOR FEES) REGULATIONS 2020\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by paragraph 613(1) (a) of the Companies Act 2016\n[Act 777], the Minister makes the following regulations:\n\nCitation and commencement\n1. (1) These regulations may be cited as the Companies (Company Auditor and\nLiquidator Fees) Regulations 2020.\n\n(2) These Regulations come into operation on 15 January 2020.\n\nFees\n2. The fees payable in respect of the matters specified in column (2) of the Schedule\nshall be as specified in column (3).\n\nRevocation\n3. The Fees (Company Auditors and Liquidators) Regulations 1966 [ P.U. 371/66] is\nrevoked.\n\nSCHEDULE\n\n[Regulation 2]\n\n(1)\nNo.\n(2)\nMatter\n(3)\nFee\n(RM)\n1. Approval as a company auditor\n\n500.00 per approval\n2. Renewal of approval as a company auditor 500.00 per renewal of\napproval\n3. Approval as a liquidator\n\n500.00 per approval\n\n4. Renewal of approval as a liquidator 500.00 per renewal of\napproval\n\nMade 13 January 2020\n[KPDNKK 600-1/2/58; PN(PU2)740/III]\n\nDATUK SERI SAIFUDDIN NASUTION BIN ISMAIL\nMinister of Domestic Trade\nand Consumer Affairs"}}],"pack":"my-16"};
  FT["MY-H7067"] = {"id":"MY-H7067","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 9/2021&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":15,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2021年传染病预防与控制（疫区地方措施）（有条件行动管制）条例","en":"PREVENTION AND CONTROL OF INFECTIOUS DISEASES (MEASURES WITHIN INFECTED LOCAL AREAS) (CONDITIONAL MOVEMENT CONTROL) REGULATIONS 2021","orig":"PREVENTION AND CONTROL OF INFECTIOUS DISEASES (MEASURES WITHIN INFECTED LOCAL AREAS) (CONDITIONAL MOVEMENT CONTROL) REGULATIONS 2021","ms":"Peraturan Pencegahan dan Kawalan Penyakit Berjangkit (Langkah dalam Kawasan Tempatan Berjangkit) (Kawalan Pergerakan Bersyarat) 2021","vi":"Quy định về Phòng chống bệnh truyền nhiễm (Các biện pháp trong khu vực bị nhiễm bệnh) (Kiểm soát di chuyển có điều kiện) năm 2021","th":"ข้อบังคับการป้องกันและควบคุมโรคติดต่อ (มาตรการในท้องที่ที่ติดเชื้อ) (การควบคุมการเคลื่อนย้ายแบบมีเงื่อนไข) ค.ศ. 2021","id":"Peraturan Pencegahan dan Pengendalian Penyakit Menular (Tindakan di Wilayah Lokal Terinfeksi) (Pengendalian Mobilitas Bersyarat) Tahun 2021"},"level":"regulation","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA9","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2021","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 15 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\2021_P.U.(A)9-2021_PREVENTION AND CONTROL OF INFECTIOUS DISEASES (MEASURES WITHIN INFECTED LOCAL AREAS) (CONDITION.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H7067-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Peraturan-peraturan ini bolehlah dinamakan Peraturan-Peraturan\n\nPencegahan dan Pengawalan Penyakit Berjangkit (Langkah-Langkah di dalam\n\nKawasan Tempatan Jangkitan) (Kawalan Pergerakan Bersyarat) 2021.\n\n(2) Peraturan-Peraturan ini berkuat kuasa bagi tempoh\n\nmulai 13 Januari 2021 hingga 26 Januari 2021.\n\nPemakaian"}},{"id":"MY-H7067-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Peraturan-Peraturan ini hendaklah terpakai bagi Negeri Kedah, Kelantan,\n\nNegeri Sembilan, Pahang, Perak dan Terengganu.\n\nAktiviti terlarang"}},{"id":"MY-H7067-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Tiada seorang pun boleh melakukan, menganjurkan, mengusahakan atau\n\nselainnya terlibat dalam, mana-mana aktiviti terlarang yang dinyatakan dalam Jadual.\n\nLarangan pergerakan ke tempat yang tertakluk kepada perintah kawalan\n\npergerakan diperketat"}},{"id":"MY-H7067-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4"},"text":{"ms":"4. (1) Tiada seorang pun boleh masuk ke dalam atau keluar dari suatu tempat\n\nyang tertakluk kepada suatu perintah kawalan pergerakan diperketat kecuali\n\nmana-mana orang yang memberikan perkhidmatan jagaan kesihatan dan perubatan atau\n\nyang diberikan kebenaran oleh pegawai diberi kuasa.\n\n(2) Bagi maksud subperaturan (1), \"perintah kawalan pergerakan diperketat\"\n\nmerujuk kepada arahan yang diberikan oleh pegawai diberi kuasa di bawah\n\nsubseksyen 11(3) Akta.\n\nKawalan pergerakan di dalam kawasan tempatan jangkitan"}},{"id":"MY-H7067-A5","no":5,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 5"},"text":{"ms":"5. Tiada seorang pun boleh bergerak dari satu kawasan tempatan jangkitan ke\n\nkawasan tempatan jangkitan yang lain kecuali dengan kebenaran pegawai diberi kuasa.\n\nPergerakan bagi maksud peperiksaan"}},{"id":"MY-H7067-A6","no":6,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 6"},"text":{"ms":"6. (1) Mana-mana orang yang dikehendaki untuk menduduki apa-apa\n\npeperiksaan yang ditentukan oleh pihak berkuasa yang berkenaan di mana-mana\n\ninstitusi pembelajaran dibenarkan untuk bergerak dari satu kawasan tempatan jangkitan\n\nke kawasan tempatan jangkitan yang lain bagi maksud persediaan dan menduduki\n\npeperiksaan itu di institusi pembelajaran itu.\n\n(2) Mana-mana orang yang dikehendaki untuk menduduki apa-apa\n\npeperiksaan yang ditentukan oleh mana-mana badan profesional di mana-mana tempat\n\nyang ditentukan oleh badan profesional itu dibenarkan untuk bergerak dari\n\nsatu kawasan tempatan jangkitan ke kawasan tempatan jangkitan yang lain bagi\n\nmaksud persediaan dan menduduki peperiksaan itu.\n\n(3) Mana-mana orang yang terlibat dalam mengajar bagi persediaan\n\npeperiksaan atau dalam penjalanan apa-apa peperiksaan yang disebut di bawah\n\nsubperaturan (1) dan (2) dibenarkan untuk bergerak dari satu kawasan tempatan\n\njangkitan ke kawasan tempatan jangkitan yang lain bagi maksud mengajar bagi\n\npersediaan peperiksaan dan penjalanan peperiksaan itu.\n\n(4) Mana-mana orang yang bergerak dari satu kawasan tempatan jangkitan\n\nke kawasan tempatan jangkitan yang lain bagi maksud yang disebut di bawah\n\nsubperaturan (1), (2) dan (3)—\n\n(a) hendaklah memberikan bukti yang perlu sebagaimana yang\n\ndikehendaki oleh seseorang pegawai diberi kuasa; dan\n\n(b) boleh disertai oleh seorang ibu, bapa atau penjaga.\n\nPergerakan ke institusi pembelajaran"}},{"id":"MY-H7067-A7","no":7,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 7"},"text":{"ms":"7. (1) Seseorang boleh bergerak dari satu kawasan tempatan jangkitan\n\nke kawasan tempatan jangkitan yang lain bagi maksud untuk menghadiri pembelajaran\n\ndi mana-mana institusi pembelajaran atau untuk melaksanakan apa-apa tugas\n\ndi mana-mana institusi pembelajaran.\n\n(2) Jika seseorang yang disebut di bawah subperaturan (1) bergerak dari\n\nsatu kawasan tempatan jangkitan ke kawasan tempatan jangkitan yang lain, orang itu\n\nhendaklah memberikan bukti jika dikehendaki oleh seseorang pegawai diberi kuasa.\n\nLarangan berarak"}},{"id":"MY-H7067-A8","no":8,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 8"},"text":{"ms":"8. Tiada seorang pun boleh dengan apa-apa cara menyertai atau terlibat\n\ndalam apa-apa perarakan.\n\nKawalan berhimpun"}},{"id":"MY-H7067-A9","no":9,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 9"},"text":{"ms":"9. Seseorang boleh berhimpun atau terlibat dalam suatu perhimpunan termasuk\n\nberkumpul untuk bersembahyang di mana-mana tempat ibadat agama orang itu\n\ntertakluk kepada apa-apa arahan Ketua Pengarah yang dikeluarkan di bawah\n\nperaturan 14.\n\nPengangkutan awam"}},{"id":"MY-H7067-A10","no":10,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 10"},"text":{"ms":"10. Walau apa pun jumlah kapasiti maksimum bilangan penumpang yang boleh\n\ndibawa di dalam mana-mana pengangkutan awam darat, laut atau udara,\n\nseseorang pemegang lesen atau permit mana-mana pengangkutan awam darat, laut atau\n\nudara untuk membawa penumpang hendaklah memastikan pengangkutan awam yang\n\nberhubungan dengan lesen atau permitnya membawa bilangan penumpang mengikut\n\narahan Ketua Pengarah yang dikeluarkan di bawah peraturan 14.\n\nKehendak untuk menjalani pemeriksaan kesihatan apabila tiba di Malaysia"}},{"id":"MY-H7067-A11","no":11,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 11"},"text":{"ms":"11. (1) Pegawai diberi kuasa boleh mengarahkan mana-mana warganegara,\n\npemastautin tetap Malaysia, ekspatriat atau kor diplomatik, atau mana-mana\n\norang asing lain yang dibenarkan oleh Ketua Pengarah Imigresen, yang memasuki\n\nMalaysia dari luar negara untuk menjalani pemeriksaan kesihatan apabila tiba\n\ndi Malaysia di mana-mana pintu masuk sebelum mendapatkan pelepasan imigresen,\n\natau di mana-mana tempat lain yang ditentukan oleh Ketua Pengarah.\n\n(2) Mana-mana orang yang disebut dalam subperaturan (1) hendaklah\n\nmematuhi apa-apa arahan yang dikeluarkan oleh seseorang pegawai diberi kuasa.\n\n(3) Jika mana-mana orang yang disebut dalam subperaturan (1) diarahkan\n\nuntuk menjalani kuarantin di rumah, orang itu hendaklah memakai gelang tangan\n\nyang disediakan oleh pegawai diberi kuasa itu.\n\nKehendak bagi majikan untuk menyebabkan pekerja asingnya menjalani ujian\n\npengesanan Penyakit Koronavirus 2019 (COVID-19)"}},{"id":"MY-H7067-A12","no":12,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 12"},"text":{"ms":"12. (1) Bagi maksud untuk mencegah dan mengawal merebaknya\n\nPenyakit Koronavirus 2019 (COVID-19) di tempat kerja, seseorang pegawai diberi kuasa\n\nboleh mengarahkan mana-mana majikan yang mengambil kerja seseorang\n\npekerja asing supaya menyebabkan pekerja asing itu menjalani ujian pengesanan\n\nPenyakit Koronavirus 2019 (COVID-19), dan majikan itu hendaklah menanggung\n\nfi, kos atau caj bagi ujian itu.\n\n(2) Bagi maksud peraturan ini, \"pekerja asing\" ertinya\n\npemegang Pas Lawatan (Kerja Sementara) yang dikeluarkan di bawah peraturan 11\n\nPeraturan-Peraturan Imigresen 1963 [F.L.N. 228/1963].\n\nPermintaan maklumat"}},{"id":"MY-H7067-A13","no":13,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 13"},"text":{"ms":"13. Seseorang pegawai diberi kuasa boleh meminta apa-apa maklumat yang\n\nberhubungan dengan pencegahan dan pengawalan penyakit berjangkit daripada\n\nmana-mana orang atau kumpulan orang.\n\nArahan Ketua Pengarah"}},{"id":"MY-H7067-A14","no":14,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 14"},"text":{"ms":"14. Ketua Pengarah boleh mengeluarkan apa-apa arahan mengikut apa-apa cara,\n\nsama ada secara am atau khusus, kepada mana-mana orang atau kumpulan orang supaya\n\nmengambil apa-apa langkah bagi maksud mencegah dan mengawal apa-apa\n\npenyakit berjangkit termasuk apa-apa arahan kepada mana-mana orang atau\n\nkumpulan orang yang melakukan, menganjurkan, mengusahakan, atau yang selainnya\n\nterlibat dalam, apa-apa aktiviti selain aktiviti terlarang yang dinyatakan dalam Jadual.\n\nKesalahan"}},{"id":"MY-H7067-A15","no":15,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 15"},"text":{"ms":"15. (1) Mana-mana orang yang melanggar mana-mana peruntukan\n\nPeraturan-Peraturan ini atau mana-mana arahan Ketua Pengarah atau\n\nseseorang pegawai diberi kuasa melakukan suatu kesalahan dan boleh,\n\napabila disabitkan, didenda tidak melebihi satu ribu ringgit atau dipenjarakan\n\nselama tempoh tidak melebihi enam bulan atau kedua-duanya.\n\n(2) Jika mana-mana orang yang melakukan suatu kesalahan di bawah\n\nPeraturan-Peraturan ini ialah suatu syarikat, perkongsian liabiliti terhad, firma,\n\npertubuhan atau kumpulan orang yang lain, seseorang yang pada masa\n\npelakuan kesalahan itu ialah seorang pengarah, pegawai pematuhan, pekongsi,\n\npengurus, setiausaha atau pegawai lain yang seumpamanya bagi syarikat,\n\nperkongsian liabiliti terhad, firma, pertubuhan atau kumpulan orang yang lain itu\n\natau yang berupa sebagai bertindak atas sifat itu atau yang dengan apa-apa cara\n\natau sehingga apa-apa takat bertanggungjawab bagi pengurusan apa-apa\n\nhal ehwal syarikat, perkongsian liabiliti terhad, firma, pertubuhan atau kumpulan orang\n\nyang lain itu atau membantu dalam pengurusannya—\n\n(a) boleh dipertuduh secara berasingan atau bersesama dalam\n\nprosiding yang sama bersekali dengan syarikat,\n\nperkongsian liabiliti terhad, firma, pertubuhan atau\n\nkumpulan orang yang lain itu; dan\n\n(b) jika syarikat, perkongsian liabiliti terhad, firma, pertubuhan atau\n\nkumpulan orang yang lain itu didapati bersalah atas kesalahan itu,\n\nhendaklah disifatkan bersalah atas kesalahan itu dan boleh\n\ndikenakan hukuman atau penalti yang sama sebagaimana seorang\n\nindividu melainkan jika, dengan mengambil kira jenis fungsinya\n\natas sifat itu dan segala hal keadaan, dia membuktikan—\n\n(i) bahawa kesalahan itu telah dilakukan\n\ntanpa pengetahuannya; dan\n\n(ii) bahawa kesalahan itu telah dilakukan tanpa persetujuan\n\natau pembiarannya dan bahawa dia telah mengambil\n\nsegala langkah yang munasabah dan menjalankan\n\nusaha yang wajar untuk menghalang pelakuan kesalahan itu.\n\nJADUAL\n\nAKTIVITI TERLARANG\n\n[Peraturan 3]\n\n1. Aktiviti pelancongan ke luar negeri oleh warganegara dan aktiviti pelancongan\n\ndalam negeri yang melibatkan pelancong asing memasuki Malaysia kecuali\n\npelancong asing daripada negara sebagaimana yang dinyatakan oleh Menteri\n\n2. Aktiviti di dalam pub dan kelab malam, kecuali perniagaan restoran di dalam\n\npub dan kelab malam\n\n3. Apa-apa aktiviti dengan kehadiran yang ramai di suatu tempat sehingga\n\nmenyukarkan untuk melaksanakan penjarakan sosial dan pematuhan kepada\n\narahan Ketua Pengarah\n\nDibuat 12 Januari 2021\n\n[KKM.600-29/4/146 Jld.2 (30); PN(PU2)470/IV]\n\n DATO' SRI DR. ADHAM BIN BABA\n\n Menteri Kesihatan\n\nPREVENTION AND CONTROL OF INFECTIOUS DISEASES ACT 1988\n\nPREVENTION AND CONTROL OF INFECTIOUS DISEASES\n\n(MEASURES WITHIN INFECTED LOCAL AREAS)\n\n(CONDITIONAL MOVEMENT CONTROL) REGULATIONS 2021\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 11(2) of the\n\nPrevention and Control of Infectious Diseases Act 1988 [Act 342], the Minister makes\n\nthe following regulations:\n\nCitation and commencement\n\n1. (1) These regulations may be cited as the Prevention and Control\n\nof Infectious Diseases (Measures within Infected Local Areas)\n\n(Conditional Movement Control) Regulations 2021.\n\n(2) These Regulations have effect for the period from 13 January 2021\n\nto 26 January 2021.\n\nApplication\n\n2. These Regulations shall apply to the States of Kedah, Kelantan, Negeri Sembilan,\n\nPahang, Perak and Terengganu.\n\nProhibited activity\n\n3. No person shall carry out, organize, undertake or otherwise be involved in,\n\nany prohibited activity as specified in the Schedule.\n\nProhibition on movement to place that is subject to enhanced movement\n\ncontrol order\n\n4. (1) No person shall enter into or exit from a place that is subject\n\nto an enhanced movement control order except any person who is providing healthcare\n\nand medical services or is given permission by an authorized officer.\n\n(2) For the purposes of subregulation (1), \"enhanced movement control order\"\n\nrefers to directions given by an authorized officer under subsection 11(3) of the Act.\n\nControl of movement within infected local area\n\n5. No person shall move from one infected local area to another infected\n\nlocal area except with the approval of the authorized officer.\n\nMovement for purpose of examination\n\n6. (1) Any person who is required to sit for any examination determined by\n\nthe relevant authority at any learning institution is allowed to move from one infected\n\nlocal area to another infected local area for the purpose of preparing and sitting for\n\nthe examination at the learning institution.\n\n(2) Any person who is required to sit for any examination determined by any\n\nprofessional body at any place determined by such professional body is allowed to move\n\nfrom one infected local area to another infected local area for the purpose of preparing\n\nand sitting for the examination.\n\n(3) Any person who is involved in providing lessons for the preparation of\n\nexamination or in the conduct of any examination mentioned under subregulations (1)\n\nand (2) is allowed to move from one infected local area to another infected local area for\n\nthe purpose of providing lessons for the preparation of the examination and conducting\n\nthe examination.\n\n(4) Any person who moves from one infected local area to another\n\ninfected local area for the purpose mentioned under subregulations (1), (2) and (3)—\n\n(a) shall provide the necessary proof as requested by an authorized\n\nofficer; and\n\n(b) may be accompanied by a mother, father or guardian.\n\nMovement to learning institution\n\n7. (1) A person may move from one infected local area to another infected\n\nlocal area for the purpose of attending learning at any learning institution or performing\n\nany duty at any learning institution.\n\n(2) If a person mentioned under subregulation (1) moves from one infected\n\nlocal area to another infected local area, he shall provide the necessary proof as requested\n\nby an authorized officer.\n\nProhibition on procession\n\n8. No person shall in any way participate or be involved in any procession.\n\nControl of gathering\n\n9. A person may gather or be involved in a gathering including congregate\n\nto perform prayers at any place of worship of his religion subject to such directions\n\nof the Director General issued under regulation 14.\n\nPublic transport\n\n10. Notwithstanding the total maximum capacity of the number of passengers that\n\nmay be carried on board any land, sea or air public transport, a holder of any land, sea or\n\nair public transport licence or permit to carry passengers shall ensure that\n\nthe public transport relating to his licence or permit carries such number of passengers\n\naccording to directions of the Director General issued under regulation 14.\n\nRequirement to undergo health examination upon arrival in Malaysia\n\n11. (1) An authorized officer may direct any citizen, permanent resident of\n\nMalaysia, expatriate or diplomatic corps, or any other foreigner permitted by the\n\nDirector General of Immigration, entering Malaysia from overseas to undergo\n\nhealth examination upon arrival in Malaysia at any point of entry before proceeding\n\nfor immigration clearance, or at any other place determined by the Director General.\n\n(2) Any person referred to in subregulation (1) shall comply with\n\nany directions issued by an authorized officer.\n\n(3) Where any person referred to in subregulation (1) is directed\n\nto undergo home quarantine, the person shall wear a wristband provided by\n\nthe authorized officer.\n\nRequirement for employer to cause his foreign employee to undergo\n\nCoronavirus Disease 2019 (COVID-19) detection test\n\n12. (1) For the purpose of preventing and controlling the spread of the\n\nCoronavirus Disease 2019 (COVID-19) at work place, an authorized officer may\n\ndirect any employer who employs a foreign employee to cause the foreign employee to\n\nundergo Coronavirus Disease 2019 (COVID-19) detection test, and the employer shall pay\n\nthe fee, cost or charges for the test.\n\n(2) For the purposes of this regulation, \"foreign employee\" means\n\na holder of a Visit Pass (Temporary Employment) issued under regulation 11 of the\n\nImmigration Regulations 1963 [F.L.N. 228/1963].\n\nRequest for information\n\n13. An authorized officer may request for any information relating to\n\nthe prevention and control of infectious disease from any person or body of persons.\n\nDirections of Director General\n\n14. The Director General may issue any directions in any manner, whether generally\n\nor specifically, to any person or group of persons to take such measures for the\n\npurpose of preventing and controlling any infectious disease including any directions\n\nto any person or group of persons carrying out, organizing, undertaking, or who is\n\notherwise involved in, any activity other than a prohibited activity as specified\n\nin the Schedule.\n\nOffence\n\n15. (1) Any person who contravenes any provision of these Regulations or\n\nany directions of the Director General or an authorized officer commits an offence and\n\nshall, on conviction, be liable to a fine not exceeding one thousand ringgit or\n\nto imprisonment for a term not exceeding six months or to both.\n\n(2) Where any person who commits an offence under these Regulations\n\nis a company, limited liability partnership, firm, society or other body of persons,\n\na person who at the time of the commission of the offence was a director,\n\ncompliance officer, partner, manager, secretary or other similar officer of the company,\n\nlimited liability partnership, firm, society or other body of persons or was purporting\n\nto act in the capacity or was in any manner or to any extent responsible for the\n\nmanagement of any of the affairs of the company, limited liability partnership, firm,\n\nsociety or other body of persons or was assisting in its management—\n\n(a) may be charged severally or jointly in the same proceedings with\n\nthe company, limited liability partnership, firm, society or\n\nother body of persons; and\n\n(b) if the company, limited liability partnership, firm, society or\n\nother body of persons is found guilty of the offence, shall be deemed\n\nto be guilty of that offence and shall be liable to the same\n\npunishment or penalty as an individual unless, having regard\n\nto the nature of his functions in that capacity and to all\n\ncircumstances, he proves—\n\n(i) that the offence was committed without his knowledge; and\n\n(ii) that the offence was committed without his consent or\n\nconnivance and that he had taken all reasonable precautions\n\nand exercised due diligence to prevent the commission\n\nof the offence.\n\nSCHEDULE\n\nPROHIBITED ACTIVITY\n\n[Regulation 3]\n\n1. Outbound tour activities by a citizen and inbound tour activities involving\n\nforeign tourists entering Malaysia except foreign tourists from countries\n\nas specified by the Minister\n\n2. Activities in pubs and night clubs, except restaurant business\n\nin pubs and night clubs\n\n3. Any activity with many people in attendance at a place making it difficult to carry\n\nout social distancing and to comply with the directions of the Director General\n\nMade 12 January 2021\n\n[KKM.600-29/4/146 Jld.2 (30); PN(PU2)470/IV]\n\nDATO' SRI DR. ADHAM BIN BABA\n\nMinister of Health"}}],"pack":"my-16"};
  FT["MY-H7068"] = {"id":"MY-H7068","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 9/2022&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":3,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2022年所得税（加速资本免税额）（旅游巴士）（修正）规则","en":"INCOME TAX (ACCELERATED CAPITAL ALLOWANCE) (EXCURSION BUS) (AMENDMENT) RULES 2022","orig":"INCOME TAX (ACCELERATED CAPITAL ALLOWANCE) (EXCURSION BUS) (AMENDMENT) RULES 2022","ms":"Kaedah Cukai Pendapatan (Elaun Modal Dipercepat) (Bas Persiaran) (Pindaan) 2022","vi":"Quy tắc về Thuế thu nhập (Khấu trừ vốn được gia tốc) (Xe buýt du lịch) (Sửa đổi) năm 2022","th":"กฎภาษีเงินได้ (ค่าเผื่อทุนแบบเร่งรัด) (รถบัสทัศนาจร) (การแก้ไข) ค.ศ. 2022","id":"Tata Tertib Pajak Penghasilan (Tunjangan Modal Dipercepat) (Bus Wisata) (Perubahan) Tahun 2022"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA9","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2022","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 3 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2022_P.U.(A)9-2022_INCOME TAX (ACCELERATED CAPITAL ALLOWANCE) (EXCURSION BUS) (AMENDMENT) RULES 2022.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H7068-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1)  Kaedah-kaedah ini bolehlah dinamakan Kaedah-Kaedah\nCukai Pendapatan (Elaun Modal Dipercepat) (Bas Persiaran) (Pindaan) 2022.\n\n(2) Kaedah-Kaedah ini berkuat kuasa mulai tahun taksiran 2022.\n\nPindaan kaedah 1"}},{"id":"MY-H7068-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Kaedah-Kaedah Cukai Pendapatan (Elaun Modal Dipercepat)\n(Bas Persiaran) 2021  [P.U. (A) 291/2021] dipinda dalam subkaedah 1(2)\ndengan memotong perkataan \"hingga tahun taksiran 2021\".\n\nPindaan kaedah 2"}},{"id":"MY-H7068-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Subkaedah 2(2) dipinda—\n\n(a) dalam perenggan (b), dengan memotong perkataan \"dan\"\ndi hujung perenggan itu:\n\n(b) dengan menggantikan perenggan (c), dengan yang berikut:\n\n \"(c) bukan merupakan suatu bas persiaran yang dipulihkan; dan\"\n\n(c)  dengan memasukkan selepas perenggan (c), perenggan yang berikut:\n\n\"(d) diperolehi dalam tempoh tahun taksiran 2020 hingga\ntahun taksiran 2024.\".\nDibuat 30 Disember 2021\n[MOF.TAX(S)700-1/3/54; LHDN.AY.A.600-12/1(29)-177; PN(PU2)80/Jld. 103]\n\nTENGKU DATUK SERI UTAMA ZAFRUL BIN TENGKU ABDUL AZIZ\n                                                Menteri Kewangan\n\n[Akan dibentangkan di Dewan Rakyat menurut subseksyen 154(2)\nAkta Cukai Pendapatan 1967]\n\nINCOME TAX ACT 1967\n\nINCOME TAX (ACCELERATED CAPITAL ALLOWANCE) (EXCURSION BUS)\n(AMENDMENT) RULES 2022\n\nIn exercise of the powers conferred by paragraph 154(1) (b) of, and paragraphs 10\nand 15 of Schedule 3 to, the Income Tax Act 1967 [ Act 53 ], the Minister\nmakes the following rules:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-16"};
  FT["MY-H7069"] = {"id":"MY-H7069","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 9/2023&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2023年供应管制（管制物品）令","en":"CONTROL OF SUPPLIES (CONTROLLED ARTICLES) ORDER 2023","orig":"CONTROL OF SUPPLIES (CONTROLLED ARTICLES) ORDER 2023","ms":"Perintah Kawalan Bekalan (Barang Kawalan) 2023","vi":"Lệnh về Kiểm soát nguồn cung (Hàng hóa được kiểm soát) năm 2023","th":"คำสั่งการควบคุมเสบียง (สิ่งของควบคุม) ค.ศ. 2023","id":"Perintah Pengendalian Persediaan (Barang yang Dikendalikan) Tahun 2023"},"level":"regulation","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA9","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2023","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\2023_P.U.(A)9-2023_CONTROL OF SUPPLIES (CONTROLLED ARTICLES) ORDER 2023.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H7069-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Kawalan Bekalan\n\n(Barang-Barang Kawalan) 2023.\n\nBarang-barang kawalan"}},{"id":"MY-H7069-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Barang-barang yang dinyatakan dalam Jadual diisytiharkan sebagai\n\nbarang-barang kawalan bagi tempoh mulai 15 Januari 2023 hingga 29 Januari 2023.\n\nJADUAL\n\nBARANG-BARANG KAWALAN\n\n1. Ikan bawal putih (berat antara 200 gram hingga 400 gram seekor)\n\n2. Udang putih (berat antara 41 ekor hingga 60 ekor sekilogram)\n\n3. Kubis bulat import (Indonesia dan China, tidak termasuk kubis Beijing)\n\n4. Babi hidup\n\n5. Daging babi (perut)\n\n6. Daging babi (daging dan lemak)\n\nDibuat 9 Januari 2023\n\n[KPDN(PGK)(S)0.5001/4 Jld. 8; PN(PU2)188/Jld. 13]\n\n DATUK SERI SALAHUDDIN BIN AYUB\n\n Menteri Perdagangan Dalam Negeri dan Kos Sara Hidup\n\nCONTROL OF SUPPLIES ACT 1961\n\nCONTROL OF SUPPLIES (CONTROLLED ARTICLES) ORDER 2023\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 5 of the\n\nControl of Supplies Act 1961 [Act 122], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation\n\n1. This order may be cited as the Control of Supplies (Controlled Articles)\n\nOrder 2023.\n\nControlled articles\n\n2. The articles specified in the Schedule are declared to be controlled articles\n\nfor the period from 15 January 2023 to 29 January 2023.\n\nSCHEDULE\n\nCONTROLLED ARTICLES\n\n1. White pomfret (weight ranges between 200 grams to 400 grams each)\n\n2. Banana prawn (weight ranges between 41 prawns to 60 prawns\n\nper kilogram)\n\n3. Imported round cabbage (Indonesia and China, not including\n\nBeijing cabbage)\n\n4. Live pig\n\n5. Pork (belly)\n\n6. Pork (lean and fat)\n\nMade 9 January 2023\n\n[KPDN(PGK)(S)0.5001/4 Jld. 8; PN(PU2)188/Jld. 13]\n\n DATUK SERI SALAHUDDIN BIN AYUB\n\n Minister of Domestic Trade and Cost of Living"}}],"pack":"my-16"};
  FT["MY-H707"] = {"id":"MY-H707","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 102/2018&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2018年马来保留地（联邦直辖区）（附表二修正）令","en":"MALAY RESERVATIONS (FEDERAL TERRITORY) (AMENDMENT OF SECOND SCHEDULE) ORDER 2018","orig":"MALAY RESERVATIONS (FEDERAL TERRITORY) (AMENDMENT OF SECOND SCHEDULE) ORDER 2018","ms":"Perintah Rizab Melayu (Wilayah Persekutuan) (Pindaan Jadual Kedua) 2018","vi":"Lệnh về Đất dành riêng cho người Mã Lai (Lãnh thổ Liên bang) (Sửa đổi Phụ lục thứ hai) năm 2018","th":"คำสั่งที่ดินสงวนสำหรับชาวมลายู (เขตปกครองสหพันธ์) (การแก้ไขภาคผนวกที่สอง) ค.ศ. 2018","id":"Perintah Tanah Simpanan Melayu (Wilayah Persekutuan) (Perubahan Lampiran Kedua) Tahun 2018"},"level":"regulation","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA102","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2018","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\2018_P.U.(A)102-2018_MALAY RESERVATIONS (FEDERAL TERRITORY) (AMENDMENT OF SECOND SCHEDULE) ORDER 2018.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H707-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Perizaban Melayu\n\n(Wilayah Persekutuan) (Pindaan Jadual Kedua) 2018.\n\n(2) Perintah ini hendaklah terpakai bagi Wilayah Persekutuan Kuala Lumpur.\n\nPindaan Jadual Kedua"}},{"id":"MY-H707-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Jadual Kedua kepada Enakmen Perizaban Melayu dipinda dengan menambah\n\nyang berikut:\n\n\"Malaysia Debt Ventures Berhad\n\n Perbadanan Nasional Berhad\n\n Small Medium Enterprise Development Bank Malaysia Berhad\".\n\nDibuat 26 Mac 2018\n\n[PTG/WP(S).100-2/17/3; PTG/WP 16/19; PN(PU2)213/XC]\n\n Dengan Titah Perintah\n\nDATO' SRI MOHD. NAJIB BIN TUN HAJI ABDUL RAZAK\n\nPerdana Menteri\n\nMALAY RESERVATIONS ENACTMENT\n\nMALAY RESERVATIONS (FEDERAL TERRITORY)\n\n(AMENDMENT OF SECOND SCHEDULE) ORDER 2018\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 17(2) of the\n\nMalay Reservations Enactment [F.M.S. Cap. 142], as modified by the Federal Territory\n\n(Modification of Malay Reservations Enactment) Order 1974 [P.U. (A) 60/1974],\n\nthe Yang di-Pertuan Agong makes the following order:\n\nCitation and application"}}],"pack":"my-16"};
  FT["MY-H7070"] = {"id":"MY-H7070","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 9/2024&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2024年道路交通（禁止使用道路）（联邦道路）（第2号）令","en":"ROAD TRANSPORT (PROHIBITION OF USE OF ROAD) (FEDERAL ROADS) (NO. 2) ORDER 2024","orig":"ROAD TRANSPORT (PROHIBITION OF USE OF ROAD) (FEDERAL ROADS) (NO. 2) ORDER 2024","ms":"Perintah Pengangkutan Jalan (Larangan Penggunaan Jalan) (Jalan Raya Persekutuan) (Bilangan 2) 2024","vi":"Lệnh về Vận tải đường bộ (Cấm sử dụng đường bộ) (Đường bộ liên bang) (số 2) năm 2024","th":"คำสั่งการขนส่งทางถนน (การห้ามใช้ถนน) (ทางหลวงสหพันธ์) (ฉบับที่ 2) ค.ศ. 2024","id":"Perintah Angkutan Jalan (Larangan Penggunaan Jalan) (Jalan Raya Federal) (Nomor 2) Tahun 2024"},"level":"regulation","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA9","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2024","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\2024_P.U.(A)9-2024_ROAD TRANSPORT (PROHIBITION OF USE OF ROAD) (FEDERAL ROADS) (NO. 2) ORDER 2024.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H7070-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Pengangkutan Jalan\n\n(Larangan Penggunaan Jalan) (Jalan Persekutuan) (No. 2) 2024.\n\n(2) Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 22 Januari 2024.\n\nLarangan"}},{"id":"MY-H7070-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Pemanduan kenderaan di atas bahagian jalan yang dinyatakan dalam ruang (1)\n\nJadual Pertama sebagaimana yang ditunjukkan dalam peta dalam Jadual Kedua,\n\nmelainkan di atas jalan arah yang dinyatakan dalam ruang (2) Jadual Pertama,\n\nbagi tempoh yang dinyatakan dalam ruang (3) Jadual Pertama, dilarang.\n\nJADUAL PERTAMA\n\n(1)\n\nJalan yang baginya\n\nLarangan Terpakai\n\n(2)\n\nJalan Arah\n\n(3)\n\nTempoh Larangan\n\nSebahagian Laluan 1,\n\nJalan Butterworth-Ipoh\n\nbermula dari seksyen 724.3\n\nhingga seksyen 725.0\n\nsebagaimana yang ditunjukkan\n\ndalam peta dalam Jadual Kedua\n\nKenderaan dari Jawi ke\n\nParit Buntar dan\n\nsebaliknya hendaklah\n\nmenggunakan jalan\n\nlencongan sementara\n\nsebagaimana yang\n\nditunjukkan dalam peta\n\ndalam Jadual Kedua\n\n22 Januari 2024 hingga\n\n22 Januari 2025\n\nJADUAL KEDUA\n\nDibuat 15 Januari 2024\n\n[KKR.100-1/2/79 Jld.7; PN(PU2)460/Jld.131]\n\nDATO SRI ALEXANDER NANTA LINGGI\n\nMenteri Kerja Raya\n\nROAD TRANSPORT ACT 1987\n\nROAD TRANSPORT (PROHIBITION OF USE OF ROAD)\n\n(FEDERAL ROADS) (NO. 2) ORDER 2024\n\nWHEREAS by P.U. (B) 540/2023 published on 7 December 2023, notice was given\n\nof the intention to make an order under section 70 of the Road Transport Act 1987\n\n[Act 333]:\n\nAND WHEREAS no objection was received by the Minister of Works against the making\n\nof such order:\n\nNOW THEREFORE, in exercise of the powers conferred by section 70 of the Act,\n\nthe Minister of Works, after taking into consideration the matters referred to\n\nin subsection 70(2) of the Act, makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement\n\n1. (1) This order may be cited as the Road Transport (Prohibition of Use\n\nof Road) (Federal Roads) (No. 2) Order 2024.\n\n(2) This Order comes into operation on 22 January 2024.\n\nProhibition\n\n2. The driving of vehicles on the part of the road as specified in column (1)\n\nof the First Schedule as shown on the map in the Second Schedule, otherwise than\n\non the routes specified in column (2) of the First Schedule, for the period specified\n\nin column (3) of the First Schedule, is prohibited.\n\nFIRST SCHEDULE\n\n(1)\n\nRoad to which\n\nProhibition Applies\n\n(2)\n\nRoutes\n\n(3)\n\nProhibition Period\n\nPart of Route 1,\n\nButterworth-Ipoh Road\n\nstarting from section 724.3\n\nto section 725.0 as shown\n\non the map in the\n\nSecond Schedule\n\nVehicles from Jawi to\n\nParit Buntar and vice versa\n\nshall use temporary diversion\n\nroad as shown on the map of\n\nthe Second Schedule\n\n22 January 2024 to\n\n22 January 2025\n\nSECOND SCHEDULE\n\nMade 15 January 2024\n\n[KKR.100-1/2/79 Jld.7; PN(PU2)460/Jld.131]\n\n DATO SRI ALEXANDER NANTA LINGGI\n\n Minister of Works"}}],"pack":"my-16"};
  FT["MY-H7071"] = {"id":"MY-H7071","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 9/2025&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2025年工会（爱丽丝史密斯学校教师工会）（豁免）令","en":"TRADE UNIONS (ALICE SMITH SCHOOL TEACHERS’ UNION) (EXEMPTION) ORDER 2025","orig":"TRADE UNIONS (ALICE SMITH SCHOOL TEACHERS’ UNION) (EXEMPTION) ORDER 2025","ms":"Perintah Kesatuan Sekerja (Kesatuan Guru Sekolah Alice Smith) (Pengecualian) 2025","vi":"Lệnh về Công đoàn (Công đoàn Giáo viên Trường Alice Smith) (Miễn trừ) năm 2025","th":"คำสั่งสหภาพแรงงาน (สหภาพครูโรงเรียนอลิซ สมิธ) (การยกเว้น) ค.ศ. 2025","id":"Perintah Serikat Pekerja (Serikat Guru Sekolah Alice Smith) (Pembebasan) Tahun 2025"},"level":"regulation","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA9","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2025","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\2025_P.U.(A)9-2025_TRADE UNIONS (ALICE SMITH SCHOOL TEACHERS' UNION) (EXEMPTION) ORDER 2025.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H7071-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Kesatuan Sekerja\n\n(Kesatuan Guru-Guru Sekolah Alice Smith) (Pengecualian) 2025.\n\n(2) Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 15 Januari 2025.\n\nPengecualian"}},{"id":"MY-H7071-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Menteri mengecualikan pegawai Kesatuan Guru-Guru Sekolah Alice Smith yang\n\nbukan warganegara Persekutuan daripada peruntukan perenggan 28(1)(a) Akta.\n\nDibuat 7 Januari 2025\n\n[KSM/PUU(S)600-1/2/6/1(13); PN(PU2)249/V]\n\n SIM CHEE KEONG\n\n Menteri Sumber Manusia\n\nTRADE UNIONS ACT 1959\n\nTRADE UNIONS (ALICE SMITH SCHOOL TEACHERS' UNION)\n\n(EXEMPTION) ORDER 2025\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by paragraph 30(b) of the\n\nTrade Unions Act 1959 [Act 262], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-16"};
