  FT["MY-H778"] = {"id":"MY-H778","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 107/2022&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2022年教育服务纪律委员会（修正）条例","en":"EDUCATION SERVICE DISCIPLINARY BOARD (AMENDMENT) REGULATIONS 2022","orig":"EDUCATION SERVICE DISCIPLINARY BOARD (AMENDMENT) REGULATIONS 2022","ms":"Peraturan Lembaga Tatatertib Perkhidmatan Pelajaran (Pindaan) 2022","vi":"Quy định về Hội đồng Kỷ luật Dịch vụ Giáo dục (Sửa đổi) năm 2022","th":"ข้อบังคับคณะกรรมการวินัยบริการการศึกษา (การแก้ไข) ค.ศ. 2022","id":"Peraturan Dewan Disiplin Layanan Pendidikan (Perubahan) Tahun 2022"},"level":"regulation","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA107","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2022","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\2022_P.U.(A)107-2022_EDUCATION SERVICE DISCIPLINARY BOARD (AMENDMENT) REGULATIONS 2022.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H778-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Peraturan-peraturan ini bolehlah dinamakan Peraturan-Peraturan Lembaga\n\nTatatertib Perkhidmatan Pendidikan (Pindaan) 2022.\n\nPindaan am"}},{"id":"MY-H778-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Peraturan-Peraturan Lembaga Tatatertib Perkhidmatan Pendidikan 1994\n\n[P.U. (A) 458/1994] dipinda dalam teks bahasa kebangsaan dengan menggantikan\n\nperkataan \"Suruhanjaya Perkhidmatan Pelajaran\" di mana-mana jua terdapat dengan\n\nperkataan \"Suruhanjaya Perkhidmatan Pendidikan\".\n\nDibuat 31 Mac 2022\n\n[JPA.PUU.(S)333/6/1 Jld. 6(16); PN(PU2)171B/VI]\n\nDengan Titah Perintah\n\nTAN SRI DATO' SERI MOHD ZUKI BIN ALI\n\nSetiausaha Jemaah Menteri\n\nFEDERAL CONSTITUTION\n\nEDUCATION SERVICE DISCIPLINARY BOARD (AMENDMENT)\n\nREGULATIONS 2022\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by Clause (5B) of Article 144 of\n\nthe Federal Constitution, the Yang di-Pertuan Agong makes the following regulations:\n\nCitation"}}],"pack":"my-16"};
  FT["MY-H779"] = {"id":"MY-H779","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 107/2023&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":3,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2023年合作社（接管 KOPERASI SERBAUSAHA MAKMUR BERHAD）（委任）令","en":"CO-OPERATIVE SOCIETIES (ASSUMPTION OF CONTROL OF KOPERASI SERBAUSAHA MAKMUR BERHAD) (APPOINTMENT) ORDER 2023","orig":"CO-OPERATIVE SOCIETIES (ASSUMPTION OF CONTROL OF KOPERASI SERBAUSAHA MAKMUR BERHAD) (APPOINTMENT) ORDER 2023","ms":"Perintah Koperasi (Pengambilalihan Kawalan KOPERASI SERBAUSAHA MAKMUR BERHAD) (Pelantikan) 2023","vi":"Lệnh về Hợp tác xã (Tiếp nhận kiểm soát KOPERASI SERBAUSAHA MAKMUR BERHAD) (Bổ nhiệm) năm 2023","th":"คำสั่งสหกรณ์ (การเข้าควบคุม KOPERASI SERBAUSAHA MAKMUR BERHAD) (การแต่งตั้ง) ค.ศ. 2023","id":"Perintah Koperasi (Pengambilalihan Pengendalian KOPERASI SERBAUSAHA MAKMUR BERHAD) (Pengangkatan) Tahun 2023"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA107","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2023","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 3 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2023_P.U.(A)107-2023_CO-OPERATIVE SOCIETIES (ASSUMPTION OF CONTROL OF KOPERASI SERBAUSAHA MAKMUR BERHAD) (APPOINTMEN.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H779-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Koperasi (Pengambilalihan Kawalan\nKoperasi Serbausaha Makmur Berhad) (Pelantikan) 2023.\n\nPengambilalihan kawalan"}},{"id":"MY-H779-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Suruhanjaya melantik Dato' Haji Zazali bin Haron untuk mengambil alih\nkawalan semua harta, urusan, aktiviti dan hal ehwal Koperasi Serbausaha\nMakmur Berhad, dan menjalankan kesemua urusan, aktiviti dan hal ehwalnya\nbagi tempoh mulai 26  Mac 2023 hingga 25 Mac 2024 atau sehingga suatu\nLembaga baharu dipilih di bawah undang -undang kecil Koperasi itu, mengikut\nmana-mana yang terdahulu.\n\nKos, perbelanjaan dan saraan"}},{"id":"MY-H779-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Apa-apa kos dan perbelanjaan yang dilakukan oleh Suruhanjaya, dan saraan\nbagi orang yang dilantik di bawah perenggan 2, berhubung dengan pengambilalihan\nkawalan di bawah perenggan 2 hendakl ah kena dibayar daripada dana dan harta\nKoperasi Serbausaha Makmur Berhad sebagai suatu caj pertama.\n\nDibuat 31 Mac 2023\n[SKM.IP(SULIT)KP:3437B/1/3; PN(PU2)527/Jld. 21]\n\nDATUK UMAR SARIM BIN SAIDIN\n  Timbalan Pengerusi Eksekutif\nSuruhanjaya Koperasi Malaysia\n\nCO-OPERATIVE SOCIETIES ACT 1993\n\nCO-OPERATIVE SOCIETIES (ASSUMPTION OF CONTROL OF KOPERASI SERBAUSAHA\nMAKMUR BERHAD) (APPOINTMENT) ORDER 2023\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by paragraph 69(2) (a) of the\nCo-operative Societies Act 1993 [Act 502], the Commission makes the following order:\n\nCitation"}}],"pack":"my-16"};
  FT["MY-H780"] = {"id":"MY-H780","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 107/2024&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":3,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2024年所得税（豁免）（第6号）令2021（修正）令","en":"INCOME TAX (EXEMPTION) (NO. 6) ORDER 2021 (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2024","orig":"INCOME TAX (EXEMPTION) (NO. 6) ORDER 2021 (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2024","ms":"Perintah Perintah Cukai Pendapatan (Pengecualian) (Bilangan 6) 2021 (Pindaan) 2024","vi":"Lệnh về Lệnh Thuế thu nhập (Miễn trừ) (Số 6) 2021 (Sửa đổi) năm 2024","th":"คำสั่งคำสั่งภาษีเงินได้ (การยกเว้น) (ฉบับที่ 6) 2021 (การแก้ไข) ค.ศ. 2024","id":"Perintah Perintah Pajak Penghasilan (Pembebasan) (Nomor 6) 2021 (Perubahan) Tahun 2024"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA107","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2024","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 3 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2024_P.U.(A)107-2024_INCOME TAX (EXEMPTION) (NO. 6) ORDER 2021 (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2024.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H780-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Cukai Pendapatan\n(Pengecualian) (No. 6) 2021 (Pindaan) 2024.\n\n(2) Perintah ini berkuat kuasa mulai tahun taksiran 2024.\n\nPindaan perenggan 1"}},{"id":"MY-H780-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Perintah Cukai Pendapatan (Pengecualian) (No. 6) 2021  [P.U. (A) 282/2021 ],\nyang disebut \"Perintah ibu\" dalam Perintah ini, dipinda dalam subperenggan 1(2) dengan\nmenggantikan perkataan \"tahun taksiran 2023\" dengan perkataan \"tahun taksiran 2027\".\n\nPindaan perenggan 3"}},{"id":"MY-H780-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Perintah ibu dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas subperenggan 3( 2)\nsubperenggan yang berikut:\n\n\"(2A) Pendapatan berkanun yang diperoleh daripada suatu\nperniagaan yang disebut dalam subperenggan  (1) hendaklah enam puluh\nperatus daripada pendapatan berkanun itu.\".\n\nDibuat 8 Mac 2024\n[MOF.TAX(S)700-3/1/613(18); LHDN.AY.A 600-12/1/7(29)-329; PN(PU2)80/JLD.111]\n\n    DATUK SERI AMIR HAMZAH AZIZAN\n                                                                 Menteri Kewangan II\n\n[Akan dibentangkan di Dewan Rakyat menurut subseksyen 127(4) Akta Cukai Pendapatan 1967]\n\nINCOME TAX ACT 1967\n\nINCOME TAX (EXEMPTION) (NO. 6) ORDER 2021 (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2024\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by paragraph 127(3)(b) of the Income Tax Act 1967\n[Act 53], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-16"};
  FT["MY-H781"] = {"id":"MY-H781","coverage":"full","language":"en","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 107/2025&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2025年娱乐税（豁免）（第9号）令","en":"ENTERTAINMENTS DUTY (EXEMPTION) (NO. 9) ORDER 2025","orig":"ENTERTAINMENTS DUTY (EXEMPTION) (NO. 9) ORDER 2025","vi":"Lệnh về Thuế giải trí (Miễn trừ) (số 9) năm 2025","th":"คำสั่งภาษีบันเทิง (การยกเว้น) (ฉบับที่ 9) ค.ศ. 2025","id":"Perintah Bea Hiburan (Pembebasan) (Nomor 9) Tahun 2025","ms":"Perintah Duti Hiburan (Pengecualian) (Bilangan 9) 2025"},"level":"regulation","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA107","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2025","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\2025_P.U.(A)107-2025_ENTERTAINMENTS DUTY (EXEMPTION) (NO. 9) ORDER 2025.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H781-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"en":"1. Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Duti Hiburan (Pengecualian)\n\n(No. 9) 2025.\n\nPengecualian"}},{"id":"MY-H781-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"en":"2. Menteri mengecualikan tiket masuk bagi pameran B VERSE' (BTS, Singing the Stars)\n\nyang telah diadakan di Pavilion Bukit Jalil mulai 1 Disember 2023\n\nhingga 31 Disember 2023 daripada duti hiburan.\n\nDibuat 20 Januari 2025\n\n[MOF.700-4/6/37; PN(PU2)174/JLD.12]\n\nDATUK SERI AMIR HAMZAH AZIZAN\n\nMenteri Kewangan II\n\nENTERTAINMENTS DUTY ACT 1953\n\nENTERTAINMENTS DUTY (EXEMPTION) (NO. 9) ORDER 2025\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by paragraph 12(1)(b) of the\n\nEntertainments Duty Act 1953 [Act 103], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation"}}],"pack":"my-16"};
  FT["MY-H782"] = {"id":"MY-H782","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 107/2026&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2025年印刷机与出版物（不良出版物管制）（第16号）令","en":"PRINTING PRESSES AND PUBLICATIONS (CONTROL OF UNDESIRABLE PUBLICATIONS) (NO. 16) ORDER 2025","orig":"PRINTING PRESSES AND PUBLICATIONS (CONTROL OF UNDESIRABLE PUBLICATIONS) (NO. 16) ORDER 2025","ms":"Perintah Mesin Cetak dan Penerbitan (Kawalan Penerbitan Tidak Diingini) (Bilangan 16) 2025","vi":"Lệnh về Máy in và ấn phẩm (Kiểm soát ấn phẩm không mong muốn) (số 16) năm 2025","th":"คำสั่งแท่นพิมพ์และสิ่งพิมพ์ (การควบคุมสิ่งพิมพ์ที่ไม่พึงประสงค์) (ฉบับที่ 16) ค.ศ. 2025","id":"Perintah Mesin Cetak dan Penerbitan (Pengendalian Terbitan Tidak Diinginkan) (Nomor 16) Tahun 2025"},"level":"regulation","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA107","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2026","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\2026_P.U.(A)107-2026_PRINTING PRESSES AND PUBLICATIONS (CONTROL OF UNDESIRABLE PUBLICATIONS) (NO. 16) ORDER 2025.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H782-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Mesin Cetak dan Penerbitan\n\n(Kawalan Hasil Penerbitan Tidak Diingini) (No. 16) 2025.\n\nLarangan"}},{"id":"MY-H782-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Pencetakan, pengimportan, penghasilan, penghasilan semula, penerbitan,\n\npenjualan, pengeluaran, pengelilingan, pengedaran atau pemilikan hasil penerbitan yang\n\ndiperihalkan dalam Jadual yang mungkin memudaratkan kemoralan adalah dilarang\n\nsecara mutlak di seluruh Malaysia.\n\nJADUAL\n\n(1)\n\nTajuk Hasil\n\nPenerbitan\n\n(2)\n\nPengarang\n\n(3)\n\nPenerbit\n\n(4)\n\nBahasa\n\nThings I Wanted To Say\n\nbut never did\n\nMonica Murphy Penguin Random\n\nHouse\n\nInggeris\n\nDibuat23 Februari 2026\n\n[KDN.PK.S.600-16/15/199; PN(PU2)417/JLD.28]\n\n DATUK SERI SAIFUDDIN NASUTION BIN ISMAIL\n\n Menteri Dalam Negeri\n\nPRINTING PRESSES AND PUBLICATIONS ACT 1984\n\nPRINTING PRESSES AND PUBLICATIONS\n\n(CONTROL OF UNDESIRABLE PUBLICATIONS) (NO. 16) ORDER 2025\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 7(1) of the Printing Presses\n\nand Publications Act 1984 [Act 301], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation\n\n1. This order may be cited as the Printing Presses and Publications\n\n(Control of Undesirable Publications) (No. 16) Order 2025.\n\nProhibition\n\n2. The printing, importation, production, reproduction, publishing, sale, issue,\n\ncirculation, distribution or possession of the publication described in the Schedule\n\nwhich is likely to be prejudicial to morality is absolutely prohibited throughout Malaysia.\n\nSCHEDULE\n\n(1)\n\nTitle of\n\nPublication\n\n(2)\n\nAuthor\n\n(3)\n\nPublisher\n\n(4)\n\nLanguage\n\nThings I Wanted To Say\n\nbut never did\n\nMonica Murphy Penguin Random\n\nHouse\n\nEnglish\n\nMade 23 February 2026\n\n[KDN.PK.S.600-16/15/199; PN(PU2)417/JLD.28]\n\n DATUK SERI SAIFUDDIN NASUTION BIN ISMAIL\n\n Minister of Home Affairs"}}],"pack":"my-16"};
  FT["MY-H783"] = {"id":"MY-H783","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 108/2012&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2012年印花税（豁免）令","en":"STAMP DUTY (EXEMPTION) ORDER 2012","orig":"STAMP DUTY (EXEMPTION) ORDER 2012","ms":"Perintah Duti Setem (Pengecualian) 2012","vi":"Lệnh về Thuế tem (Miễn trừ) năm 2012","th":"คำสั่งอากรแสตมป์ (การยกเว้น) ค.ศ. 2012","id":"Perintah Bea Meterai (Pembebasan) Tahun 2012"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA108","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2012","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2012_P.U.(A)108-2012_STAMP DUTY (EXEMPTION) ORDER 2012.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H783-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Duti Setem (Pengecualian)\n(2) Perintah ini disifatkan telah mula berkuat kuasa pada 15 Jun 2011.\nPengecualian"}},{"id":"MY-H783-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. (1) Apa-apa surat cara bagi perjanjian pinjaman atau pembiayaan di bawah\nsyariah yang boleh dikenakan duti di bawah subbutiran 27(a)(i) Jadual Pertama Akta\nyang disempurnakan antara Perusahaan Kecil dan Sederhana yang telah mendapat\nkelulusan untuk insentif di bawah Polisi Laluan Hijau daripada Sekretariat Polisi Laluan\nHijau Kementerian Kewangan dengan\n(a) Bank Perusahaan Kecil & Sederhana Malaysia Berhad;\n(b) Bank Pembangunan Malaysia Berhad; atau\n(c) Export-Import Bank of Malaysia Berhad,\ndikecualikan daripada duti setem.\n(2) Bagi maksud subperenggan (1), perjanjian pinjaman atau pembiayaan di\nbawah syariah adalah surat cara yang disempurnakan pada atau selepas 15 Jun 2011\ntetapi tidak lewat dari 31 Disember 2014.\n(3) Permohonan bagi pengecualian di bawah subperenggan (1) boleh dibuat\nsekali sahaja.\n\nDibuat 17 April 2012\n[Perb. 0.3865/432; PN(PU2)159/XXXVI]\nDATO' SERI AHMAD HUSNI MOHAMAD HANADZLAH\nMenteri Kewangan Kedua\n\nSTAMP ACT 1949\nSTAMP DUTY (EXEMPTION) ORDER 2012\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 80(1) of the Stamp Act 1949\n[Act 378], the Minister makes the following order:\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-16"};
  FT["MY-H784"] = {"id":"MY-H784","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 108/2013&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2013年可再生能源（附表修正）令","en":"RENEWABLE ENERGY (AMENDMENT OF SCHEDULE) ORDER 2013","orig":"RENEWABLE ENERGY (AMENDMENT OF SCHEDULE) ORDER 2013","ms":"Perintah Tenaga Boleh Baharu (Pindaan Jadual) 2013","vi":"Lệnh về Năng lượng tái tạo (Sửa đổi phụ lục) năm 2013","th":"คำสั่งพลังงานหมุนเวียน (การแก้ไขภาคผนวก) ค.ศ. 2013","id":"Perintah Energi Terbarukan (Perubahan Lampiran) Tahun 2013"},"level":"regulation","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA108","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2013","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\2013_P.U.(A)108-2013_RENEWABLE ENERGY (AMENDMENT OF SCHEDULE) ORDER 2013.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H784-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Tenaga Boleh Baharu\n\n(Pindaan Jadual) 2013.\n\n(2) Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 28 Mac 2013.\n\nPindaan Jadual"}},{"id":"MY-H784-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Jadual kepada Akta 725 dipinda berkenaan dengan Sumber Boleh Baharu\n\nFotovolta Suria dalam Ruang Pertama\n\n(a) dengan menggantikan perkataan \"8\" dalam Ruang Kelima yang\n\nbertentangan dengan subperenggan (a)(iii),(iv),(v) dan (vi) dalam Ruang\n\nKedua perkataan \"20\"; dan\n\n(b) dengan menggantikan perkataan \"8\" dalam Ruang Kelima yang\n\nbertentangan dengan subperenggan (b)(iii) dan (iv) dalam Ruang Kedua\n\nperkataan \"0\".\n\nDibuat 20 Mac 2013\n\n[KeTTHA:BP(S)9/14 Klt. 4(38); PN(PU2)693/IV]\n\n DATO' SRI PETER CHIN FAH KUI\n\n Menteri Tenaga, Teknologi Hijau dan Air\n\nRENEWABLE ENERGY ACT 2011\n\nRENEWABLE ENERGY (AMENDMENT OF SCHEDULE) ORDER 2013\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 63 of the Renewable Energy Act\n\n2011 [Act 725], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-16"};
  FT["MY-H785"] = {"id":"MY-H785","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 108/2014&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2014年野生动物保护（附表修正）令","en":"WILDLIFE CONSERVATION (AMENDMENT OF SCHEDULE) ORDER 2014","orig":"WILDLIFE CONSERVATION (AMENDMENT OF SCHEDULE) ORDER 2014","ms":"Perintah Pemuliharaan Hidupan Liar (Pindaan Jadual) 2014","vi":"Lệnh về Bảo tồn động vật hoang dã (Sửa đổi phụ lục) năm 2014","th":"คำสั่งการอนุรักษ์สัตว์ป่า (การแก้ไขภาคผนวก) ค.ศ. 2014","id":"Perintah Konservasi Satwa Liar (Perubahan Lampiran) Tahun 2014"},"level":"regulation","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA108","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2014","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\2014_P.U.(A)108-2014_WILDLIFE CONSERVATION (AMENDMENT OF SCHEDULE) ORDER 2014.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H785-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Pemuliharaan Hidupan Liar\n\n(Pindaan Jadual) 2014.\n\nPindaan Jadual Pertama"}},{"id":"MY-H785-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Jadual Pertama kepada Akta Pemuliharaan Hidupan Liar 2010 dipinda dalam\n\nBahagian 2—\n\n(a) berhubung dengan KELAS MAMALIA, di bawah kepala ORDER\n\nDIPROTODONTIA, dengan memotong butiran yang berikut:\n\n(b) berhubung dengan KELAS AVES, di bawah kepala ORDER\n\nPSITTACIFORMES, dalam famili Psittacidae, dengan memotong butiran\n\nyang berikut:\n\nFamili Nama Saintifik Nama\n\nTempatan\n\nNama Biasa\n\nKELAS AVES\n\nORDER PSITTACIFORMES\n\nPsittacidae \"Melopsittacus\n\nundulatus\n\n― Budgerigar\n\nNymphicus\n\nhollandicus\n\n― Cockatiel\".\n\nFamili Nama Saintifik Nama\n\nTempatan\n\nNama Biasa\n\nKELAS MAMALIA\n\nORDER DIPROTODONTIA\n\n\"Petauridae Petaurus breviceps ― Sugar Glider\";\n\ndan\n\nDibuat 8 April 2014\n\n[NRE/PUU 611-2/1/8; PN(PU2)697/V]\n\nDATUK SERI PALANIVEL A/L GOVINDASAMY\n\n Menteri Sumber Asli dan Alam Sekitar\n\nWILDLIFE CONSERVATION ACT 2010\n\nWILDLIFE CONSERVATION (AMENDMENT OF SCHEDULE) ORDER 2014\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 134 of the Wildlife Conservation\n\nAct 2010 [Act 716], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation"}}],"pack":"my-16"};
  FT["MY-H786"] = {"id":"MY-H786","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 108/2015&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2015年雇员社会保障（一般规定）（修正）条例","en":"EMPLOYEES' SOCIAL SECURITY (GENERAL) (AMENDMENT) REGULATIONS 2015","orig":"EMPLOYEES' SOCIAL SECURITY (GENERAL) (AMENDMENT) REGULATIONS 2015","ms":"Peraturan Keselamatan Sosial Pekerja (Am) (Pindaan) 2015","vi":"Quy định về An sinh xã hội cho người lao động (Quy định chung) (Sửa đổi) năm 2015","th":"ข้อบังคับประกันสังคมลูกจ้าง (บททั่วไป) (การแก้ไข) ค.ศ. 2015","id":"Peraturan Jaminan Sosial Karyawan (Ketentuan Umum) (Perubahan) Tahun 2015"},"level":"regulation","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA108","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2015","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\2015_P.U.(A)108-2015_EMPLOYEES' SOCIAL SECURITY (GENERAL) (AMENDMENT) REGULATIONS 2015.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H786-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Peraturan-peraturan ini bolehlah dinamakan Peraturan-Peraturan\n\n(Am) Keselamatan Sosial Pekerja (Pindaan) 2015.\n\n(2) Peraturan-Peraturan ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 15 Jun 2015.\n\nPindaan peraturan 32"}},{"id":"MY-H786-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Subperaturan 32(1) Peraturan-Peraturan (Am) Keselamatan Sosial Pekerja 1971\n\n[P.U. (A) 99/1971] dipinda dengan menggantikan perkataan \"hari terakhir\" dengan\n\nperkataan \"hari kelima belas\".\n\nDibuat 29 Mei 2015\n\n[KSM/PUU/(S)600-1/2/11/2; PN(PU2)58/XX]\n\nDATO' SRI RICHARD RIOT ANAK JAEM\n\nMenteri Sumber Manusia\n\nEMPLOYEES' SOCIAL SECURITY ACT 1969\n\nEMPLOYEES' SOCIAL SECURITY (GENERAL) (AMENDMENT) REGULATIONS 2015\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 105 of the Employees' Social\n\nSecurity Act 1969 [Act 4], the Minister makes the following regulations:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-16"};
  FT["MY-H787"] = {"id":"MY-H787","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 108/2016&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2016年印刷机与出版物（不良出版物管制）（第6号）令","en":"PRINTING PRESSES AND PUBLICATIONS (CONTROL OF UNDESIRABLE PUBLICATIONS) (NO. 6) ORDER 2016","orig":"PRINTING PRESSES AND PUBLICATIONS (CONTROL OF UNDESIRABLE PUBLICATIONS) (NO. 6) ORDER 2016","ms":"Perintah Mesin Cetak dan Penerbitan (Kawalan Penerbitan Tidak Diingini) (Bilangan 6) 2016","vi":"Lệnh về Máy in và ấn phẩm (Kiểm soát ấn phẩm không mong muốn) (số 6) năm 2016","th":"คำสั่งแท่นพิมพ์และสิ่งพิมพ์ (การควบคุมสิ่งพิมพ์ที่ไม่พึงประสงค์) (ฉบับที่ 6) ค.ศ. 2016","id":"Perintah Mesin Cetak dan Penerbitan (Pengendalian Terbitan Tidak Diinginkan) (Nomor 6) Tahun 2016"},"level":"regulation","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA108","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2016","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\2016_P.U.(A)108-2016_PRINTING PRESSES AND PUBLICATIONS (CONTROL OF UNDESIRABLE PUBLICATIONS) (NO. 6) ORDER 2016.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H787-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Mesin Cetak dan Penerbitan\n\n(Kawalan Hasil Penerbitan Tidak Diingini) (No. 6) 2016.\n\nLarangan"}},{"id":"MY-H787-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Pencetakan, pengimportan, penghasilan, penghasilan semula, penerbitan,\n\npenjualan, pengeluaran, pengelilingan, pengedaran atau pemilikan hasil penerbitan\n\nyang diperihalkan dalam Jadual yang mungkin memudaratkan ketenteraman awam,\n\nyang mungkin menggemparkan fikiran orang ramai dan yang mungkin memudaratkan\n\nkepentingan awam adalah dilarang secara mutlak di seluruh Malaysia.\n\nJADUAL\n\nTajuk Hasil\n\nPenerbitan\n\nPengarang Penerbit Pencetak Bahasa\n\nSinema Spiritual:\n\nDramaturgi dan\n\nKritikan\n\nFaisal Tehrani Unit Buku Harakah\n\nNo. 28, Jalan Pahang\n\nBarat, Off Jalan\n\nPahang, 53000\n\nKuala Lumpur\n\nPercetakan Maju\n\nJaya\n\nAmpang New\n\nVillage, Selangor\n\nDE\n\nMelayu\n\nDibuat 5 Februari 2016\n\n[KDN:PQ(S) 600- 1/1 Jld.6 (25); PN(PU2)417/XVI]\n\nDATO' SERI DR. AHMAD ZAHID BIN HAMIDI\n\nMenteri Dalam Negeri\n\nPRINTING PRESSES AND PUBLICATIONS ACT 1984\n\nPRINTING PRESSES AND PUBLICATIONS\n\n(CONTROL OF UNDESIRABLE PUBLICATIONS) (NO. 6) ORDER 2016\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 7(1) of the Printing Presses and\n\nPublications Act 1984 [Act 301], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation\n\n1. This order may be cited as the Printing Presses and Publications\n\n(Control of Undesirable Publications) (No. 6) Order 2016.\n\nProhibition\n\n2. The printing, importation, production, reproduction, publishing, sale, issue,\n\ncirculation, distribution or possession of the publication described in the Schedule\n\nwhich is likely to be prejudicial to public order, which is likely to alarm public opinion\n\nand which is likely to be prejudicial to public interest is absolutely prohibited\n\nthroughout Malaysia.\n\nSCHEDULE\n\nTitle of\n\nPublication\n\nAuthor Publisher Printer Language\n\nSinema Spiritual:\n\nDramaturgi dan\n\nKritikan\n\nFaisal Tehrani Unit Buku Harakah\n\nNo. 28, Jalan Pahang\n\nBarat, Off Jalan\n\nPahang, 53000\n\nKuala Lumpur\n\nPercetakan Maju\n\nJaya\n\nAmpang New\n\nVillage, Selangor\n\nDE\n\nMalay\n\nMade 5 February 2016\n\n[KDN:PQ(S) 600- 1/1 Jld.6 (25); PN(PU2)417/XVI]\n\nDATO' SERI DR. AHMAD ZAHID BIN HAMIDI\n\nMinister of Home Affairs"}}],"pack":"my-16"};
  FT["MY-H788"] = {"id":"MY-H788","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 108/2017&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":3,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2017年价格管制与反暴利（汽油与柴油最高零售价格核定）（第2号）令","en":"PRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING (DETERMINATION OF MAXIMUM RETAIL PRICE FOR PETROL AND DIESEL) (NO. 2) ORDER 2017","orig":"PRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING (DETERMINATION OF MAXIMUM RETAIL PRICE FOR PETROL AND DIESEL) (NO. 2) ORDER 2017","ms":"Perintah Kawalan Harga dan Anti-Pencatutan (Penetapan Harga Runcit Maksimum bagi Petrol dan Diesel) (Bilangan 2) 2017","vi":"Lệnh về Kiểm soát giá và chống trục lợi (Xác định giá bán lẻ tối đa đối với xăng và dầu diesel) (số 2) năm 2017","th":"คำสั่งการควบคุมราคาและการต่อต้านการฉวยโอกาส (การกำหนดราคาขายปลีกสูงสุดสำหรับน้ำมันเบนซินและดีเซล) (ฉบับที่ 2) ค.ศ. 2017","id":"Perintah Pengendalian Harga dan Anti-Pencatutan (Penetapan Harga Eceran Maksimum untuk Bensin dan Solar) (Nomor 2) Tahun 2017"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA108","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2017","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 3 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2017_P.U.(A)108-2017_PRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING (DETERMINATION OF MAXIMUM RETAIL PRICE FOR PETROL AND DIESE.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H788-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Kawalan Harga dan\nAntipencatutan (Penentuan Harga  Runcit Maksimum bagi Petrol dan Diesel )\n(No. 2) 2017.\n\n (2) Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada  6 April  2017.\n\nHarga runcit maksimum bagi petrol dan diesel"}},{"id":"MY-H788-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Harga runcit maksimum bagi petrol dan diesel hendaklah sebagaimana yang\ndinyatakan dalam Jadual.\n\nPembatalan"}},{"id":"MY-H788-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Perintah Kawalan Harga dan Antipencatutan (Penentuan Harga Runcit Maksimum\nbagi Petrol dan Diesel ) 2017 [P.U. (A)  89/2017] yang disiarkan dalam Warta\npada 29 Mac 2017 dibatalkan.\n\nPRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING ACT 2011\n\nPRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING\n(DETERMINATION OF MAXIMUM RETAIL PRICE FOR PETROL AND DIESEL) (NO. 2)\nORDER 2017\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 4 of the\nPrice Control and Anti-Profiteering Act 2011 [Act 723], the Controller, with the approval\nof the Minister, makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement\n\nJADUAL/SCHEDULE\n\nHARGA RUNCIT MAKSIMUM BAGI PETROL DAN DIESEL/\nMAXIMUM RETAIL PRICE FOR PETROL AND DIESEL\n\nKelas petrol dan diesel/\nClass of petrol and diesel\n\nHarga seliter/\nPrice per litre\n(RM)\n\nPetrol RON97/\nPetrol RON97\n\n2.43\n\nPetrol RON95/\nPetrol RON95\n\n2.16\n\nDiesel Euro2/\nDiesel Euro2\n\n2.08\n\nDibuat 5 April 2017\nMade 5 April 2017\n[KPDNKK 600-1/2/14; PN(PU2)695/XVI]\n\nDATO' SRI JAMIL BIN SALLEH\nPengawal Harga/\nPrice Controller\n\nDiluluskan 5 April 2017\nApproved 5 April 2017\n[KPDNKK 600-1/2/14; PN(PU2)695/XVI]\n\nDATO' SERI HAMZAH BIN ZAINUDIN\nMenteri Perdagangan Dalam Negeri, Koperasi dan Kepenggunaan/\nMinister of Domestic Trade, Co-operatives and Consumerism"}}],"pack":"my-16"};
  FT["MY-H789"] = {"id":"MY-H789","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 108/2018&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2018年印刷机与出版物（不良出版物管制）（第3号）令","en":"PRINTING PRESSES AND PUBLICATIONS (CONTROL OF UNDESIRABLE PUBLICATIONS) (NO. 3) ORDER 2018","orig":"PRINTING PRESSES AND PUBLICATIONS (CONTROL OF UNDESIRABLE PUBLICATIONS) (NO. 3) ORDER 2018","ms":"Perintah Mesin Cetak dan Penerbitan (Kawalan Penerbitan Tidak Diingini) (Bilangan 3) 2018","vi":"Lệnh về Máy in và ấn phẩm (Kiểm soát ấn phẩm không mong muốn) (số 3) năm 2018","th":"คำสั่งแท่นพิมพ์และสิ่งพิมพ์ (การควบคุมสิ่งพิมพ์ที่ไม่พึงประสงค์) (ฉบับที่ 3) ค.ศ. 2018","id":"Perintah Mesin Cetak dan Penerbitan (Pengendalian Terbitan Tidak Diinginkan) (Nomor 3) Tahun 2018"},"level":"regulation","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA108","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2018","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\2018_P.U.(A)108-2018_PRINTING PRESSES AND PUBLICATIONS (CONTROL OF UNDESIRABLE PUBLICATIONS) (NO. 3) ORDER 2018.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H789-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Mesin Cetak dan Penerbitan\n\n(Kawalan Hasil Penerbitan Tidak Diingini) (No. 3) 2018.\n\nLarangan"}},{"id":"MY-H789-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Pencetakan, pengimportan, penghasilan, penghasilan semula, penerbitan,\n\npenjualan, pengeluaran, pengelilingan, pengedaran atau pemilikan hasil penerbitan yang\n\ndiperihalkan dalam Jadual yang mungkin memudaratkan kemoralan dilarang secara\n\nmutlak di seluruh Malaysia.\n\nJADUAL\n\nTajuk Hasil\n\nPenerbitan\n\nPengarang Penerbit Pencetak Bahasa\n\nConfessions: A Secret\n\nDiary\n\nAmber Stephens AVON\n\nA division of\n\nHarperCollins\n\nPublishers\n\n77-85 Fulham\n\nPalace Road,\n\nLondon W6 8JB\n\nClays Ltd,\n\nSt Ives plc\n\nGreat\n\nBritain\n\nInggeris\n\nDibuat 4 April 2018\n\n[KDN.PQ(S) 600-2/3 Jld.4 (12); PN(PU2)417/XXIII]\n\nDATO' SERI DR. AHMAD ZAHID BIN HAMIDI\n\nMenteri Dalam Negeri\n\nPRINTING PRESSES AND PUBLICATIONS ACT 1984\n\nPRINTING PRESSES AND PUBLICATIONS\n\n(CONTROL OF UNDESIRABLE PUBLICATIONS) (NO. 3) ORDER 2018\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 7(1) of the\n\nPrinting Presses and Publications Act 1984 [Act 301], the Minister makes the\n\nfollowing order:\n\nCitation\n\n1. This order may be cited as the Printing Presses and Publications\n\n(Control of Undesirable Publications) (No. 3) Order 2018.\n\nProhibition\n\n2. The printing, importation, production, reproduction, publishing, sale, issue,\n\ncirculation, distribution or possession of the publication described in the Schedule which\n\nis likely to be prejudicial to morality is absolutely prohibited throughout Malaysia.\n\nSCHEDULE\n\nTitle of Publication Author Publisher Printer Language\n\nConfessions: A Secret\n\nDiary\n\nAmber Stephens AVON\n\nA division of\n\nHarperCollins\n\nPublishers\n\n77-85 Fulham\n\nPalace Road,\n\nLondon W6 8JB\n\nClays Ltd, St\n\nIves plc\n\nGreat Britain\n\nEnglish\n\nMade 4 April 2018\n\n[KDN.PQ(S) 600-2/3 Jld.4 (12); PN(PU2)417/XXIII]\n\nDATO' SERI DR. AHMAD ZAHID BIN HAMIDI\n\nMinister of Home Affairs"}}],"pack":"my-16"};
  FT["MY-H790"] = {"id":"MY-H790","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 108/2019&status=PINDAAN","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2019年牙科（附表二修正）（第2号）令","en":"DENTAL (AMENDMENT OF SECOND SCHEDULE) (NO. 2) ORDER 2019","orig":"DENTAL (AMENDMENT OF SECOND SCHEDULE) (NO. 2) ORDER 2019","ms":"Perintah Pergigian (Pindaan Jadual Kedua) (Bilangan 2) 2019","vi":"Lệnh về Nha khoa (Sửa đổi Phụ lục thứ hai) (số 2) năm 2019","th":"คำสั่งทันตกรรม (การแก้ไขภาคผนวกที่สอง) (ฉบับที่ 2) ค.ศ. 2019","id":"Perintah Kedokteran Gigi (Perubahan Lampiran Kedua) (Nomor 2) Tahun 2019"},"level":"regulation","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA108","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2019","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\2019_P.U.(A)108-2019_DENTAL (AMENDMENT OF SECOND SCHEDULE) (NO. 2) ORDER 2019.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H790-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Pergigian (Pindaan Jadual\nKedua) (No. 2) 2019.\n\nPindaan Jadual Kedua"}},{"id":"MY-H790-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Jadual Kedua kepada Akta Pergigian 1971 dipinda berhubung dengan negara\n\"India\", dengan menggantikan butiran \"Meenakshi Ammal Dental College &\nHospital, Meenakshi Academy of Higher Education & Research (dahulunya\ndikenali sebagai Meenakshi Ammal Dental College, Dr. M. G. R. Tamil Nadu\nUniversity)\" dan butir-butir yang berhubungan dengannya, dengan butiran dan\nbutir-butir yang berikut:\n\nP.U. (A) 108.                          726\n\nInstitusi yang                     Perihal kelulusan\nmemberikan kelulusan\n\n\"Meenakshi Ammal Dental College &    Ijazah Sarjana Muda\nHospital, Meenakshi Academy of Higher     Pembedahan Pergigian\".\nEducation & Research yang disifatkan\n\nsebagai suatu universiti dan yang dahulunya\n\ndikenali sebagai Meenakshi Ammal Dental\n\nCollege & Hospital, Meenakshi Academy\n\nof Higher Education & Research\n\nDibuat 4 Mac 2019\n[KKM.PUU/PU2/DR/5(32); PN(PU2)93/VII]\n\nDatuk Seri Dr. DZULKEFLY BIN AHMAD\nMenteri Kesihatan\n\nDENTAL ACT 1971\n\nDENTAL (AMENDMENT OF SECOND SCHEDULE) (No. 2) Order 2019\n\nIn exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 12(2) of the Dental Act 1971\n[Act 51], the Minister, after consulting the Council, makes the following order:\n\nCitation"}}],"pack":"my-16"};
  FT["MY-H791"] = {"id":"MY-H791","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 108/2021&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2021年医疗（附表二修正）（第2号）令","en":"MEDICAL (AMENDMENT OF SECOND SCHEDULE) (NO. 2) ORDER 2021","orig":"MEDICAL (AMENDMENT OF SECOND SCHEDULE) (NO. 2) ORDER 2021","ms":"Perintah Perubatan (Pindaan Jadual Kedua) (Bilangan 2) 2021","vi":"Lệnh về Y tế (Sửa đổi Phụ lục thứ hai) (số 2) năm 2021","th":"คำสั่งการแพทย์ (การแก้ไขภาคผนวกที่สอง) (ฉบับที่ 2) ค.ศ. 2021","id":"Perintah Kedokteran (Perubahan Lampiran Kedua) (Nomor 2) Tahun 2021"},"level":"regulation","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA108","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2021","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\2021_P.U.(A)108-2021_MEDICAL (AMENDMENT OF SECOND SCHEDULE) (NO. 2) ORDER 2021.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H791-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Perubatan (Pindaan Jadual Kedua)\n\n(No. 2) 2021.\n\nPindaan Jadual Kedua"}},{"id":"MY-H791-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Jadual Kedua kepada Akta Perubatan 1971 dipinda―\n\n(a) berhubung dengan negara \"Malaysia\", dengan menggantikan butiran\n\n\"Cyberjaya University College of Medical Sciences\" dengan butiran yang\n\nberikut:\n\nNama Institusi yang\n\nmemberikan kelulusan\n\n\"University of Cyberjaya\n\n(dahulunya dikenali sebagai\n\nCyberjaya University College of\n\nMedical Sciences)\";\n\n(b) berhubung dengan negara \"Australia\"—\n\n(i) dengan menggantikan butir-butir yang berhubungan dengan\n\nbutiran \"University of Queensland\" dengan butir-butir yang berikut:\n\nPerihal kelulusan\n\n\"Doctor of Medicine\"; dan\n\n(ii) dengan menggantikan butir-butir yang berhubungan dengan\n\nbutiran \"Monash University, Victoria\" dengan butir-butir\n\nyang berikut:\n\n(c) berhubung dengan negara \"United States of America\", dengan\n\nmenggantikan butiran \"Jefferson Medical College of Philadelphia\" dengan\n\nbutiran yang berikut:\n\nPerihal kelulusan\n\n\"Bachelor of Medicine and\n\nBachelor of Surgery (Honours)\n\n(diiktiraf pada 1 Julai 2010)\n\nBachelor of Medical Science and\n\nDoctor of Medicine (diiktiraf pada\n\n19 Disember 2017)\";\n\n(d) berhubung dengan negara \"Russia\", dengan menggantikan butiran\n\n\"Russian State Medical University\" dengan butiran yang berikut:\n\nDibuat 3 Mac 2021\n\n[KKM871A4/7-1/2; PN(PU2)97/XIV]\n\n DATO' SRI DR. ADHAM BIN BABA\n\n Menteri Kesihatan\n\nNama Institusi yang\n\nmemberikan kelulusan\n\n\"Sidney Kimmel Medical College,\n\nThomas Jefferson University\n\n(dahulunya dikenali sebagai\n\nJefferson Medical College of\n\nPhiladelphia)\"; dan\n\nNama Institusi yang\n\nmemberikan kelulusan\n\n\"Russian National Research\n\nMedical University (dahulunya\n\ndikenali sebagai Russian State\n\nMedical University)\n\nN.I. Pirogov Russian National\n\nResearch Medical University\n\n(dahulunya dikenali sebagai\n\nRussian National Research\n\nMedical University)\".\n\nMEDICAL ACT 1971\n\nMEDICAL (AMENDMENT OF SECOND SCHEDULE) (NO. 2) ORDER 2021\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 12(2) of the\n\nMedical Act 1971 [Act 50], the Minister, after consulting the Council, makes the following\n\norder:\n\nCitation"}}],"pack":"my-16"};
  FT["MY-H792"] = {"id":"MY-H792","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 108/2022&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2022年雇员公积金（依第54(6)款增补及修改提款用途）令","en":"EMPLOYEES PROVIDENT FUND (ADDITION AND MODIFICATION TO THE PURPOSES FOR WITHDRAWAL UNDER SUBSECTION 54(6)) ORDER 2022","orig":"EMPLOYEES PROVIDENT FUND (ADDITION AND MODIFICATION TO THE PURPOSES FOR WITHDRAWAL UNDER SUBSECTION 54(6)) ORDER 2022","ms":"Perintah Kumpulan Wang Simpanan Pekerja (Penambahan dan Pengubahan Tujuan Pengeluaran menurut Subseksyen 54(6)) 2022","vi":"Lệnh về Quỹ Tiết kiệm Nhân viên (Bổ sung và sửa đổi mục đích rút tiền theo khoản 54(6)) năm 2022","th":"คำสั่งกองทุนสำรองเลี้ยงชีพลูกจ้าง (การเพิ่มและการแก้ไขวัตถุประสงค์ในการถอนเงินตามมาตรา 54(6)) ค.ศ. 2022","id":"Perintah Dana Simpanan Pegawai (Penambahan dan Perubahan Tujuan Penarikan menurut Ayat 54(6)) Tahun 2022"},"level":"regulation","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA108","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2022","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\2022_P.U.(A)108-2022_EMPLOYEES PROVIDENT FUND (ADDITION AND MODIFICATION TO THE PURPOSES FOR WITHDRAWAL UNDER SUBSEC.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H792-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Kumpulan Wang\n\nSimpanan Pekerja (Tambahan dan Ubah Suaian kepada Maksud Pengeluaran\n\ndi bawah Subseksyen 54(6)) 2022.\n\n(2) Perintah ini berkuat kuasa bagi tempoh mulai 15 April 2022\n\nhingga 30 Jun 2022.\n\nTambahan dan ubah suaian kepada maksud pengeluaran di bawah\n\nsubseksyen 54(6)"}},{"id":"MY-H792-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Subseksyen 54(6) Akta ditambah dan diubah suai—\n\n(a) dengan memotong perkataan \"dan\" di hujung perenggan (l);\n\n(b) dengan menggantikan noktah di hujung perenggan (m)\n\ndengan perkataan \"; dan\"; dan\n\n(c) dengan memasukkan selepas perenggan (m) perenggan yang berikut:\n\n\"(n) ahli Kumpulan Wang itu memerlukan pembiayaan bagi maksud\n\nmembantunya dalam menampung komitmen kewangannya yang\n\nterjejas disebabkan oleh pandemik Penyakit Koronavirus 2019\n\n(COVID-19) bagi notis pengeluaran yang diberikan kepada\n\nLembaga sehingga 30 April 2022.\".\n\nDibuat 12 April 2022\n\n[MOF.SBM(R) 600-41/39/91; PN(PU2)498/Jld. 19]\n\nTENGKU DATUK SERI UTAMA ZAFRUL BIN TENGKU ABDUL AZIZ\n\n Menteri Kewangan\n\nEMPLOYEES PROVIDENT FUND ACT 1991\n\nEMPLOYEES PROVIDENT FUND (ADDITION AND MODIFICATION TO THE PURPOSES\n\nFOR WITHDRAWAL UNDER SUBSECTION 54(6)) ORDER 2022\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 54(7) of the\n\nEmployees Provident Fund Act 1991 [Act 452], the Minister, after consulting the Board,\n\nmakes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-16"};
  FT["MY-H793"] = {"id":"MY-H793","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 108/2023&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":3,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2023年马来西亚海洋公园设立（修正）令","en":"ESTABLISHMENT OF MARINE PARKS MALAYSIA (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2023","orig":"ESTABLISHMENT OF MARINE PARKS MALAYSIA (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2023","ms":"Perintah Penubuhan Taman Laut Malaysia (Pindaan) 2023","vi":"Lệnh về Việc thành lập các vườn quốc gia biển Malaysia (Sửa đổi) năm 2023","th":"คำสั่งการจัดตั้งอุทยานทางทะเลมาเลเซีย (การแก้ไข) ค.ศ. 2023","id":"Perintah Pembentukan Taman Laut Malaysia (Perubahan) Tahun 2023"},"level":"regulation","category":"03_涉外投资与贸易","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA108","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2023","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 3 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\03_涉外投资与贸易\\2023_P.U.(A)108-2023_ESTABLISHMENT OF MARINE PARKS MALAYSIA (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2023.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H793-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Penubuhan Taman Laut\n\nMalaysia (Pindaan) 2023.\n\n(2) Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 4 April 2023.\n\nPindaan perenggan 2"}},{"id":"MY-H793-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Perintah Penubuhan Taman Laut Malaysia 1994 [P.U. (A) 401/1994], yang disebut\n\n\"Perintah ibu\" dalam Perintah ini, dipinda dalam perenggan 2—\n\n(a) dalam subperenggan (1), dengan menggantikan perkataan\n\n\"dan Jadual Ketiga\" dengan perkataan \", Jadual Ketiga dan Jadual Keempat\";\n\ndan\n\n(b) dengan memasukkan selepas subperenggan (4) subperenggan\n\nyang berikut:\n\n\"(5) Had mana-mana kawasan atau sebahagian dari\n\nsesuatu kawasan yang ditubuhkan sebagai taman laut hendaklah\n\npada jarak satu batu nautika arah laut daripada titik terluar\n\npulau-pulau yang dinyatakan dalam ruang (1) Jadual Keempat yang\n\ndiukur pada tikas air pasang biasa.\"\n\nJadual baharu Keempat"}},{"id":"MY-H793-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Perintah ibu dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas Jadual Ketiga Jadual\n\nyang berikut:\n\n\"JADUAL KEEMPAT\n\n(1) (2)\n\nNama Pulau Negeri"}}],"pack":"my-16"};
  FT["MY-H794"] = {"id":"MY-H794","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 108/2024&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":3,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2024年所得税（豁免）（第7号）令2021（修正）令","en":"INCOME TAX (EXEMPTION) (NO. 7) ORDER 2021 (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2024","orig":"INCOME TAX (EXEMPTION) (NO. 7) ORDER 2021 (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2024","ms":"Perintah Perintah Cukai Pendapatan (Pengecualian) (Bilangan 7) 2021 (Pindaan) 2024","vi":"Lệnh về Lệnh Thuế thu nhập (Miễn trừ) (Số 7) 2021 (Sửa đổi) năm 2024","th":"คำสั่งคำสั่งภาษีเงินได้ (การยกเว้น) (ฉบับที่ 7) 2021 (การแก้ไข) ค.ศ. 2024","id":"Perintah Perintah Pajak Penghasilan (Pembebasan) (Nomor 7) 2021 (Perubahan) Tahun 2024"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA108","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2024","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 3 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2024_P.U.(A)108-2024_INCOME TAX (EXEMPTION) (NO. 7) ORDER 2021 (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2024.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H794-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Cukai Pendapatan\n(Pengecualian) (No. 7) 2021 (Pindaan) 2024.\n\n(2) Perintah ini berkuat kuasa mulai tahun taksiran 2024.\n\nPindaan perenggan 1"}},{"id":"MY-H794-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Perintah Cukai Pendapatan (Pengecualian) (No. 7) 2021 [ P.U. (A)  283/2021],\nyang disebut \"Perintah ibu\" dalam Perintah ini, dipinda dalam subperenggan 1(2) dengan\nmenggantikan perkataan \"tahun taksiran 2023\" dengan perkataan \"tahun taksiran 2027\".\n\nPindaan perenggan 3"}},{"id":"MY-H794-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Perintah ibu dipinda dengan mem asukkan selepas subperenggan 3(2)\nsubperenggan yang berikut:\n\n\"(2A)       Pendapatan berkanun yang diperoleh daripada suatu perniagaan\nyang disebut dalam subperenggan (1) hendaklah enam puluh peratus daripada\npendapatan berkanun itu.\".\n\nDibuat 8 Mac 2024\n[MOF.TAX(S)700-3/1/613(18); LHDN.AY.A 600-12/1/7 (29)-329; PN(PU2)80/JLD.111]\n\n         DATUK SERI AMIR HAMZAH AZIZAN\n                                                                 Menteri Kewangan II\n\n[Akan dibentangkan di Dewan Rakyat menurut subseksyen 127(4) Akta Cukai Pendapatan 1967]\n\nINCOME TAX ACT 1967\n\nINCOME TAX (EXEMPTION) (NO. 7) ORDER 2021 (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2024\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by paragraph 127(3)(b) of the Income Tax Act 1967\n[Act 53], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-16"};
  FT["MY-H795"] = {"id":"MY-H795","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 108/2025&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2025年娱乐税（豁免）（第10号）令","en":"ENTERTAINMENTS DUTY (EXEMPTION) (NO. 10) ORDER 2025","orig":"ENTERTAINMENTS DUTY (EXEMPTION) (NO. 10) ORDER 2025","ms":"Perintah Duti Hiburan (Pengecualian) (Bilangan 10) 2025","vi":"Lệnh về Thuế giải trí (Miễn trừ) (số 10) năm 2025","th":"คำสั่งภาษีบันเทิง (การยกเว้น) (ฉบับที่ 10) ค.ศ. 2025","id":"Perintah Bea Hiburan (Pembebasan) (Nomor 10) Tahun 2025"},"level":"regulation","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA108","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2025","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\2025_P.U.(A)108-2025_ENTERTAINMENTS DUTY (EXEMPTION) (NO. 10) ORDER 2025.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H795-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Duti Hiburan (Pengecualian)\n\n(No. 10) 2025.\n\nPengecualian"}},{"id":"MY-H795-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Menteri mengecualikan tiket masuk bagi persembahan Eric Chou Concert 2024\n\nyang telah diadakan di Axiata Arena Bukit Jalil, Kuala Lumpur pada 30 November 2024\n\ndan 1 Disember 2024 daripada duti hiburan.\n\nDibuat 20 Januari 2025\n\n[MOF.700-4/6/37; PN(PU2)174/JLD.12]\n\nDATUK SERI AMIR HAMZAH AZIZAN\n\nMenteri Kewangan II\n\nENTERTAINMENTS DUTY ACT 1953\n\nENTERTAINMENTS DUTY (EXEMPTION) (NO. 10) ORDER 2025\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by paragraph 12(1)(b) of the\n\nEntertainments Duty Act 1953 [Act 103], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation"}}],"pack":"my-16"};
  FT["MY-H796"] = {"id":"MY-H796","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 108/2026&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2026年印刷机与出版物（不良出版物管制）（第17号）令","en":"PRINTING PRESSES AND PUBLICATIONS (CONTROL OF UNDESIRABLE PUBLICATIONS) (NO. 17) ORDER 2026","orig":"PRINTING PRESSES AND PUBLICATIONS (CONTROL OF UNDESIRABLE PUBLICATIONS) (NO. 17) ORDER 2026","ms":"Perintah Mesin Cetak dan Penerbitan (Kawalan Penerbitan Tidak Diingini) (Bilangan 17) 2026","vi":"Lệnh về Máy in và ấn phẩm (Kiểm soát ấn phẩm không mong muốn) (số 17) năm 2026","th":"คำสั่งแท่นพิมพ์และสิ่งพิมพ์ (การควบคุมสิ่งพิมพ์ที่ไม่พึงประสงค์) (ฉบับที่ 17) ค.ศ. 2026","id":"Perintah Mesin Cetak dan Penerbitan (Pengendalian Terbitan Tidak Diinginkan) (Nomor 17) Tahun 2026"},"level":"regulation","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA108","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2026","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\2026_P.U.(A)108-2026_PRINTING PRESSES AND PUBLICATIONS (CONTROL OF UNDESIRABLE PUBLICATIONS) (NO. 17) ORDER 2026.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H796-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Mesin Cetak dan Penerbitan\n\n(Kawalan Hasil Penerbitan Tidak Diingini) (No. 17) 2026.\n\nLarangan"}},{"id":"MY-H796-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Pencetakan, pengimportan, penghasilan, penghasilan semula, penerbitan,\n\npenjualan, pengeluaran, pengelilingan, pengedaran atau pemilikan hasil penerbitan\n\nyang diperihalkan dalam Jadual yang mungkin memudaratkan kemoralan adalah\n\ndilarang secara mutlak di seluruh Malaysia.\n\nJADUAL\n\n(1)\n\nTajuk Hasil\n\nPenerbitan\n\n(2)\n\nPengarang\n\n(3)\n\nPenerbit\n\n(4)\n\nBahasa\n\nThings I Wanted To Say Monica Murphy Penguin Random\n\nHouse\n\nInggeris\n\nDibuat 23 Februari 2026\n\n[KDN.PK.S.600-16/15/200; PN(PU2)417/JLD.28]\n\nDATUK SERI SAIFUDDIN NASUTION BIN ISMAIL\n\nMenteri Dalam Negeri\n\nPRINTING PRESSES AND PUBLICATIONS ACT 1984\n\nPRINTING PRESSES AND PUBLICATIONS\n\n(CONTROL OF UNDESIRABLE PUBLICATIONS) (NO. 17) ORDER 2026\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 7(1) of the Printing Presses and\n\nPublications Act 1984 [Act 301], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation\n\n1. This order may be cited as the Printing Presses and Publications\n\n(Control of Undesirable Publications) (No. 17) Order 2026.\n\nProhibition\n\n2. The printing, importation, production, reproduction, publishing, sale, issue,\n\ncirculation, distribution or possession of the publication described in the Schedule\n\nwhich is likely to be prejudicial to morality is absolutely prohibited throughout Malaysia.\n\nSCHEDULE\n\n(1)\n\nTitle of\n\nPublication\n\n(2)\n\nAuthor\n\n(3)\n\nPublisher\n\n(4)\n\nLanguage\n\nThings I Wanted To Say Monica Murphy Penguin Random\n\nHouse\n\nEnglish\n\nMade 23 February 2026\n\n[KDN.PK.S.600-16/15/200; PN(PU2)417/JLD.28]\n\nDATUK SERI SAIFUDDIN NASUTION BIN ISMAIL\n\nMinister of Home Affairs"}}],"pack":"my-16"};
  FT["MY-H797"] = {"id":"MY-H797","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 109/1982&status=PINDAAN","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"1982年法律修订（1953年时效法）令","en":"REVISION OF LAWS (LIMITIATION ACT 1953) ORDER 1982","orig":"REVISION OF LAWS (LIMITIATION ACT 1953) ORDER 1982","ms":"Perintah Semakan Undang-Undang (Akta Had Masa 1953) 1982","vi":"Lệnh về Rà soát pháp luật (Luật Thời hiệu 1953) năm 1982","th":"คำสั่งการปรับปรุงกฎหมาย (พระราชบัญญัติอายุความ ค.ศ. 1953) ค.ศ. 1982","id":"Perintah Revisi Peraturan (Undang-Undang Pembatasan 1953) Tahun 1982"},"level":"regulation","category":"01_宪法与基础法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA109","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"1982","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\01_宪法与基础法\\1982_P.U.(A)109-1982_REVISION OF LAWS (LIMITIATION ACT 1953) ORDER 1982.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H797-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan .. Perintah Penyemakan Nama dan\nUndang-Undang (Akta Had Masa 1953) 1982 dan hendaklah Mulaberkua\ndisifatkan telah. berkuatkuasa mulai, dari, 19hb November, 1981."}},{"id":"MY-H797-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Akta Had Masa 1953 adalah dibetulkan seperti berikut :        Pembetulan\n\n(a) Dengan, memasukkan, selepas sahaja_perkataan-perkataan Akta 294.\n\"a further conversion\" yang terdapat dalam baris empat\nseksyen; 7 (1)) perkataan-perkataan, yang berikut. \"or\nwrongful detention takes place, no action shall be brought\nin respect of the further conversion\";\n\n(b) dengan memasukkan selepas sahaja perkataan-perkataan\n\"in satisfaction of\" yang terdapat dalam seksyen 8 (d)\nhuruf \"a\";\n\n(c) dengan . memasukkan selepas sahaja_perkataan-perkataan\n\"created by the assurance,\" yang terdapat dalam seksyen\n10 (3) perkataan-perkataan yang berikut \"in possession of\nthe land charged, and no person has been in. possession\nof the land by virtue of the assurance,\";            |\n\n(d) dengan menggantikan noktah yang terdapat pada akhir\nseksyen 10 (4) dengan noktah bertindih:\n(e) dengan menambah selepas sahaja perkataan \"acknow-\n\nledgment\" dalam nota birai bagi seksyen 26 perkataan-\nperkataan ‘yang berikut \"or part payment\";\n\nP.U. (A) 109.                     298\n\n— ————  I                   ~\n\nAct I.\n\nCitation and\ncommence-\nment.\n\nRectification\nof Act 254.\n\nlengan menggantikan perkataan \"peyment\" yang terda\na dalam seksyen 26 (2) dengan perkataan \"payment\",   pat\nDiperbuat pada 5hb April 1982.\n(P.N. (S.U.) 270; P.N. (PU?) 231.1\n\nTan Sri DATUK CHANG MIN Tart,\nPesuruhjaya Penyemakan Undang-undang,\nMalaysia\n\nREVISION OF LAWS ACT 1968\nREVISION OF LAWS (LIMITATION AcT 1953) ORDER 1982\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 15 of the Revision\nof Laws Act 1968, the Commissioner of Law Revision, with the\napproval of the Law Revision Committee, makes the following\nOrder:"}}],"pack":"my-16"};
  FT["MY-H798"] = {"id":"MY-H798","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 109/2012&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":4,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2012年所得税（取得 1-InnoCERT 认证支出扣除）规则","en":"INCOME TAX (DEDUCTION FOR EXPENDITURE TO OBTAIN THE 1-INNOCERT CERTIFICATION) RULES 2012","orig":"INCOME TAX (DEDUCTION FOR EXPENDITURE TO OBTAIN THE 1-INNOCERT CERTIFICATION) RULES 2012","ms":"Kaedah Cukai Pendapatan (Potongan bagi Perbelanjaan untuk Memperoleh Pensijilan 1-InnoCERT) 2012","vi":"Quy tắc về Thuế thu nhập (Khấu trừ chi phí để có được chứng nhận 1-InnoCERT) năm 2012","th":"กฎภาษีเงินได้ (การหักค่าใช้จ่ายเพื่อให้ได้การรับรอง 1-InnoCERT) ค.ศ. 2012","id":"Tata Tertib Pajak Penghasilan (Pemotongan atas Pengeluaran untuk Memperoleh Sertifikasi 1-InnoCERT) Tahun 2012"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA109","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2012","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 4 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2012_P.U.(A)109-2012_INCOME TAX (DEDUCTION FOR EXPENDITURE TO OBTAIN THE 1-INNOCERT CERTIFICATION) RULES 2012.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H798-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1.   (1) Kaedah-kaedah ini bolehlah dinamakan Kaedah-Kaedah Cukai\nPendapatan (Potongan bagi Perbelanjaan untuk Mendapatkan Pensijilan\n1-InnoCERT) 2012.\n\n (2) Kaedah-Kaedah ini disifatkan telah berkuat kuasa mulai tahun taksiran\n\nTafsiran"}},{"id":"MY-H798-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Dalam Kaedah-Kaedah ini—\n\n  \"SIRIM Berhad\" ertinya suatu syarikat yang diperbadankan di Malaysia menurut\nAkta Syarikat 1965 (No. syarikat: 367474-V);\n\n\"Perbadanan Perusahaan Kecil dan Sederhana Malaysia \" ertinya suatu\npertubuhan perbadanan yang ditubuhkan di bawah seksyen 3 Akta Perbadanan\nPerusahaan Kecil dan Sederhana Malaysia 1995 [Akta 539];\n\n \"Pensijilan 1-InnoCERT\" ertinya Pensijilan 1-Inovasi bagi Penarafan Enterpris\ndan Transformasi yang dikeluarka n oleh Perbadanan Perusahaan Kecil dan Sederhana\nMalaysia kepada orang yang layak yang telah diberi penarafan AAA, AA atau A oleh\nSIRIM Berhad.\n\nPemakaian"}},{"id":"MY-H798-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. (1) Kaedah-Kaedah ini hendaklah terpakai kepada orang yang layak yang\nmembuat permohonan untuk mendapatkan suatu Pensijilan 1-InnoCERT tidak lewat\n\ndari 31 Disember 2014 yang baginya orang yang layak itu diberi Pensijilan 1-InnoCERT\nyang pertama.\n\n(2) Bagi maksud Kaedah-Kaedah ini, orang yang layak adalah—\n\n(a) seseorang dalam industri perkilangan, industri perkhidmatan\nberkaitan perkilangan da n industri berasaskan pertanian  yang\nbermastautin di Malaysia, yang pada akhir tempoh asas bagi suatu\ntahun taksiran itu—\n\n(i)  mempunyai tidak kurang daripada lima dan tidak lebih\ndaripada seratus lima puluh orang pekerja sepenuh masa;\natau\n\n(ii)  telah mencapai jualan tahunan tidak kurang dari dua ratus\nlima puluh ribu ringgit dan tidak lebih daripada dua puluh\nlima juta ringgit; atau\n\n(b) seseorang dalam industri perkhidmatan, industri pertanian utama,\nteknologi makl umat dan komunikasi  yang bermastautin di\nMalaysia, yang pada akhir tempoh asas bagi suatu tahun taksiran\nitu—\n\n(i) mempunyai tidak kurang daripada lima dan tidak lebih\ndaripada lima puluh orang pekerja sepenuh masa; atau\n\n(ii) telah mencapai jualan tahunan tidak kurang daripada dua\nratus ribu ringgit dan tidak lebih daripada lima juta ringgit.\n\nPotongan"}},{"id":"MY-H798-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4"},"text":{"ms":"4.  (1) Bagi menentukan pendapatan larasan orang yang layak bagi tempoh asas\nbagi suatu tahun taksiran, maka hendaklah dibenarkan sebagai potongan suatu amaun\nbersamaan dengan perbelanjaan yang dilakukan oleh orang yang layak itu untuk\n\nmendapatkan suatu Pensijilan 1-InnoCERT yang pertama baginya daripada Perbadanan\nPerusahaan Kecil dan Sederhana Malaysia.\n\n   (2) Bagi maksud subkaedah (1), perbelanjaan yang dilakukan—\n\n(a) hendaklah merupakan perbelanjaan langsung yang dilakukan bagi\npermohonan yang orang yang layak itu telah diberi Pensijilan\n1-InnoCERT; dan\n\n(b) hendaklah disifatkan telah dilakukan dalam tempoh asas bagi\nsuatu tahun taksiran yang dalamnya Pensijilan 1-InnoCERT telah\ndiberi kepada orang yang layak itu.\n\n (3) Perbelanjaan disebut di dalam Kaedah -Kaedah ini adalah seperti  yang\nberikut:\n\n(a) yuran pensijilan sebanyak lima ribu ringgit; dan\n\n(b) perbelanjaan yang dilakukan oleh juruaudit SIRIM  Berhad\nyang terdiri daripada —\n\n(i)  kos perjalanan pergi dan balik dari pejabat ke premis orang\n yang layak itu termasuklah —\n\n  (A)   perbatuan, t ol dan bayaran letak kereta; atau\n\n (B) dalam kes perjalanan melalui udara, kos\nperjalanan kelas ekonomi dan tuntutan\npenukaran penerbangan ;\n\n(ii)  kos penginapan dalam bilik standard atau elaun lojing; dan\n\n (iii)  elaun makan.\n\nDibuat 17 April 2012\n[Perb. 0.3865/432(39)(2011); LHDN 01/35/(S)/42/51/259-20; PN(PU2)80/LXIV]\n\n     DATO' SERI AHMAD HUSNI MOHAMAD HANADZLAH\n          Menteri Kewangan Kedua\n\n[Akan dibentangkan di Dewan Rakyat menurut subseksyen 154(2) Akta Cukai Pendapatan\n1967]\n\nINCOME TAX ACT 1967\n\nINCOME TAX (DEDUCTION FOR EXPENDITURE TO OBTAIN THE 1-INNOCERT\nCERTIFICATION) RULES 2012\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by paragraph 154(1)(b) of the Income Tax Act 1967\n[Act 53], the Minister makes the following rules:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-16"};
  FT["MY-H799"] = {"id":"MY-H799","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 109/2014&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2014年商业登记（费用豁免）规则","en":"REGISTRATION OF BUSINESSES (WAIVER OF FEE) RULES 2014","orig":"REGISTRATION OF BUSINESSES (WAIVER OF FEE) RULES 2014","ms":"Kaedah Pendaftaran Perniagaan (Pelepasan Fi) 2014","vi":"Quy tắc về Đăng ký kinh doanh (Miễn phí) năm 2014","th":"กฎการขึ้นทะเบียนธุรกิจ (การยกเว้นค่าธรรมเนียม) ค.ศ. 2014","id":"Tata Tertib Registrasi Usaha (Pembebasan Biaya) Tahun 2014"},"level":"regulation","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA109","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2014","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\2014_P.U.(A)109-2014_REGISTRATION OF BUSINESSES (WAIVER OF FEE) RULES 2014.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H799-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Kaedah-kaedah ini bolehlah dinamakan Kaedah-Kaedah Pendaftaran\n\nPerniagaan (Penepian Fi) 2014.\n\n(2) Kaedah-Kaedah ini disifatkan telah mula berkuat kuasa pada\n\n30 Disember 2013.\n\nPenepian fi"}},{"id":"MY-H799-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. (1) Tertakluk kepada subkaedah (2), fi yang ditetapkan dalam butiran 5(e)\n\nJadual Kedua kepada Kaedah-Kaedah Pendaftaran Perniagaan 1957 [L.N. 282/1957]\n\ndiketepikan berkenaan dengan orang yang bertanggungjawab bagi apa-apa perniagaan\n\nyang perakuan pendaftarannya hilang atau musnah disebabkan oleh bencana banjir\n\nyang berlaku pada bulan Disember 2013 di Negeri Pahang, Terengganu, Kelantan dan\n\nJohor.\n\n(2) Penepian fi di bawah subkaedah (1) terpakai bagi permohonan salinan\n\nterperaku perakuan pendaftaran yang dibuat dari 31 Disember 2013 hingga\n\n31 Mac 2014.\n\nDibuat 8 April 2014\n\n[KPDN(PUU)(PU2) 26/5/33; PN(PU2)253/III]\n\nDATO' SRI HASAN BIN MALEK\n\nMenteri Perdagangan Dalam Negeri,\n\nKoperasi dan Kepenggunaan\n\nREGISTRATION OF BUSINESSES ACT 1956\n\nREGISTRATION OF BUSINESSES (WAIVER OF FEE) RULES 2014\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by paragraph 16(2)(j) of the Registration of\n\nBusinesses Act 1956 [Act 197] read together with paragraph 44(b) of the Interpretation\n\nActs 1948 and 1967 [Act 388], the Minister makes the following rules:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-16"};
  FT["MY-H800"] = {"id":"MY-H800","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 109/2015&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2015年工人赔偿（外籍劳工赔偿计划）（保险）（修正）令","en":"WORKMEN'S COMPENSATION (FOREIGN WORKERS' COMPENSATION SCHEME) (INSURANCE) (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2015","orig":"WORKMEN'S COMPENSATION (FOREIGN WORKERS' COMPENSATION SCHEME) (INSURANCE) (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2015","ms":"Perintah Pampasan Pekerja (Skim Pampasan Pekerja Asing) (Insurans) (Pindaan) 2015","vi":"Lệnh về Bồi thường cho người lao động (Chương trình Bồi thường cho Lao động Nước ngoài) (Bảo hiểm) (Sửa đổi) năm 2015","th":"คำสั่งการชดเชยแรงงาน (โครงการชดเชยแรงงานต่างด้าว) (การประกันภัย) (การแก้ไข) ค.ศ. 2015","id":"Perintah Kompensasi Pekerja (Skema Kompensasi Pekerja Asing) (Asuransi) (Perubahan) Tahun 2015"},"level":"regulation","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA109","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2015","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\2015_P.U.(A)109-2015_WORKMEN'S COMPENSATION (FOREIGN WORKERS' COMPENSATION SCHEME) (INSURANCE) (AMENDMENT) ORDER 201.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H800-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Pampasan Pekerja\n\n(Skim Pampasan Pekerja Asing) (Insurans) (Pindaan) 2015.\n\n(2) Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 10 Jun 2015.\n\nPindaan Jadual"}},{"id":"MY-H800-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Perintah Pampasan Pekerja (Skim Pampasan Pekerja Asing) (Insurans) 2005\n\n[P.U. (A) 45/2005] dipinda dalam Jadual—\n\n(a) dengan memasukkan sebelum perkataan \"Allianz General Insurance\n\nMalaysia Berhad\" perkataan \"AIG Malaysia Insurance Berhad\";\n\n(b) dengan memasukkan selepas perkataan \"Allianz General Insurance\n\nMalaysia Berhad\" perkataan \"AmGeneral Insurance Berhad\";\n\n(c) dengan memotong perkataan \"Kurnia Insurance (Malaysia) Berhad\"; dan\n\n(d) dengan memotong perkataan \"AmG Insurance Berhad\".\n\nDibuat 27 Mei 2015\n\n[KSM/PUU/(S)/600; PN(PU2)296/VI]\n\nDATO' SRI RICHARD RIOT ANAK JAEM\n\nMenteri Sumber Manusia\n\nWORKMEN'S COMPENSATION ACT 1952\n\nWORKMEN'S COMPENSATION (FOREIGN WORKERS' COMPENSATION SCHEME)\n\n(INSURANCE) (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2015\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 26(2) of the Workmen's\n\nCompensation Act 1952 [Act 273], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-16"};
  FT["MY-H801"] = {"id":"MY-H801","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 109/2016&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2016年印刷机与出版物（不良出版物管制）（第7号）令","en":"PRINTING PRESSES AND PUBLICATIONS (CONTROL OF UNDESIRABLE PUBLICATIONS) (NO. 7) ORDER 2016","orig":"PRINTING PRESSES AND PUBLICATIONS (CONTROL OF UNDESIRABLE PUBLICATIONS) (NO. 7) ORDER 2016","ms":"Perintah Mesin Cetak dan Penerbitan (Kawalan Penerbitan Tidak Diingini) (Bilangan 7) 2016","vi":"Lệnh về Máy in và ấn phẩm (Kiểm soát ấn phẩm không mong muốn) (số 7) năm 2016","th":"คำสั่งแท่นพิมพ์และสิ่งพิมพ์ (การควบคุมสิ่งพิมพ์ที่ไม่พึงประสงค์) (ฉบับที่ 7) ค.ศ. 2016","id":"Perintah Mesin Cetak dan Penerbitan (Pengendalian Terbitan Tidak Diinginkan) (Nomor 7) Tahun 2016"},"level":"regulation","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA109","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2016","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\2016_P.U.(A)109-2016_PRINTING PRESSES AND PUBLICATIONS (CONTROL OF UNDESIRABLE PUBLICATIONS) (NO. 7) ORDER 2016.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H801-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Mesin Cetak dan Penerbitan\n\n(Kawalan Hasil Penerbitan Tidak Diingini) (No. 7) 2016.\n\nLarangan"}},{"id":"MY-H801-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Pencetakan, pengimportan, penghasilan, penghasilan semula, penerbitan,\n\npenjualan, pengeluaran, pengelilingan, pengedaran atau pemilikan hasil penerbitan\n\nyang diperihalkan dalam Jadual yang mungkin memudaratkan ketenteraman awam,\n\nyang mungkin menggemparkan fikiran orang ramai dan yang mungkin memudaratkan\n\nkepentingan awam adalah dilarang secara mutlak di seluruh Malaysia.\n\nJADUAL\n\nTajuk Hasil\n\nPenerbitan\n\nPengarang/\n\nPenterjemah\n\nPenerbit Pencetak Bahasa\n\nRasulullah Saw.:\n\nSejak Hijrah Hingga\n\nWafat\n\nDr. Ali Syariati/\n\nDr. Afif\n\nMuhammad\n\nPUSTAKA HIDAYAH\n\nAnggota Ikatan\n\nPenerbit Indonesia\n\n(IKAPI)\n\nJl. Rereng Adumanis\n\nNo. 31, Sukaluyu,\n\nBandung 40123,\n\nJawa Barat, Indonesia\n\n- Indonesia\n\nDibuat 5 Februari 2016\n\n[KDN:PQ(S)600-2/1 Jld.2(24); PN(PU2)417/XVI]\n\n DATO' SERI DR. AHMAD ZAHID BIN HAMIDI\n\n Menteri Dalam Negeri\n\nPRINTING PRESSES AND PUBLICATIONS ACT 1984\n\nPRINTING PRESSES AND PUBLICATIONS\n\n(CONTROL OF UNDESIRABLE PUBLICATIONS) (NO. 7) ORDER 2016\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 7(1) of the Printing Presses and\n\nPublications Act 1984 [Act 301], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation\n\n1. This order may be cited as the Printing Presses and Publications (Control of\n\nUndesirable Publications) (No. 7) Order 2016.\n\nProhibition\n\n2. The printing, importation, production, reproduction, publishing, sale, issue,\n\ncirculation, distribution or possession of the publication described in the Schedule\n\nwhich is likely to be prejudicial to public order, which is likely to alarm public opinion\n\nand which is likely to be prejudicial to public interest is absolutely prohibited\n\nthroughout Malaysia.\n\nSCHEDULE\n\nTitle of\n\nPublication\n\nAuthor /\n\nTranslator\n\nPublisher Printer Language\n\nRasulullah Saw.:\n\nSejak Hijrah\n\nHingga Wafat\n\nDr. Ali Syariati/\n\nDr. Afif\n\nMuhammad\n\nPUSTAKA HIDAYAH\n\nAnggota Ikatan\n\nPenerbit Indonesia\n\n(IKAPI)\n\nJl. Rereng Adumanis\n\nNo. 31, Sukaluyu,\n\nBandung 40123,\n\nJawa Barat, Indonesia\n\n- Indonesian\n\nMade 5 February 2016\n\n[KDN:PQ(S)600-2/1 Jld.2(24); PN(PU2)417/XVI]\n\n DATO' SERI DR. AHMAD ZAHID BIN HAMIDI\n\n Minister of Home Affairs"}}],"pack":"my-16"};
  FT["MY-H802"] = {"id":"MY-H802","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 109/2017&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":4,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2017年道路交通（摄像记录违法行为）（修正）规则","en":"ROAD TRANSPORT (CAMERA-RECORDED OFFENCES) (AMENDMENT) RULES 2017","orig":"ROAD TRANSPORT (CAMERA-RECORDED OFFENCES) (AMENDMENT) RULES 2017","ms":"Kaedah Pengangkutan Jalan (Kesalahan Rakaman Kamera) (Pindaan) 2017","vi":"Quy tắc về Vận tải đường bộ (Vi phạm ghi hình bằng camera) (Sửa đổi) năm 2017","th":"กฎการขนส่งทางถนน (การกระทำผิดที่บันทึกด้วยกล้อง) (การแก้ไข) ค.ศ. 2017","id":"Tata Tertib Angkutan Jalan (Pelanggaran Terekam Kamera) (Perubahan) Tahun 2017"},"level":"regulation","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA109","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2017","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 4 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\2017_P.U.(A)109-2017_ROAD TRANSPORT (CAMERA-RECORDED OFFENCES) (AMENDMENT) RULES 2017.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H802-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Kaedah-kaedah ini bolehlah dinamakan Kaedah-Kaedah Pengangkutan\n\nJalan (Kesalahan yang Dirakamkan Melalui Kamera) (Pindaan) 2017.\n\n(2) Kaedah-Kaedah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 6 April 2017.\n\nPindaan kaedah 4"}},{"id":"MY-H802-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Kaedah-Kaedah Pengangkutan Jalan (Kesalahan yang Dirakamkan\n\nMelalui Kamera) 2012 [P.U. (A) 309/2012], yang disebut \"Kaedah-Kaedah ibu\" dalam\n\nKaedah-Kaedah ini, dipinda dalam kaedah 4—\n\n(a) dengan menggantikan subkaedah (1) dengan subkaedah yang berikut:\n\n\"(1) Sistem pengesan yang digunakan bagi maksud kesalahan\n\nyang dirakamkan melalui kamera berhubung dengan suatu kamera\n\nstatik dan kamera mudah alih hendaklah terdiri daripada semua\n\natau mana-mana kelengkapan yang berikut:\n\n(a) gelung induktif;\n\n(b) jaluran piezo;\n\n(c) radar;\n\n(d) laser; dan\n\n(e) kilauan kamera.\";\n\n(b) dalam subkaedah (2), dengan menggantikan perkataan\n\n\"kelajuan kenderaan motor atau tidak mematuhi isyarat merah pada\n\nisyarat lalu lintas, mengikut mana-mana yang berkenaan\"\n\ndengan perkataan \"mana-mana kesalahan yang dirakamkan melalui\n\nkamera\"; dan\n\n(c) dalam subkaedah (3), dengan mengantikan perkataan\n\n\"kelajuan kenderaan motor\" dengan perkataan \"mana-mana kesalahan\n\nyang dirakamkan melalui kamera\".\n\nPindaan Jadual Kedua"}},{"id":"MY-H802-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Kaedah-Kaedah ibu dipinda dalam Jadual Kedua dengan menggantikan\n\nperenggan (a) dengan perenggan yang berikut:\n\n\"(a) ujian dan penentukuran bagi suatu kamera statik atau kamera mudah\n\nalih boleh dijalankan di mana-mana lokasi di mana kamera itu dipasang,\n\ndi mana-mana depoh pemprosesan atau di mana-mana tempat yang\n\ndiluluskan oleh Ketua Pengarah atau Ketua Pegawai Polis;\".\n\nPindaan Jadual Keempat"}},{"id":"MY-H802-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4"},"text":{"ms":"4. Kaedah-Kaedah ibu dipinda dengan menggantikan Jadual Keempat dengan\n\nJadual yang berikut:\n\n\"JADUAL KEEMPAT\n\n[Kaedah 7]\n\nNOTIS\n\nNOTIS\n\nAKTA PENGANGKUTAN JALAN 1987\n\nKAEDAH-KAEDAH PENGANGKUTAN JALAN (KESALAHAN YANG DIRAKAMKAN MELALUI KAMERA) 2012\n\nKepada:\n\nNama:………………………………………………………............... No. Kad Pengenalan/No. Syarikat: ……………………………………\n\nNo. : ..................................\n\nAlamat: …………………………………………………………………………………………………………………………………………………………………\n\n……………………………………………………………………………………………………………………………………………………………………………...\n\nBAHAWASANYA saya mempunyai sebab-sebab yang munasabah untuk mempercayai bahawa kamu telah\n\nmelakukan kesalahan yang berikut di bawah:\n\nSeksyen: ……………………………………………………….. Akta Pengangkutan Jalan 1987\n\nKaedah: ……………………………………………… Kaedah-Kaedah:………………………………………………………………………………………\n\nNo. Pendaftaran Kenderaan Motor/ Jenis Kenderaan\n\nMotor:\n\n…………………………………………………………………………..\n\n…………………………………………………………………………..\n\nTarikh/ Masa:\n\n………………………………………………………………………….\n\n………………………………………………………………………….\n\nTempat kesalahan:\n\n………………………………………………………………………….\n\n………………………………………………………………………….\n\nKesalahan:\n\n(i) ………………………………………………………………..........................\n\n(ii) …………………………………………………………………………………\n\n(iii) …………………………………………………………………………………\n\nKelajuan Sebenar: …………………………………………………………..\n\nHad Laju yang dibenarkan: ……………………………………………..\n\n KAMU DENGAN INI DIPERINTAHKAN supaya hadir sendiri atau melalui peguam di hadapan Majistret di\n\n………………………………………………………………………………….…………………………………………..pada………………………………….…….\n\njam ……….….……………………..………… * pagi/petang.\n\nKesalahan ini ialah kesalahan boleh kompaun dan kamu boleh membayar kompaun sebanyak RM …………………………..\n\npada atau sebelum …………………………………………………………………………………………………………………………\n\nJika kamu bukan pemandu pada masa kesalahan itu dilakukan, kamu hendaklah mengemukakan nama dan alamat\n\npemandu kepada * Jabatan Pengangkutan Jalan/Polis Di Raja Malaysia dalam masa tiga puluh (30) hari dari tarikh\n\npenyampaian notis ini.\n\nImej kenderaan motor Imej kenderaan motor\n\n………………………………………………………………….\n\n*Pegawai Pengangkutan Jalan/Pegawai Polis\n\nCatatan: *Potong mana-mana yang tidak\n\nberkenaan\n\nDikeluarkan pada:\n\nJam:\n\nDibuat 5 April 2017\n\n[KP/BD/PJ/0.137/3; PN(PU2)460/LXXXIX]\n\n DATO' SERI LIOW TIONG LAI\n\n Menteri Pengangkutan\n\nROAD TRANSPORT ACT 1987\n\nROAD TRANSPORT (CAMERA-RECORDED OFFENCES) (AMENDMENT) RULES 2017\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 53A of the\n\nRoad Transport Act 1987 [Act 333], the Minister makes the following rules:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-16"};
  FT["MY-H803"] = {"id":"MY-H803","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 109/2018&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2018年印刷机与出版物（不良出版物管制）（第4号）令","en":"PRINTING PRESSES AND PUBLICATIONS (CONTROL OF UNDESIRABLE PUBLICATIONS) (NO. 4) ORDER 2018","orig":"PRINTING PRESSES AND PUBLICATIONS (CONTROL OF UNDESIRABLE PUBLICATIONS) (NO. 4) ORDER 2018","ms":"Perintah Mesin Cetak dan Penerbitan (Kawalan Penerbitan Tidak Diingini) (Bilangan 4) 2018","vi":"Lệnh về Máy in và ấn phẩm (Kiểm soát ấn phẩm không mong muốn) (số 4) năm 2018","th":"คำสั่งแท่นพิมพ์และสิ่งพิมพ์ (การควบคุมสิ่งพิมพ์ที่ไม่พึงประสงค์) (ฉบับที่ 4) ค.ศ. 2018","id":"Perintah Mesin Cetak dan Penerbitan (Pengendalian Terbitan Tidak Diinginkan) (Nomor 4) Tahun 2018"},"level":"regulation","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA109","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2018","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\2018_P.U.(A)109-2018_PRINTING PRESSES AND PUBLICATIONS (CONTROL OF UNDESIRABLE PUBLICATIONS) (NO. 4) ORDER 2018.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H803-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Mesin Cetak dan Penerbitan\n\n(Kawalan Hasil Penerbitan Tidak Diingini) (No. 4) 2018.\n\nLarangan"}},{"id":"MY-H803-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Pencetakan, pengimportan, penghasilan, penghasilan semula, penerbitan,\n\npenjualan, pengeluaran, pengelilingan, pengedaran atau pemilikan hasil penerbitan yang\n\ndiperihalkan dalam Jadual yang mungkin memudaratkan ketenteraman awam, yang\n\nmungkin menggemparkan fikiran orang ramai dan yang mungkin memudaratkan\n\nkepentingan awam dilarang secara mutlak di seluruh Malaysia.\n\nJADUAL\n\nTajuk Hasil\n\nPenerbitan\n\nPengarang/\n\nPenterjemah\n\nPenerbit Pencetak Bahasa\n\n1. Islam Dan Teologi\n\nPembebasan\n\nAsghar Ali Engineer/\n\nAgung Prihantoro\n\nPustaka Pelajar\n\nCeleban Timur UH\n\nIII/548 Yogjakarta\n\n55167\n\nPustaka\n\nPelajar\n\nOffset\n\nIndonesia\n\n2. The Road To\n\nMuhammad\n\nJalaluddin Rakhmat Penerbit Mizan\n\nPT Mizan Pustaka\n\nAnggota IKAPI\n\n- Indonesia\n\nJln. Cinambo\n\nNo. 135\n\nCisarantren Wetan,\n\nUjungberung,\n\nBandung 40294\n\n3. Mutiara Sastra Ali;\n\nEdisi Surat &\n\nAforisme\n\nMuhammad Hashem Penerbit Al-Huda\n\nP.O. Box 7335\n\nJKSPM 12073\n\n- Indonesia\n\nDibuat 4 April 2018\n\n[KDN.PQ(S) 600-2/1 Jld.2 (21); PN(PU2)417/XXIII]\n\nDATO' SERI DR. AHMAD ZAHID BIN HAMIDI\n\nMenteri Dalam Negeri\n\nPRINTING PRESSES AND PUBLICATIONS ACT 1984\n\nPRINTING PRESSES AND PUBLICATIONS\n\n(CONTROL OF UNDESIRABLE PUBLICATIONS) (NO. 4) ORDER 2018\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 7(1) of the\n\nPrinting Presses and Publications Act 1984 [Act 301], the Minister makes the\n\nfollowing order:\n\nCitation\n\n1. This order may be cited as the Printing Presses and Publications\n\n(Control of Undesirable Publications) (No. 4) Order 2018.\n\nProhibition\n\n2. The printing, importation, production, reproduction, publishing, sale, issue,\n\ncirculation, distribution or possession of the publications described in the Schedule\n\nwhich is likely to be prejudicial to public order, likely to alarm public opinion and likely\n\nto be prejudicial to public interest is absolutely prohibited throughout Malaysia.\n\nSCHEDULE\n\nTitle of\n\nPublication\n\nAuthor/\n\nTranslator\n\nPublisher Printer Language\n\n1. Islam Dan Teologi\n\nPembebasan\n\nAsghar Ali\n\nEngineer/Agung\n\nPrihantoro\n\nPustaka Pelajar\n\nCeleban Timur UH\n\nIII/548 Yogjakarta\n\n55167\n\nPustaka\n\nPelajar Offset\n\nIndonesian\n\n2. The Road To\n\nMuhammad\n\nJalaluddin\n\nRakhmat\n\nPenerbit Mizan\n\nPT Mizan Pustaka\n\nAnggota IKAPI\n\nJln. Cinambo\n\n- Indonesian\n\nNo. 135\n\nCisarantren Wetan,\n\nUjungberung,\n\nBandung 40294\n\n3. Mutiara Sastra Ali;\n\nEdisi Surat &\n\nAforisme\n\nMuhammad\n\nHashem\n\nPenerbit Al-Huda\n\nP.O. Box 7335\n\nJKSPM 12073\n\n- Indonesian\n\nMade 4 April 2018\n\n[KDN.PQ(S) 600-2/1 Jld.2 (21); PN(PU2)417/XXIII]\n\nDATO' SERI DR. AHMAD ZAHID BIN HAMIDI\n\nMinister of Home Affairs"}}],"pack":"my-16"};
  FT["MY-H804"] = {"id":"MY-H804","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 109/2019&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":3,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2019年价格管制与反暴利（汽油与柴油最高零售价格核定）（第11号）令","en":"PRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING (DETERMINATION OF MAXIMUM RETAIL PRICE FOR PETROL AND DIESEL) (NO. 11) ORDER 2019","orig":"PRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING (DETERMINATION OF MAXIMUM RETAIL PRICE FOR PETROL AND DIESEL) (NO. 11) ORDER 2019","ms":"Perintah Kawalan Harga dan Anti-Pencatutan (Penetapan Harga Runcit Maksimum bagi Petrol dan Diesel) (Bilangan 11) 2019","vi":"Lệnh về Kiểm soát giá và chống trục lợi (Xác định giá bán lẻ tối đa đối với xăng và dầu diesel) (số 11) năm 2019","th":"คำสั่งการควบคุมราคาและการต่อต้านการฉวยโอกาส (การกำหนดราคาขายปลีกสูงสุดสำหรับน้ำมันเบนซินและดีเซล) (ฉบับที่ 11) ค.ศ. 2019","id":"Perintah Pengendalian Harga dan Anti-Pencatutan (Penetapan Harga Eceran Maksimum untuk Bensin dan Solar) (Nomor 11) Tahun 2019"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA109","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2019","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 3 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2019_P.U.(A)109-2019_PRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING (DETERMINATION OF MAXIMUM RETAIL PRICE FOR PETROL AND DIESE.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H804-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Kawalan Harga dan Antipencatutan\n(Penentuan Harga Runcit Maksimum bagi Petrol dan Diesel) (No. 11) 2019.\n\nHarga runcit maksimum bagi petrol dan diesel"}},{"id":"MY-H804-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Harga runcit maksimum bagi petrol dan diesel hendaklah sebagaimana yang\ndinyatakan dalam Jadual.\n\nPembatalan"}},{"id":"MY-H804-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Perintah Kawalan Harga dan Antipencatutan (Penentuan Harga Runcit Maksimum\nbagi Petrol dan Diesel) (No. 10) 2019 [ P.U. (A) 105/2019 ] yang disiarkan dalam Warta\npada 5 April 2019 dibatalkan.\n\nPRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING ACT 2011\n\nPRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING\n(DETERMINATION OF MAXIMUM RETAIL PRICE FOR PETROL AND DIESEL)\n(NO. 11) ORDER 2019\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 4\nof the Price Control and Anti -Profiteering Act 2011 [ Act 723], the Controller, with the\napproval of the Minister, makes the following order:\n\nCitation\n\nJADUAL/SCHEDULE\n\nHARGA RUNCIT MAKSIMUM BAGI PETROL DAN DIESEL/\nMAXIMUM RETAIL PRICE FOR PETROL AND DIESEL\n\nKelas petrol dan diesel/\nClass of petrol and diesel\n\nHarga seliter/\nPrice per litre\n(RM)\n\nPetrol RON97\n\n2.68\n\nPetrol RON95\n\n                                        2.08\n\nDiesel Euro2\n\n2.18\n\nDiesel Euro5\n\n2.28\n\nDibuat 12 April 2019\nMade 12 April 2019\n[KPDNKK 600-1/2/14; PN(PU2)695/XXIV]\n\nDATUK MUEZ BIN ABD AZIZ\nPengawal Harga/\nPrice Controller\n\nDiluluskan 12 April 2019\nApproved 12 April 2019\n[KPDNKK 600-1/2/14; PN(PU2)695/XXIV]\n\nDATUK SERI SAIFUDDIN NASUTION BIN ISMAIL\nMenteri Perdagangan Dalam Negeri dan Hal Ehwal Pengguna/\nMinister of Domestic Trade and Consumer Affairs"}}],"pack":"my-16"};
  FT["MY-H805"] = {"id":"MY-H805","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 109/2020&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":11,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2020年传染病预防与控制（疫区地方措施）（第2号）条例","en":"PREVENTION AND CONTROL OF INFECTIOUS DISEASES (MEASURES WITHIN INFECTED LOCAL AREAS) (NO. 2) REGULATIONS 2020","orig":"PREVENTION AND CONTROL OF INFECTIOUS DISEASES (MEASURES WITHIN INFECTED LOCAL AREAS) (NO. 2) REGULATIONS 2020","ms":"Peraturan Pencegahan dan Kawalan Penyakit Berjangkit (Langkah dalam Kawasan Tempatan Berjangkit) (Bilangan 2) 2020","vi":"Quy định về Phòng chống bệnh truyền nhiễm (Các biện pháp trong khu vực bị nhiễm bệnh) (số 2) năm 2020","th":"ข้อบังคับการป้องกันและควบคุมโรคติดต่อ (มาตรการในท้องที่ที่ติดเชื้อ) (ฉบับที่ 2) ค.ศ. 2020","id":"Peraturan Pencegahan dan Pengendalian Penyakit Menular (Tindakan di Wilayah Lokal Terinfeksi) (Nomor 2) Tahun 2020"},"level":"regulation","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA109","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2020","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 11 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）；已清除正文中的 1 个控制字符（C0/C1 区，法律文本中无合法用途，系 PDF 抽取/表单域残留）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\2020_P.U.(A)109-2020_PREVENTION AND CONTROL OF INFECTIOUS DISEASES (MEASURES WITHIN INFECTED LOCAL AREAS) (NO. 2) RE.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H805-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Peraturan-peraturan ini bolehlah dinamakan Peraturan-Peraturan\n\nPencegahan dan Pengawalan Penyakit Berjangkit (Langkah-Langkah\n\ndi dalam Kawasan Tempatan Jangkitan) (No. 2) 2020.\n\n(2) Peraturan-Peraturan ini berkuat kuasa bagi tempoh mulai 1 April 2020\n\nhingga 14 April 2020.\n\nTafsiran"}},{"id":"MY-H805-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Dalam Peraturan-Peraturan ini—\n\n\"kawasan tempatan jangkitan\" ertinya mana-mana kawasan yang diisytiharkan\n\nsebagai kawasan tempatan jangkitan di bawah Perintah Pencegahan dan\n\nPengawalan Penyakit Berjangkit (Pengisytiharan Kawasan Tempatan Jangkitan)\n\n2020 [P.U. (A) 87/2020];\n\n\"perkhidmatan perlu\" ertinya perkhidmatan sebagaimana yang dinyatakan\n\ndalam Jadual dan termasuklah apa-apa aktiviti dan proses dalam rantaian\n\npembekalan perkhidmatan perlu itu.\n\nKawalan pergerakan"}},{"id":"MY-H805-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. (1) Tiada seorang pun boleh bergerak dari satu tempat ke suatu tempat\n\nyang lain di dalam mana-mana kawasan tempatan jangkitan atau dari satu\n\nkawasan tempatan jangkitan ke suatu kawasan tempatan jangkitan yang lain\n\nkecuali bagi maksud di bawah subperaturan (2).\n\n(2) Seseorang boleh bergerak dari satu tempat ke suatu tempat yang lain\n\ndi dalam mana-mana kawasan tempatan jangkitan atau dari satu kawasan\n\ntempatan jangkitan ke suatu kawasan tempatan jangkitan yang lain bagi\n\nmaksud yang berikut:\n\n(a) untuk membeli makanan, keperluan harian, ubat atau penokok diet;\n\n(b) untuk membekalkan atau menghantar makanan, keperluan harian, ubat\n\natau penokok diet;\n\nP.U. (A) 109.\n\n(c) untuk mendapatkan perkhidmatan jagaan kesihatan atau perubatan;\n\n(d) untuk melaksanakan apa-apa tugas rasmi; atau\n\n(e) untuk melaksanakan apa-apa tugas berhubung dengan apa-apa\n\nperkhidmatan perlu.\n\n(3) Subperaturan (2) tidak terpakai jika suatu arahan dibuat di bawah\n\nperenggan 11(3)(b) Akta.\n\nSyarat-syarat bagi pergerakan"}},{"id":"MY-H805-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4"},"text":{"ms":"4. (1) Jika seseorang bergerak dari satu tempat ke suatu tempat yang lain\n\ndi dalam mana-mana kawasan tempatan jangkitan atau dari satu kawasan\n\ntempatan jangkitan ke suatu kawasan tempatan jangkitan yang lain—\n\n(a) untuk membeli makanan, keperluan harian, ubat atau penokok diet,\n\npergerakannya hendaklah hanya, ke suatu tempat di dalam radius\n\nyang tidak melebihi sepuluh kilometer dari kediamannya, atau ke\n\nsuatu tempat yang paling hampir dengan kediamannya, dan dia\n\ntidak boleh disertai mana-mana orang lain, melainkan jika adalah\n\nsemunasabahnya perlu baginya untuk disertai mana-mana orang lain;\n\n(b) untuk mendapatkan perkhidmatan jagaan kesihatan atau perubatan,\n\npergerakannya hendaklah hanya, ke suatu tempat di dalam radius\n\nyang tidak melebihi sepuluh kilometer dari kediamannya, atau ke\n\nsuatu tempat yang paling hampir dengan kediamannya, dan dia boleh\n\ndisertai mana-mana orang lain yang semunasabahnya perlu;\n\n(c) untuk melaksanakan apa-apa tugas rasmi, dia hendaklah mengemukakan\n\nsurat kebenaran daripada majikannya jika dikehendaki oleh seseorang\n\npegawai diberi kuasa;\n\n(d) untuk melaksanakan tugasnya berhubung dengan apa-apa perkhidmatan\n\nperlu, dia hendaklah mengemukakan surat kebenaran daripada\n\nmajikannya jika dikehendaki oleh seseorang pegawai diberi kuasa.\n\n(2) Bagi maksud mengawal pergerakan orang yang membeli makanan,\n\npemunya atau pengendali, atau orang yang bertanggungjawab bagi, suatu\n\nperniagaan menjual makanan hendaklah menjalankan perniagaan hanya secara\n\npandu lalu, bawa pulang atau penghantaran tertakluk kepada apa-apa arahan\n\nyang dikeluarkan oleh Ketua Pengarah.\n\nPergerakan kerana sebab khas dan tertentu"}},{"id":"MY-H805-A5","no":5,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 5"},"text":{"ms":"5. Jika, kerana sebab khas dan tertentu, seseorang perlu bergerak dari satu\n\ntempat ke suatu tempat yang lain di dalam mana-mana kawasan tempatan\n\njangkitan atau dari satu kawasan tempatan jangkitan ke suatu kawasan tempatan\n\njangkitan yang lain, orang itu hendaklah mendapatkan kebenaran bertulis\n\nterlebih dahulu daripada pegawai polis yang menjaga balai polis yang paling\n\nhampir dengan kediaman orang itu.\n\nP.U. (A) 109.\n\nKawalan perhimpunan"}},{"id":"MY-H805-A6","no":6,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 6"},"text":{"ms":"6. (1) Tiada seorang pun boleh berhimpun atau terlibat dalam mana-mana\n\nperhimpunan di dalam mana-mana premis di dalam mana-mana kawasan\n\ntempatan jangkitan sama ada bagi maksud keagamaan, sukan, rekreasi, sosial\n\natau kebudayaan.\n\n(2) Walau apa pun subperaturan (1), seseorang boleh berhimpun atau terlibat\n\ndalam suatu perhimpunan bagi maksud upacara pengebumian dengan syarat\n\norang yang hadir ke upacara itu hendaklah dalam bilangan yang minimum.\n\nPergerakan untuk menjalankan kerja ke atas infrastruktur"}},{"id":"MY-H805-A7","no":7,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 7"},"text":{"ms":"7. (1) Apa-apa pergerakan dari satu tempat ke suatu tempat yang lain di dalam\n\nmana-mana kawasan tempatan jangkitan atau dari satu kawasan tempatan jangkitan\n\nke suatu kawasan tempatan jangkitan yang lain boleh dibuat oleh mana-mana\n\norang untuk menjalankan apa-apa kerja ke atas mana-mana infrastruktur yang\n\nberkaitan dengan mana-mana perkhidmatan perlu yang jika tidak dijalankan\n\nakan menjejaskan penyampaian perkhidmatan perlu itu.\n\n(2) Apa-apa pergerakan dari satu tempat ke suatu tempat yang lain di dalam\n\nmana-mana kawasan tempatan jangkitan atau dari satu kawasan tempatan\n\njangkitan ke suatu kawasan tempatan jangkitan yang lain boleh dibuat oleh\n\nmana-mana orang untuk menjalankan apa-apa kerja ke atas mana-mana\n\ninfrastruktur yang jika tidak dijalankan akan menjejaskan keselamatan dan\n\nkestabilan infrastruktur itu.\n\n(3) Jika seseorang bergerak dari satu tempat ke suatu tempat yang lain\n\ndi dalam mana-mana kawasan tempatan jangkitan atau dari satu kawasan tempatan\n\njangkitan ke suatu kawasan tempatan jangkitan yang lain untuk menjalankan\n\nkerja yang disebut dalam subperaturan (1) atau (2), dia hendaklah memberikan\n\nbukti yang perlu jika dikehendaki oleh seseorang pegawai diberi kuasa.\n\nKehendak untuk menjalani pemeriksaan kesihatan apabila tiba di Malaysia"}},{"id":"MY-H805-A8","no":8,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 8"},"text":{"ms":"8. Seseorang warganegara, pemastautin tetap Malaysia atau ekspatriat yang\n\npulang dari luar negara hendaklah menjalani pemeriksaan kesihatan apabila\n\ntiba di Malaysia sebelum mendapatkan pelepasan imigresen di mana-mana\n\npintu masuk dan hendaklah mematuhi apa-apa arahan seseorang pegawai diberi\n\nkuasa.\n\nPermintaan maklumat"}},{"id":"MY-H805-A9","no":9,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 9"},"text":{"ms":"9. Jika seseorang pegawai diberi kuasa meminta apa-apa maklumat yang\n\nberhubungan dengan pencegahan dan pengawalan penyakit berjangkit daripada\n\nmana-mana orang atau kumpulan orang, orang atau kumpulan orang itu\n\nhendaklah mematuhi permintaan itu.\n\nP.U. (A) 109.\n\nArahan Ketua Pengarah"}},{"id":"MY-H805-A10","no":10,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 10"},"text":{"ms":"10. Ketua Pengarah boleh mengeluarkan apa-apa arahan mengikut apa-apa\n\ncara, sama ada secara am atau khusus, kepada mana-mana orang atau kumpulan\n\norang supaya mengambil apa-apa langkah bagi maksud mencegah dan\n\nmengawal apa-apa penyakit berjangkit di dalam mana-mana kawasan tempatan\n\njangkitan.\n\nKesalahan"}},{"id":"MY-H805-A11","no":11,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 11"},"text":{"ms":"11. (1) Mana-mana orang yang melanggar mana-mana peruntukan PeraturanPeraturan ini atau mana-mana arahan Ketua Pengarah atau seseorang pegawai\n\ndiberi kuasa melakukan suatu kesalahan dan boleh, apabila disabitkan, didenda\n\ntidak melebihi satu ribu ringgit atau dipenjarakan selama tempoh tidak melebihi\n\nenam bulan atau kedua-duanya.\n\n(2) Jika mana-mana orang yang melakukan suatu kesalahan di bawah\n\nPeraturan-Peraturan ini ialah suatu syarikat, perkongsian liabiliti terhad, firma,\n\npertubuhan atau kumpulan orang yang lain, seseorang yang pada masa pelakuan\n\nkesalahan itu ialah seorang pengarah, pegawai pematuhan, pekongsi, pengurus,\n\nsetiausaha atau pegawai lain yang seumpamanya bagi syarikat, perkongsian\n\nliabiliti terhad, firma, pertubuhan atau kumpulan orang yang lain itu atau yang\n\nberupa sebagai bertindak atas sifat itu atau yang dengan apa-apa cara atau\n\nsehingga apa-apa takat bertanggungjawab bagi pengurusan apa-apa hal ehwal\n\nsyarikat, perkongsian liabiliti terhad, firma, pertubuhan atau kumpulan orang\n\nyang lain itu atau membantu dalam pengurusannya—\n\n(a) boleh dipertuduh secara berasingan atau bersesama dalam prosiding\n\nyang sama bersekali dengan syarikat, perkongsian liabiliti terhad,\n\nfirma, pertubuhan atau kumpulan orang yang lain itu; dan\n\n(b) jika syarikat, perkongsian liabiliti terhad, firma, pertubuhan atau\n\nkumpulan orang yang lain itu didapati bersalah atas kesalahan itu,\n\nhendaklah disifatkan bersalah atas kesalahan itu dan boleh dikenakan\n\nhukuman atau penalti yang sama sebagaimana seorang individu\n\nmelainkan jika, dengan mengambil kira jenis fungsinya atas sifat\n\nitu dan segala hal keadaan, dia membuktikan—\n\n(i) bahawa kesalahan itu telah dilakukan tanpa pengetahuannya;\n\ndan\n\n(ii) bahawa kesalahan itu telah dilakukan tanpa persetujuan atau\n\npembiarannya dan bahawa dia telah mengambil segala langkah\n\nyang munasabah dan menjalankan segala usaha yang wajar\n\nuntuk menghalang pelakuan kesalahan itu.\n\nP.U. (A) 109.\n\nJADUAL\n\nPERKHIDMATAN PERLU\n\n[Peraturan 2]\n\n1. Makanan\n\n2. Air\n\n3. Tenaga\n\n4. Komunikasi dan internet\n\n5. Keselamatan dan pertahanan\n\n6. Pengurusan sisa pepejal dan pembersihan awam dan pembetungan\n\n7. Penjagaan kesihatan dan perubatan termasuk penokok diet\n\n8. Perbankan dan kewangan\n\n9. E-dagang\n\n10. Logistik yang terhad kepada penyampaian perkhidmatan perlu\n\nDibuat 31 Mac 2020\n\n[KKM.600-29/4/146 Jld. 2 (30); PN(PU2)470/VI]\n\nDato' Sri Dr. Adham bin Baba\n\nMenteri Kesihatan\n\nPREVENTION AND CONTROL OF INFECTIOUS DISEASES ACT 1988\n\nPrevention and Control of Infectious Diseases (Measures within\n\nInfected Local Areas) (No. 2) Regulations 2020\n\nIn exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 11(2) of the Prevention\n\nand Control of Infectious Diseases Act 1988 [Act 342], the Minister makes\n\nthe following regulations:\n\nCitation and commencement\n\n1. (1) These regulations may be cited as the Prevention and Control\n\nof Infectious Diseases (Measures within Infected Local Areas) (No. 2)\n\nRegulations 2020.\n\n(2) These Regulations have effect for the period from 1 April 2020 to\n\n14 April 2020.\n\nP.U. (A) 109.\n\nInterpretation\n\n2. In these Regulations—\n\n\"infected local area\" means any area declared to be an infected local area\n\nunder the Prevention and Control of Infectious Diseases (Declaration of Infected\n\nLocal Areas) Order 2020 [P.U. (A) 87/2020];\n\n\"essential services\" means the services as specified in the Schedule and\n\nincludes any activity and process in the supply chain of such essential services.\n\nControl of movement\n\n3. (1) No person shall move from one place to another place within any\n\ninfected local area or from one infected local area to another infected local\n\narea except for the purposes under subregulation (2).\n\n(2) A person may move from one place to another place within any infected\n\nlocal area or from one infected local area to another infected local area for\n\nthe following purposes:\n\n(a) to purchase food, daily necessities, medicine or dietary supplement;\n\n(b) to supply or deliver food, daily necessities, medicine or dietary\n\nsupplement;\n\n(c) to seek healthcare or medical services;\n\n(d) to perform any official duty; or\n\n(e) to perform any duty in relation to any essential services.\n\n(3) Subregulation (2) shall not apply if a direction is made under\n\nparagraph 11(3)(b) of the Act.\n\nConditions for movement\n\n4. (1) Where a person moves from one place to another place within any\n\ninfected local area or from one infected local area to another infected local\n\narea—\n\n(a) to purchase food, daily necessities, medicine or dietary supplement,\n\nhis movement shall only be, to a place within a radius of not more\n\nthan ten kilometres from his residence, or to a place nearest to his\n\nresidence, and he shall not be accompanied by any other person,\n\nunless it is reasonably necessary for him to be accompanied by any\n\nother person;\n\nP.U. (A) 109.\n\n(b) to seek healthcare or medical services, his movement shall only be,\n\nto a place within a radius of not more than ten kilometres from his\n\nresidence, or to a place nearest to his residence, and he may be\n\naccompanied by any other person as may be reasonably necessary;\n\n(c) to perform any official duty, he shall produce an authorization letter\n\nfrom his employer if required by an authorized officer;\n\n(d) to perform his duty in relation to any essential services, he shall\n\nproduce an authorization letter from his employer if required by an\n\nauthorized officer.\n\n(2) For the purpose of controlling the movement of persons purchasing food,\n\nthe owner or operator of, or person responsible for, a business of selling food\n\nshall carry out business only by way of drive-through, take away or delivery\n\nsubject to any direction as may be issued by the Director General.\n\nMovement due to special and particular reason\n\n5. Where, due to a special and particular reason, a person needs to move\n\nfrom one place to another place within any infected local area or from one\n\ninfected local area to another infected local area, that person shall obtain prior\n\nwritten permission of the police officer in charge of the police station nearest\n\nto the residence of such person.\n\nControl of gathering\n\n6. (1) No person shall gather or be involved in any gathering in any premises\n\nwithin any infected local area whether for religious, sports, recreational, social\n\nor cultural purpose.\n\n(2) Notwithstanding subregulation (1), a person may gather or be involved\n\nin a gathering for the purposes of a funeral ceremony on the condition that\n\nthe attendance to such ceremony shall be kept to the minimum.\n\nMovement to carry out works on infrastructure\n\n7. (1) Any movement from one place to another place within any infected\n\nlocal area or from one infected local area to another infected local area may\n\nbe made by any person to carry out any works on any infrastructure related\n\nto any essential services which if not carried out would affect the provision\n\nof the essential services.\n\n(2) Any movement from one place to another place within any infected\n\nlocal area or from one infected local area to another infected local area may\n\nbe made by any person to carry out any works on any infrastructure which if\n\nnot carried out would affect the safety and the stability of the infrastructure.\n\nP.U. (A) 109.\n\n(3) Where a person moves from one place to another place within any\n\ninfected local area or from one infected local area to another infected local\n\narea to carry out the works referred to in subregulation (1) or (2), he shall\n\nprovide the necessary proof if requested by an authorized officer.\n\nRequirement to undergo health examination upon arrival in Malaysia\n\n8. A citizen, a permanent resident of Malaysia or an expatriate returning from\n\noverseas shall undergo health examination upon arrival in Malaysia before\n\nproceeding for immigration clearance at any point of entry and shall comply\n\nwith any direction of an authorized officer.\n\nRequest for information\n\n9. Where an authorized officer requests for any information relating to the\n\nprevention and control of infectious disease from any person or body of\n\npersons, the person or body of persons shall comply with the request.\n\nDirection of Director General\n\n10. Director General may issue any direction in any manner, whether generally\n\nor specifically, to any person or group of persons to take such measures for\n\nthe purpose of preventing and controlling any infectious diseases within any\n\ninfected local area.\n\nOffence\n\n11. (1) Any person who contravenes any provision of these Regulations or any\n\ndirection of the Director General or an authorized officer commits an offence\n\nand shall, on conviction, be liable to a fine not exceeding one thousand ringgit\n\nor to imprisonment for a term not exceeding six months or to both.\n\n(2) Where any person who commits an offence under these Regulations is a\n\ncompany, limited liability partnership, firm, society or other body of persons,\n\na person who at the time of the commission of the offence was a director,\n\ncompliance officer, partner, manager, secretary or other similar officer of the\n\ncompany, limited liability partnership, firm, society or other body of persons\n\nor was purporting to act in the capacity or was in any manner or to any extent\n\nresponsible for the management of any of the affairs of the company, limited\n\nliability partnership, firm, society or other body of persons or was assisting\n\nin its management—\n\n(a) may be charged severally or jointly in the same proceedings with the\n\ncompany, limited liability partnership, firm, society or the body of\n\npersons; and\n\nP.U. (A) 109.\n\n(b) if the company, limited liability partnership, firm, society or the body\n\nof persons is found guilty of the offence, shall be deemed to be\n\nguilty of that offence and shall be liable to the same punishment or\n\npenalty as an individual unless, having regard to the nature of his\n\nfunctions in that capacity and to all circumstances, he proves—\n\n(i) that the offence was committed without his knowledge; and\n\n(ii) that the offence was committed without his consent or connivance\n\nand that he had taken all reasonable precautions and exercised\n\ndue diligence to prevent the commission of the offence.\n\nSCHEDULE\n\nESSENTIAL SERVICES\n\n[Regulation 2]\n\n1. Food\n\n2. Water\n\n3. Energy\n\n4. Communication and internet\n\n5. Security and defence\n\n6. Solid waste and public cleansing management and sewerage\n\n7. Healthcare and medical including dietary supplement\n\n8. Banking and finance\n\n9. E-commerce\n\n10. Logistics confined to the provision of essential services\n\nMade 31 March 2020\n\n[KKM.600-29/4/146 Jld. 2 (30); PN(PU2)470/VI]\n\nDato' Sri Dr. Adham bin Baba\n\nMinister of Health\n\nHakcipta Pencetak H\n\nPERCETAKAN NASIONAL MALAYSIA BERHAD\n\nSemua Hak Terpelihara. Tiada mana-mana bahagian jua daripada penerbitan ini boleh diterbitkan semula atau disimpan di dalam bentuk\n\nyang boleh diperolehi semula atau disiarkan dalam sebarang bentuk dengan apa jua cara elektronik, mekanikal, fotokopi, rakaman dan/\n\natau sebaliknya tanpa mendapat izin daripada Percetakan Nasional Malaysia Berhad (Pencetak kepada Kerajaan Malaysia yang\n\ndilantik).\n\nDICETAK OLEH\n\nPERCETAKAN NASIONAL MALAYSIA BERHAD,\n\nKUALA LUMPUR\n\nBAGI PIHAK DAN DENGAN PERINTAH KERAJAAN MALAYSIA\n\nWJW014951 31-03-2020\n\nP.U. (A) 109."}}],"pack":"my-16"};
  FT["MY-H806"] = {"id":"MY-H806","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 109/2021&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2021年联邦直辖区（规划）（土地与建筑物用途类别）（吉隆坡联邦直辖区）（修正）规则","en":"FEDERAL TERRITORY (PLANNING) (CLASSES OF USE OF LAND AND BUILDINGS) (FEDERAL TERRITORY OF KUALA LUMPUR) (AMENDMENT) RULES 2021","orig":"FEDERAL TERRITORY (PLANNING) (CLASSES OF USE OF LAND AND BUILDINGS) (FEDERAL TERRITORY OF KUALA LUMPUR) (AMENDMENT) RULES 2021","ms":"Kaedah Wilayah Persekutuan (Perancangan) (Kelas Penggunaan Tanah dan Bangunan) (Wilayah Persekutuan Kuala Lumpur) (Pindaan) 2021","vi":"Quy tắc về Lãnh thổ Liên bang (Quy hoạch) (Các loại mục đích sử dụng đất và công trình) (Lãnh thổ Liên bang Kuala Lumpur) (Sửa đổi) năm 2021","th":"กฎเขตการปกครองสหพันธ์ (การผังเมือง) (ประเภทการใช้ประโยชน์ที่ดินและอาคาร) (เขตการปกครองสหพันธ์กัวลาลัมเปอร์) (การแก้ไข) ค.ศ. 2021","id":"Tata Tertib Wilayah Persekutuan (Penataan Ruang) (Kelas Penggunaan Tanah dan Bangunan) (Wilayah Persekutuan Kuala Lumpur) (Perubahan) Tahun 2021"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA109","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2021","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2021_P.U.(A)109-2021_FEDERAL TERRITORY (PLANNING) (CLASSES OF USE OF LAND AND BUILDINGS) (FEDERAL TERRITORY OF KUALA.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H806-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Kaedah-kaedah ini bolehlah dinamakan Kaedah-Kaedah (Perancangan)\nWilayah Persekutuan (Kelas Kegunaan Tanah dan Bangunan)\n(Wilayah Persekutuan Kuala Lumpur) (Pindaan) 2021.\n\n (2) Kaedah-Kaedah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 15 Mac 2021.\n\nPindaan Jadual"}},{"id":"MY-H806-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Kaedah-Kaedah (Perancangan) Wilayah Persekutuan (Kelas Kegunaan Tanah\ndan Bangunan)  (Wilayah Persekutuan Kuala Lumpur) 2018 [ P.U. (A) 276/2018 ]\ndipinda dalam Jadual berhubung dengan butiran 6 dalam ruang (1)—\n\n(a) dalam ruang (3), dengan memasukkan selepas perkataan \"Kelas B6\"\nperkataan \"Kelas B11\"; dan\n\n(b) dalam ruang (4), dengan memotong perkataan \"Kelas B11\".\n\nDibuat 1 Mac 2021\n[DBKL/JUP/BPPP/GN/1486 (JLD. 4); PN(PU2)396/VII]\n\nDATUK SERI HJ. MAHADI BIN CHE NGAH\n                                                                                                Datuk Bandar Kuala Lumpur\n\nDiluluskan 3 Mac 2021\n[KWP(S)24/PUU/698/1/59/Jld. 5; PN(PU2)396/VII]\n\n     TAN SRI TPr ANNUAR BIN HJ. MUSA\n            Menteri Wilayah Persekutuan\n\nFEDERAL TERRITORY (PLANNING) ACT 1982\n\n FEDERAL TERRITORY (PLANNING) (CLASSES OF USE OF LAND AND BUILDINGS)\n(FEDERAL TERRITORY OF KUALA LUMPUR) (AMENDMENT) RULES 2021\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by paragraph 64(2)(b)\nof the Federal Territory (Planning) Act 1982 [ Act 267 ], the Commissioner\nof the City of Kuala Lumpur, with the approval of the Minister, makes the following rules:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-16"};
  FT["MY-H807"] = {"id":"MY-H807","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 109/2022&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2022年雇员公积金局（修正）规则","en":"EMPLOYEES PROVIDENT FUND (AMENDMENT) RULES 2022","orig":"EMPLOYEES PROVIDENT FUND (AMENDMENT) RULES 2022","ms":"Kaedah Kumpulan Wang Simpanan Pekerja (Pindaan) 2022","vi":"Quy tắc về Quỹ Tiết kiệm Nhân viên (Sửa đổi) năm 2022","th":"กฎกองทุนสำรองเลี้ยงชีพพนักงาน (การแก้ไข) ค.ศ. 2022","id":"Tata Tertib Dana Simpanan Karyawan (Perubahan) Tahun 2022"},"level":"regulation","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA109","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2022","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\2022_P.U.(A)109-2022_EMPLOYEES PROVIDENT FUND (AMENDMENT) RULES 2022.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H807-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Kaedah-kaedah ini bolehlah dinamakan Kaedah-Kaedah Kumpulan\n\nWang Simpanan Pekerja (Pindaan) 2022.\n\n(2) Kaedah-Kaedah ini berkuat kuasa bagi tempoh mulai 15 April 2022\n\nhingga 30 Jun 2022.\n\nPindaan kaedah 41"}},{"id":"MY-H807-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Kaedah-Kaedah Kumpulan Wang Simpanan Pekerja 1991 [P.U. (A) 493/1991]\n\ndipinda dalam kaedah 41 dengan memasukkan selepas subkaedah (10ZH) subkaedah\n\nyang berikut:\n\n\"Ahli Kumpulan Wang\n\nmemerlukan\n\npembiayaan bagi\n\nmaksud\n\nmembantunya dalam\n\nmenampung\n\nkomitmen\n\nkewangannya yang\n\nterjejas disebabkan\n\noleh pandemik\n\nPenyakit Koronavirus\n\n2019 (COVID-19) bagi\n\nnotis pengeluaran\n\nyang diberikan kepada\n\nLembaga sehingga\n\n30 April 2022.\n\n(10ZI) Jika notis pengeluaran dibuat\n\ndi bawah perenggan 54(6)(n) Akta atas alasan\n\nbahawa ahli Kumpulan Wang memerlukan\n\npembiayaan bagi maksud membantunya dalam\n\nmenampung komitmen kewangannya yang terjejas\n\ndisebabkan oleh pandemik Penyakit Koronavirus 2019\n\n(COVID-19) bagi notis pengeluaran yang diberikan\n\nkepada Lembaga sehingga 30 April 2022, ahli\n\nKumpulan Wang itu hendaklah memberikan suatu\n\nnotis pengeluaran kepada Lembaga mengikut\n\napa-apa cara sebagaimana yang ditentukan oleh\n\nLembaga.\n\n(10ZJ) Notis pengeluaran yang disebut dalam\n\nsubkaedah (10ZI) hendaklah dikemukakan oleh\n\nahli Kumpulan Wang kepada Lembaga pada bila-bila\n\nmasa sehingga 30 April 2022.\n\n(10ZK) Jika Lembaga berpuas hati dengan\n\nnotis pengeluaran yang dikemukakan oleh ahli\n\nKumpulan Wang, Lembaga boleh membenarkan ahli\n\nKumpulan Wang itu untuk mengeluarkan suatu\n\namaun tidak kurang daripada lima puluh ringgit dan\n\ntidak melebihi sepuluh ribu ringgit pada tarikh notis\n\npengeluaran itu dibenarkan tertakluk kepada—\n\n(a) amaun yang ada pada kredit\n\ndalam Akaun II ahli Kumpulan\n\nWang itu digunakan\n\nsepenuhnya; dan\n\n(b) amaun yang ada pada kredit\n\ndalam Akaun I ahli Kumpulan\n\nWang itu digunakan jika\n\nterdapat apa-apa kekurangan\n\ndalam amaun yang ada pada\n\nkredit yang disebut dalam\n\nperenggan (a) bagi maksud\n\npengeluaran itu.\n\n(10ZL) Bagi maksud subkaedah (10ZK),\n\namaun pengeluaran hendaklah dibayar kepada ahli\n\nKumpulan Wang secara sekali gus.\n\n(10ZM) Ahli Kumpulan Wang itu hendaklah,\n\npada tarikh pengeluaran, mempunyai amaun\n\nyang ada pada kreditnya dalam Akaun I\n\nsekurang-kurangnya satu ratus ringgit.\n\n(10ZN) Jika ahli Kumpulan Wang telah\n\nmengemukakan notis pengeluaran di bawah\n\nsubkaedah (10ZI) kepada Lembaga, notis\n\npengeluaran itu tidak boleh dibatalkan.\".\n\nDibuat 13 April 2022\n\n[MOF.SBM(R) 600-41/39/91; PN(PU2)498/JLD. 19]\n\n TAN SRI AHMAD BADRI BIN MOHD ZAHIR\n\n Pengerusi\n\n Lembaga Kumpulan Wang Simpanan Pekerja\n\nEMPLOYEES PROVIDENT FUND ACT 1991\n\nEMPLOYEES PROVIDENT FUND (AMENDMENT) RULES 2022\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 73 of the\n\nEmployees Provident Fund Act 1991 [Act 452], the Board makes the following rules:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-16"};
  FT["MY-H808"] = {"id":"MY-H808","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 109/2023&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2023年销售税（免税货物）（修正）令","en":"SALES TAX (GOODS EXEMPTED FROM TAX) (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2023","orig":"SALES TAX (GOODS EXEMPTED FROM TAX) (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2023","ms":"Perintah Cukai Jualan (Barang yang Dikecualikan daripada Cukai) (Pindaan) 2023","vi":"Lệnh về Thuế bán hàng (Hàng hóa được miễn thuế) (Sửa đổi) năm 2023","th":"คำสั่งภาษีขาย (สินค้าที่ได้รับการยกเว้นภาษี) (การแก้ไข) ค.ศ. 2023","id":"Perintah Pajak Penjualan (Barang yang Dibebaskan dari Pajak) (Perubahan) Tahun 2023"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA109","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2023","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2023_P.U.(A)109-2023_SALES TAX (GOODS EXEMPTED FROM TAX) (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2023.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H808-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Cukai Jualan (Barang yang\nDikecualikan daripada Cukai) (Pindaan) 2023.\n\nPindaan Jadual A"}},{"id":"MY-H808-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Perintah Cukai Jualan (Barang yang  Dikecualikan daripada Cukai) 20 22\n[P.U. (A) 175/2022] dipinda dalam Jadual A—\n\n(a) berhubung dengan kepala 12.07, dengan memotong\nsubkepala 1208.10.00 00 dan 1208.90.00 00 dan butir -butir yang\nberhubungan dengannya;\n\n(b) berhubung dengan kepala 30.06, dalam sub kepala 3006.93.00 00, dalam\nruang (3), dengan memotong perkataan \"(Solely for medicaments)\"; dan\n\n(c) berhubung dengan kepala 84.38, dengan memotong\nsubkepala 8438.90.19 00 dan butir-butir yang berhubungan dengannya.\n\nDibuat 3 April 2023\n[KE.HF(152)899/04 JLD2(17); MOF.TAX(S)700-1/2/26 JLD.8; PN(PU2)752/JLD.5]\n\nANWAR BIN IBRAHIM\nMenteri Kewangan\n\n[Akan dibentangkan di hadapan Dewan Rakyat menurut subseksyen 35(2) Akta Cukai Jualan 2018]\nSALES TAX ACT 2018\n\nSALES TAX (GOODS EXEMPTED FROM TAX) (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2023\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by paragraph 35(1) (a) of\nthe Sales Tax Act 2018 [Act 806], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation"}}],"pack":"my-16"};
  FT["MY-H809"] = {"id":"MY-H809","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 109/2024&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":3,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2024年所得税（豁免）（第8号）令2021（修正）令","en":"INCOME TAX (EXEMPTION) (NO. 8) ORDER 2021 (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2024","orig":"INCOME TAX (EXEMPTION) (NO. 8) ORDER 2021 (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2024","ms":"Perintah Perintah Cukai Pendapatan (Pengecualian) (Bilangan 8) 2021 (Pindaan) 2024","vi":"Lệnh về Lệnh Thuế thu nhập (Miễn trừ) (Số 8) 2021 (Sửa đổi) năm 2024","th":"คำสั่งคำสั่งภาษีเงินได้ (การยกเว้น) (ฉบับที่ 8) 2021 (การแก้ไข) ค.ศ. 2024","id":"Perintah Perintah Pajak Penghasilan (Pembebasan) (Nomor 8) 2021 (Perubahan) Tahun 2024"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA109","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2024","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 3 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2024_P.U.(A)109-2024_INCOME TAX (EXEMPTION) (NO. 8) ORDER 2021 (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2024.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H809-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Cukai Pendapatan\n(Pengecualian) (No. 8) 2021 (Pindaan) 2024.\n\n(2) Perintah ini berkuat kuasa mulai tahun taksiran 2024.\n\nPindaan perenggan 1"}},{"id":"MY-H809-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Perintah Cukai Pendapatan (Pengecualian) (No. 8) 2021 [P.U. (A) 28 4/2021],\nyang disebut \"Perintah ibu\" dalam Perintah ini, dipinda dalam subperenggan 1(2) dengan\nmenggantikan perkataan \"tahun taksiran 2023\" dengan perkataan \"tahun taksiran 2027\".\n\nPindaan perenggan 3"}},{"id":"MY-H809-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Perintah ibu dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas subperenggan 3 (2)\nsubperenggan yang berikut:\n\n\"(2A)       Pendapatan berkanun yang diperoleh daripada suatu perniagaan\nyang disebut dalam subperenggan (1) hendaklah enam puluh peratus daripada\npendapatan berkanun itu.\".\n\nDibuat 8 Mac 2024\n[MOF.TAX(S)700-3/1/613(18); LHDN.AY.A 600-12/1/7 (29)-329; PN(PU2)80/JLD.111]\n\nDATUK SERI AMIR HAMZAH AZIZAN\nMenteri Kewangan II\n\n[Akan dibentangkan di Dewan Rakyat menurut subseksyen 127(4) Akta Cukai Pendapatan 1967]\n\nINCOME TAX ACT 1967\n\nINCOME TAX (EXEMPTION) (NO. 8) ORDER 2021 (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2024\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by paragraph 127(3)(b) of the Income Tax Act 1967\n[Act 53], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-16"};
  FT["MY-H810"] = {"id":"MY-H810","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 109/2025&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2025年娱乐税（豁免）（第11号）令","en":"ENTERTAINMENTS DUTY (EXEMPTION) (NO. 11) ORDER 2025","orig":"ENTERTAINMENTS DUTY (EXEMPTION) (NO. 11) ORDER 2025","ms":"Perintah Duti Hiburan (Pengecualian) (Bilangan 11) 2025","vi":"Lệnh về Thuế giải trí (Miễn trừ) (số 11) năm 2025","th":"คำสั่งภาษีบันเทิง (การยกเว้น) (ฉบับที่ 11) ค.ศ. 2025","id":"Perintah Bea Hiburan (Pembebasan) (Nomor 11) Tahun 2025"},"level":"regulation","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA109","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2025","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\2025_P.U.(A)109-2025_ENTERTAINMENTS DUTY (EXEMPTION) (NO. 11) ORDER 2025.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H810-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Duti Hiburan (Pengecualian)\n\n(No. 11) 2025.\n\nPengecualian"}},{"id":"MY-H810-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Menteri mengecualikan tiket masuk bagi persembahan AR Rahman\n\nLive in Kuala Lumpur 2024 yang telah diadakan di Stadium Nasional Bukit Jalil,\n\nKuala Lumpur pada 27 Julai 2024 daripada duti hiburan.\n\nDibuat 20 Januari 2025\n\n[MOF.700-4/6/37; PN(PU2)174/JLD.12]\n\nDATUK SERI AMIR HAMZAH AZIZAN\n\n Menteri Kewangan II\n\nENTERTAINMENTS DUTY ACT 1953\n\nENTERTAINMENTS DUTY (EXEMPTION) (NO. 11) ORDER 2025\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by paragraph 12(1)(b) of the\n\nEntertainments Duty Act 1953 [Act 103], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation"}}],"pack":"my-16"};
  FT["MY-H811"] = {"id":"MY-H811","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 109/2026&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2026年印刷机与出版物（不良出版物管制）（第18号）令","en":"PRINTING PRESSES AND PUBLICATIONS (CONTROL OF UNDESIRABLE PUBLICATIONS) (NO. 18) ORDER 2026","orig":"PRINTING PRESSES AND PUBLICATIONS (CONTROL OF UNDESIRABLE PUBLICATIONS) (NO. 18) ORDER 2026","ms":"Perintah Mesin Cetak dan Penerbitan (Kawalan Penerbitan Tidak Diingini) (Bilangan 18) 2026","vi":"Lệnh về Máy in và ấn phẩm (Kiểm soát ấn phẩm không mong muốn) (số 18) năm 2026","th":"คำสั่งแท่นพิมพ์และสิ่งพิมพ์ (การควบคุมสิ่งพิมพ์ที่ไม่พึงประสงค์) (ฉบับที่ 18) ค.ศ. 2026","id":"Perintah Mesin Cetak dan Penerbitan (Pengendalian Terbitan Tidak Diinginkan) (Nomor 18) Tahun 2026"},"level":"regulation","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA109","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2026","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\2026_P.U.(A)109-2026_PRINTING PRESSES AND PUBLICATIONS (CONTROL OF UNDESIRABLE PUBLICATIONS) (NO. 18) ORDER 2026.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H811-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Mesin Cetak dan Penerbitan\n\n(Kawalan Hasil Penerbitan Tidak Diingini) (No. 18) 2026.\n\nLarangan"}},{"id":"MY-H811-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Pencetakan, pengimportan, penghasilan, penghasilan semula, penerbitan,\n\npenjualan, pengeluaran, pengelilingan, pengedaran atau pemilikan hasil penerbitan\n\nyang diperihalkan dalam Jadual yang mungkin memudaratkan kemoralan\n\nadalah dilarang secara mutlak di seluruh Malaysia.\n\nJADUAL\n\n(1)\n\nTajuk Hasil\n\nPenerbitan\n\n(2)\n\nPengarang\n\n(3)\n\nPenerbit\n\n(4)\n\nBahasa\n\nI'll Always Be\n\nWith You\n\nMonica Murphy Penguin Random\n\nHouse\n\nInggeris\n\nDibuat 23 Februari 2026\n\n[KDN.PK.S.600-16/15/183; PN(PU2)417/JLD.28]\n\nDATUK SERI SAIFUDDIN NASUTION BIN ISMAIL\n\nMenteri Dalam Negeri\n\nPRINTING PRESSES AND PUBLICATIONS ACT 1984\n\nPRINTING PRESSES AND PUBLICATIONS\n\n(CONTROL OF UNDESIRABLE PUBLICATIONS) (NO. 18) ORDER 2026\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 7(1) of the Printing Presses\n\nand Publications Act 1984 [Act 301], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation\n\n1. This order may be cited as the Printing Presses and Publications\n\n(Control of Undesirable Publications) (No. 18) Order 2026.\n\nProhibition\n\n2. The printing, importation, production, reproduction, publishing, sale, issue,\n\ncirculation, distribution or possession of the publication described in the Schedule\n\nwhich is likely to be prejudicial to morality is absolutely prohibited throughout Malaysia.\n\nSCHEDULE\n\n(1)\n\nTitle of\n\nPublication\n\n(2)\n\nAuthor\n\n(3)\n\nPublisher\n\n(4)\n\nLanguage\n\nI'll Always Be\n\nWith You\n\nMonica Murphy Penguin Random\n\nHouse\n\nEnglish\n\nMade 23 February 2026\n\n[KDN.PK.S.600-16/15/183; PN(PU2)417/JLD.28]\n\nDATUK SERI SAIFUDDIN NASUTION BIN ISMAIL\n\nMinister of Home Affairs"}}],"pack":"my-16"};
  FT["MY-H812"] = {"id":"MY-H812","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 10/2012&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2012年联邦政府部长（修正）令","en":"MINISTERS OF THE FEDERAL GOVERNMENT (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2012","orig":"MINISTERS OF THE FEDERAL GOVERNMENT (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2012","ms":"Perintah Menteri Kerajaan Persekutuan (Pindaan) 2012","vi":"Lệnh về Các Bộ trưởng Chính phủ Liên bang (Sửa đổi) năm 2012","th":"คำสั่งรัฐมนตรีของรัฐบาลสหพันธ์ (การแก้ไข) ค.ศ. 2012","id":"Perintah Menteri Pemerintah Federal (Perubahan) Tahun 2012"},"level":"regulation","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA10","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2012","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\2012_P.U.(A)10-2012_MINISTERS OF THE FEDERAL GOVERNMENT (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2012.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H812-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Menteri-Menteri Kerajaan\n\nPersekutuan (Pindaan) 2012.\n\n(2) Subsubperenggan 2(a)(i) disifatkan telah mula berkuat kuasa pada\n\n9 Ogos 2011.\n\n(3) Subsubperenggan 2(a)(ii) disifatkan telah mula berkuat kuasa pada\n\n1 April 2011.\n\n(4) Subsubperenggan 2(a)(iii) dan subperenggan 2(b) disifatkan telah mula\n\nberkuat kuasa pada 1 Januari 2011.\n\n(5) Subsubperenggan 2(a)(iv) disifatkan telah mula berkuat kuasa pada\n\n7 Januari 2011.\n\nPindaan Jadual"}},{"id":"MY-H812-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Jadual kepada Perintah Menteri-Menteri Kerajaan Persekutuan 2009\n\n[P.U. (A) 222/2009] dipinda―\n\n(a) berkenaan dengan Jabatan Perdana Menteri ―\n\n(i) dengan memasukkan dalam ruang \"Nama\" dan \"Gelaran dan Nama\n\nJawatan\" selepas perkataan \"Tan Sri Dato' Haji Mahiaddin bin Md.\n\nYasin\" dalam ruang \"Nama\" perkataan yang berikut:\n\n\"Senator Dato'\n\nPalanivel a/l\n\nK. Govindasamy\n\nMenteri di Jabatan Perdana\n\nMenteri\";\n\n(ii) dengan memasukkan dalam ruang \"Jabatan\" dan \"Perkara\" selepas\n\nperkataan \"Suruhanjaya Pelantikan Kehakiman\" dalam ruang\n\n\"Jabatan\" perkataan yang berikut:\n\n\"Suruhanjaya Integriti\n\nAgensi\n\nPenguatkuasaan\n\nMelaksanakan fungsi-fungsi\n\ndan menjalankan kuasa-kuasa\n\ndi bawah Akta Suruhanjaya\n\nIntegriti Agensi\n\nPenguatkuasaan 2009\";\n\n(iii) dengan memasukkan dalam ruang \"Jabatan\" dan \"Perkara\" selepas\n\nperkataan \"Amanah Raya Berhad\" dalam ruang \"Jabatan\"\n\nperkataan yang berikut:\n\n\"Kumpulan Industri -\n\nKerajaan Bagi\n\nTeknologi Tinggi\n\nMalaysia (MIGHT)\n\nMeneroka dan menggalakkan\n\npembangunan industri\n\nteknologi tinggi melalui\n\npemanfaatan dan aplikasi\n\nstrategik sains dan teknologi\n\nbagi pembangunan negara dan\n\npemupukan teknologi\n\ntempatan bagi kemajuan\n\nindustri\n\nMembangun, melaksana dan\n\nmenguruskan program\n\nForesight Negara bagi\n\nmengenal pasti bidang\n\nteknologi keutamaan bagi\n\npenyelidikan dan\n\npembangunan dan kemajuan\n\nindustri\n\nMelaksana, mengurus dan\n\nmenyelaras pengauditan\n\nkompetensi industri dan\n\npenilaian prestasi aktiviti\n\npenyelidikan dan\n\npembangunan\n\nMengurus dan mengendalikan\n\n\"Technology Depository\n\nAgency\"\n\nUrus setia bagi Majlis\n\nAeroangkasa Malaysia\n\nUrus setia bagi \"Global Science\n\nand Innovation Advisory\n\nCouncil (GSIAC)\";\n\n(iv) dengan memasukkan dalam ruang \"Jabatan\" dan \"Perkara\" selepas\n\nperkataan \"Teraju Bumiputera Corporation\" dalam ruang\n\n\"Jabatan\" perkataan yang berikut:\n\n\"Perbadanan Kuasa\n\nNuklear Malaysia\n\nMerancang, menerajui dan\n\nmenyelaras pelaksanaan\n\nprogram pembangunan tenaga\n\nnuklear serta memastikan\n\npembangunan infrastruktur\n\nnuklear negara selaras dengan\n\ngaris panduan Agensi Tenaga\n\nAtom Antarabangsa (IAEA)\";\n\n(b) berkenaan dengan Kementerian Sains, Teknologi dan Inovasi dengan\n\nmemotong perkataan \"Kumpulan Industri Kerajaan Bagi Teknologi Tinggi\n\nMalaysia (MIGHT)\" dalam ruang \"Jabatan\" dan semua perkataan yang\n\nterdapat bersetentangan dengannya dalam ruang \"Perkara\".\n\nDibuat 3 Januari 2012\n\n[PM(BK)R. 11456/13 Jld. 50; PN(PU2)18/XXIV]\n\nDengan Titah Perintah\n\n TAN SRI MOHD SIDEK BIN HJ. HASSAN\n\n Setiausaha Jemaah Menteri\n\nMINISTERIAL FUNCTIONS ACT 1969\n\nMINISTERS OF THE FEDERAL GOVERNMENT (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2012\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 2 of the Ministerial Functions Act 1969\n\n[Act 2], the Yang di-Pertuan Agong makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-16"};
  FT["MY-H813"] = {"id":"MY-H813","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 10/2013&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":4,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2013年选举（邮寄投票）（修正）条例","en":"ELECTIONS (POSTAL VOTING) (AMENDMENT) REGULATIONS 2013","orig":"ELECTIONS (POSTAL VOTING) (AMENDMENT) REGULATIONS 2013","ms":"Peraturan Pilihan Raya (Pengundian Melalui Pos) (Pindaan) 2013","vi":"Quy định về Bầu cử (Bỏ phiếu qua bưu điện) (Sửa đổi) năm 2013","th":"ข้อบังคับการเลือกตั้ง (การลงคะแนนทางไปรษณีย์) (การแก้ไข) ค.ศ. 2013","id":"Peraturan Pemilihan Umum (Pemungutan Suara via Pos) (Perubahan) Tahun 2013"},"level":"regulation","category":"01_宪法与基础法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA10","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2013","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 4 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\01_宪法与基础法\\2013_P.U.(A)10-2013_ELECTIONS (POSTAL VOTING) (AMENDMENT) REGULATIONS 2013.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H813-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1.  (1) Peraturan-peraturan ini bolehlah dinamakan Peraturan-Peraturan\nPilihan Raya (Pengundian Pos) (Pindaan) 2013.\n\n(2) Peraturan-Peraturan ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 15 Januari 2013.\n\nPindaan peraturan 3"}},{"id":"MY-H813-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2.  Peraturan-Peraturan Pilihan Raya (Pengundian Pos)  2003 [P.U. (A) 185 /2003],\nyang disebut \"Peraturan -Peraturan ibu\" dalam Peraturan -Peraturan ini, dipinda dalam\nperaturan 3\n\n(a) dalam subperaturan (2), dengan menggantikan perkataan \"dengan\nmenggunakan Borang 1 dalam Jadual\" dengan perkataan \"me ngikut cara\nyang ditentukan oleh Suruhanjaya Pilihan Raya\"; dan\n\n(b) dengan menggantikan subperaturan (3) dan (4) dengan subperaturan\nyang berikut:\n\n  \"(3) Permohonan itu hendaklah dibuat kepada S uruhanjaya\nPilihan Raya  dan masa untuk membuat permohonan itu akan\nditetapkan oleh Suruhanjaya Pilihan Raya melalui pemberitahuan\ndalam Warta.\n\n(4)     Jika sesuatu permohonan diluluskan, Suruhanjaya Pilihan\nRaya hendaklah memberitahu pemohon sedemikian mengikut cara\n\nyang ditentukan oleh Suruhanjaya Pilihan Raya dan hendaklah\nmengeluarkan suatu kertas undi pos kepada pemohon.\"; dan\n\n(c) dengan memasukkan selepas superaturan (4) subperaturan yang berikut:\n\n\"(5)         Jika sesuatu permohonan tidak diluluskan, Suruhanjaya\nPilihan Raya hendaklah memberitahu pemohon sedemikian\nmengikut cara yang ditentukan oleh Suruhanjaya Pilihan Raya dan\nhendaklah menyatakan alasannya untuk tidak meluluskan\npermohonan itu.\".\n\nPindaan peraturan 7"}},{"id":"MY-H813-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Subperaturan 7(1) Peraturan-Peraturan ibu dipinda\n\n(a) dalam teks bahasa kebangsaan, dengan menggantikan perkataan  \"sebelah\nbelakangnya dengan cop rasmi\"  dengan perkataan \"dengan tanda rasmi\";\ndan\n\n(b) dalam teks bahasa Inggeris, dengan memotong perkataan \"its reverse\".\n\nPindaan Jadual"}},{"id":"MY-H813-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4"},"text":{"ms":"4. Jadual kepada Peraturan-Peraturan ibu dipinda dengan memotong Borang 1.\n\nDibuat 2 Januari 2013\n[SPR(R)109; PN(PU2)178E/II]\n\n  Dengan perintah Suruhanjaya Pilihan Raya\n\n     DATUK KAMARUDDIN MOHAMED BARIA\n                Setiausaha\n               Suruhanjaya Pilihan Raya\n\n[Akan dibentangkan dalam Dewan Rakyat menurut seksyen 17 Akta Pilihan Raya 1958]\n\nELECTIONS ACT 1958\n\nELECTIONS (POSTAL VOTING) (AMENDMENT) REGULATIONS 2013\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 16 of the Elections Act 1958  [Act 19], the\nElection Commission, with the approval of the Yang di -Pertuan Agong, makes the\nfollowing regulations:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-16"};
