  FT["MY-H816"] = {"id":"MY-H816","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 10/2016&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2016年国家遗产（宣布在世人物为国家遗产）令","en":"NATIONAL HERITAGE (DECLARATION OF LIVING PERSON AS A NATIONAL HERITAGE) ORDER 2016","orig":"NATIONAL HERITAGE (DECLARATION OF LIVING PERSON AS A NATIONAL HERITAGE) ORDER 2016","ms":"Perintah Warisan Negara (Pengisytiharan Orang Hidup sebagai Warisan Negara) 2016","vi":"Lệnh về Di sản quốc gia (Tuyên bố người đang sống là di sản quốc gia) năm 2016","th":"คำสั่งมรดกแห่งชาติ (การประกาศให้บุคคลที่ยังมีชีวิตเป็นมรดกแห่งชาติ) ค.ศ. 2016","id":"Perintah Warisan Nasional (Pernyataan Orang Hidup sebagai Warisan Nasional) Tahun 2016"},"level":"regulation","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA10","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2016","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\2016_P.U.(A)10-2016_NATIONAL HERITAGE (DECLARATION OF LIVING PERSON AS A NATIONAL HERITAGE) ORDER 2016.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H816-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Warisan Kebangsaan\n\n(Perisytiharan Orang Hidup sebagai Warisan Kebangsaan) 2016.\n\nPerisytiharan Warisan Kebangsaan"}},{"id":"MY-H816-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Orang yang dinamakan dalam ruang (1) Jadual diisytiharkan sebagai\n\nWarisan Kebangsaan dalam bidang yang dinyatakan dalam ruang (2).\n\nJADUAL\n\n(1) (2)\n\nNama Bidang\n\nSaad bin Taib Mek Mulung\n\nRomli bin Mahamud Awang Batil\n\nDato' Md Aripin bin Said Lagu-lagu rakyat\n\nMaznah anak Unyan Penganyaman tradisional Orang Asli\n\nMathew Ngau Jau Muzik Sape\n\nDibuat 27 Disember 2015\n\n[JWN.PP.600/3/51/1/3; PN(PU2)652/XII]\n\nDATO' SERI MOHAMED NAZRI BIN TAN SRI ABDUL AZIZ\n\nMenteri Pelancongan dan Kebudayaan\n\nNATIONAL HERITAGE ACT 2005\n\nNATIONAL HERITAGE (DECLARATION OF LIVING PERSON AS A\n\nNATIONAL HERITAGE) ORDER 2016\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 67(1) of\n\nthe National Heritage Act 2005 [Act 645], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation\n\n1. This order may be cited as the National Heritage\n\n(Declaration of Living Person as a National Heritage) Order 2016.\n\nDeclaration of National Heritage\n\n2. The persons named in column (1) of the Schedule are declared as\n\nNational Heritage in the fields specified in column (2).\n\nSCHEDULE\n\n(1) (2)\n\nNames Fields\n\nSaad bin Taib Mek Mulung\n\nRomli bin Mahamud Awang Batil\n\nDato' Md Aripin bin Said Folk songs\n\nMaznah anak Unyan Aboriginal People traditional weaving\n\nMathew Ngau Jau Sape music\n\nMade 27 December 2015\n\n[JWN.PP.600/3/51/1/3; PN(PU2)652/XII]\n\nDATO' SERI MOHAMED NAZRI BIN TAN SRI ABDUL AZIZ\n\nMinister of Tourism and Culture"}}],"pack":"my-16"};
  FT["MY-H817"] = {"id":"MY-H817","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 10/2017&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2017年国民登记（修正）条例","en":"NATIONAL REGISTRATION (AMENDMENT) REGULATIONS 2017","orig":"NATIONAL REGISTRATION (AMENDMENT) REGULATIONS 2017","ms":"Peraturan Pendaftaran Negara (Pindaan) 2017","vi":"Quy định về Đăng ký quốc gia (Sửa đổi) năm 2017","th":"ข้อบังคับการขึ้นทะเบียนประชาชน (การแก้ไข) ค.ศ. 2017","id":"Peraturan Registrasi Nasional (Perubahan) Tahun 2017"},"level":"regulation","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA10","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2017","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\2017_P.U.(A)10-2017_NATIONAL REGISTRATION (AMENDMENT) REGULATIONS 2017.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H817-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Peraturan-peraturan ini bolehlah dinamakan Peraturan-Peraturan\n\nPendaftaran Negara (Pindaan) 2017.\n\n(2) Peraturan-Peraturan ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 15 Januari 2017.\n\nPindaan peraturan 27"}},{"id":"MY-H817-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Peraturan-Peraturan Pendaftaran Negara 1990 [P.U. (A) 472/1990] dipinda\n\ndalam peraturan 27—\n\n(a) dengan menomborkan semula peraturan yang sedia ada sebagai\n\nsubperaturan (1); dan\n\n(b) dengan memasukkan selepas subperaturan (1) yang dinomborkan\n\nsemula itu subperaturan yang berikut:\n\n\" (2) Walau apa pun peruntukan subperaturan (1),\n\nKetua Pengarah boleh menghendaki mana-mana orang\n\nyang dinyatakan dalam perenggan 1(f) dan (g) mendaftar\n\nmengikut Peraturan-Peraturan ini.\".\n\nDibuat 6 Januari 2017\n\n[KDN. (S):PP03/1278/3 Jld. 3; PN(PU2)223]\n\nDATO' SERI DR. AHMAD ZAHID BIN HAMIDI\n\nMenteri Dalam Negeri\n\nNATIONAL REGISTRATION ACT 1959\n\nNATIONAL REGISTRATION (AMENDMENT) REGULATIONS 2017\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 6 of the\n\nNational Registration Act 1959 [Act 78], the Minister makes the following regulations:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-16"};
  FT["MY-H818"] = {"id":"MY-H818","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 10/2018&status=PINDAAN","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2018年牙科（附表二修正）令","en":"DENTAL (AMENDMENT OF SECOND SCHEDULE) ORDER 2018","orig":"DENTAL (AMENDMENT OF SECOND SCHEDULE) ORDER 2018","ms":"Perintah Pergigian (Pindaan Jadual Kedua) 2018","vi":"Lệnh về Nha khoa (Sửa đổi Phụ lục thứ hai) năm 2018","th":"คำสั่งทันตกรรม (การแก้ไขภาคผนวกที่สอง) ค.ศ. 2018","id":"Perintah Kedokteran Gigi (Perubahan Lampiran Kedua) Tahun 2018"},"level":"regulation","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA10","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2018","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\2018_P.U.(A)10-2018_DENTAL (AMENDMENT OF SECOND SCHEDULE) ORDER 2018.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H818-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Pergigian (Pindaan Jadual\n\nKedua) 2018.\n\nPindaan Jadual Kedua"}},{"id":"MY-H818-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Jadual Kedua kepada Akta Pergigian 1971 dipinda, berhubung dengan negara\n\n\"Malaysia\", dengan memasukkan selepas butiran \"Universiti SEGi\" dan butir-butir\n\nyang berhubungan dengannya butiran dan butir-butir yang berikut:\n\nInstitusi yang\n\nmemberikan kelulusan\n\nPerihal kelulusan\n\n\"Kolej Universiti Lincoln Doctor of Dental Surgery (D.D.S)\n\n(Diiktiraf pada 22 September 2017)\".\n\nDibuat 28 Disember 2017\n\n [KKM-60(20/2)/1/5; PN(PU2)93/VII]\n\nDATUK SERI DR. S. SUBRAMANIAM\n\nMenteri Kesihatan\n\nDENTAL ACT 1971\n\nDENTAL (AMENDMENT OF SECOND SCHEDULE) ORDER 2018\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 12(2) of the Dental Act 1971\n\n[Act 51], the Minister, after consulting the Council, makes the following order:\n\nCitation"}}],"pack":"my-16"};
  FT["MY-H819"] = {"id":"MY-H819","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 10/2019&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2019年危险药品（附表一修正）令","en":"DANGEROUS DRUGS (AMENDMENT OF FIRST SCHEDULE) ORDER 2019","orig":"DANGEROUS DRUGS (AMENDMENT OF FIRST SCHEDULE) ORDER 2019","ms":"Perintah Dadah Berbahaya (Pindaan Jadual Pertama) 2019","vi":"Lệnh về Thuốc nguy hiểm (Sửa đổi Phụ lục thứ nhất) năm 2019","th":"คำสั่งยาเสพติดให้โทษ (การแก้ไขภาคผนวกแรก) ค.ศ. 2019","id":"Perintah Obat Berbahaya (Perubahan Lampiran Pertama) Tahun 2019"},"level":"regulation","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA10","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2019","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en；已清除正文中的 3 个控制字符（C0/C1 区，法律文本中无合法用途，系 PDF 抽取/表单域残留）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\2019_P.U.(A)10-2019_DANGEROUS DRUGS (AMENDMENT OF FIRST SCHEDULE) ORDER 2019.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H819-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Dadah Berbahaya\n\n(Pindaan Jadual Pertama) 2019.\n\nPindaan Jadual Pertama"}},{"id":"MY-H819-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Jadual Pertama kepada Akta Dadah Berbahaya 1952 dipinda dalam\n\nBahagian III—\n\n(a) dengan memasukkan selepas butiran \"Acetylmethadol\" butiran\n\nyang berikut:\n\n\"Acryloylfentanyl\";\n\n(b) dengan memasukkan selepas butiran \"2-amino-1-(2, 5-dimethoxy-4-\n\nmethyl) phenylpropane\" butiran yang berikut:\n\n\"N-[(2S)-1-Amino-3-methyl-1-oxobutan-2yl]-1(cyclohexylmethyl)\n\n-1H-indazole-3-carboxamide (AB-CHMINACA)\n\nN-[(2S)-1-Amino-3-methyl-1-oxobutan-2-yl]-1-pentyl-1Hindazole-3-carboxamide (AB-PINACA)\";\n\n(c) dengan memasukkan selepas butiran \"2-(4-bromo-2,\n\n5-dimethoxyphenyl)-N-(2-methoxybenzyl) ethanamine (25B-NBOMe)\"\n\nbutiran yang berikut:\n\n\"Carfentanil\";\n\n(d) dengan memasukkan selepas butiran \"Flunitrazepam\" butiran yang\n\nberikut:\n\n\"4-Fluoroamphetamine (4-FA)\n\n4-Fluoroisubutyrfentanyl (4-FIBF, pFIBF)\n\nFuranyl fentanyl\";\n\n(e) dengan memasukkan selepas butiran \"3-methylfentanyl\" butiran yang\n\nberikut:\n\n\"Methyl (2S)-2-{[1-(5-fluoropentyl)-1H-indazole-3-carbonyl]\n\namino}-3,3-dimethylbutanoate (5F-ADB/5F-MDMB-PINACA)\";\n\n(f) dengan memasukkan selepas butiran \"Norpipanone\" butiran yang\n\nberikut:\n\n\"Ocfentanil\";\n\n(g) dengan memasukkan selepas butiran \"Paramethoxymethylamphetamine (PMMA)\" butiran yang berikut:\n\n\"(1-Pentyl-1H-indol-3-yl)(2,2,3,3 tetramethylcyclopropyl)\n\nmethanone (UR-144)\";\n\n(h) dengan memasukkan selepas butiran \"Psilocybine,\n\n3-(2-dimethylaminoethyl)-indol-4-yl dihydrogen phosphate\" butiran\n\nyang berikut:\n\n\"Quinolin-8-yl 1-(5-fluoropentyl)-1H-indole-3-carboxylate\n\n(5F-PB-22)\"; dan\n\n(i) dengan memasukkan selepas butiran \"Tetrahydrocannabinols,\n\n1- hydroxy-3-pentyl-6a,7,10, 10a-tetrahydro-6, 6, 9-trimethyl-6-Hdibenzo [b,d] pyran\" butiran yang berikut:\n\n\"Tetrahydrofuranyl fentanyl (THF-F)\".\n\nDibuat 20 Disember 2018\n\n[KKM.R.600-1/1/24;PN(PU2)214/VI]\n\nDATUK SERI DR. DZULKEFLY BIN AHMAD\n\nMenteri Kesihatan\n\nDANGEROUS DRUGS ACT 1952\n\nDANGEROUS DRUGS (AMENDMENT OF FIRST SCHEDULE) ORDER 2019\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 45A of the\n\nDangerous Drugs Act 1952 [Act 234], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation"}}],"pack":"my-16"};
  FT["MY-H820"] = {"id":"MY-H820","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 10/2020&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2020年农药（豁免）令","en":"PESTICIDES (EXEMPTION) ORDER 2020","orig":"PESTICIDES (EXEMPTION) ORDER 2020","ms":"Perintah Racun Makhluk Perosak (Pengecualian) 2020","vi":"Lệnh về Thuốc bảo vệ thực vật (Miễn trừ) năm 2020","th":"คำสั่งสารกำจัดศัตรูพืช (การยกเว้น) ค.ศ. 2020","id":"Perintah Pestisida (Pembebasan) Tahun 2020"},"level":"regulation","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA10","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2020","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\2020_P.U.(A)10-2020_PESTICIDES (EXEMPTION) ORDER 2020.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H820-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Racun Makhluk Perosak\n\n(Pengecualian) 2020.\n\n(2) Perintah ini berkuat kuasa bagi tempoh mulai 15 Januari 2020\n\nhingga 15 Januari 2025.\n\nPengecualian"}},{"id":"MY-H820-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Menteri mengecualikan mana-mana orang yang menggunakan racun makhluk\n\nperosak daripada kehendak untuk menggunakan mengikut penggunaan, sebagaimana\n\nyang diluluskan oleh Lembaga di bawah perenggan 53A(1)(b) Akta, yang dinyatakan pada\n\nlabel, tertakluk kepada syarat yang berikut:\n\n(a) penggunaan racun makhluk perosak hendaklah terhad kepada pengawalan\n\nKumbang Merah Palma (Rhynchophorus ferrugineus dan Rhynchophorus\n\nvulneratus) yang merupakan perosak yang terdapat pada tanaman kelapa,\n\npalma hiasan dan jenis tanaman palma yang lain; dan\n\n(b) penggunaan racun makhluk perosak hendaklah terhad kepada racun\n\nmakhluk perosak yang mengandungi perawis aktif mengikut perumusan\n\nsebagaimana yang dinyatakan dalam Jadual.\n\nJADUAL\n\n(1)\n\nBil.\n\n(2)\n\nPerawis Aktif\n\n(3)\n\nPerumusan\n\n1. cypermethrin pekatan teremulsi (EC))\n\n2. cypermethrin emulsi, minyak dalam air (EW)\n\n3. carbofuran butir (GR)\n\n4. imidacloprid pekatan larut air (SL) atau pekatan ampaian\n\n(SC)\n\n5. lambda-cyhalothrin pekatan teremulsi (EC)\n\n6. chlorpyrifos pekatan teremulsi (EC)\n\n7. beta-cyfluthrin pekatan teremulsi (EC)\n\n8. dinotefuran serbuk bancuh (WP)\n\n9. thiamethoxam pekatan ampaian (SC)\n\nDATUK SERI SALAHUDDIN BIN AYUB\n\nMenteri Pertanian dan Industri Asas Tani\n\nDibuat 6 Januari 2020\n\n[KP/LA/483/11 Jld. 10; PN(PU2)275/XXII]\n\nPESTICIDES ACT 1974\n\nPESTICIDES (EXEMPTION) ORDER 2020\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 59 of the\n\nPesticides Act 1974 [Act 149], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement\n\n1. (1) This order may be cited as the Pesticides (Exemption) Order 2020.\n\n(2) This Order has effect for the period from 15 January 2020\n\nto 15 January 2025.\n\nExemption\n\n2. The Minister exempts any person who uses pesticides from the requirement to\n\nuse in accordance with the uses, as approved by the Board under paragraph 53A(1)(b) of\n\nthe Act, stipulated on the label, subject to the following conditions:\n\n(a) the use of pesticides shall be limited to the control of Red Palm Weevils\n\n(Rhynchophorus ferrugineus and Rhynchophorus vulneratus) which are\n\npests found on coconut plant, ornamental palm and other types of palm\n\nplants; and\n\n(b) the use of pesticides shall be limited to pesticides which contain active\n\ningredients according to the formulation, as specified in the Schedule.\n\nSCHEDULE\n\n(1)\n\nNo.\n\n(2)\n\nActive ingredient\n\n(3)\n\nFormulation\n\n1. cypermethrin emulsifiable concentrate (EC)\n\n2. cypermethrin emulsion, oil in water (EW)\n\n3. carbofuran granule (GR)\n\n4. imidacloprid soluble liquid (SL) or suspension\n\nconcentrate (SC)\n\n5. lambda-cyhalothrin emulsifiable concentrate (EC)\n\n6. chlorpyrifos emulsifiable concentrate (EC)\n\n7. beta-cyfluthrin emulsifiable concentrate (EC)\n\n8. dinotefuran wettable powder (WP)\n\n9. thiamethoxam suspension concentrate (SC)\n\n DATUK SERI SALAHUDDIN BIN AYUB\n\n Minister of Agriculture and Agro-based Industry\n\nMade 6 January 2020\n\n[KP/LA/483/11 Jld. 10; PN(PU2)275/XXII]"}}],"pack":"my-16"};
  FT["MY-H821"] = {"id":"MY-H821","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 10/2021&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":16,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2021年传染病预防与控制（疫区地方措施）（复苏式行动管制）条例","en":"PREVENTION AND CONTROL OF INFECTIOUS DISEASES (MEASURES WITHIN INFECTED LOCAL AREAS) (RECOVERY MOVEMENT CONTROL) REGULATIONS 2021","orig":"PREVENTION AND CONTROL OF INFECTIOUS DISEASES (MEASURES WITHIN INFECTED LOCAL AREAS) (RECOVERY MOVEMENT CONTROL) REGULATIONS 2021","ms":"Peraturan Pencegahan dan Kawalan Penyakit Berjangkit (Langkah dalam Kawasan Tempatan Berjangkit) (Kawalan Pergerakan Pemulihan) 2021","vi":"Quy định về Phòng chống bệnh truyền nhiễm (Các biện pháp trong khu vực bị nhiễm bệnh) (Kiểm soát di chuyển phục hồi) năm 2021","th":"ข้อบังคับการป้องกันและควบคุมโรคติดต่อ (มาตรการในท้องที่ที่ติดเชื้อ) (การควบคุมการเคลื่อนย้ายระยะฟื้นฟู) ค.ศ. 2021","id":"Peraturan Pencegahan dan Pengendalian Penyakit Menular (Tindakan di Wilayah Lokal Terinfeksi) (Pengendalian Pergerakan Pemulihan) Tahun 2021"},"level":"regulation","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA10","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2021","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 16 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\2021_P.U.(A)10-2021_PREVENTION AND CONTROL OF INFECTIOUS DISEASES (MEASURES WITHIN INFECTED LOCAL AREAS) (RECOVERY.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H821-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Peraturan-peraturan ini bolehlah dinamakan Peraturan-Peraturan\n\nPencegahan dan Pengawalan Penyakit Berjangkit (Langkah-Langkah di dalam\n\nKawasan Tempatan Jangkitan) (Kawalan Pergerakan Pemulihan) 2021.\n\n(2) Peraturan-Peraturan ini berkuat kuasa bagi tempoh mulai 13 Januari 2021\n\nhingga 31 Mac 2021.\n\nPemakaian"}},{"id":"MY-H821-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Peraturan-Peraturan ini hendaklah terpakai bagi Negeri Perlis dan Sarawak.\n\nAktiviti terlarang"}},{"id":"MY-H821-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Tiada seorang pun boleh melakukan, menganjurkan, mengusahakan atau\n\nselainnya terlibat dalam, mana-mana aktiviti terlarang yang dinyatakan dalam Jadual.\n\nPergerakan ke kawasan tempatan jangkitan lain"}},{"id":"MY-H821-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4"},"text":{"ms":"4. Mana-mana orang boleh bergerak ke kawasan tempatan jangkitan yang lain\n\ntertakluk kepada arahan Ketua Pengarah.\n\nLarangan pergerakan ke tempat yang tertakluk kepada perintah kawalan\n\npergerakan diperketat"}},{"id":"MY-H821-A5","no":5,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 5"},"text":{"ms":"5. (1) Tiada seorang pun boleh masuk ke dalam atau keluar dari suatu tempat\n\nyang tertakluk kepada suatu perintah kawalan pergerakan diperketat kecuali\n\nmana-mana orang yang memberikan perkhidmatan jagaan kesihatan dan perubatan atau\n\nyang diberikan kebenaran oleh pegawai diberi kuasa.\n\n(2) Bagi maksud subperaturan (1), \"perintah kawalan pergerakan diperketat\"\n\nmerujuk kepada arahan yang diberikan oleh pegawai diberi kuasa di bawah\n\nsubseksyen 11(3) Akta.\n\nPergerakan bagi maksud peperiksaan"}},{"id":"MY-H821-A6","no":6,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 6"},"text":{"ms":"6. (1) Mana-mana orang yang dikehendaki untuk menduduki apa-apa\n\npeperiksaan yang ditentukan oleh pihak berkuasa yang berkenaan di mana-mana\n\ninstitusi pembelajaran dibenarkan untuk bergerak dari satu kawasan tempatan jangkitan\n\nke kawasan tempatan jangkitan yang lain bagi maksud persediaan dan menduduki\n\npeperiksaan itu di institusi pembelajaran itu.\n\n(2) Mana-mana orang yang dikehendaki untuk menduduki apa-apa\n\npeperiksaan yang ditentukan oleh mana-mana badan profesional di mana-mana tempat\n\nyang ditentukan oleh badan profesional itu dibenarkan untuk bergerak dari satu\n\nkawasan tempatan jangkitan ke kawasan tempatan jangkitan yang lain bagi maksud\n\npersediaan dan menduduki peperiksaan itu.\n\n(3) Mana-mana orang yang terlibat dalam mengajar bagi persediaan\n\npeperiksaan atau dalam penjalanan apa-apa peperiksaan yang disebut di bawah\n\nsubperaturan (1) dan (2) dibenarkan untuk bergerak dari satu kawasan tempatan\n\njangkitan ke kawasan tempatan jangkitan yang lain bagi maksud mengajar bagi\n\npersediaan peperiksaan dan penjalanan peperiksaan itu.\n\n(4) Mana-mana orang yang bergerak dari satu kawasan tempatan jangkitan ke\n\nkawasan tempatan jangkitan yang lain bagi maksud yang disebut di bawah\n\nsubperaturan (1), (2) dan (3)—\n\n(a) hendaklah memberikan bukti yang perlu sebagaimana yang\n\ndikehendaki oleh seseorang pegawai diberi kuasa; dan\n\n(b) boleh disertai oleh seorang ibu, bapa atau penjaga.\n\nPergerakan ke institusi pembelajaran"}},{"id":"MY-H821-A7","no":7,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 7"},"text":{"ms":"7. (1) Seseorang boleh bergerak dari satu kawasan tempatan jangkitan ke\n\nkawasan tempatan jangkitan yang lain bagi maksud untuk menghadiri pembelajaran\n\ndi mana-mana institusi pembelajaran atau untuk melaksanakan apa-apa tugas\n\ndi mana-mana institusi pembelajaran.\n\n(2) Jika seseorang yang disebut di bawah subperaturan (1) bergerak dari\n\nsatu kawasan tempatan jangkitan ke kawasan tempatan jangkitan yang lain, orang itu\n\nhendaklah memberikan bukti jika dikehendaki oleh seseorang pegawai diberi kuasa.\n\nLarangan berarak"}},{"id":"MY-H821-A8","no":8,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 8"},"text":{"ms":"8. Tiada seorang pun boleh dengan apa-apa cara menyertai atau terlibat\n\ndalam apa-apa perarakan.\n\nKawalan berhimpun"}},{"id":"MY-H821-A9","no":9,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 9"},"text":{"ms":"9. Seseorang boleh berhimpun atau terlibat dalam suatu perhimpunan termasuk\n\nberkumpul untuk bersembahyang di mana-mana tempat ibadat agama orang itu\n\ntertakluk kepada apa-apa arahan Ketua Pengarah yang dikeluarkan di bawah\n\nperaturan 14.\n\nPengangkutan awam"}},{"id":"MY-H821-A10","no":10,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 10"},"text":{"ms":"10. Walau apa pun jumlah kapasiti maksimum bilangan penumpang yang boleh\n\ndibawa di dalam mana-mana pengangkutan awam darat, laut atau udara,\n\nseseorang pemegang lesen atau permit mana-mana pengangkutan awam darat, laut atau\n\nudara untuk membawa penumpang hendaklah memastikan pengangkutan awam yang\n\nberhubungan dengan lesen atau permitnya membawa bilangan penumpang mengikut\n\narahan Ketua Pengarah yang dikeluarkan di bawah peraturan 14.\n\nKehendak untuk menjalani pemeriksaan kesihatan apabila tiba di Malaysia"}},{"id":"MY-H821-A11","no":11,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 11"},"text":{"ms":"11. (1) Pegawai diberi kuasa boleh mengarahkan mana-mana warganegara,\n\npemastautin tetap Malaysia, ekspatriat atau kor diplomatik, atau mana-mana\n\norang asing lain yang dibenarkan oleh Ketua Pengarah Imigresen, yang memasuki\n\nMalaysia dari luar negara untuk menjalani pemeriksaan kesihatan apabila tiba\n\ndi Malaysia di mana-mana pintu masuk sebelum mendapatkan pelepasan imigresen,\n\natau di mana-mana tempat lain yang ditentukan oleh Ketua Pengarah.\n\n(2) Mana-mana orang yang disebut dalam subperaturan (1) hendaklah\n\nmematuhi apa-apa arahan yang dikeluarkan oleh seseorang pegawai diberi kuasa.\n\n(3) Jika mana-mana orang yang disebut dalam subperaturan (1) diarahkan\n\noleh pegawai diberi kuasa untuk menjalani kuarantin di mana-mana tempat, orang itu\n\nhendaklah memakai gelang tangan yang disediakan oleh pegawai diberi kuasa itu.\n\nKehendak bagi majikan untuk menyebabkan pekerja asingnya menjalani ujian\n\npengesanan Penyakit Koronavirus 2019 (COVID-19)"}},{"id":"MY-H821-A12","no":12,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 12"},"text":{"ms":"12. (1) Bagi maksud untuk mencegah dan mengawal merebaknya\n\nPenyakit Koronavirus 2019 (COVID-19) di tempat kerja, seseorang pegawai diberi kuasa\n\nboleh mengarahkan mana-mana majikan yang mengambil kerja seseorang\n\npekerja asing supaya menyebabkan pekerja asing itu menjalani ujian pengesanan\n\nPenyakit Koronavirus 2019 (COVID-19), dan majikan itu hendaklah menanggung fi,\n\nkos atau caj bagi ujian itu.\n\n(2) Bagi maksud peraturan ini, \"pekerja asing\" ertinya pemegang Pas Lawatan\n\n(Kerja Sementara) yang dikeluarkan di bawah peraturan 11\n\nPeraturan-Peraturan Imigresen 1963 [F.L.N. 228/1963].\n\nPermintaan maklumat"}},{"id":"MY-H821-A13","no":13,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 13"},"text":{"ms":"13. Seseorang pegawai diberi kuasa boleh meminta apa-apa maklumat yang\n\nberhubungan dengan pencegahan dan pengawalan penyakit berjangkit daripada\n\nmana-mana orang atau kumpulan orang.\n\nArahan Ketua Pengarah"}},{"id":"MY-H821-A14","no":14,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 14"},"text":{"ms":"14. Ketua Pengarah boleh mengeluarkan apa-apa arahan mengikut apa-apa cara,\n\nsama ada secara am atau khusus, kepada mana-mana orang atau kumpulan orang supaya\n\nmengambil apa-apa langkah bagi maksud mencegah dan mengawal apa-apa\n\npenyakit berjangkit termasuk apa-apa arahan kepada mana-mana orang atau\n\nkumpulan orang yang melakukan, menganjurkan, mengusahakan, atau yang selainnya\n\nterlibat dalam, apa-apa aktiviti selain aktiviti terlarang yang dinyatakan dalam Jadual.\n\nKesalahan"}},{"id":"MY-H821-A15","no":15,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 15"},"text":{"ms":"15. (1) Mana-mana orang yang melanggar mana-mana peruntukan\n\nPeraturan-Peraturan ini atau mana-mana arahan Ketua Pengarah atau\n\nseseorang pegawai diberi kuasa melakukan suatu kesalahan dan boleh,\n\napabila disabitkan, didenda tidak melebihi satu ribu ringgit atau dipenjarakan\n\nselama tempoh tidak melebihi enam bulan atau kedua-duanya.\n\n(2) Jika mana-mana orang yang melakukan suatu kesalahan di bawah\n\nPeraturan-Peraturan ini ialah suatu syarikat, perkongsian liabiliti terhad, firma,\n\npertubuhan atau kumpulan orang yang lain, seseorang yang pada masa\n\npelakuan kesalahan itu ialah seorang pengarah, pegawai pematuhan, pekongsi,\n\npengurus, setiausaha atau pegawai lain yang seumpamanya bagi syarikat,\n\nperkongsian liabiliti terhad, firma, pertubuhan atau kumpulan orang yang lain itu\n\natau yang berupa sebagai bertindak atas sifat itu atau yang dengan apa-apa cara\n\natau sehingga apa-apa takat bertanggungjawab bagi pengurusan apa-apa\n\nhal ehwal syarikat, perkongsian liabiliti terhad, firma, pertubuhan atau kumpulan orang\n\nyang lain itu atau membantu dalam pengurusannya—\n\n(a) boleh dipertuduh secara berasingan atau bersesama dalam\n\nprosiding yang sama bersekali dengan syarikat,\n\nperkongsian liabiliti terhad, firma, pertubuhan atau\n\nkumpulan orang yang lain itu; dan\n\n(b) jika syarikat, perkongsian liabiliti terhad, firma, pertubuhan atau\n\nkumpulan orang yang lain itu didapati bersalah atas kesalahan itu,\n\nhendaklah disifatkan bersalah atas kesalahan itu dan boleh\n\ndikenakan hukuman atau penalti yang sama sebagaimana seorang\n\nindividu melainkan jika, dengan mengambil kira jenis fungsinya\n\natas sifat itu dan segala hal keadaan, dia membuktikan—\n\n(i) bahawa kesalahan itu telah dilakukan\n\ntanpa pengetahuannya; dan\n\n(ii) bahawa kesalahan itu telah dilakukan tanpa persetujuan\n\natau pembiarannya dan bahawa dia telah mengambil\n\nsegala langkah yang munasabah dan menjalankan\n\nusaha yang wajar untuk menghalang pelakuan kesalahan itu.\n\nPembatalan dan kecualian"}},{"id":"MY-H821-A16","no":16,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 16"},"text":{"ms":"16. (1) Peraturan-Peraturan Pencegahan dan Pengawalan Penyakit Berjangkit\n\n(Langkah-Langkah di dalam Kawasan Tempatan Jangkitan) (No. 9) 2020\n\n[P.U. (A) 400/2020] dibatalkan.\n\n(2) Apa-apa arahan Ketua Pengarah yang dikeluarkan atau disifatkan telah\n\ndikeluarkan di bawah Peraturan-Peraturan Pencegahan dan Pengawalan\n\nPenyakit Berjangkit (Langkah-Langkah di dalam Kawasan Tempatan Jangkitan)\n\n(No. 9) 2020 hendaklah disifatkan telah dibuat di bawah Peraturan-Peraturan ini dan\n\nhendaklah terus kekal berkuat kuasa melainkan jika dibatalkan oleh Ketua Pengarah.\n\nJADUAL\n\nAKTIVITI TERLARANG\n\n[Peraturan 3]\n\n1. Aktiviti pelancongan ke luar negeri oleh warganegara dan aktiviti pelancongan\n\ndalam negeri yang melibatkan pelancong asing memasuki Malaysia kecuali\n\npelancong asing daripada negara sebagaimana yang dinyatakan oleh Menteri\n\n2. Aktiviti di dalam pub dan kelab malam, kecuali perniagaan restoran di dalam\n\npub dan kelab malam\n\n3. Apa-apa aktiviti dengan kehadiran yang ramai di suatu tempat sehingga\n\nmenyukarkan untuk melaksanakan penjarakan sosial dan pematuhan kepada\n\narahan Ketua Pengarah\n\nDibuat 12 Januari 2021\n\n[KKM.600-29/4/146 Jld.2 (30); PN(PU2)470/IV]\n\n DATO' SRI DR. ADHAM BIN BABA\n\n Menteri Kesihatan\n\nPREVENTION AND CONTROL OF INFECTIOUS DISEASES ACT 1988\n\nPREVENTION AND CONTROL OF INFECTIOUS DISEASES\n\n(MEASURES WITHIN INFECTED LOCAL AREAS)\n\n(RECOVERY MOVEMENT CONTROL) REGULATIONS 2021\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 11(2) of the\n\nPrevention and Control of Infectious Diseases Act 1988 [Act 342], the Minister makes\n\nthe following regulations:\n\nCitation and commencement\n\n1. (1) These regulations may be cited as the Prevention and Control of\n\nInfectious Diseases (Measures within Infected Local Areas) (Recovery Movement\n\nControl) Regulations 2021.\n\n(2) These Regulations have effect for the period from 13 January 2021\n\nto 31 March 2021.\n\nApplication\n\n2. These Regulations shall apply to the States of Perlis and Sarawak.\n\nProhibited activity\n\n3. No person shall carry out, organize, undertake or otherwise be involved in,\n\nany prohibited activity as specified in the Schedule.\n\nMovement to another infected local area\n\n4. Any person may move to another infected local area subject to directions of the\n\nDirector General.\n\nProhibition on movement to place that is subject to enhanced movement\n\ncontrol order\n\n5. (1) No person shall enter into or exit from a place that is subject\n\nto an enhanced movement control order except any person who is providing healthcare\n\nand medical services or is given permission by an authorized officer.\n\n(2) For the purposes of subregulation (1), \"enhanced movement control order\"\n\nrefers to directions given by an authorized officer under subsection 11(3) of the Act.\n\nMovement for purpose of examination\n\n6. (1) Any person who is required to sit for any examination determined by the\n\nrelevant authority at any learning institution is allowed to move from one infected local\n\narea to another infected local area for the purpose of preparing and sitting for the\n\nexamination at the learning institution.\n\n(2) Any person who is required to sit for any examination determined by any\n\nprofessional body at any place determined by such professional body is allowed to move\n\nfrom one infected local area to another infected local area for the purpose of preparing\n\nand sitting for the examination.\n\n(3) Any person who is involved in providing lessons for the preparation of\n\nexamination or in the conduct of any examination mentioned under subregulations (1)\n\nand (2) is allowed to move from one infected local area to another infected local area for\n\nthe purpose of providing lessons for the preparation of the examination and conducting\n\nthe examination.\n\n(4) Any person who moves from one infected local area to another infected\n\nlocal area for the purpose mentioned under subregulations (1), (2) and (3)—\n\n(a) shall provide the necessary proof as requested by an authorized\n\nofficer; and\n\n(b) may be accompanied by a mother, father or guardian.\n\nMovement to learning institution\n\n7. (1) A person may move from one infected local area to another infected local\n\narea for the purpose of attending learning at any learning institution or performing\n\nany duty at any learning institution.\n\n(2) If a person mentioned under subregulation (1) moves from one infected\n\nlocal area to another infected local area, he shall provide the necessary proof as requested\n\nby an authorized officer.\n\nProhibition on procession\n\n8. No person shall in any way participate or be involved in any procession.\n\nControl of gathering\n\n9. A person may gather or be involved in a gathering including congregate\n\nto perform prayers at any place of worship of his religion subject to such directions\n\nof the Director General issued under regulation 14.\n\nPublic transport\n\n10. Notwithstanding the total maximum capacity of the number of passengers that\n\nmay be carried on board any land, sea or air public transport, a holder of any land, sea or\n\nair public transport licence or permit to carry passengers shall ensure that the\n\npublic transport relating to his licence or permit carries such number of passengers\n\naccording to the directions of the Director General issued under regulation 14.\n\nRequirement to undergo health examination upon arrival in Malaysia\n\n11. (1) An authorized officer may direct any citizen, permanent resident\n\nof Malaysia, expatriate or diplomatic corps, or any other foreigner permitted by the\n\nDirector General of Immigration, entering Malaysia from overseas to undergo health\n\nexamination upon arrival in Malaysia at any point of entry before proceeding for\n\nimmigration clearance, or at any other place determined by the Director General.\n\n(2) Any person referred to in subregulation (1) shall comply with any\n\ndirections issued by an authorized officer.\n\n(3) Where any person referred to in subregulation (1) is directed by the\n\nauthorized officer to undergo quarantine at any place, the person shall wear\n\na wristband provided by the authorized officer.\n\nRequirement for employer to cause his foreign employee to undergo Coronavirus\n\nDisease 2019 (COVID-19) detection test\n\n12. (1) For the purpose of preventing and controlling the spread of the\n\nCoronavirus Disease 2019 (COVID-19) at work place, an authorized officer may direct\n\nany employer who employs a foreign employee to cause the foreign employee to undergo\n\nCoronavirus Disease 2019 (COVID-19) detection test, and the employer shall pay the fee,\n\ncost or charges for the test.\n\n(2) For the purposes of this regulation, \"foreign employee\" means a holder of\n\na Visit Pass (Temporary Employment) issued under regulation 11 of the Immigration\n\nRegulations 1963 [F.L.N. 228/1963].\n\nRequest for information\n\n13. An authorized officer may request for any information relating to the\n\nprevention and control of infectious disease from any person or body of persons.\n\nDirections of Director General\n\n14. The Director General may issue any directions in any manner, whether generally\n\nor specifically, to any person or group of persons to take such measures for the\n\npurpose of preventing and controlling any infectious disease including any directions\n\nto any person or group of persons carrying out, organizing, undertaking, or who is\n\notherwise involved in, any activity other than a prohibited activity as specified\n\nin the Schedule.\n\nOffence\n\n15. (1) Any person who contravenes any provision of these Regulations or\n\nany directions of the Director General or an authorized officer commits an offence and\n\nshall, on conviction, be liable to a fine not exceeding one thousand ringgit or\n\nto imprisonment for a term not exceeding six months or to both.\n\n(2) Where any person who commits an offence under these Regulations\n\nis a company, limited liability partnership, firm, society or other body of persons,\n\na person who at the time of the commission of the offence was a director,\n\ncompliance officer, partner, manager, secretary or other similar officer of the company,\n\nlimited liability partnership, firm, society or other body of persons or was purporting\n\nto act in the capacity or was in any manner or to any extent responsible for the\n\nmanagement of any of the affairs of the company, limited liability partnership, firm,\n\nsociety or other body of persons or was assisting in its management—\n\n(a) may be charged severally or jointly in the same proceedings with\n\nthe company, limited liability partnership, firm, society or\n\nother body of persons; and\n\n(b) if the company, limited liability partnership, firm, society or\n\nother body of persons is found guilty of the offence, shall be deemed\n\nto be guilty of that offence and shall be liable to the same\n\npunishment or penalty as an individual unless, having regard\n\nto the nature of his functions in that capacity and to all\n\ncircumstances, he proves—\n\n(i) that the offence was committed without his knowledge; and\n\n(ii) that the offence was committed without his consent or\n\nconnivance and that he had taken all reasonable precautions\n\nand exercised due diligence to prevent the commission\n\nof the offence.\n\nRevocation and savings\n\n16. (1) The Prevention and Control of Infectious Diseases (Measures within\n\nInfected Local Areas) (No. 9) Regulations 2020 [P. U. (A) 400/2020] are revoked.\n\n(2) Any directions of the Director General issued or deemed to have been\n\nissued under the Prevention and Control of Infectious Diseases (Measures within Infected\n\nLocal Areas) (No. 9) Regulations 2020 shall be deemed to have been made under these\n\nRegulations and shall continue to remain in force unless revoked by the Director General.\n\nSCHEDULE\n\nPROHIBITED ACTIVITY\n\n[Regulation 3]\n\n1. Outbound tour activities by a citizen and inbound tour activities involving\n\nforeign tourists entering Malaysia except foreign tourists from countries\n\nas specified by the Minister\n\n2. Activities in pubs and night clubs, except restaurant business\n\nin pubs and night clubs\n\n3. Any activity with many people in attendance at a place making it difficult\n\nto carry out social distancing and to comply with the directions of the\n\nDirector General\n\nMade 12 January 2021\n\n[KKM.600-29/4/146 Jld.2 (30); PN(PU2)470/IV]\n\nDATO' SRI DR. ADHAM BIN BABA\n\nMinister of Health"}}],"pack":"my-16"};
  FT["MY-H822"] = {"id":"MY-H822","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 10/2022&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":5,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2022年价格管制与反暴利（最高价格核定）令","en":"PRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING (DETERMINATION OF MAXIMUM PRICE) ORDER 2022","orig":"PRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING (DETERMINATION OF MAXIMUM PRICE) ORDER 2022","ms":"Perintah Kawalan Harga dan Anti-Pencatutan (Penetapan Harga Maksimum) 2022","vi":"Lệnh về Kiểm soát giá và chống trục lợi (Xác định giá tối đa) năm 2022","th":"คำสั่งการควบคุมราคาและการต่อต้านการฉวยโอกาส (การกำหนดราคาสูงสุด) ค.ศ. 2022","id":"Perintah Pengendalian Harga dan Anti-Pencatutan (Penetapan Harga Maksimum) Tahun 2022"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA10","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2022","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 5 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2022_P.U.(A)10-2022_PRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING (DETERMINATION OF MAXIMUM PRICE) ORDER 2022.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H822-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Kawalan Harga dan\nAntipencatutan (Penentuan Harga Maksimum) 2022.\n\n(2)    Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 15 Januari 2022.\n\nTafsiran"}},{"id":"MY-H822-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Dalam Perintah ini, \"Vaksin COVID-19\" ertinya suatu vaksin yang—\n\n(a) disuntik ke dalam badan manusia yang digunakan untuk merangsang\nsistem imun badan  manusia supaya bertindak balas meli ndungi\nbadan manusia  daripada jangkitan Penyakit Koronavirus 2019\n(COVID-19); dan\n\n(b) didaftarkan dengan Pihak Berkuasa Kawalan Dadah menggunakan\nnombor pendaftaran yang ditetapkan oleh pihak berkuasa itu.\n\nHarga borong maksimum"}},{"id":"MY-H822-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Harga borong maksimum  bagi Vaksin COVID -19 yang dinyatakan dalam\nruang (1) Jadual ditentukan sebagaimana yang dinyatakan dalam ruang (2).\n\nHarga runcit maksimum"}},{"id":"MY-H822-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4"},"text":{"ms":"4. Harga runcit maksimum bagi Vaksin COVID -19 yang dinyatakan dalam\nruang (1) Jadual ditentukan sebagaimana yang dinyatakan dalam ruang ( 3) dan\n\nharga runcit maksimum itu tidak termasuk apa -apa caj perkhidmatan atau caj barangan\npakai buang yang digunakan bagi maksud suntikan Vaksin COVID-19 itu.\n\nSenarai harga jualan Vaksin COVID-19"}},{"id":"MY-H822-A5","no":5,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 5"},"text":{"ms":"5. (1) Menurut seksyen 9 Akta, m ana-mana pemegang lesen bagi kemudahan\njagaan kesihatan swasta atau pemilik farmasi yang kemudahan jagaan kesihatan swasta\natau farmasinya menjual atau menawarkan untuk menjual V aksin COVID-19 hendaklah\nmempamerkan senarai harga jualan Vaksin COVID-19 itu—\n\n(a) dalam bentuk fizikal atau media elektronik di kemudahan jagaan\nkesihatan swasta atau farmasi, masing-masing; dan\n\n(b) dalam kedudukan yang mudah dilihat yang senang dibaca oleh\nmana-mana orang yang ingin membeli vaksin itu.\n\n(2) Bagi maksud  perenggan ini, \"kemudahan jagaan kesihatan swasta\"\nmempunyai erti yang diberikan kepadanya  di bawah seksyen 2 Akta Kemudahan dan\nPerkhidmatan Jagaan Kesihatan Swasta 1998 [Akta 586].\n\nPRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING ACT 2011\n\nPRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING\n(DETERMINATION OF MAXIMUM PRICE) ORDER 2022\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 4 of the Price Control and\nAnti-Profiteering Act 2011 [ Act 723], the Controller, with the approval of the Minister,\nmakes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement\n\nJADUAL/SCHEDULE\n\n[Perenggan 3 dan 4/Paragraphs 3 and 4]\n\nHARGA BORONG MAKSIMUM DAN RUNCIT MAKSIMUM VAKSIN COVID-19/\nMAXIMUM WHOLESALE AND MAXIMUM RETAIL PRICE FOR COVID-19 VACCINE\n\nBil./\nNo.\n(1)\nBarangan/Goods\nHarga Maksimum per dos/\nMaximum Price per dose (RM)\n(2)\nBorong/\nWholesale\n(3)\nRuncit/Retail\n1.  CoronaVac Suspension for Injection\nSARS-CoV-2 Vaccine (Vero Cell),\nInactivated\n\n(No. Pendaftaran/Registration Number:\nMAL21036010ARZ/MAL21046125ACSZ)\n\n62.00 77.00\n2.  COVILO Suspension for Injection\nCOVID-19 Vaccine (Vero Cell), Inactivated\n\n(No. Pendaftaran/ Registration Number :\nMAL21076098AZ)\n\n49.00 61.00\n\nDibuat 12 Januari 2022\nMade 12 January 2022\n[KPDNKK(R)100-9/2/5 JLD9(5); PN(PU2)695/Jld. 30]\n\nDATUK SERI HAJI HASNOL ZAM ZAM BIN HAJI AHMAD\nPengawal Harga/Price Controller\n\nDiluluskan 12 Januari 2022\nApproved 12 January 2022\n[KPDNKK(R)100-9/2/5 JLD9(5); PN(PU2)695/Jld. 30]\n\nDATO SRI ALEXANDER NANTA LINGGI\nMenteri Perdagangan Dalam Negeri dan Hal Ehwal Pengguna/\nMinister of Domestic Trade and Consumer Affairs"}}],"pack":"my-16"};
  FT["MY-H823"] = {"id":"MY-H823","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 10/2023&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":4,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2023年价格管制与反暴利（最高价格核定）（第2号）令","en":"PRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING (DETERMINATION OF MAXIMUM PRICE) (NO. 2) ORDER 2023","orig":"PRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING (DETERMINATION OF MAXIMUM PRICE) (NO. 2) ORDER 2023","ms":"Perintah Kawalan Harga dan Anti-Pencatutan (Penetapan Harga Maksimum) (Bilangan 2) 2023","vi":"Lệnh về Kiểm soát giá và chống trục lợi (Xác định giá tối đa) (số 2) năm 2023","th":"คำสั่งการควบคุมราคาและการต่อต้านการฉวยโอกาส (การกำหนดราคาสูงสุด) (ฉบับที่ 2) ค.ศ. 2023","id":"Perintah Pengendalian Harga dan Anti-Pencatutan (Penetapan Harga Maksimum) (Nomor 2) Tahun 2023"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA10","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2023","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 4 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2023_P.U.(A)10-2023_PRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING (DETERMINATION OF MAXIMUM PRICE) (NO. 2) ORDER 2023.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H823-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Kawalan Harga dan\nAntipencatutan (Penentuan Harga Maksimum) (No. 2) 2023.\n\n (2)  Perintah    ini    berkuat    kuasa    bagi    tempoh   mulai   15   Januari   2023\nhingga 29 Januari 2023.\n\nHarga pengeluar maksimum"}},{"id":"MY-H823-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Harga pengeluar maksimum bagi barangan harga terkawal yang dinyatakan\ndalam ruang (1) J adual Pertama bagi Negeri -Negeri di Semenanjung Malaysia,\nNegeri Sarawak, Negeri Sabah dan Wilayah Persekutuan Labuan ditentukan mengikut\nkawasan dan daerah sebagaimana yang dinyatakan dalam ruang (2).\n\nHarga borong maksimum"}},{"id":"MY-H823-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Harga borong maksimum bagi barangan harga terkawal yang dinyatakan dalam\nruang (1) Jadual Kedua bagi Negeri -Negeri di Semenanjung Malaysia, Negeri Sarawak,\nNegeri Sabah dan Wilayah Persekutuan Labuan ditentukan mengikut kawasan dan\ndaerah sebagaimana yang dinyatakan dalam ruang (2).\n\nHarga runcit maksimum"}},{"id":"MY-H823-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4"},"text":{"ms":"4. Harga runcit maksimum bagi barangan harga terkawal yang dinyatakan dalam\nruang (1) Jadual Ketiga bagi Negeri -Negeri di Semenanjung Malaysia, Negeri Sarawak,\nNegeri Sabah dan Wilayah Persekutuan Labuan ditentuk an mengikut kawasan dan\ndaerah sebagaimana yang dinyatakan dalam ruang (2).\n\nPRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING ACT 2011\n\nPRICE CONTROL AND ANTI-PROFITEERING\n(DETERMINATION OF MAXIMUM PRICE) (NO. 2) ORDER 2023\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 4\nof the Price Control and Anti -Profiteering Act 2011 [ Act 723 ], the Controller, with the\napproval of the Minister, makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-16"};
  FT["MY-H824"] = {"id":"MY-H824","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 10/2024&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":3,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2024年消费税（修正）令","en":"EXCISE DUTIES (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2024","orig":"EXCISE DUTIES (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2024","ms":"Perintah Duti Eksais (Pindaan) 2024","vi":"Lệnh về Thuế tiêu thụ đặc biệt (Sửa đổi) năm 2024","th":"คำสั่งภาษีสรรพสามิต (การแก้ไข) ค.ศ. 2024","id":"Perintah Cukai (Perubahan) Tahun 2024"},"level":"regulation","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA10","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2024","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 3 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\2024_P.U.(A)10-2024_EXCISE DUTIES (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2024.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H824-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Duti Eksais (Pindaan) 2024.\n\n(2) Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 1 Mac 2024.\n\nPindaan Jadual"}},{"id":"MY-H824-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Perintah Duti Eksais 2022 [P.U. (A) 163/2022] dipinda dalam Jadual—\n\n(a) dengan memasukkan sebelum Bab 20 dan butir-butir yang berhubungan\n\ndengannya Bab dan butir–butir yang berikut:\n\n\"Chapter 18\n\nCocoa and cocoa preparations\n\nHeading Subheading Descriptions of goods Unit of\n\nQuantity\n\nRate of\n\nDuty\n\n(1) (2) (3) (4) (5)\n\n18.06 Chocolate and other food preparations\n\ncontaining cocoa.\n\n1806.10.00 00 - Cocoa powder, containing added sugar or\n\nother sweetening matter\n\nkg RM0.47\n\nper\n\n100 grams\n\n1806.90 - Other:\n\n1806.90.30 00 - - Food preparations of flour, meal,\n\nstarch or malt extract, containing 40%\n\nor more but not exceeding 50% by\n\nweight of cocoa calculated on a totally\n\ndefatted basis\n\nkg RM0.47\n\nper\n\n100 grams\n\nHeading Subheading Descriptions of goods Unit of\n\nQuantity\n\nRate of\n\nDuty\n\n(1) (2) (3) (4) (5)\n\n1806.90.90 00 - - Other kg RM0.47\n\nper\n\n100 grams\n\nChapter 19\n\nPreparations of cereals, flour, starch or milk; pastrycooks' products\n\nHeading Subheading Descriptions of goods Unit of\n\nQuantity\n\nRate of\n\nDuty\n\n(1) (2) (3) (4) (5)\n\n19.01 Malt extract; food preparations of flour,\n\ngroats, meal, starch or malt extract, not\n\ncontaining cocoa or containing less than\n\n40% by weight of cocoa calculated on\n\na totally defatted basis, not elsewhere\n\nspecified or included; food preparations\n\nof goods of headings 04.01 to 04.04, not\n\ncontaining cocoa or containing less than\n\n5% by weight of cocoa calculated on\n\na totally defatted basis, not elsewhere\n\nspecified or included.\n\n1901.90 - Other:\n\n- - Other, of goods of headings 04.01 to\n\n04.04:\n\n1901.90.32 00 - - - Other, containing cocoa powder kg RM0.47\n\nper\n\n100 grams\n\n1901.90.39 00 - - - Other kg RM0.47\n\nper\n\n100 grams\n\n- - Other soya-based preparations:\n\n1901.90.41 00 - - - In powder form\n\nIn other forms\n\nkg RM0.47\n\nper\n\n100 grams\n\n1901.90.49 00 - - - kg RM0.47\n\nper\n\n100 grams\n\nHeading Subheading Descriptions of goods Unit of\n\nQuantity\n\nRate of\n\nDuty\n\n(1) (2) (3) (4) (5)\n\n- - Other:\n\n1901.90.99 00 - - - Other kg RM0.47\n\nper\n\n100 grams\n\n(b) dengan memasukkan selepas Bab 20 dan butir-butir yang berhubungan\n\ndengannya Bab dan butir-butir yang berikut:\n\n\"Chapter 21\n\nMiscellaneous edible preparations\n\nHeading Subheading Descriptions of goods Unit of\n\nQuantity\n\nRate of\n\nDuty\n\n(1) (2) (3) (4) (5)\n\n21.01 Extracts, essences and concentrates, of\n\ncoffee, tea or maté, and preparations with\n\na basis of these products or with a basis of\n\ncoffee, tea or maté; roasted chicory and\n\nother roasted coffee substitutes, and\n\nextracts, essences and concentrates\n\nthereof.\n\n- Extracts, essences and concentrates, of\n\ncoffee, and preparations with a basis of\n\nthese extracts, essences or concentrates\n\nor with a basis of coffee:\n\n2101.12 - - Preparations with a basis of extracts,\n\nessences or concentrates or with\n\na basis of coffee:\n\n2101.12.10 00 - - - Mixtures in paste form with a basis\n\nof ground roasted coffee, containing\n\nvegetable fats\n\nkg RM0.47\n\nper\n\n100 grams\n\n- - - Other:\n\n\"; dan\n\nHeading Subheading Descriptions of goods Unit of\n\nQuantity\n\nRate of\n\nDuty\n\n(1) (2) (3) (4) (5)\n\n2101.12.91 00 - - - - Coffee preparations with a basis\n\nof extracts, essences or\n\nconcentrate containing added\n\nsugar, whether or not containing\n\ncreamer\n\nkg RM0.47\n\nper\n\n100 grams\n\n2101.12.92 00 - - - - Coffee preparations with a basis\n\nof ground roasted coffee\n\ncontaining added sugar,\n\nwhether or not containing\n\ncreamer\n\nkg RM0.47\n\nper\n\n100 grams\n\n2101.12.99 00 - - - - Other kg RM0.47\n\nper\n\n100 grams\n\n2101.20 - Extracts, essences and concentrates, of tea\n\nor maté, and preparations with a basis of\n\nthese extracts, essences or concentrates\n\nor with a basis of tea or maté:\n\n2101.20.30 00 - - Preparations of tea consisting of a\n\nmixture of tea, milk powder and sugar\n\nkg RM0.47\n\nper\n\n100 grams\n\n2101.20.90 00 - - Other kg RM0.47\n\nper\n\n100 grams\n\n21.06 Food preparations not elsewhere\n\nspecified or included.\n\n2106.90 - Other:\n\n- - Other, non-alcoholic preparations of a\n\nkind used for the making or for the\n\nmanufacture of beverages:\n\n2106.90.53 00 - - - Ginseng based products kg RM0.47\n\nper\n\n100 grams\n\n2106.90.59 00 - - - Other kg RM0.47\n\nper\n\n100 grams \".\n\nPembatalan"}},{"id":"MY-H824-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Perintah Duti Eksais (Pindaan) 2022 [P.U. (A) 287/2022] dibatalkan.\n\nDibuat 15 Januari 2024\n\n[Sulit KE.HT(96)669/19-8 Klt.4Sk.5;MOF.TAX(S)700-2/1/16 JLD.13; PN(PU2)337/JLD. 28]\n\n DATUK SERI AMIR HAMZAH AZIZAN\n\n Menteri Kewangan Kedua\n\n[Akan dibentangkan di hadapan Dewan Rakyat menurut subseksyen 6(2) Akta Eksais 1976]\n\nEXCISE ACT 1976\n\nEXCISE DUTIES (AMENDMENT) ORDER 2024\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 6(1) of the\n\nExcise Act 1976 [Act 176], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-16"};
  FT["MY-H825"] = {"id":"MY-H825","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 10/2025&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":5,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2025年关税（临时反倾销税）（第2号）令","en":"CUSTOMS (PROVISIONAL ANTI-DUMPING DUTIES) (NO. 2) ORDER 2025","orig":"CUSTOMS (PROVISIONAL ANTI-DUMPING DUTIES) (NO. 2) ORDER 2025","ms":"Perintah Kastam (Duti Anti-Lambakan Sementara) (Bilangan 2) 2025","vi":"Lệnh về Hải quan (Thuế chống bán phá giá tạm thời) (số 2) năm 2025","th":"คำสั่งศุลกากร (อากรตอบโต้การทุ่มตลาดชั่วคราว) (ฉบับที่ 2) ค.ศ. 2025","id":"Perintah Kepabeanan (Bea Masuk Anti-Dumping Sementara) (Nomor 2) Tahun 2025"},"level":"regulation","category":"03_涉外投资与贸易","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA10","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2025","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 5 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\03_涉外投资与贸易\\2025_P.U.(A)10-2025_CUSTOMS (PROVISIONAL ANTI-DUMPING DUTIES) (NO. 2) ORDER 2025.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H825-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Kastam\n\n(Duti Anti-Lambakan Sementara) (No. 2) 2025.\n\n(2) Perintah ini berkuat kuasa bagi tempoh mulai 11 Januari 2025\n\nhingga 10 Mei 2025.\n\nDuti anti-lambakan sementara"}},{"id":"MY-H825-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Duti anti-lambakan sementara hendaklah dilevi atas dan dibayar oleh pengimport\n\nberkenaan dengan barang-barang yang dinyatakan dalam ruang (1) dan (2) Jadual yang\n\ndieksport dari negara yang dinyatakan dalam ruang (3) ke dalam Malaysia oleh pengeluar\n\natau pengeksport yang dinyatakan dalam ruang (4) pada kadar duti yang dinyatakan\n\ndalam ruang (5).\n\nCagaran"}},{"id":"MY-H825-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Duti anti-lambakan sementara yang dilevi di bawah Perintah ini hendaklah\n\ndijamin oleh suatu cagaran yang sama amaunnya dengan amaun duti yang dilevi.\n\nPenjenisan barang-barang"}},{"id":"MY-H825-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4"},"text":{"ms":"4. (1) Penjenisan barang-barang yang dinyatakan dalam Jadual hendaklah\n\nmematuhi Rukun Tafsiran dalam Perintah Duti Kastam 2022 [P.U. (A) 114/2022].\n\n(2) Nombor kepala atau subkepala yang dinyatakan dalam ruang (1) Jadual\n\ndiperuntukkan bagi kemudahan rujukan dan tidak mempunyai kesan mengikat atas\n\npenjenisan barang-barang yang diperihalkan dalam ruang (2).\n\nKesan terhadap duti import dan cukai jualan"}},{"id":"MY-H825-A5","no":5,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 5"},"text":{"ms":"5. Pengenaan duti anti-lambakan sementara di bawah Perintah ini tidaklah\n\nmenjejaskan pengenaan dan pemungutan—\n\n(a) duti import di bawah Akta Kastam 1967; dan\n\n(b) cukai jualan di bawah Akta Cukai Jualan 2018 [Akta 806].\n\nJADUAL\n\n[Perenggan 2]\n\nDUTI ANTI-LAMBAKAN SEMENTARA\n\n(1)\n\nNombor\n\nKepala/\n\nSubkepala\n\nmengikut\n\nKod H.S.\n\n(2)\n\nPerihalan\n\nBarang-Barang\n\n(3)\n\nNegara\n\n(4)\n\nPengeluar/\n\nPengeksport\n\n(5)\n\nKadar Duti\n\n[Peratusan (%)\n\ndaripada Nilai\n\nKos, Insurans\n\ndan Tambang\n\n(KIT)]\n\n7210.11.90 00\n\n7210.12.90 00\n\nProduk gulungan\n\nrata besi atau\n\nkeluli bukan aloi\n\ndengan\n\nkelebaran\n\n600 mm atau\n\nlebih, disalut,\n\ndisadur atau\n\ndisepuh dengan\n\ntimah\n\n(electrolytic\n\ntinplate atau\n\ntinplate)\n\n(a) Republik\n\n Rakyat\n\nChina\n\n(i) Baoshan Iron &\n\nSteel Co., Ltd.\n\n2.52%\n\n(ii) GDH Zhongyue\n\n(Qinhuangdao)\n\nTinplate\n\nIndustrial\n\nCo., Ltd.\n\n12.61%\n\n(iii) GDH Zhongyue\n\n(Zhongshan)\n\nTinplate\n\nIndustrial\n\nCo., Ltd.\n\n12.61%\n\n(1)\n\nNombor\n\nKepala/\n\nSubkepala\n\nmengikut\n\nKod H.S.\n\n(2)\n\nPerihalan\n\nBarang-Barang\n\n(3)\n\nNegara\n\n(4)\n\nPengeluar/\n\nPengeksport\n\n(5)\n\nKadar Duti\n\n[Peratusan (%)\n\ndaripada Nilai\n\nKos, Insurans\n\ndan Tambang\n\n(KIT)]\n\n(iv) Hesteel Group\n\nHengshui Strip\n\nProcessing\n\nCo., Ltd.\n\n18.18%\n\n(v) Shougang\n\nJingtang United\n\nIron & Steel\n\nCo., Ltd.\n\n16.33%\n\n(vi) Lain-lain 18.18%\n\n(b) Republik\n\nIndia\n\n(i) Semua\n\npengeluar atau\n\npengeksport\n\n27.88%\n\n(c) Jepun (i) Nippon Steel\n\nCorporation\n\n36.80%\n\n(ii) Lain-lain 36.80%\n\n(d) Republik\n\nKorea\n\n(i) KG Dongbu\n\nSteel Co., Ltd.\n\n28.66%\n\n(ii) Lain-lain 35.43%\n\nDibuat 8 Januari 2025\n\n[SULIT KE.HT(96)340/21; MOF.TAX(S)700-4/1/672 Jld.2; PN(PU2)338D/JLD.8]\n\n DATUK SERI AMIR HAMZAH AZIZAN\n\nMenteri Kewangan II\n\n[Akan dibentangkan di Dewan Rakyat menurut subseksyen 11(2) Akta Kastam 1967]\n\nCUSTOMS ACT 1967\n\nCOUNTERVAILING AND ANTI-DUMPING DUTIES ACT 1993\n\nCUSTOMS (PROVISIONAL ANTI-DUMPING DUTIES) (NO. 2) ORDER 2025\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 11(1) of the Customs Act 1967\n\n[Act 235] read together with section 24 of the Countervailing and Anti-Dumping Duties\n\nAct 1993 [Act 504], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement\n\n1. (1) This order may be cited as the Customs (Provisional Anti-Dumping\n\nDuties) (No. 2) Order 2025.\n\n(2) This Order has effect for the period from 11 January 2025 to 10 May 2025.\n\nProvisional anti-dumping duties\n\n2. Provisional anti-dumping duties shall be levied and paid by the importers\n\nin respect of the goods specified in columns (1) and (2) of the Schedule exported from\n\nthe countries specified in column (3) into Malaysia by the producers or exporters\n\nspecified in column (4) at the rate of duties specified in column (5).\n\nSecurity\n\n3. The provisional anti-dumping duties levied under this Order shall be guaranteed\n\nby a security which amount is equal to the amount of duties levied.\n\nClassification of goods\n\n4. (1) The classification of goods specified in the Schedule shall comply with\n\nthe Rules of Interpretation in the Customs Duties Order 2022 [P.U. (A) 114/2022].\n\n(2) The heading or subheading numbers specified in column (1)\n\nof the Schedule are provided for ease of reference and have no binding effect\n\non the classification of goods described in column (2).\n\nEffect on import duties and sales tax\n\n5. The imposition of provisional anti-dumping duties under this Order is\n\nwithout prejudice to the imposition and collection of—\n\n(a) import duties under the Customs Act 1967; and\n\n(b) sales tax under the Sales Tax Act 2018 [Act 806].\n\nSCHEDULE\n\n[Paragraph 2]\n\nPROVISIONAL ANTI-DUMPING DUTIES\n\n(1)\n\nHeading/\n\nSubheading\n\nNumber\n\naccording to\n\nH.S. Code\n\n(2)\n\nDescription\n\nof Goods\n\n(3)\n\nCountry\n\n(4)\n\nProducer/\n\nExporter\n\n(5)\n\nRate of Duties\n\n[Percentage (%)\n\nof the Cost,\n\nInsurance\n\nand Freight\n\n(CIF) Value]\n\n7210.11.90 00\n\n7210.12.90 00\n\nFlat-rolled\n\nproducts of iron\n\nor non-alloy\n\nsteel of a width\n\nof 600 mm or\n\nmore, clad,\n\nplated or coated\n\nwith tin\n\n(electrolytic\n\ntinplate or\n\ntinplate)\n\n(a) The\n\nPeople's\n\nRepublic\n\nof China\n\n(i) Baoshan Iron &\n\nSteel Co., Ltd.\n\n2.52%\n\n(ii) GDH Zhongyue\n\n(Qinhuangdao)\n\nTinplate\n\nIndustrial\n\nCo., Ltd.\n\n12.61%\n\n(iii) GDH Zhongyue\n\n(Zhongshan)\n\nTinplate\n\nIndustrial\n\nCo., Ltd.\n\n12.61%\n\n(1)\n\nHeading/\n\nSubheading\n\nNumber\n\naccording to\n\nH.S. Code\n\n(2)\n\nDescription\n\nof Goods\n\n(3)\n\nCountry\n\n(4)\n\nProducer/\n\nExporter\n\n(5)\n\nRate of Duties\n\n[Percentage (%)\n\nof the Cost,\n\nInsurance\n\nand Freight\n\n(CIF) Value]\n\n(iv) Hesteel Group\n\nHengshui Strip\n\nProcessing\n\nCo., Ltd.\n\n18.18%\n\n(v) Shougang\n\nJingtang United\n\nIron & Steel\n\nCo., Ltd.\n\n16.33%\n\n(vi) Others 18.18%\n\n(b) The\n\nRepublic\n\nof India\n\n(i) All producers\n\nor exporters\n\n27.88%\n\n(c) Japan (i) Nippon Steel\n\nCorporation\n\n36.80%\n\n(ii) Others 36.80%\n\n(d) The\n\nRepublic\n\nof Korea\n\n(i) KG Dongbu\n\nSteel Co., Ltd.\n\n28.66%\n\n(ii) Others 35.43%\n\nMade 8 January 2025\n\n[SULIT KE.HT(96)340/21; MOF.TAX(S)700-4/1/672 Jld.2; PN(PU2)338D/JLD.8]\n\nDATUK SERI AMIR HAMZAH AZIZAN\n\nMinister of Finance II\n\n[To be laid before the Dewan Rakyat pursuant to subsection 11(2) of the Customs Act 1967]"}}],"pack":"my-16"};
  FT["MY-H826"] = {"id":"MY-H826","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 10/2026&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2026年医疗器械（指定医疗器械）令","en":"MEDICAL DEVICE (DESIGNATED MEDICAL DEVICE) ORDER 2026","orig":"MEDICAL DEVICE (DESIGNATED MEDICAL DEVICE) ORDER 2026","ms":"Perintah Peranti Perubatan (Peranti Perubatan yang Ditetapkan) 2026","vi":"Lệnh về Trang thiết bị y tế (Trang thiết bị y tế được chỉ định) năm 2026","th":"คำสั่งเครื่องมือแพทย์ (เครื่องมือแพทย์ที่กำหนด) ค.ศ. 2026","id":"Perintah Alat Kesehatan (Perangkat Medis yang Ditunjuk) Tahun 2026"},"level":"regulation","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA10","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2026","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\2026_P.U.(A)10-2026_MEDICAL DEVICE (DESIGNATED MEDICAL DEVICE) ORDER 2026.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H826-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Peranti Perubatan\n\n(Peranti Perubatan yang Ditetapkan) 2026.\n\n(2) Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 1 Jun 2026.\n\nPeranti perubatan yang ditetapkan"}},{"id":"MY-H826-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Menteri menentukan peranti perubatan dalam ruang 2 Jadual sebagai\n\nsuatu peranti perubatan yang ditetapkan yang hendaklah digunakan bagi maksud\n\nyang disebut dalam ruang 3.\n\nJADUAL\n\n(1)\n\nBil.\n\n(2)\n\nPeranti perubatan yang ditetapkan\n\n(3)\n\nMaksud penggunaan\n\n1. Laser perubatan\n\n(a) Alexandrite laser (756nm) (i) menyingkirkan rambut\n\n(ii) menghilangkan atau\n\nmengurangkan pigmentasi\n\nseperti melasma,\n\njeragat, dsb.\n\n(iii) merawat lesi vaskular\n\nseperti telangiektasia,\n\nurat labah-labah,\n\nkapilari pecah dan rosacea\n\n(1)\n\nBil.\n\n(2)\n\nPeranti perubatan yang ditetapkan\n\n(3)\n\nMaksud penggunaan\n\n(iv) meremajakan kulit dengan\n\nmengurangkan kedutan dan\n\nkekenduran kulit melalui\n\nrangsangan pengeluaran\n\nkolagen\n\n(v) apa-apa maksud\n\npenggunaan estetik lain\n\nsebagaimana yang\n\nditentukan oleh pembuat\n\ndan mengikut penggunaan\n\nyang diniatkan baginya\n\n(b) Diode laser (800nm) (i) menyingkirkan rambut\n\n(ii) meremajakan kulit dengan\n\nmengurangkan kedutan dan\n\nkekenduran kulit melalui\n\nrangsangan pengeluaran\n\nkolagen\n\n(iii) merawat jerawat dan\n\nmengurangkan keradangan\n\nkulit\n\n(iv) menghilangkan atau\n\nmengurangkan pigmentasi\n\nseperti melasma,\n\njeragat, dsb.\n\n(v) merawat lesi vaskular\n\nseperti telangiektasia, urat\n\nlabah-labah, kapilari pecah\n\ndan rosacea\n\n(vi) mengurangkan parut atau\n\nkulit tidak rata dengan\n\nmerangsang penghasilan\n\nkolagen dan membentuk\n\nsemula tisu parut\n\n(vii) apa-apa maksud\n\npenggunaan estetik lain\n\nsebagaimana yang\n\nditentukan oleh pembuat\n\n(1)\n\nBil.\n\n(2)\n\nPeranti perubatan yang ditetapkan\n\n(3)\n\nMaksud penggunaan\n\ndan mengikut penggunaan\n\nyang diniatkan baginya\n\n(c) Erbium YAG laser\n\n(2940nm)\n\n(i) menghaluskan kulit\n\n(ii) menghilangkan atau\n\nmengurangkan parut dan\n\nkulit tidak rata\n\n(iii) meremajakan kulit dengan\n\nmengurangkan kedutan dan\n\nkekenduran kulit melalui\n\nrangsangan pengeluaran\n\nkolagen\n\n(iv) menghilangkan atau\n\nmengurangkan pigmentasi\n\nseperti melasma,\n\njeragat, dsb.\n\n(v) merawat actinic keratosis\n\niaitu lesi kulit pra-kanser\n\n(vi) menghilangkan ketuat\n\nmelalui ablasi tisu\n\n(vii) apa-apa maksud\n\npenggunaan estetik lain\n\nsebagaimana yang\n\nditentukan oleh pembuat\n\ndan mengikut penggunaan\n\nyang diniatkan baginya\n\n(d) Fractional CO2 laser\n\n(10,600nm)\n\n(i) menghilangkan atau\n\nmengurangkan parut dan\n\nkulit tidak rata\n\n(ii) menghilangkan ketuat\n\nmelalui ablasi tisu\n\n(iii) menghilangkan atau\n\nmengurangkan pigmentasi\n\nseperti melasma,\n\njeragat, dsb.\n\n(1)\n\nBil.\n\n(2)\n\nPeranti perubatan yang ditetapkan\n\n(3)\n\nMaksud penggunaan\n\n(iv) merawat actinic keratosis\n\niaitu lesi kulit pra-kanser\n\n(v) apa-apa maksud\n\npenggunaan estetik lain\n\nsebagaimana yang\n\nditentukan oleh pembuat\n\ndan mengikut penggunaan\n\nyang diniatkan baginya\n\n(e) Nd: YAG laser\n\n(532nm atau 1064nm)\n\n(i) meremajakan kulit dengan\n\nmengurangkan kedutan dan\n\nkekenduran kulit melalui\n\nrangsangan pengeluaran\n\nkolagen\n\n(ii) menghilangkan atau\n\nmengurangkan parut atau\n\nkulit tidak rata\n\n(iii) menghilangkan atau\n\nmengurangkan pigmentasi\n\nseperti melasma,\n\njeragat, dsb.\n\n(iv) merawat lesi vaskular\n\nseperti telangiektasia,\n\ncherry angioma, dsb.\n\n(v) menyingkirkan rambut\n\n(vi) apa-apa maksud\n\npenggunaan estetik lain\n\nsebagaimana yang\n\nditentukan oleh pembuat\n\ndan mengikut penggunaan\n\nyang diniatkan baginya\n\n(f) Pulse-dye laser\n\n(585nm atau 595nm)\n\n(i) merawat lesi vaskular\n\nseperti urat labah-labah,\n\ntanda lahir, rosacea dan\n\nhaemangioma\n\n(1)\n\nBil.\n\n(2)\n\nPeranti perubatan yang ditetapkan\n\n(3)\n\nMaksud penggunaan\n\n(ii) menghilangkan atau\n\nmengurangkan parut atau\n\nkulit tidak rata\n\n(iii) merawat lesi berpigmen,\n\nmengurangkan penampilan\n\nbintik-bintik usia dan\n\njeragat\n\n(iv) meremajakan kulit dengan\n\nmengurangkan kedutan dan\n\nkekenduran kulit melalui\n\nrangsangan pengeluaran\n\nkolagen\n\n(vi) apa-apa maksud\n\npenggunaan estetik lain\n\nsebagaimana yang\n\nditentukan oleh pembuat\n\ndan mengikut penggunaan\n\nyang diniatkan baginya\n\n(g) Ruby laser\n\n(694nm)\n\n(i) menghilangkan atau\n\nmengurangkan pigmentasi\n\nseperti melasma,\n\njeragat, dsb.\n\n(ii) menyingkirkan rambut\n\n(iii) merawat lesi vaskular\n\nseperti telangiektasia, urat\n\nlabah-labah, kapilari pecah,\n\ndan rosacea\n\n(iv) apa-apa maksud\n\npenggunaan estetik lain\n\nsebagaimana yang\n\nditentukan oleh pembuat\n\ndan mengikut penggunaan\n\nyang diniatkan baginya\n\n(1)\n\nBil.\n\n(2)\n\nPeranti perubatan yang ditetapkan\n\n(3)\n\nMaksud penggunaan\n\n2. Peranti HIFU (High-Intensity\n\nFocused Ultrasound)\n\n(i) meremajakan kulit dengan\n\nmengurangkan kedutan dan\n\nkekenduran kulit melalui\n\nrangsangan pengeluaran\n\nkolagen\n\n(ii) mengurangkan lemak\n\nmelalui kaedah adipocytes\n\napoptosis atau coagulative\n\nnecrosis\n\n(iii) menghilangkan atau\n\nmengurangkan pigmentasi\n\nseperti melasma,\n\njeragat, dsb.\n\n(iv) apa-apa maksud\n\npenggunaan estetik lain\n\nsebagaimana yang\n\nditentukan oleh pembuat\n\ndan mengikut penggunaan\n\nyang diniatkan baginya\n\n3. Peranti liposuction (i) menyingkirkan simpanan\n\nlemak setempat\n\n(ii) apa-apa maksud\n\npenggunaan estetik lain\n\nsebagaimana yang\n\nditentukan oleh pembuat\n\ndan mengikut penggunaan\n\nyang diniatkan baginya\n\nNota: \"nm\" dalam konteks laser merujuk kepada nanometer, iaitu unit ukuran\n\npanjang gelombang\n\nDibuat 8 Januari 2026\n\n[KKMMDA(S)100/1-1-1; PN(PU2)711/V]\n\nDATUK SERI DR. HAJI DZULKEFLY BIN AHMAD\n\nMenteri Kesihatan\n\nMEDICAL DEVICE ACT 2012\n\nMEDICAL DEVICE (DESIGNATED MEDICAL DEVICE) ORDER 2026\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 26 of the Medical Device Act 2012\n\n[Act 737], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement\n\n1. (1) This order may be cited as the Medical Device (Designated Medical\n\nDevice) Order 2026.\n\n(2) This Order comes into operation on 1 June 2026.\n\nDesignated medical device\n\n2. The Minister specifies medical devices in column 2 of the Schedule to be\n\na designated medical device which shall be used for the purposes referred to in\n\ncolumn 3.\n\nSCHEDULE\n\n(1)\n\nNo.\n\n(2)\n\nDesignated medical device\n\n(3)\n\nPurpose of use\n\n1. Medical laser\n\n(a) Alexandrite laser (756nm) (i) remove hair\n\n(ii) remove or reduce\n\npigmentation such as\n\nmelasma, freckles, etc.\n\n(iii) treat vascular lesions\n\nsuch as telangiectasia,\n\nspider veins, broken\n\ncapillaries and rosacea\n\n(iv) rejuvenate skin by\n\nreducing wrinkles and\n\nsagging skin through\n\n(1)\n\nNo.\n\n(2)\n\nDesignated medical device\n\n(3)\n\nPurpose of use\n\nstimulation of collagen\n\nproduction\n\n(v) any other aesthetic\n\npurpose of use as\n\ndetermined by the\n\nmanufacturer and in\n\naccordance with its\n\nintended use\n\n(b) Diode laser (800nm) (i) remove hair\n\n(ii) rejuvenate skin by\n\nreducing wrinkles and\n\nsagging skin through\n\nstimulation of collagen\n\nproduction\n\n(iii) treat acne and reduce skin\n\ninflammation\n\n(iv) remove or reduce\n\npigmentation such as\n\nmelasma, freckles, etc.\n\n(v) treat vascular lesions\n\nsuch as telangiectasia,\n\nspider veins, broken\n\ncapillaries and rosacea\n\n(vi) reduce scar or uneven\n\nskin by promoting\n\ncollagen production and\n\nremodelling the scar tissue\n\n(vii) any other aesthetic\n\npurpose of use as\n\ndetermined by the\n\nmanufacturer and in\n\naccordance with its\n\nintended use\n\n(c) Erbium YAG laser\n\n(2940nm)\n\n(i) smoothens the skin\n\n(1)\n\nNo.\n\n(2)\n\nDesignated medical device\n\n(3)\n\nPurpose of use\n\n(ii) remove or reduce scars\n\nand uneven skin\n\n(iii) rejuvenate skin by\n\nreducing wrinkles and\n\nsagging skin through\n\nstimulation of collagen\n\nproduction\n\n(iv) remove or reduce\n\npigmentation such as\n\nmelasma, freckles, etc.\n\n(v) treat actinic keratosis,\n\nwhich is a precancerous\n\nskin lesion\n\n(vi) remove warts by tissue\n\nablation\n\n(vii) any other aesthetic\n\npurpose of use as\n\ndetermined by the\n\nmanufacturer and in\n\naccordance with its\n\nintended use\n\n(d) Fractional CO2 laser\n\n(10,600nm)\n\n(i) remove or reduce scars\n\nand uneven skin\n\n(ii) remove warts by tissues\n\nablation\n\n(iii) remove or reduce\n\npigmentation such as\n\nmelasma, freckles, etc.\n\n(iv) treat actinic keratosis,\n\nwhich is a precancerous\n\nskin lesion\n\n(v) any other aesthetic\n\npurpose of use as\n\ndetermined by the\n\nmanufacturer and in\n\n(1)\n\nNo.\n\n(2)\n\nDesignated medical device\n\n(3)\n\nPurpose of use\n\naccordance with its\n\nintended use\n\n(e) Nd: YAG laser\n\n(532nm or 1064nm)\n\n(i) rejuvenate skin by\n\nreducing wrinkles and\n\nsagging skin through\n\nstimulation of collagen\n\nproduction\n\n(ii) remove or reduce scars\n\nand uneven skin\n\n(iii) remove or reduce\n\npigmentation disorders\n\nsuch as melasma, freckles,\n\netc.\n\n(iv) treats vascular lesions\n\nsuch as telangiectasia,\n\ncherry angioma, etc.\n\n(v) remove hair\n\n(vi) any other aesthetic\n\npurpose of use as\n\ndetermined by the\n\nmanufacturer and in\n\naccordance with its\n\nintended use\n\n(f) Pulse-dye laser\n\n(585nm or 595nm)\n\n(i) treat vascular lesions such\n\nas spider veins,\n\nbirthmarks, rosacea and\n\nhaemangioma\n\n(ii) remove or reduce scars\n\nand uneven skin\n\n(iii) treat pigmented lesions\n\nand reduce the\n\nappearance of age spots\n\nand melasma\n\n(1)\n\nNo.\n\n(2)\n\nDesignated medical device\n\n(3)\n\nPurpose of use\n\n(iv) rejuvenate skin by\n\nreducing wrinkles and\n\nsagging skin through\n\nstimulation of collagen\n\nproduction\n\n(vi) any other aesthetic\n\npurpose of use as\n\ndetermined by the\n\nmanufacturer and in\n\naccordance with its\n\nintended use\n\n(g) Ruby laser\n\n(694nm)\n\n(i) remove or reduce\n\npigmentation such as\n\nmelasma, freckles, etc.\n\n(ii) remove hair\n\n(iii) treat vascular lesions such\n\ntelangiectasia, spider\n\nveins, broken capillaries\n\nand rosacea\n\n(vii) any other aesthetic\n\npurpose of use as\n\ndetermined by the\n\nmanufacturer and in\n\naccordance with its\n\nintended use\n\n2. HIFU (High-Intensity Focused\n\nUltrasound) device\n\n(i) rejuvenate skin by\n\nreducing wrinkles and\n\nsagging skin through\n\nstimulation of collagen\n\nproduction\n\n(ii) fat reduction via\n\nadipocytes apoptosis or\n\ncoagulative necrosis\n\n(iii) remove or reduce\n\npigmentation such as\n\nmelasma, freckles, etc.\n\n(1)\n\nNo.\n\n(2)\n\nDesignated medical device\n\n(3)\n\nPurpose of use\n\n(viii) any other aesthetic\n\npurpose of use as\n\ndetermined by the\n\nmanufacturer and in\n\naccordance with its\n\nintended use\n\n3. Liposuction device (i) remove localised adipose\n\ndeposits\n\n(ii) any other aesthetic\n\npurpose of use as\n\ndetermined by the\n\nmanufacturer and in\n\naccordance with its\n\nintended use\n\nNotes: \"nm\" in the context of lasers refers to nanometres, which is a unit\n\nof wavelength measurement\n\nMade 8 January 2026\n\n[KKMMDA(S)100/1-1-1; PN(PU2)711/V]\n\nDATUK SERI DR. HAJI DZULKEFLY BIN AHMAD\n\nMinister of Health"}}],"pack":"my-16"};
  FT["MY-H827"] = {"id":"MY-H827","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 110/1978&status=PINDAAN","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":3,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"1978年马来亚大学（豁免）令","en":"UNIVERSITY OF MALAYA (EXEMPTION) ORDER 1978","orig":"UNIVERSITY OF MALAYA (EXEMPTION) ORDER 1978","ms":"Perintah Universiti Malaya (Pengecualian) 1978","vi":"Lệnh về Đại học Malaya (Miễn trừ) năm 1978","th":"คำสั่งมหาวิทยาลัยมาลายา (การยกเว้น) ค.ศ. 1978","id":"Perintah Universitas Malaya (Pembebasan) Tahun 1978"},"level":"regulation","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA110","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"1978","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 3 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\1978_P.U.(A)110-1978_UNIVERSITY OF MALAYA (EXEMPTION) ORDER 1978.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H827-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Kesatuan Sekerja (Penge-\ncualian di bawah Seksyen 30) (No. 2) 1978."}},{"id":"MY-H827-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Pengecualian dari peruntukan seksyen 28 (1) (a) Ordinan Kesatuan\nSekerja 1959 adalah diberi kepada pegawai-pegawai Persatuan Bank-\nbank Perdagangan Tanah Melayu."}},{"id":"MY-H827-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. Perintah ini hendaklah berkuatkuasa selama dua tahun dari 1hb\nMac 1977.\n\nDiperbuat pada 23 haribulan Mac 1978.\n(KB & TR. Sulit 59/60 Pt. II; PN. (PU?) 249.1\n\nDATUK LEB SAN CHOON,\nMenteri Buruh dan Tenaga Rakyat\n\n. TRADE UNIONS ORDINANCE 1959\nTRADE UNIONS (EXEMPTION UNDER SECTION 30) (No. 2) Order 1978\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 30 of the Trade Unions\nOrdinance 1959, the Minister of Labour and Manpower makes the\nfollowing order:"}}],"pack":"my-16"};
  FT["MY-H828"] = {"id":"MY-H828","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 110/2003&status=PINDAAN","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2003年法律修订（1992年娱乐（吉隆坡联邦直辖区）法的更正）令","en":"REVISION OF LAWS (RECTIFICATION OF ENTERTAINMENT (FEDERAL TERRITORY OF KUALA LUMPUR) ACT 1992) ORDER 2003","orig":"REVISION OF LAWS (RECTIFICATION OF ENTERTAINMENT (FEDERAL TERRITORY OF KUALA LUMPUR) ACT 1992) ORDER 2003","ms":"Perintah Semakan Semula Undang-Undang (Pembetulan Akta Hiburan (Wilayah Persekutuan Kuala Lumpur) 1992) 2003","vi":"Lệnh về Sửa đổi Luật (Đính chính Luật Giải trí (Lãnh thổ Liên bang Kuala Lumpur) 1992) năm 2003","th":"คำสั่งการปรับปรุงกฎหมาย (การแก้ไขข้อผิดพลาดพระราชบัญญัติสถานบันเทิง (เขตปกครองสหพันธ์กัวลาลัมเปอร์) ค.ศ. 1992) ค.ศ. 2003","id":"Perintah Revisi Undang-Undang (Koreksi Undang-Undang Hiburan (Wilayah Persekutuan Kuala Lumpur) 1992) Tahun 2003"},"level":"regulation","category":"01_宪法与基础法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA110","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2003","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\01_宪法与基础法\\2003_P.U.(A)110-2003_REVISION OF LAWS (RECTIFICATION OF ENTERTAINMENT (FEDERAL TERRITORY OF KUALA LUMPUR) ACT 1992).txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H828-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Had Laju Tempatan\n(Jalan Persekutuan) (Malaysia Barat) (Pindaan) 2003.\n\nPindaan Jadual Pertama"}},{"id":"MY-H828-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Perintah Had Laju Tempatan (Jalan Persekutuan) (Malaysia Barat) 1992\n(P.U. (A) 462/1991) dipinda dalam Jadual Pertama di bawah tajuk \"NEGERI\nSELANGOR\" dengan memasukkan selepas butiran 51 butiran yang berikut:\n\n(1)                               (2)\nNama jalan dan lokasi                    Had laju\n(kmlj)\n\n\"52. Laluan 29-Lebuhraya Damansara\nPuchong/Putrajaya dan Cyberjaya             80\".\n(dari km. 11.00 diukur dari Pejabat\nPos Puchong hingga km. 20.86)\n\nDibuat 2 April 2003\n[KKR/U/50/15 Jld. 3; PN(PU?)460/XXX VIII]\n\nDato' Seri S. SAMY VELLU\nMenteri Kerja Raya\n\n865            P.U. (A) 109-110.\n\nGENERAL PURPOSE\n\nCommercial | Industrial           Vacant               Housing            Housing\nLand                  Within              Without\nHousing           Housing\n\nEstate              Estate\n\nKT III SI\n\nMade 21 March 2003\n(JPM/WPLK/S.01/136/1; PN(PU*)632/VI]\n\nDivision\nRateable\nProperty\n\nDatuk Han Monp. Noor BIN Moktar\nChief Executive Officer,\nLabuan Corporation\n\nApproved,\n\nSENATOR Datuk Tengku ADNAN\nBIN Tengku Mansor\nMinister in the Prime Minister's Office\n\nP.U. (A) 110.\nAKTA PENYEMAKAN UNDANG-UNDANG 1968\n\nPERINTAH PENYEMAKAN UNDANG-UNDANG (PEMBETULAN AKTA HIBURAN\n(Wilayah Persekutuan Kuala Lumpur) 1992) 2003\n\nPada menjalankan kuasa yang diberikan oleh seksyen 15 Akta Penyemakan\nUndang-Undang 1968 (Akta 1), Pesuruhjaya Penyemak Undang-Undang membuat\nperintah yang berikut:\n\nNama"}}],"pack":"my-16"};
  FT["MY-H829"] = {"id":"MY-H829","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 110/2012&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":3,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2012年所得税（推广国际学校或私立学校的扣除）规则","en":"INCOME TAX (DEDUCTION FOR PROMOTION OF INTERNATIONAL OR PRIVATE SCHOOL) RULES 2012","orig":"INCOME TAX (DEDUCTION FOR PROMOTION OF INTERNATIONAL OR PRIVATE SCHOOL) RULES 2012","ms":"Kaedah Cukai Pendapatan (Potongan bagi Penggalakan Sekolah Antarabangsa atau Swasta) 2012","vi":"Quy tắc về Thuế thu nhập (Khấu trừ cho việc quảng bá trường quốc tế hoặc trường tư thục) năm 2012","th":"กฎภาษีเงินได้ (การหักสำหรับการส่งเสริมโรงเรียนนานาชาติหรือโรงเรียนเอกชน) ค.ศ. 2012","id":"Tata Tertib Pajak Penghasilan (Pengurangan atas Promosi Sekolah Internasional atau Swasta) Tahun 2012"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA110","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2012","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 3 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2012_P.U.(A)110-2012_INCOME TAX (DEDUCTION FOR PROMOTION OF INTERNATIONAL OR PRIVATE SCHOOL) RULES 2012.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H829-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Kaedah-kaedah ini bolehlah dinamakan Kaedah-Kaedah Cukai\nPendapatan (Potongan bagi Promosi Sekolah Antarabangsa atau Swasta) 2012.\n(2) Kaedah-Kaedah ini hendaklah berkuat kuasa mulai tahun taksiran 2012.\nPemakaian"}},{"id":"MY-H829-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Kaedah-Kaedah ini hendaklah terpakai bagi—\n(a) suatu sekolah antarabangsa atau swasta yang merupakan—\n(i) suatu syarikat yang diperbadankan di bawah Akta Syarikat 1965\n[Akta 125]; atau\n(ii) suatu pertubuhan yang ditubuhkan dan didaftarkan di bawah Akta\nPertubuhan 1966 [Akta 335];\nyang bermastautin di Malaysia dan berdaftar dengan Kementerian\nPelajaran Malaysia dan telah mematuhi syarat dan peraturan yang\nditetapkan oleh Kementerian itu di bawah Akta Pendidikan 1996\n[Akta 550];\n(b) suatu sekolah antarabangsa atau swasta yang menjalankan perniagaan\npenyediaan pendidikan di suatu sekolah yang terletak di Malaysia dalam\ntempoh asas bagi suatu tahun taksiran; dan\n\n(c) suatu sekolah antarabangsa atau swasta yang tidak layak untuk suatu\npotongan d i bawah Kaedah -Kaedah Cukai Pendapatan (Potongan bagi\nPromosi Eksport Perkhidmatan) 1999 [P.U. (A) 193/1999].\nPotongan"}},{"id":"MY-H829-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. (1) Tertakluk kepada Kaedah -Kaedah ini, bagi maksud menentukan pendapatan\nlarasan suatu se kolah antarabangsa atau swasta daripada perniagaannya bagi tempoh\nasas bagi suatu tahun taksiran, maka hendaklah dibenarkan sebagai potongan apa -apa\nbelanja pasti dan perbelanjaan dari jenis yang diperihalkan dalam sub kaedah (2) yang\ntelah dilakukan—\n(a) oleh sekolah itu, dalam tempoh asas itu, berkenaan dengan\nperniagaan itu; dan\n(b) terutamanya dan khususnya bagi maksud mempromosikan sekolah\nantarabangsa atau swastanya yang dijalankan dan terletak di\nMalaysia.\n(2) Belanja pasti dan perbelanjaan yang disebutkan dalam subkaedah (1) ialah—\n(a) perbelanjaan yang dilakukan berkenaan dengan penyelidikan\npasaran bagi pendidikan sekolah antarabangsa atau swasta;\n(b) perbelanjaan yang dilakukan berkenaan  dengan penyediaan\nmaklumat teknik al kepada seseorang di luar Malaysia yang\nberhubungan dengan perkhidmatan yang disediakan oleh sekolah\nitu di Malaysia;\n(c) perbelanjaan berkenaan dengan perjalanan ke suatu negara di luar\nMalaysia oleh seorang wakil sekolah itu (tidak lebih daripada tiga\norang) bagi maksud menyertai pameran pendidikan yang diadakan\ndi luar Malaysia dan diluluskan oleh Kementerian Pelajaran\nMalaysia dan perbelanjaan sebenar itu  tertakluk kepada\n\n(i) tambang kapal terbang kelas ekonomi;\n(ii) maksimum sebanyak tiga ratus ringgit sehari untuk\npenginapan; dan\n(iii) maksimum sebanyak satu ratus lima puluh ringgit sehari\nuntuk makanan,\nbagi kes eluruhan tempoh bermula dari tarikh wakil itu bertolak\ndari Malaysia dan berakhir pada tarikh dia kembali ke Malaysia;\n(d) perbelanjaan yang secara langsung dilakukan bagi menyertai\npameran pendidikan yang diadakan di luar Malaysia dan diluluskan\noleh Kementerian Pendidikan Malaysia selain daripada perbelanjaan\nyang dinyatakan dalam perenggan (2)(c); atau\n(e) perbelanjaan yang dilakukan berkenaan dengan publisiti dan iklan\ndalam apa-apa media di luar Malaysia bagi mempromosikan se kolah\nantarabangsa atau swasta di Malaysia.\n(3) Jumlah keseluruhan potongan yang dibenarkan di bawah subkaedah (2) bagi\nmaksud menyertai pameran p endidikan yang diadakan di luar Malaysia hendaklah\nmerupakan tambahan kepada apa -apa potongan yang boleh dibenarkan di bawah\nseksyen 33 Akta dan hendaklah tidak melebihi satu ratus ribu ringgit bagi setiap tahun\ntaksiran.\n(4) Tiada apa -apa potongan boleh dibenarkan di bawah Kaedah -Kaedah ini\nberkenaan dengan apa-apa belanja pasti, perbelanjaan atau bayaran lain yang—\n(a) dari jenis yang disebut dalam subseksyen 39(1) Akta; atau\n(b) dilakukan oleh suatu se kolah antarabangsa atau swasta yang\nmempunyai tempat perniagaan dan tertakluk kepada cukai di\n\ndalam negara yang belanja pasti dan perbelanjaan itu dilakukan.\n(5) Jika amaun apa -apa belanja pasti dan perbelanjaan, yang keseluruhannya\nakan boleh dibenarkan sebagai potongan di bawah Kaedah -Kaedah ini jika tidak kerana\nsubkaedah ini, melebihi amaun yang pa da pendapat Ketua Pengarah semunasabahnya\ndijangkakan akan dilakukan mengikut perjalanan biasa perniagaan itu , yang berkenaan\ndengannya belanja pasti dan perbelanjaan itu telah dilakukan, maka Ketua P engarah\nboleh setakat yang berlebihan itu tidak membenarkan amaun itu sebagai potongan di\nbawah Kaedah-Kaedah ini.\n(6) Bagi maksud subkaedah (1), jika dua tempoh asas bertindih, tempoh yang\nsama dalam kedua -dua tempoh itu hendaklah disifatkan sebagai termasuk dalam\ntempoh asas yang pertama itu sahaja.\nDibuat 17 April 2012\n[CR(8.09)294/6/4-9 (SJ.9)(2012)(SK.2); LHDN. 01/35/(S)/42/51/231-17.13; PN(PU2)80/LXIV]\nDATO' SERI AHMAD HUSNI MOHAMAD HANADZLAH\nMenteri Kewangan Kedua\n[Akan dibentangkan di Dewan Rakyat menurut subseksyen 154(2) Akta Cukai Pendapatan 1967]\n\nINCOME TAX ACT 1967\nINCOME TAX (DEDUCTION FOR PROMOTION OF INTERNATIONAL OR PRIVATE\nSCHOOL) RULES 2012\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by paragraph 154(1) (b) read together with\nparagraph 33(1) (d) of the Income Tax Act 1967 [ Act 53 ], the Minister makes the\nfollowing rules:\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-16"};
  FT["MY-H830"] = {"id":"MY-H830","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 110/2013&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2013年公司（附表修正）令","en":"COMPANIES (AMENDMENT OF SCHEDULE) ORDER 2013","orig":"COMPANIES (AMENDMENT OF SCHEDULE) ORDER 2013","ms":"Perintah Syarikat (Pindaan Jadual) 2013","vi":"Lệnh về Công ty (Sửa đổi phụ lục) năm 2013","th":"คำสั่งบริษัท (การแก้ไขภาคผนวก) ค.ศ. 2013","id":"Perintah Perusahaan (Perubahan Lampiran) Tahun 2013"},"level":"regulation","category":"02_民商事与经济法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA110","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2013","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\02_民商事与经济法\\2013_P.U.(A)110-2013_COMPANIES (AMENDMENT OF SCHEDULE) ORDER 2013.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H830-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1.  (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Syarikat (Pindaan Jadual)\n\n(2) Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 1 April 2013.\n\nPindaan Jadual Kedua"}},{"id":"MY-H830-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2.  Jadual Kedua kepada Akta Syarikat 1965 [Akta 125] dipinda—\n\n(a) dalam butiran 3(i), dengan menggantikan perkataan \"RM100,000\" dengan\nperkataan \"RM400,000\"; dan\n\n(b) dalam butiran  3(ii), dengan menggantikan perkataan \"RM100,000\"\ndengan perkataan \"RM400,000\".\n\nDibuat 26 Mac 2013\n[KPDN(BUU)(PU2)26/5/40; PN(PU2)4/VIII]\n\nDATO' SRI ISMAIL SABRI BIN YAAKOB\n   Menteri Perdagangan Dalam Negeri,\n           Koperasi dan Kepenggunaan\n\nCOMPANIES ACT 1965\n\nCOMPANIES (AMENDMENT OF SCHEDULE) ORDER 2013\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 374 of the Companies Act 1965 [Act 125],\nthe Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-16"};
  FT["MY-H831"] = {"id":"MY-H831","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 110/2014&status=PINDAAN","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2014年人力资源发展机构（附表一修正）令","en":"PEMBANGUNAN SUMBER MANUSIA BERHAD (AMENDMENT OF FIRST SCHEDULE) ORDER 2014","orig":"PEMBANGUNAN SUMBER MANUSIA BERHAD (AMENDMENT OF FIRST SCHEDULE) ORDER 2014","ms":"Perintah Perbadanan Pembangunan Sumber Manusia (Pindaan Jadual Pertama) 2014","vi":"Lệnh về Tổng công ty Phát triển Nguồn nhân lực (Sửa đổi Phụ lục thứ nhất) năm 2014","th":"คำสั่งองค์การพัฒนาทรัพยากรมนุษย์ (การแก้ไขภาคผนวกแรก) ค.ศ. 2014","id":"Perintah Perusahaan Pengembangan Sumber Daya Manusia (Perubahan Lampiran Pertama) Tahun 2014"},"level":"regulation","category":"05_其他及未分类","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA110","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2014","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\05_其他及未分类\\2014_P.U.(A)110-2014_PEMBANGUNAN SUMBER MANUSIA BERHAD (AMENDMENT OF FIRST SCHEDULE) ORDER 2014.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H831-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Pembangunan Sumber\n\nManusia Berhad (Pindaan Jadual Pertama) 2014.\n\n (2) Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 21 April 2014.\n\nPindaan Jadual Pertama"}},{"id":"MY-H831-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Jadual Pertama kepada Akta Pembangunan Sumber Manusia Berhad 2001\n\ndipinda—\n\n(a) dalam Bahagian I, dalam perenggan \"A. Sektor Perkilangan\",\n\ndengan memasukkan selepas subperenggan (2) subperenggan yang\n\nberikut:\n\n\"(3) Perubahan bilangan pekerja\n\nSekiranya bilangan pekerja bagi majikan di bawah\n\nsubperenggan A(1) menjadi kurang daripada lima puluh orang\n\natau modal berbayar bagi majikan di bawah subperenggan A(2)\n\nmenjadi kurang daripada dua juta lima ratus ribu ringgit, kadar\n\nlevi yang dikenakan hendaklah kekal pada satu peratus daripada\n\nupah bulanan setiap pekerja itu.\";\n\n(b) dalam Bahagian I, dalam perenggan \"B. Sektor Perkhidmatan\"—\n\n(i) dalam subperenggan (1)—\n\n(A) dengan menggantikan butiran (iii) dengan butiran yang\n\nberikut:\n\n\"(iii) Pengusahaan pelancongan, iaitu apa-apa aktiviti\n\nyang melibatkan perniagaan, pengendalian atau\n\npengurusan pelancongan dalam negeri atau ke luar\n\nnegeri atau apa-apa perniagaan agensi\n\npengembaraan mengikut pengertian Akta Industri\n\nPelancongan 1992 [Akta 482];\";\n\n(B) dengan menggantikan butiran (xiia) dengan butiran yang\n\nberikut:\n\n\"(xiia) Pengangkutan darat perdagangan, iaitu penyediaan\n\nperkhidmatan pengangkutan awam darat\n\n(tidak termasuk perkhidmatan pengangkutan\n\nkereta api), terminal, kemudahan, rangkaian, sistem,\n\npengendalian dan perkhidmatan lain yang berkaitan\n\ndengan pengangkutan awam darat atau\n\nperkhidmatan pengangkutan awam darat itu,\n\ntermasuk penyediaan kenderaan perkhidmatan\n\nawam dan kenderaan barangan bagi mengangkut\n\npenumpang atau barangan iaitu bas, bas carter,\n\nbas ekspres, bas pengantara, bas mini, bas\n\nberhenti-henti, bas sekolah, bas persiaran, bas\n\nlapangan terbang, bas pekerja, teksi lapangan\n\nterbang, kereta sewa, teksi mewah, teksi, dan kereta\n\nsewa dan pandu bagi pelancong;\";\n\n(C) dalam butiran (xxi), dengan mengantikan noktah di hujung\n\nbutiran itu dengan koma bernoktah; dan\n\n(D) dengan memasukkan selepas butiran (xxi) butiran yang\n\nberikut:\n\n\"(xxii) Perbekalan gas, wap dan pendingin udara, iaitu\n\npengumpulan, pembekalan, pengagihan atau\n\npenyediaan gas, wap dan pendingin udara termasuk\n\npengagihan bahan api berunsur gas melalui saluran\n\nutama, pengumpulan dan pengagihan wap dan air\n\npanas bagi maksud pemanasan, tenaga atau maksud\n\nlain, pengagihan udara dingin atau air yang\n\ndisejukkan bagi maksud pendinginan, dan\n\npembekalan ais bagi maksud makanan dan bukan\n\nmakanan atau bagi maksud pendinginan;\n\n(xxiii) Perawatan dan pembekalan air, iaitu proses\n\nperawatan air daripada pelbagai sumber dan\n\npembekalan atau pengagihan air melalui pelbagai\n\ncara bagi keperluan domestik dan industri;\n\n(xxiv) Pembetungan, iaitu apa-apa aktiviti yang melibatkan\n\npenyediaan, penyenggaraan atau pengendalian\n\nsistem pembetungan atau kemudahan rawatan\n\nkumbahan termasuk penakungan dan rawatan air\n\nbuangan dari kawasan kediaman atau perindustrian\n\nyang dibawa melalui apa-apa cara jua bagi maksud\n\npelambakan, pelupusan atau penukaran kepada\n\nbentuk bukan toksik;\n\n(xxv) Perkhidmatan pengurusan sisa dan pemulihan\n\nsemula bahan, iaitu apa-apa aktiviti yang melibatkan\n\npengumpulan, rawatan atau pelupusan bahan sisa\n\npepejal, cecair atau bergas yang dibuang, ditolak,\n\ntidak dikehendaki atau ditinggalkan untuk diguna\n\nsemula, dikitar semula, diproses semula, dipulih\n\nsemula atau ditulenkan melalui suatu proses yang\n\nberasingan termasuk aktiviti pemulihan dan\n\nperkhidmatan pengurusan sisa yang lain;\n\n(xxvi) Penerbitan wayang gambar, video dan program\n\ntelevisyen, rakaman bunyi dan penerbitan muzik,\n\niaitu apa-apa perniagaan atau aktiviti mengenai\n\napa-apa perihalan yang melibatkan—\n\n(A) pembuatan atau penerbitan wayang gambar,\n\nfilem, video dan program televisyen atau\n\niklan komersial;\n\n(B) aktiviti pascapenerbitan filem, video dan\n\nprogram televisyen, atau iklan komersial\n\nuntuk radio, televisyen atau filem;\n\n(C) aktiviti pengedaran atau aktiviti bagi\n\nmendapatkan hak pengedaran filem,\n\npita video, DVD atau penerbitan yang\n\nseumpamanya bagi maksud komersial;\n\n(D) aktiviti penayangan wayang gambar atau\n\npita video;\n\n(E) penerbitan rakaman induk (bunyi) asal,\n\nperkhidmatan rakaman bunyi dan\n\nperkhidmatan yang berkaitan; atau\n\n(F) aktiviti penerbitan muzik dan\n\nperkhidmatan yang berkaitan;\n\n(xxvii) Perkhidmatan maklumat, iaitu penyediaan dan\n\npembekalan data, pengetahuan atau maklumat\n\nkepada pelanggan bagi maksud komersial termasuk\n\npenyediaan perkhidmatan memproses data dan\n\nperkhidmatan pengehosan, perkhidmatan portal\n\nweb, perkhidmatan agensi berita dan sindiket\n\nberita, dan perkhidmatan yang berkaitan;\n\n(xxviii) Perkhidmatan bangunan dan landskap, iaitu\n\napa-apa perniagaan atau aktiviti yang melibatkan\n\npengurusan, penyenggaraan, penjagaan atau\n\npembersihan bangunan, landskap, kelengkapan\n\nenjin, jentera atau pembersihan perindustrian yang\n\nlain;\n\n(xxix) Perkhidmatan pengurusan acara, iaitu apa-apa\n\nperniagaan atau aktiviti mengenai apa-apa perihalan\n\nyang melibatkan pengurusan, promosi atau\n\npenganjuran konvensyen, pameran perniagaan atau\n\nperdagangan, atau acara awam atau persendirian;\n\n(xxx) Pendidikan awal kanak-kanak, iaitu penyediaan\n\npenjagaan atau pendidikan awal kepada\n\nkanak-kanak berumur di bawah enam tahun oleh\n\ntaman bimbangan kanak-kanak dan taman didikan\n\nkanak-kanak termasuk penyediaan pendidikan khas\n\nuntuk kanak-kanak kurang upaya pada peringkat ini\n\ntetapi tidak termasuk penjagaan atau pendidikan\n\nawal kanak-kanak yang disediakan oleh taman\n\nbimbingan kanak-kanak atau taman didikan\n\nkanak-kanak yang dimiliki atau yang dikendalikan\n\noleh mana-mana jabatan atau agensi Kerajaan\n\nPersekutuan atau Kerajaan Negeri, atau oleh\n\nmana-mana badan berkanun;\n\n(xxxi) Perkhidmatan sokongan kesihatan, iaitu apa-apa\n\nperniagaan atau aktiviti yang melibatkan\n\nperkhidmatan makmal perubatan atau kesihatan,\n\npusat dialisis, pusat fisioterapi atau terapi pekerjaan,\n\nakupuntur, atau ahli herba dan homeopati, tetapi\n\ntidak termasuk—\n\n(A) aktiviti hospital dan rumah bersalin;\n\n(B) aktiviti amalan perubatan am atau pergigian;\n\n(C) aktiviti penjagaan di rumah;\n\n(D) perkhidmatan jagaan kesihatan yang\n\ndisediakan oleh jururawat, bidan,\n\nahli krioterapi, tukang urut tradisional,\n\npengamal Ayurveda atau pengamal\n\nperubatan alternatif lain, atau pengamal\n\nparamedikal;\n\n(E) perkhidmatan ambulan; dan\n\n(F) perkhidmatan jagaan kesihatan swasta lain\n\nmengikut pengertian Akta Kemudahan dan\n\nPerkhidmatan Jagaan Kesihatan Swasta 1998\n\n[Akta 586];\n\n(xxxii) Francais, iaitu berhubung dengan perniagaan\n\nfrancais, apa-apa jenis perniagaan atau aktiviti yang\n\nmelibatkan perjanjian francais atau yang melibatkan\n\npembelian hak untuk menjual atau mengedar\n\nproduk, perkhidmatan, maklumat, teknik atau harta\n\nintelek tertentu oleh pemegang francais daripada\n\npemberi francais. Perkataan \"francais\" mempunyai\n\nerti yang diberikan kepadanya dalam Akta Francais\n\n1998 [Akta 590];\n\n(xxxiii)Penjualan dan pembaikan kenderaan bermotor, iaitu\n\nperdagangan atau penjualan, sama ada secara\n\nborong atau runcit, apa-apa jenis kenderaan\n\nbermotor atau komponen kenderaan bermotor oleh\n\npengilang, pembekal, pemborong, peruncit atau ejen\n\ndan penyediaan perkhidmatan yang bersampingan\n\ndengan penjualan kenderaan bermotor atau\n\nkomponen kenderaan bermotor itu atau penyediaan\n\nperkhidmatan selepas jualan secara berkala,\n\ntermasuk penyenggaraan atau pembaikan, semasa\n\natau selepas sesuatu kenderaan bermotor atau\n\nkomponen kenderaan bermotor dijual;\n\n(xxxiv)Perkhidmatan penyiaran swasta, iaitu apa-apa\n\naktiviti bagi mencipta kandungan atau mendapatkan\n\nhak untuk mengedarkan kandungan bagi rancangan\n\nradio, televisyen atau rancangan kabel dan\n\npenyiaran kandungan itu kepada umum;\n\n(xxxv) Sekolah memandu, iaitu apa-apa aktiviti yang\n\nmelibatkan penyediaan perkhidmatan oleh sesuatu\n\nsekolah memandu atau institut memandu;\n\n(xxxvi)Perkhidmatan veterinar, iaitu penyediaan\n\nperkhidmatan pengawalan dan penjagaan kesihatan\n\nuntuk haiwan ternakan atau peliharaan oleh doktor\n\nveterinar atau pekerja veterinar termasuk—\n\n(A) pemeriksaan klinikopatologi dan diagnosis;\n\n(B) diagnosis, penyembuhan, peringanan,\n\nrawatan atau pencegahan apa-apa penyakit,\n\nkecacatan, luka atau kecederaan pada\n\nhaiwan;\n\n(C) perkhidmatan ambulan haiwan; dan\n\n(D) perkhidmatan ujian spesimen haiwan.\n\nPerkataan \"perkhidmatan veterinar\" hendaklah\n\ntermasuk kesemua aktiviti atau perkhidmatan yang\n\ndisediakan oleh klinik haiwan, pusat veterinar atau\n\nhospital veterinar.\";\n\n(ii) dalam subperenggan (2), dalam teks bahasa kebangsaan, dengan\n\nmenggantikan perkataan \"majikan dengan lima sepuluh\" dengan\n\nperkataan \"majikan yang mempunyai lima puluh\"; dan\n\n(iii) dengan memasukkan selepas subperenggan (2) subperenggan\n\nyang berikut:\n\nKelas Majikan\n\n\"(3) Majikan yang\n\nmempunyai tiga\n\npuluh orang\n\nIndustri\n\nPerkhidmatan makanan dan\n\nminuman, iaitu apa-apa\n\nperniagaan atau aktiviti\n\npekerja atau lebih mengenai apa-apa perihalan\n\nyang melibatkan\n\nperkhidmatan bekalan\n\nmakanan atau minuman\n\nuntuk pelanggan atau untuk\n\nsuatu acara (tetapi tidak\n\ntermasuk aktiviti\n\npengilangan makanan dan\n\nminuman).\n\n(4) Perubahan bilangan pekerja\n\nSekiranya bilangan pekerja bagi majikan di bawah\n\nsubperenggan B(2) menjadi kurang daripada lima\n\npuluh orang atau bilangan pekerja bagi majikan di\n\nbawah subperenggan B(3) menjadi kurang daripada\n\ntiga puluh orang, kadar levi yang dikenakan hendaklah\n\nkekal pada satu peratus daripada upah bulanan setiap\n\npekerja itu.\";\n\n(c) dalam Bahagian I, dengan menggantikan perenggan \"C. Perubahan\n\nbilangan perkerja\" dengan perenggan yang berikut:\n\nKelas Majikan Industri\n\n\"C. Sektor Perlombongan dan Pengkuarian\n\n(1) Majikan yang\n\nmempunyai lima\n\npuluh orang pekerja\n\natau lebih\n\nPerlombongan dan\n\npengkuarian, iaitu apa-apa\n\nperniagaan atau aktiviti yang\n\nmelibatkan proses\n\npengekstrakan mineral yang\n\nterjadi secara semula jadi\n\nsebagai pepejal, cecair atau gas\n\ntermasuklah—\n\n(A) perlombongan batu\n\narang keras dan lignit\n\n(batu arang coklat atau\n\nperang), bijih besi, bijih\n\nlogam bukan besi, atau\n\nmineral kimia dan baja;\n\n(B) perlombongan atau\n\npengkuarian bahan\n\npelelas, asbestos, mil\n\nfosil bersilikon, grafit\n\nsemula jadi, steatit\n\n(talkum), batu permata,\n\nasfalt semula jadi,\n\nasfaltit dan batu\n\nberasfalt, bitumen\n\npepejal semula jadi,\n\nkuartza dan mika;\n\n(C) pengekstrakan minyak\n\npetroleum mentah, syal\n\nbitumen atau syal\n\nminyak dan pasir tar,\n\ngas asli, kondensat,\n\nhidrokarbon cecair,\n\nmetana, etana, butana\n\natau propana;\n\n(D) pengekstrakan dan\n\npenggumpulan tanah\n\ngambut dan\n\ngaram, termasuk\n\npengekstrakan garam\n\nmelalui penyejatan air\n\nlaut atau air masin lain;\n\n(E) pengkuarian batu, pasir\n\ndan tanah liat; atau\n\n(F) perkhidmatan sokongan\n\nkhusus perlombongan\n\natau pengkuarian yang\n\ndisediakan berdasarkan\n\nfi atau kontrak.\n\n(2) Majikan yang\n\nmempunyai sepuluh\n\norang pekerja atau\n\nlebih tetapi kurang\n\ndaripada lima puluh\n\norang pekerja dan\n\nmempunyai modal\n\nberbayar sebanyak\n\ndua juta lima ratus\n\nribu ringgit\n\n(RM2,500,000) dan\n\nke atas\n\n(3) Perubahan bilangan pekerja\n\nSekiranya bilangan pekerja bagi majikan di bawah\n\nsubperenggan C(1) menjadi kurang daripada lima puluh\n\norang atau modal berbayar bagi majikan di bawah\n\nsubperenggan C(2) menjadi kurang daripada dua juta\n\nlima ratus ribu ringgit, kadar levi yang dikenakan\n\nhendaklah kekal pada satu peratus daripada upah\n\nbulanan setiap pekerja itu.\"; dan\n\n(d) dengan menggantikan Bahagian II dengan Bahagian yang berikut:\n\n\"BAHAGIAN II\n\nKelas Majikan Industri\n\nMajikan yang mempunyai\n\nsepuluh orang pekerja atau\n\nlebih tetapi kurang daripada\n\nlima puluh orang pekerja dan\n\nmempunyai modal berbayar\n\nsebanyak kurang daripada dua\n\njuta lima ratus ribu ringgit\n\n(RM2,500,000)\n\n(i) Pengilangan, iaitu pembuatan\n\natau pemprosesan sesuatu\n\nbarang dengan\n\nmenggunakan buruh atau\n\nmesin atau kedua-duanya,\n\ntermasuk mengubah bahagian\n\natau komponen kepada barang\n\nlain yang mempunyai sifat atau\n\nciri yang berbeza melalui\n\npengubahan, pengadunan,\n\npenghiasan, pengemasan atau\n\nselainnya mengawet atau\n\nmenyesuaikan apa-apa barang\n\natau bahan supaya ia dapat\n\ndigunakan, dijual, diangkut,\n\ndihantar atau dilupuskan,\n\ntermasuk pembinaan kapal atau\n\npemasangan bahagian-bahagian\n\nkapal;\n\n(ii) Perlombongan dan pengkuarian,\n\niaitu apa-apa perniagaan atau\n\naktiviti yang melibatkan proses\n\npengekstrakan mineral yang\n\nterjadi secara semula jadi sebagai\n\npepejal, cecair atau gas\n\ntermasuklah—\n\n(A) perlombongan batu\n\narang keras dan lignit\n\n(batu arang coklat atau\n\nperang), bijih besi, bijih\n\nlogam bukan besi, atau\n\nmineral kimia dan baja;\n\n(B) perlombongan atau\n\npengkuarian bahan\n\npelelas, asbestos, mil\n\nfosil bersilikon, grafit\n\nsemula jadi, steatit\n\n(talkum), batu permata,\n\nasfalt semula jadi, asfaltit\n\ndan batu berasfalt,\n\nbitumen pepejal\n\nsemula jadi, kuartza dan\n\nmika;\n\n(C) pengekstrakan minyak\n\npetroleum mentah, syal\n\nbitumen atau syal minyak\n\ndan pasir tar, gas asli,\n\nkondensat, hidrokarbon\n\ncecair, metana,\n\netana, butana atau\n\npropana;\n\n(D) pengekstrakan dan\n\npenggumpulan tanah\n\ngambut dan garam,\n\ntermasuk pengekstrakan\n\ngaram melalui penyejatan\n\nair laut atau air masin\n\nlain;\n\n(E) pengkuarian batu, pasir\n\ndan tanah liat; atau\n\n(F) perkhidmatan sokongan\n\nkhusus perlombongan\n\natau pengkuarian yang\n\ndisediakan berdasarkan fi\n\natau kontrak.\".\n\nDibuat 16 April 2014\n\n[KSM/PUU/(S)/600-1/2/8/10; PN(PU2)616/III]\n\nDATO' SRI RICHARD RIOT ANAK JAEM\n\n Menteri Sumber Manusia\n\nPEMBANGUNAN SUMBER MANUSIA BERHAD ACT 2001\n\nPEMBANGUNAN SUMBER MANUSIA BERHAD (AMENDMENT OF\n\nFIRST SCHEDULE) ORDER 2014\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by section 49 of the Pembangunan Sumber Manusia\n\nBerhad Act 2001 [Act 612], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-16"};
  FT["MY-H832"] = {"id":"MY-H832","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 110/2015&status=AMENDMENT","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2015年关税税则（豁免）（修正）（第2号）令","en":"CUSTOMS DUTIES (EXEMPTION) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 2) ORDER 2015","orig":"CUSTOMS DUTIES (EXEMPTION) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 2) ORDER 2015","ms":"Perintah Duti Kastam (Pengecualian) (Pindaan) (Bilangan 2) 2015","vi":"Lệnh về Thuế quan (Miễn trừ) (Sửa đổi) (số 2) năm 2015","th":"คำสั่งอากรศุลกากร (การยกเว้น) (การแก้ไข) (ฉบับที่ 2) ค.ศ. 2015","id":"Perintah Bea Masuk (Pembebasan) (Perubahan) (Nomor 2) Tahun 2015"},"level":"regulation","category":"03_涉外投资与贸易","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA110","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2015","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\03_涉外投资与贸易\\2015_P.U.(A)110-2015_CUSTOMS DUTIES (EXEMPTION) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 2) ORDER 2015.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H832-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Duti Kastam (Pengecualian)\n(Pindaan) (No. 2) 2015.\n\n(2) Perintah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 11 Jun 2015.\n\nPindaan Jadual"}},{"id":"MY-H832-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Perintah Duti Kastam (Pengecualian) 2013 [P.U. (A) 371/2013] dipinda dalam\nBahagian I Jadual , berhubung dengan butiran 100, dalam ruang ( 3) dengan memotong\nperkataan \" 7213.10 000, 7213.20 000, 7213.91 000, 7213.99 000, 7214.10 210,\n7214.10 290, 7214.10 910, 7214.20 210, 7214.20 290, 7214.20 910, 7214.30 100,\n7214.30 900, 7214.91 200, 7214.99 210, 7214.99 290, 7214.99 910,\".\n\nDibuat 1 Jun 2015\n[SULIT KE.HT(96)669/13-66 Klt.8 Sk.8; Perb.0.3865/318(SJ.3)(SK.1);\nPN(PU2)338/XXXIV]\n\nDATO' SERI AHMAD HUSNI BIN MOHAMAD HANADZLAH\nMenteri Kewangan Kedua\n\nCUSTOMS ACT 1967\n\nCUSTOMS DUTIES (EXEMPTION) (AMENDMENT) (NO. 2) ORDER 2015\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 14(1) of the Customs Act 1967\n[Act 235], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-16"};
  FT["MY-H833"] = {"id":"MY-H833","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 110/2016&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2016年印刷机与出版物（不良出版物管制）（第8号）令","en":"PRINTING PRESSES AND PUBLICATIONS (CONTROL OF UNDESIRABLE PUBLICATIONS) (NO. 8) ORDER 2016","orig":"PRINTING PRESSES AND PUBLICATIONS (CONTROL OF UNDESIRABLE PUBLICATIONS) (NO. 8) ORDER 2016","ms":"Perintah Mesin Cetak dan Penerbitan (Kawalan Penerbitan Tidak Diingini) (Bilangan 8) 2016","vi":"Lệnh về Máy in và ấn phẩm (Kiểm soát ấn phẩm không mong muốn) (số 8) năm 2016","th":"คำสั่งแท่นพิมพ์และสิ่งพิมพ์ (การควบคุมสิ่งพิมพ์ที่ไม่พึงประสงค์) (ฉบับที่ 8) ค.ศ. 2016","id":"Perintah Mesin Cetak dan Penerbitan (Pengendalian Terbitan Tidak Diinginkan) (Nomor 8) Tahun 2016"},"level":"regulation","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA110","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2016","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）；已清除正文中的 2 个控制字符（C0/C1 区，法律文本中无合法用途，系 PDF 抽取/表单域残留）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\2016_P.U.(A)110-2016_PRINTING PRESSES AND PUBLICATIONS (CONTROL OF UNDESIRABLE PUBLICATIONS) (NO. 8) ORDER 2016.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H833-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. Perintah ini bolehlah dinamakan Perintah Mesin Cetak dan Penerbitan\n\n(Kawalan Hasil Penerbitan Tidak Diingini) (No. 8) 2016.\n\nLarangan"}},{"id":"MY-H833-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Pencetakan, pengimportan, penghasilan, penghasilan semula, penerbitan,\n\npenjualan, pengeluaran, pengelilingan, pengedaran atau pemilikan hasil penerbitan\n\nyang diperihalkan dalam Jadual yang mungkin memudaratkan ketenteraman awam,\n\nyang mungkin menggemparkan fikiran orang ramai dan yang mungkin memudaratkan\n\nkepentingan awam adalah dilarang secara mutlak di seluruh Malaysia.\n\nJADUAL\n\nTajuk Hasil\n\nPenerbitan\n\nPengarang/\n\nPenterjemah\n\nPenerbit Pencetak Bahasa\n\nTafsir Ayat-Ayat\n\nKematian\n\nMuhammad\n\nHusain al-Hasani\n\nal-Husaini athThabathaba'i\n\n(Alamah\n\nThabathaba'i)/\n\nIrwan\n\nKurniawan\n\nPUSTAKA HIDAYAH\n\nAnggota Ikatan\n\nPenerbit Indonesia\n\n(IKAPI)\n\nJl. Rereng Adumanis\n\n31, Sukaluyu,\n\nBandung 40123,\n\nJawa Barat,\n\nIndonesia\n\n- Indonesia\n\nDibuat 5 Februari 2016\n\n[KDN:PQ(S)600-2/1 Jld.2(24); PN(PU2)417/XVI]\n\n DATO' SERI DR. AHMAD ZAHID BIN HAMIDI\n\n Menteri Dalam Negeri\n\nPRINTING PRESSES AND PUBLICATIONS ACT 1984\n\nPRINTING PRESSES AND PUBLICATIONS\n\n(CONTROL OF UNDESIRABLE PUBLICATIONS) (NO. 8) ORDER 2016\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by subsection 7(1) of the Printing Presses and\n\nPublications Act 1984 [Act 301], the Minister makes the following order:\n\nCitation\n\n1. This order may be cited as the Printing Presses and Publications\n\n(Control of Undesirable Publications) (No. 8) Order 2016.\n\nProhibition\n\n2. The printing, importation, production, reproduction, publishing, sale, issue,\n\ncirculation, distribution or possession of the publication described in the Schedule\n\nwhich is likely to be prejudicial to public order, which is likely to alarm public opinion\n\nand which is likely to be prejudicial to public interest is absolutely prohibited\n\nthroughout Malaysia.\n\nSCHEDULE\n\nTitle of\n\nPublication\n\nAuthor /\n\nTranslator\n\nPublisher Printer Language\n\nTafsir Ayat-Ayat\n\nKematian\n\nMuhammad\n\nHusain al-Hasani\n\nal-Husaini athThabathaba'i\n\n(Alamah\n\nThabathaba'i)/\n\nIrwan\n\nKurniawan\n\nPUSTAKA HIDAYAH\n\nAnggota Ikatan\n\nPenerbit Indonesia\n\n(IKAPI)\n\nJl. Rereng Adumanis\n\n31, Sukaluyu,\n\nBandung 40123,\n\nJawa Barat,\n\nIndonesia\n\n- Indonesian\n\nMade 5 February 2016\n\n[KDN:PQ(S)600-2/1 Jld.2(24); PN(PU2)417/XVI]\n\n DATO' SERI DR. AHMAD ZAHID BIN HAMIDI\n\n Minister of Home Affairs"}}],"pack":"my-16"};
  FT["MY-H834"] = {"id":"MY-H834","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 110/2017&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":9,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2017年道路交通（记分）规则","en":"ROAD TRANSPORT (DEMERIT POINTS) RULES 2017","orig":"ROAD TRANSPORT (DEMERIT POINTS) RULES 2017","ms":"Kaedah Pengangkutan Jalan (Mata Demerit) 2017","vi":"Quy tắc về Vận tải đường bộ (Điểm trừ) năm 2017","th":"กฎการขนส่งทางถนน (คะแนนความประพฤติ) ค.ศ. 2017","id":"Tata Tertib Angkutan Jalan (Poin Demerit) Tahun 2017"},"level":"regulation","category":"04_劳工与行政法","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA110","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2017","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 9 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）；已清除正文中的 15 个控制字符（C0/C1 区，法律文本中无合法用途，系 PDF 抽取/表单域残留）。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\04_劳工与行政法\\2017_P.U.(A)110-2017_ROAD TRANSPORT (DEMERIT POINTS) RULES 2017.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H834-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1) Kaedah-kaedah ini bolehlah dinamakan Kaedah-Kaedah Pengangkutan\n\nJalan (Mata Demerit) 2017.\n\n(2) Kaedah-Kaedah ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 6 April 2017.\n\nTafsiran"}},{"id":"MY-H834-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. Dalam Kaedah-Kaedah ini, \"kesalahan berjadual\" ertinya mana-mana kesalahan\n\nyang dinyatakan dalam Jadual.\n\nPemakluman kepada Ketua Pengarah"}},{"id":"MY-H834-A3","no":3,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 3"},"text":{"ms":"3. (1) Jika seseorang pemegang lesen memandu—\n\n(a) telah disabitkan atas mana-mana kesalahan berjadual; atau\n\n(b) telah dikompaun bagi mana-mana kesalahan berjadual dan telah\n\nmembayar kompaun itu,\n\nKetua Pengarah hendaklah dimaklumkan mengenai butir-butir sabitan atau kompaun\n\nitu berkenaan dengan pemegang lesen memandu itu.\n\n(2) Pemakluman di bawah subkaedah (1) hendaklah dibuat oleh Pengarah,\n\nKetua Pegawai Polis, Dato Bandar, Perbadanan Putrajaya, Datuk Bandar Majlis\n\nBandaraya, Yang Dipertua Majlis Perbandaran, Pengerusi Majlis Perbandaran atau\n\nKetua Pengarah Lembaga Lebuhraya Malaysia, mengikut mana-mana yang berkenaan.\n\nPemberian mata demerit dan rekod"}},{"id":"MY-H834-A4","no":4,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 4"},"text":{"ms":"4. (1) Setelah menerima pemberitahuan di bawah kaedah 3, Ketua Pengarah\n\nhendaklah memberikan mata demerit sebagaimana yang dinyatakan dalam Jadual\n\nkepada pemegang lesen memandu itu.\n\n(2) Ketua Pengarah hendaklah merekodkan mata demerit yang diberikan\n\ndi bawah subkaedah (1) dalam daftar pemegang lesen memandu.\n\n(3) Mata demerit yang diberikan di bawah subkaedah (1) hendaklah mula\n\nberkuat kuasa dari tarikh kesalahan berjadual dilakukan.\n\nPenggantungan dan pembatalan lesen memandu selain lesen memandu\n\npercubaan"}},{"id":"MY-H834-A5","no":5,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 5"},"text":{"ms":"5. (1) Jika seseorang pemegang lesen memandu selain lesen memandu\n\npercubaan telah diberikan sejumlah dua puluh atau lebih mata demerit terkumpul,\n\nKetua Pengarah boleh menggantung lesen memandu pemegang lesen itu.\n\n(2) Penggantungan lesen memandu di bawah subkaedah (1) hendaklah—\n\n(a) dalam hal penggantungan pertama, selama suatu tempoh yang\n\ntidak kurang daripada enam bulan tetapi tidak lebih daripada\n\nlapan bulan;\n\n(b) dalam hal penggantungan kedua, selama suatu tempoh yang tidak\n\nkurang daripada lapan bulan tetapi tidak lebih daripada sepuluh\n\nbulan; dan\n\n(c) dalam hal penggantungan ketiga atau lebih, selama suatu tempoh\n\nyang tidak kurang daripada sepuluh bulan tetapi tidak lebih\n\ndaripada dua belas bulan.\n\n(3) Tertakluk kepada subkaedah (4), jika seorang pemegang lesen memandu\n\nyang telah diberikan mata demerit—\n\n(a) tidak disabitkan atas mana-mana kesalahan berjadual atau tidak\n\ndikompaun bagi mana-mana kesalahan berjadual selama tempoh\n\ndua belas bulan berturut-turut daripada tarikh terakhir orang itu\n\nmelakukan suatu kesalahan berjadual; dan\n\n(b) telah, jika dikehendaki oleh Ketua Pengarah, menghadiri kursus\n\npemulihan yang diluluskan oleh Ketua Pengarah,\n\nKetua Pengarah boleh memotong sejumlah tidak melebihi lima puluh peratus mata\n\ndemerit daripada jumah mata demerit terkumpul pemegang lesen memandu itu.\n\n(4) Perenggan (3)(a) tidak terpakai jika pemegang lesen memandu itu\n\nmelakukan mana-mana kesalahan berjadual dalam tempoh dua belas bulan\n\nberturut-turut yang disebut dalam perenggan itu tetapi dia hanya disabitkan atau\n\ndikompaun bagi kesalahan itu dan diberikan mata demerit selepas tempoh dua belas\n\nbulan berturut-turut itu.\n\n(5) Jika seseorang yang lesen memandunya digantung di bawah kaedah ini\n\ndiberikan mata demerit bagi kesalahan berjadual yang dilakukan semasa tempoh\n\npenggantungannya, mata demerit yang diberikan—\n\n(a) tidak boleh diambil kira bagi maksud pembatalan mata demerit\n\ndi akhir tempoh penggantungan; dan\n\n(b) tertakluk kepada subkaedah (6), akan, jika dikumpulkan sebanyak\n\ndua puluh mata demerit atau lebih, menjadikan lesen memandu\n\norang itu digantung selanjutnya oleh Ketua Pengarah mengikut\n\nsubkaedah (1).\n\n(6) Jika lesen memandu seseorang itu digantung di bawah kaedah ini untuk\n\nkali ketiga dalam tempoh lima tahun, Ketua Pengarah hendaklah membatalkan lesen\n\nmemandu orang itu.\n\nPembatalan lesen memandu percubaan"}},{"id":"MY-H834-A6","no":6,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 6"},"text":{"ms":"6. (1) Jika seorang pemegang lesen memandu percubaan telah diberikan dua\n\npuluh atau lebih mata demerit terkumpul, Ketua Pengarah hendaklah membatalkan\n\nlesen memandu percubaan orang itu.\n\n(2) Dalam hal jika seorang pemegang lesen memandu percubaan diberikan\n\nlesen memandu, apa-apa mata demerit yang diberikan kepada orang itu semasa orang\n\nitu memegang lesen memandu percubaan hendaklah kekal direkodkan atas namanya\n\ndalam daftar pemegang lesen memandu.\n\n(3) Jika seseorang yang telah diberi lesen memandu diberikan mata demerit\n\nbagi kesalahan berjadual yang dilakukan semasa orang itu memegang lesen memandu\n\npercubaan dan mata demerit itu akan, jika diambil kira dengan mata demerit yang\n\ndiberikan semasa orang itu memegang lesen memandu percubaan, terjumlah kepada\n\ndua puluh mata demerit atau lebih, Ketua Pengarah boleh membatalkan lesen memandu\n\nyang diberikan kepada orang itu.\n\n(4) Jika sesuatu lesen memandu percubaan dibatalkan di bawah kaedah ini,\n\nsetiap mata demerit yang diberikan kepada pemegang lesen memandu percubaan itu\n\nhendaklah dibatalkan.\n\nPenyerahan lesen memandu"}},{"id":"MY-H834-A7","no":7,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 7"},"text":{"ms":"7. (1) Mana-mana orang yang menerima notis secara bertulis bagi\n\npenggantungan atau pembatalan lesen memandu di bawah subseksyen 37(1) Akta\n\nhendaklah, dalam tempoh dua puluh satu hari dari tarikh penyampaian notis itu,\n\nmenyerahkan lesen memandunya di mana-mana cawangan Jabatan Pengangkutan Jalan\n\natau di mana-mana tempat lain yang diluluskan oleh Ketua Pengarah.\n\n(2) Penggantungan dan pembatalan suatu lesen memandu hendaklah mula\n\nberkuat kuasa pada tarikh penyerahan lesen memandu atau di akhir tempoh dua puluh\n\nsatu hari dari tarikh penyampaian notis, mengikut mana-mana yang terdahulu.\n\nKesan penggantungan dan pembatalan lesen memandu"}},{"id":"MY-H834-A8","no":8,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 8"},"text":{"ms":"8. (1) Mana-mana orang yang lesen memandunya digantung di bawah\n\nKaedah-Kaedah ini tidak boleh memandu suatu kenderaan motor di bawah apa-apa\n\nlesen memandu, termasuk lesen memandu yang dikeluarkan oleh mana-mana pihak\n\nberkuasa lain, atau mendapatkan lesen memandu sepanjang tempoh\n\npenggantungannya.\n\n(2) Mana-mana orang yang lesen memandunya dibatalkan di bawah\n\nKaedah-Kaedah ini tidak boleh memandu suatu kenderaan motor di bawah apa-apa\n\nlesen memandu, termasuk lesen memandu yang dikeluarkan oleh mana-mana pihak\n\nberkuasa lain, atau mendapatkan lesen memandu bagi tempoh dua belas bulan dari\n\ntarikh pembatalan lesen.\n\n(3) Walau apa pun kaedah ini, Ketua Pengarah boleh menolak atau\n\nmenggantung apa-apa urusan atau transaksi yang terpakai bagi orang itu di bawah\n\nAkta.\n\nPeruntukan peralihan"}},{"id":"MY-H834-A9","no":9,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 9"},"text":{"ms":"9. (1) Kaedah-Kaedah Kenderaan Motor (Mata Demerit) 1997\n\n[P.U. (A) 79/1997] (selepas ini disebut \"Kaedah-Kaedah yang dibatalkan\") dibatalkan.\n\n(2) Apa-apa mata demerit yang diberikan di bawah Kaedah-Kaedah yang\n\ndibatalkan hendaklah, pada tarikh permulaan kuat kuasa Kaedah-Kaedah ini, terbatal\n\ndan tidak boleh diambil kira dalam pengiraan mata demerit di bawah Kaedah-Kaedah\n\nini.\n\n(3) Apa-apa notis penggantungan yang dihantar di bawah Kaedah-Kaedah\n\nyang dibatalkan sebelum permulaan kuat kuasa Kaedah-Kaedah ini hendaklah terbatal\n\ndan tidak boleh diambil kira dalam pengiraan penggantungan selanjutnya atau\n\npembatalan di bawah Kaedah-Kaedah ini.\n\n(4) Apa-apa tempoh penggantungan di bawah Kaedah-Kaedah yang\n\ndibatalkan yang masih berkuat kuasa hendaklah, pada tarikh permulaan kuat kuasa\n\nKaedah-Kaedah ini, ditamatkan dan tidak boleh diambil kira dalam pengiraan\n\npenggantungan selanjutnya atau pembatalan di bawah Kaedah-Kaedah ini.\n\n(5) Apa-apa rekod yang dibuat di bawah Kaedah-Kaedah yang dibatalkan\n\nhendaklah, pada tarikh permulaan kuat kuasa Kaedah-Kaedah ini, terus disimpan di\n\nbawah Kaedah-Kaedah ini.\n\nJADUAL\n\n[Subkaedah 4(1)]\n\nKESALAHAN BERJADUAL DAN MATA DEMERIT\n\nBil. Kesalahan Perihalan kesalahan\n\nMata demerit yang\n\ndiberikan\n\nPemandu\n\nkenderaan\n\nmotor\n\nselain\n\nkenderaan\n\nbarangan\n\ndan bas\n\nPemandu\n\nkenderaan\n\nbarangan\n\ndan bas\n\n1. Subseksyen 43(1)\n\nAkta\n\nMemandu dengan tidak cermat\n\ndan tidak bertimbang rasa\n\n10 10\n\n2. Subseksyen 45(1)\n\nAkta\n\nMenjaga suatu kenderaan motor\n\nsemasa berada di bawah\n\npengaruh minuman yang\n\nmemabukkan atau dadah\n\n10 10\n\n3. Subseksyen 45A(1)\n\nAkta\n\nMemandu atau menjaga suatu\n\nkenderaan motor dengan\n\nkepekatan alkohol melebihi had\n\nyang ditetapkan\n\n10 10\n\n4. Subseksyen 45B(4)\n\nAkta\n\nTidak mengadakan spesimen\n\nnafas bagi ujian nafas apabila\n\ndikehendaki berbuat demikian\n\noleh pegawai polis\n\n10 10\n\nBil. Kesalahan Perihalan kesalahan\n\nMata demerit yang\n\ndiberikan\n\nPemandu\n\nkenderaan\n\nmotor\n\nselain\n\nkenderaan\n\nbarangan\n\ndan bas\n\nPemandu\n\nkenderaan\n\nbarangan\n\ndan bas\n\n5. Subseksyen 45C(6)\n\nAkta\n\nTidak mengadakan spesimen\n\nnafas bagi ujian nafas atau\n\nspesimen darah atau air kencing\n\nbagi ujian makmal apabila\n\ndikehendaki berbuat demikian\n\noleh pegawai polis\n\n10 10\n\n6. Kaedah 18 KaedahKaedah Lalu Lintas\n\nJalan 1959\n\n[L.N. 166/1959] atau\n\nsubkaedah 92(1)\n\nKaedah-Kaedah\n\nKenderaan Bermotor\n\n(Pembuatan dan\n\nPenggunaan) 1959\n\n[L.N. 170/1959]\n\nMemandu kenderaan barangan\n\nyang membawa muatan\n\nyang boleh mendatangkan\n\nbahaya atau berkemungkinan\n\nmenyebabkan bahaya\n\n7. Kaedah 21 KaedahKaedah Lalu Lintas\n\nJalan 1959 atau\n\nsubkaedah 92(2)\n\nKaedah-Kaedah\n\nMemandu kenderaan barangan\n\nyang membawa muatan yang\n\nmenjulur melebihi bahagian\n\nbelakang, hadapan atau tepi\n\nkenderaan barangan tanpa\n\nBil. Kesalahan Perihalan kesalahan\n\nMata demerit yang\n\ndiberikan\n\nPemandu\n\nkenderaan\n\nmotor\n\nselain\n\nkenderaan\n\nbarangan\n\ndan bas\n\nPemandu\n\nkenderaan\n\nbarangan\n\ndan bas\n\nKenderaan Bermotor\n\n(Pembuatan dan\n\nPenggunaan) 1959\n\nkebenaran terdahulu Ketua\n\nPengarah\n\n8. Kaedah 19 KaedahKaedah Lalu Lintas\n\nJalan 1959 atau\n\nkaedah 92A KaedahKaedah Kenderaan\n\nBermotor\n\n(Pembuatan dan\n\nPenggunaan) 1959\n\nMemandu kenderaan barangan\n\ndengan muatan yang terjatuh\n\natau dengan tumpahan daripada\n\nkenderaan barangan\n\n9. Kaedah 20 KaedahKaedah Lalu Lintas\n\nJalan 1959 atau\n\nkaedah 93 KaedahKaedah Kenderaan\n\nBermotor\n\n(Pembuatan dan\n\nPenggunaan) 1959\n\nMemandu kenderaan barangan\n\nyang tidak sesuai\n\nyang menyebabkan atau\n\nberkemungkinan menyebabkan\n\nbahaya\n\nBil. Kesalahan Perihalan kesalahan\n\nMata demerit yang\n\ndiberikan\n\nPemandu\n\nkenderaan\n\nmotor\n\nselain\n\nkenderaan\n\nbarangan\n\ndan bas\n\nPemandu\n\nkenderaan\n\nbarangan\n\ndan bas\n\n10. Subseksyen 79(1)\n\nAkta\n\nTidak mematuhi atau\n\nmengabaikan arahan pegawai\n\npolis, pegawai pengangkutan\n\njalan atau warden lalu lintas\n\ndalam mengawal selia lalu lintas\n\nsemasa memandu atau\n\nmendorongi kenderaan\n\n4 6\n\n11. Subseksyen 79(2)\n\nAkta\n\nTidak mematuhi atau\n\nmengabaikan petunjuk yang\n\ndiberi oleh isyarat lalu lintas\n\nyang berikut semasa memandu\n\natau mendorongi kenderaan:\n\n(a) isyarat merah;\n\n(b) isyarat berhenti pada\n\nsimpang jalan; atau\n\n(c) isyarat had laju dengan—\n\n(i) melebihi 40 km\n\nsejam;\n\nBil. Kesalahan Perihalan kesalahan\n\nMata demerit yang\n\ndiberikan\n\nPemandu\n\nkenderaan\n\nmotor\n\nselain\n\nkenderaan\n\nbarangan\n\ndan bas\n\nPemandu\n\nkenderaan\n\nbarangan\n\ndan bas\n\n(ii) melebihi 25 km ke\n\n40 km sejam; atau\n\n(iii) melebihi 1 km ke\n\n25 km sejam\n\n12. Subkaedah 17(1)\n\nKaedah-Kaedah\n\nIsyarat Lalu Lintas\n\n(Saiz, Warna dan\n\nJenis) 1959\n\n[L.N. 167/1959]\n\nTidak mematuhi isyarat merah 4 6\n\n13. Subseksyen 40(1)\n\nAkta\n\nMelebihi had laju yang\n\ndikenakan pada sesuatu\n\nkenderaan seperti yang berikut:\n\n(a) melebihi 40 km sejam;\n\n(b) melebihi 25 km ke 40 km\n\nsejam\n\n(c) melebihi 1 km ke 25 km\n\nsejam\n\nBil. Kesalahan Perihalan kesalahan\n\nMata demerit yang\n\ndiberikan\n\nPemandu\n\nkenderaan\n\nmotor\n\nselain\n\nkenderaan\n\nbarangan\n\ndan bas\n\nPemandu\n\nkenderaan\n\nbarangan\n\ndan bas\n\n14. Kaedah 17B KaedahKaedah Lalu Lintas\n\nJalan 1959 atau\n\nperenggan 12(3)(a)\n\natau 12(3)(b)\n\nKaedah-Kaedah\n\nIsyarat Lalu Lintas\n\n(Saiz, Warna dan\n\nJenis) 1959\n\nMemotong kenderaan di garisan\n\nberterusan\n\n4 6\n\n15. Kaedah 89 KaedahKaedah Kenderaan\n\nBermotor\n\n(Pembuatan dan\n\nPenggunaan) 1959\n\nMemandu kenderaan barangan\n\ndengan melebihi had berat\n\nmaksimum dengan muatan yang\n\ndibenarkan\n\n16. Kaedah 90 KaedahKaedah Kenderaan\n\nBermotor\n\n(Pembuatan dan\n\nPenggunaan) 1959\n\nMembawa orang dalam\n\nkenderaan perkhidmatan awam\n\nmelebihi bilangan orang yang\n\nditetapkan dalam apa-apa lesen\n\nyang sah atau perakuan\n\nkenderaan perkhidmatan awam\n\nBil. Kesalahan Perihalan kesalahan\n\nMata demerit yang\n\ndiberikan\n\nPemandu\n\nkenderaan\n\nmotor\n\nselain\n\nkenderaan\n\nbarangan\n\ndan bas\n\nPemandu\n\nkenderaan\n\nbarangan\n\ndan bas\n\n17. Kaedah 5 KaedahKaedah Lalu Lintas\n\nJalan 1959\n\nMemotong kenderaan motor di\n\nsebelah kiri\n\n4 6\n\n18. Subkaedah 53(1)\n\nKaedah-Kaedah Lalu\n\nLintas Jalan 1959\n\nMemandu, menunda, menolak,\n\nmeletakkan atau meninggalkan\n\ntanpa berjaga kenderaan\n\ndi lorong kecemasan\n\n4 6\n\n19. Kaedah 9 KaedahKaedah Lalu Lintas\n\nJalan 1959\n\nTidak memberi laluan kepada\n\nkenderaan yang mempunyai\n\nkeutamaan berbanding dengan\n\nlalu lintas lain\n\n3 5\n\n20. Subkaedah 17A(1)\n\nKaedah-Kaedah Lalu\n\nLintas Jalan 1959\n\nMenggunakan atau cuba untuk\n\nmenggunakan telefon bimbit\n\natau apa-apa kelengkapan\n\nkomunikasi lain dengan tidak\n\nmenggunakan alat bebas tangan\n\nsemasa memandu\n\n3 5\n\nBil. Kesalahan Perihalan kesalahan\n\nMata demerit yang\n\ndiberikan\n\nPemandu\n\nkenderaan\n\nmotor\n\nselain\n\nkenderaan\n\nbarangan\n\ndan bas\n\nPemandu\n\nkenderaan\n\nbarangan\n\ndan bas\n\n21. Kaedah 4A KaedahKaedah Lalu Lintas\n\nJalan 1959\n\nMemandu kenderaan barangan\n\natau kenderaan perkhidmatan\n\nawam secara berterusan di\n\nlorong paling kanan\n\n22. Kaedah 4 KaedahKaedah Kereta\n\nMotor (Talipinggang\n\nKeledar) 1978\n\n[P.U. (A) 378/1978]\n\nMemandu kenderaan motor\n\ntanpa memakai tali pinggang\n\nkeledar mengikut cara yang\n\ndikehendaki oleh jenis dan\n\nbinaan tali pinggang keledar itu\n\n3 3\n\n23. Kaedah 4 KaedahKaedah Motosikal\n\n(Topi Keledar) 1973\n\n[P.U. (A) 43/1973]\n\nMemandu motosikal tanpa\n\nmemakai topi keledar mengikut\n\ncara yang dikehendaki oleh jenis\n\ndan binaan topi keledar itu\n\n2 2\n\nNOTA:\n\nDalam Jadual ini—\n\n\"bas\"—\n\n(a) berhubung dengan Semenanjung Malaysia, mempunyai erti yang\n\ndiberikan kepadanya dalam Jadual Pertama kepada Akta Pengangkutan\n\nAwam Darat 2010 [Akta 715]; dan\n\n(b) berhubung dengan Sabah, Sarawak dan Wilayah Persekutuan Labuan,\n\nmempunyai erti yang diberikan kepadanya dalam Akta Lembaga\n\nPelesenan Kenderaan Perdagangan 1987 [Akta 334],\n\ndan termasuk bas persiaran.\n\n\"bas persiaran\"—\n\n(a) berhubung dengan Semenanjung Malaysia, mempunyai erti yang\n\ndiberikan kepadanya dalam Jadual Kedua kepada Akta Pengangkutan\n\nAwam Darat 2010; dan\n\n(b) berhubung dengan Sabah, Sarawak dan Wilayah Persekutuan Labuan,\n\nmempunyai erti yang diberikan kepadanya dalam Akta Lembaga\n\nPelesenan Kenderaan Perdagangan 1987 dan Akta Pelesenan Kenderaan\n\nPelancongan 1999 [Akta 594], mengikut mana-mana yang berkenaan.\n\nDibuat 5 April 2017\n\n[KP/BD/PJ/0.137/3; PN(PU2)460/LXXXIX]\n\nDATO' SERI LIOW TIONG LAI\n\nMenteri Pengangkutan\n\nROAD TRANSPORT ACT 1987\n\nROAD TRANSPORT (DEMERIT POINTS) RULES 2017\n\nIN exercise of the power conferred by subsections 35(2) and 35A(2) of\n\nthe Road Transport Act 1987 [Act 333], the Minister makes the following rules:\n\nCitation and commencement\n\n1. (1) These rules may be cited as the Road Transport (Demerit Points)\n\nRules 2017.\n\n(2) These Rules come into operation on 6 April 2017.\n\nInterpretation\n\n2. In these Rules, \"scheduled offence\" means any offence specified in the Schedule.\n\nNotification to Director General\n\n3. (1) Where a holder of a driving licence—\n\n(a) has been convicted of any scheduled offence; or\n\n(b) has been compounded for any scheduled offence and has paid that\n\ncompound,\n\nthe Director General shall be notified of the particulars of the conviction or compound in\n\nrespect of the holder of the driving licence.\n\n(2) The notification under subrule (1) shall be made by the Director, Chief\n\nPolice Officer, Dato Bandar, Perbadanan Putrajaya, Mayor of a City Council, President of\n\na Municipal Council, Chairman of a Municipal Council or Director General of the\n\nHighway Authority Malaysia, as the case may be.\n\nAward of demerit points and records\n\n4. (1) Upon receipt of notification under rule 3, the Director General shall award\n\ndemerit points as set out in the Schedule against the holder of the driving licence.\n\n(2) The Director General shall record the demerit points awarded under\n\nsubrule (1) in the register of holders of driving licences.\n\n(3) The demerit points awarded under subrule (1) shall take effect from the\n\ndate of the commission of the scheduled offence.\n\nSuspension and revocation of driving licence other than probationary driving\n\nlicence\n\n5. (1) Where a holder of a driving licence other than probationary driving\n\nlicence has been awarded a total number of twenty or more accumulated demerit\n\npoints, the Director General may suspend the driving licence of the holder of the driving\n\nlicence.\n\n(2) The suspension of a driving licence under subrule (1) shall be—\n\n(a) in the case of first suspension, for a period of not less than six\n\nmonths but not more than eight months;\n\n(b) in the case of second suspension, for a period of not less than eight\n\nmonths but not more than ten months; and\n\n(c) in the case of third suspension or more, for a period of not less\n\nthan ten months but not more than twelve months.\n\n(3) Subject to subrule (4), if a holder of a driving licence who has been\n\nawarded demerit points\n\n(a) is not convicted of any scheduled offence or has not been\n\ncompounded for any scheduled offence for a period of twelve\n\nconsecutive months from the date of his last commission of a\n\nscheduled offence; and\n\n(b) has, if required by the Director General, attended a rehabilitation\n\ncourse as approved by the Director General,\n\nthe Director General may deduct a total of not exceeding fifty percent of the demerit\n\npoints from the total demerit points accumulated by the holder of the driving licence.\n\n(4) Paragraph (3)(a) shall not apply if the holder of a driving licence commits\n\nany scheduled offence during the period of twelve consecutive months referred to in\n\nthat paragraph but he is only convicted of or compounded for that offence and awarded\n\ndemerit points after that period of twelve consecutive months.\n\n(5) Where a person whose driving licence is suspended under this rule is\n\nawarded demerit points for a scheduled offence committed during the period of\n\nsuspension, the demerit points awarded—\n\n(a) shall not be taken into account for the purpose of cancellation of\n\ndemerit points at the end of the period of suspension; and\n\n(b) subject to subrule (6), would, if accumulated to twenty demerit\n\npoints or more, render his driving licence to be further suspended\n\nby the Director General in accordance with subrule (1).\n\n(6) Where a person's driving licence is suspended under this rule for the\n\nthird time in a period of five years, the Director General shall revoke the person's\n\ndriving licence.\n\nRevocation of probationary driving licence\n\n6. (1) Where a holder of a probationary driving licence has been awarded a total\n\nnumber of twenty or more accumulated demerit points, the Director General shall\n\nrevoke the person's probationary driving licence.\n\n(2) In the case where a holder of a probationary driving licence is granted a\n\ndriving licence, any demerit points awarded against him when he was holding the\n\nprobationary licence shall remain recorded as against his name in the register of\n\nholders of driving licences.\n\n(3) Where a person who has been granted a driving licence is awarded\n\ndemerit points for a scheduled offence committed when he was holding a probationary\n\ndriving licence and the demerit points would, if taken into account with the demerit\n\npoints awarded when he was holding the probationary driving licence, amount to\n\ntwenty demerit points or more, the Director General may revoke the driving licence\n\ngranted to the person.\n\n(4) Where a probationary driving licence is revoked under this rule, every\n\ndemerit point awarded against the holder of the probationary licence shall be cancelled.\n\nSurrender of driving licence\n\n7. (1) Any person who receives a notice in writing of a suspension or revocation\n\nof a driving licence under subsection 37(1) of the Act shall, within twenty-one days from\n\nthe date of service of the notice, surrender the driving licence at any branch of the Road\n\nTransport Department or at any other places approved by the Director General.\n\n(2) The suspension or revocation of a driving licence shall take effect on the\n\ndate of the surrender of the driving licence or at the end of the period of twenty-one\n\ndays from the date of service of the notice, whichever is earlier.\n\nEffect of suspension and revocation of driving licence\n\n8. (1) Any person whose driving licence is suspended under these Rules shall\n\nnot drive a motor vehicle under any driving licence, including a driving licence issued by\n\nany other authority, or obtain a driving licence during the period of suspension.\n\n(2) Any person whose driving licence is revoked under these Rules shall not\n\ndrive a motor vehicle under any driving licence, including a driving licence issued by\n\nany other authority, or obtain a driving licence for a period of twelve months from the\n\ndate of revocation of the licence.\n\n(3) Notwithstanding this rule, the Director General may refuse or suspend\n\nany dealing or transaction applicable to the person under the Act.\n\nRevocation and transitional provisions\n\n9. (1) The Motor Vehicles (Demerit Points) Rules 1997 [P.U. (A) 79/1997]\n\n(hereinafter referred to as \"the revoked Rules\") is revoked.\n\n(2) Any demerit points awarded under the revoked Rules shall, on the date of\n\ncoming into operation of these Rules, be cancelled and shall not be taken into account in\n\nthe computation of demerit points under these Rules.\n\n(3) Any notice of suspension sent to any person under the revoked Rules\n\nbefore the coming into operation of these Rules shall be revoked and shall not be taken\n\ninto account in the computation of a further suspension or for revocation under these\n\nRules.\n\n(4) Any period of suspension under the revoked Rules which is still in\n\noperation shall, on the date of coming into operation of these Rules, be terminated and\n\nshall not be taken into account in the computation of a further suspension or for\n\nrevocation under these Rules.\n\n(5) Any record made under the revoked Rules shall, on the date of coming\n\ninto operation of these Rules, continue to be kept under these Rules.\n\nSCHEDULE\n\n[Subrule 4(1)]\n\nSCHEDULED OFFENCES AND DEMERIT POINTS\n\nNo. Offence Description of offence\n\nDemerit points to be\n\nawarded\n\nDriver of\n\nmotor\n\nvehicle\n\nother than\n\ngoods\n\nvehicle and\n\nbus\n\nDriver of\n\ngoods\n\nvehicle or\n\nbus\n\n1. Subsection 43(1) of\n\nthe Act\n\nCareless and inconsiderate driving 10 10\n\n2. Subsection 45(1) of\n\nthe Act\n\nBeing in charge of motor vehicle\n\nwhen under the influence of\n\nintoxicating liquor or drugs\n\n10 10\n\n3. Subsection 45A(1) of\n\nthe Act\n\nDriving or being in charge of motor\n\nvehicle with alcohol concentration\n\nabove prescribed limit\n\n10 10\n\nNo. Offence Description of offence\n\nDemerit points to be\n\nawarded\n\nDriver of\n\nmotor\n\nvehicle\n\nother than\n\ngoods\n\nvehicle and\n\nbus\n\nDriver of\n\ngoods\n\nvehicle or\n\nbus\n\n4. Subsection 45B(4) of\n\nthe Act\n\nFailing to provide specimen of\n\nbreath for breath test when\n\nrequired by police officer\n\n10 10\n\n5. Subsection 45C(6) of\n\nthe Act\n\nFailing to provide specimen of\n\nbreath for analysis or specimen of\n\nblood or urine for laboratory test\n\nwhen required by police officer\n\n10 10\n\n6. Rule 18 of the Road\n\nTraffic Rules, 1959\n\n[L.N. 166/1959] or\n\nsubrule 92(1) of the\n\nMotor Vehicles\n\n(Construction and\n\nUse) Rules, 1959\n\n[L.N. 170/1959]\n\nDriving goods vehicle with load\n\nthat causes danger or likely to\n\ncause danger\n\n7. Rule 21 of the Road\n\nTraffic Rules, 1959\n\nor subrule 92(2) of\n\nthe Motor Vehicle\n\n(Construction and\n\nUse) Rules, 1959\n\nDriving goods vehicle with load\n\nthat projects beyond the rear, front\n\nor side of body of vehicle without\n\nprior approval from Director\n\nGeneral\n\nNo. Offence Description of offence\n\nDemerit points to be\n\nawarded\n\nDriver of\n\nmotor\n\nvehicle\n\nother than\n\ngoods\n\nvehicle and\n\nbus\n\nDriver of\n\ngoods\n\nvehicle or\n\nbus\n\n8. Rule 19 of the Road\n\nTraffic Rules, 1959\n\nor rule 92A of the\n\nMotor Vehicle\n\n(Construction and\n\nUse) Rules, 1959\n\nDriving goods vehicle with falling\n\nload or with spilling from the\n\ngoods vehicle\n\n9. Rule 20 of the Road\n\nTraffic Rules, 1959\n\nor rule 93 of the\n\nMotor Vehicle\n\n(Construction and\n\nUse) Rules, 1959\n\nDriving goods vehicle that is\n\nunsuitable that causes danger or\n\nlikely to cause danger\n\n10. Subsection 79(1) of\n\nthe Act\n\nFailing or neglecting directions by\n\npolice officer, road transport\n\nofficer or traffic warden in\n\nregulating traffic while driving or\n\npropelling vehicle\n\n4 6\n\n11. Subsection 79(2) of\n\nthe Act\n\nFailing or neglecting to conform to\n\nindication given by the following\n\ntraffic signs while driving or\n\npropelling vehicle:\n\nNo. Offence Description of offence\n\nDemerit points to be\n\nawarded\n\nDriver of\n\nmotor\n\nvehicle\n\nother than\n\ngoods\n\nvehicle and\n\nbus\n\nDriver of\n\ngoods\n\nvehicle or\n\nbus\n\n(a) red signal;\n\n(b) stop sign at road\n\nintersection; or\n\n(c) speed limit sign by—\n\n(i) exceeding 40 km per\n\nhour;\n\n(ii) exceeding 25 km to 40\n\nkm per hour; or\n\n(iii) exceeding 1 km to\n\n25 km per hour\n\n12. Subrule 17(1) of the\n\nTraffic Signs (Size,\n\nColour and Type)\n\nRules, 1959\n\n[L.N. 167/1959]\n\nFailing to conform to red signal 4 6\n\nNo. Offence Description of offence\n\nDemerit points to be\n\nawarded\n\nDriver of\n\nmotor\n\nvehicle\n\nother than\n\ngoods\n\nvehicle and\n\nbus\n\nDriver of\n\ngoods\n\nvehicle or\n\nbus\n\n13. Subsection 40(1) of\n\nthe Act\n\nExceeding the speed limit imposed\n\nfor a vehicle as follows:\n\n(a) exceeding 40 km per hour\n\n(b) exceeding 25 km to 40 km\n\nper hour\n\n(c) exceeding 1 km to 25 km per\n\nhour\n\n14. Rule 17B of the Road\n\nTraffic Rules, 1959\n\nor paragraph\n\n12(3)(a) or 12(3)(b)\n\nof the Traffic Signs\n\n(Size, Colour and\n\nType) Rules, 1959\n\nOvertaking vehicle on continuous\n\nline\n\n4 6\n\n15. Rule 89 of the Motor\n\nVehicles\n\n(Construction and\n\nUse) Rules, 1959\n\nDriving goods vehicle exceeding\n\nthe maximum permissible laden\n\nweight\n\nNo. Offence Description of offence\n\nDemerit points to be\n\nawarded\n\nDriver of\n\nmotor\n\nvehicle\n\nother than\n\ngoods\n\nvehicle and\n\nbus\n\nDriver of\n\ngoods\n\nvehicle or\n\nbus\n\n16. Rule 90 of the Motor\n\nVehicles\n\n(Construction and\n\nUse) Rules, 1959\n\nCarrying persons on public service\n\nvehicle exceeding the number of\n\npersons specified in any valid\n\nlicence or public service vehicle\n\ncertificate\n\n17. Rule 5 of the Road\n\nTraffic Rules, 1959\n\nOvertaking traffic on the left side 4 6\n\n18. Subrule 53(1) of the\n\nRoad Traffic Rules,\n\nDriving, towing, pushing, parking\n\nor leaving unattended vehicle on\n\nemergency lane\n\n4 6\n\n19. Rule 9 of the Road\n\nTraffic Rules, 1959\n\nFailing to give way to vehicles\n\nwhich have priority over other\n\ntraffic\n\n3 5\n\n20. Subrule 17A(1) of\n\nthe Road Traffic\n\nRules, 1959\n\nUsing or attempting to use\n\nhand-held telephone or any other\n\ncommunication equipment not\n\nthrough hand-free kit while driving\n\n3 5\n\nNo. Offence Description of offence\n\nDemerit points to be\n\nawarded\n\nDriver of\n\nmotor\n\nvehicle\n\nother than\n\ngoods\n\nvehicle and\n\nbus\n\nDriver of\n\ngoods\n\nvehicle or\n\nbus\n\n21. Rule 4A of the Road\n\nTraffic Rules, 1959\n\nDriving goods vehicle or public\n\nservice vehicle continuously in the\n\nextremely right lane\n\n22. Rule 4 of the Motor\n\nVehicles (Safety\n\nSeat-Belts)\n\nRules 1978\n\n[P.U. (A) 378/1978]\n\nDriving a motor vehicle without\n\nwearing safety seat-belt in the\n\nmanner required by the nature\n\nand construction of the safety\n\nseat-belt\n\n3 3\n\n23. Rule 4 of the MotorCycles (Safety\n\nHelmets) Rules 1973\n\n[P.U. (A) 43/1973]\n\nDriving on a motorcycle without\n\nwearing safety helmet in the\n\nmanner required by the nature and\n\nconstruction of the safety helmet\n\n2 2\n\nNOTE:\n\nIn this Schedule—\n\n\"bus\"—\n\n(a) in relation to the Peninsular Malaysia, has the meaning assigned to it in\n\nthe First Schedule to the Land Public Transport Act 2010 [Act 715]; and\n\n(b) in relation to Sabah, Sarawak and the Federal Territory of Labuan, has the\n\nmeaning assigned to it in the Commercial Vehicles Licensing\n\nBoard Act 1987 [Act 334],\n\nand includes excursion bus.\n\n\"excursion bus\"—\n\n(a) in relation to the Peninsular Malaysia, has the meaning assigned to it in\n\nthe Second Schedule to the Land Public Transport Act 2010; and\n\n(b) in relation to Sabah, Sarawak and the Federal Territory of Labuan, has the\n\nmeaning assigned to it in the Commercial Vehicles Licensing\n\nBoard Act 1987 or the Tourism Vehicles Licensing Act 1999 [Act 594], as\n\nthe case may be.\n\nMade 5 April 2017\n\n[KP/BD/PJ/0.137/3; PN(PU2)460/LXXXIX]\n\nDATO' SERI LIOW TIONG LAI\n\nMinister of Transport"}}],"pack":"my-16"};
  FT["MY-H835"] = {"id":"MY-H835","coverage":"full","language":"ms","sourceName":"Attorney General's Chambers (AGC) Malaysia — Laws of Malaysia","sourceUrl":"https://lom.agc.gov.my/act-view.php?type=pua&no=P.U. (A) 110/2018&status=PRINCIPAL","fetchedAt":"2026-10-28","articleCount":2,"structureMode":"ARTICLE","title":{"zh":"2018年民用航空（豁免）（第2号）条例","en":"CIVIL AVIATION (EXEMPTION) (NO. 2) REGULATIONS 2018","orig":"CIVIL AVIATION (EXEMPTION) (NO. 2) REGULATIONS 2018","ms":"Peraturan Penerbangan Awam (Pengecualian) (Bilangan 2) 2018","vi":"Quy định về Hàng không dân dụng (Miễn trừ) (số 2) năm 2018","th":"ข้อบังคับการบินพลเรือน (การยกเว้น) (ฉบับที่ 2) ค.ศ. 2018","id":"Peraturan Penerbangan Sipil (Pembebasan) (Nomor 2) Tahun 2018"},"level":"regulation","category":"03_涉外投资与贸易","status":"active","docNumber":"PUA110","issuingBody":"马来西亚国会（Dewan Rakyat）","promulgatedDate":"2018","completenessNote":"全文：第 1 条至第 2 条；逐字未改写（源自厂商 OCR 文本）。原文马来文/英文双语并置，已分别落 text.ms 与 text.en。","textQuality":"ocr-vendor","sourceFile":"MY\\en\\TXT文本\\03_涉外投资与贸易\\2018_P.U.(A)110-2018_CIVIL AVIATION (EXEMPTION) (NO. 2) REGULATIONS 2018.txt","country":"MY","countryName":"马来西亚","layer":"intl","articles":[{"id":"MY-H835-A1","no":1,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 1"},"text":{"ms":"1. (1)  Peraturan-peraturan ini bolehlah dinamakan Peraturan-Peraturan\nPenerbangan Awam (Pengecualian) (No. 2) 2018.\n\n(2) Peraturan-Peraturan ini mula berkuat kuasa pada 1 Mei 2018.\n\nPengecualian"}},{"id":"MY-H835-A2","no":2,"noLabel":{"en":"Section 2"},"text":{"ms":"2. (1) Anggota kru penerbangan Malaysia Airlines Berhad dikecualikan\ndaripada sekatan berhubung dengan masa penerbangan di bawah\nsubperenggan 74 (a)(ii) Peraturan-Peraturan Penerbangan Awam 2016\n[P.U. (A) 97/2016].\n\n(2) Pengecualian di bawah subperaturan (1) tertakluk kepada syarat bahawa\npada permulaan penerbangan anggota kru penerbangan itu, agregat bagi semua masa\npenerbangannya yang sebelum itu semasa tempoh dua belas bulan yang berakhir pada\nakhir bulan sebelumnya hendaklah tidak melebihi seribu jam.\n\nDibuat 27 April 2018\n[MOT.BU(S).600-2/6/3 JLD.4(5); PN(PU2)38/X]\n\nDATO' SRI LIOW TIONG LAI\nMenteri Pengangkutan\n\nCIVIL AVIATION ACT 1969\n\nCIVIL AVIATION (EXEMPTION) (NO. 2) REGULATIONS 2018\n\nIN exercise of the powers conferred by paragraph 3(2)(p) of the\nCivil Aviation Act 1969 [Act 3], the Minister makes the following regulations:\n\nCitation and commencement"}}],"pack":"my-16"};
